desc_tab_b_cloth_059_0=A fine drawing of clothes. Open the <font color="#99cc00">Dressing Room</font> interface and use the drawing in order to change your style.
desc_tab_b_cloth_060_0=An elegant drawing of clothes. Open the <font color="#99cc00">Dressing Room</font> interface and use the drawing in order to change your style.
desc_tab_b_cloth_061_0=This is a drawing of clothes that are especially favored by the people of Jianghu. They are finely crafted. People can change the style of Jianghu Costume by using this drawing. Open the <font color="#99cc00">Dressing Room</font> interface and use the drawing in order to change your style.
