desc_book_qg_jh_04_00101=<font color="#FFAE00">Right-click to learn Swift Steps Level 1. Learning Skyward Feint Step is required.</font>
desc_growitem_4_b_1=Usage: Increases Experience Conversion Speed by 150% for 45 minutes (Cannot be used on synthesis)
desc_equip_tihuan_501_0=A rare powder made from top quality gold threads. Used for refining Level 3, 4, 5, and 6 gold equipment.<br><font color="#00FF00">If this material is used, the refined equipment will be bound.</font>
desc_equip_tihuan_601_0=Powder made from a rare high quality jade. Used to refine Level 3, 4, 5, and 6 jade equipment.<br><font color="#00FF00">If this material is used, the refined equipment will be bound.</font>
desc_equip_newshop_401_0=Rare ingredient. Used in Level 4, 5, and 6 silver refinement.
desc_equip_newshop_501_0=Rare ingredient. Used in Level 3, 4, 5, and 6 gold refinement.
desc_equip_newshop_601_0=Rare ingredient. Used in Level 3, 4, 5, and 6 Jade refinement.
cs_022_002=The climate of Nianluo Dam is warm and moist, which is suitable for the growth of poisonous insects. Be careful out there.
cs_022_003=Nianluo Dam's pleasant climate favors many rare herbs, creating treatments for rare diseases.
cs_022_004=Nianluo Dam is so breathtaking and peaceful that even I want to stay secluded here.
cs_022_005=The famous Jiuzhaigou Valley is located near Nianluo Dam. I'll definitely visit there this time.
cs_022_006=There's a legendary jade called Wuliang at Nianluo Dam, in which you can see an immortal playing sword when the night is lit by a full moon.
cs_022_007=Nianluo Dam's pleasant climate is perfectly suitable for both medicinal and poisonous herbs.
cs_022_009=Though secluded from the outside world, Nianluo Dam has two factions: Five Immortal Sect and Nishang Palace.
cs_022_010=Nishang Palace disciples always help people with free medicines, so they have a great reputation at Nianluo Dam.
menu_treasure001_01=Claim Treasure Skill Rest Voucher (Free)
title_treasure001_01=You seem very outstanding so you must be a hero. I admire the people like you.
desc_tab_b_head_074_0=Gained from the purchase of the Lore item Love of the Butterfly Attire. Made on the basis of delicate craftsmanship. Refer to this design to change the style of Jianghu costume. You can rework on equipment to change its style at <font color="#99cc00">Dressing Room</font>. <br><font color="#96a0c8">If you have the drawing in your backpack, Right-click on it to add it to your collection, it could be used only one times and will disappear after being used.</font>
desc_tab_g_head_074_0=Gained from the purchase of the Lore item Love of the Butterfly Attire. Made on the basis of delicate craftsmanship. Refer to this design to change the style of Jianghu costume. You can rework on equipment to change its style at <font color="#99cc00">Dressing Room</font>. <br><font color="#96a0c8">If you have the drawing in your backpack, Right-click on it to add it to your collection, it could be used only one times and will disappear after being used.</font>
desc_tab_b_head_075_b_0=Gained from the purchase of the Lore item Golden Snake Raiment. Made on the basis of delicate craftsmanship. Refer to this design to change the style of Jianghu costume. You can rework on equipment to change its style at <font color="#99cc00">Dressing Room</font>. <br><font color="#96a0c8">When the drawing is in your pack, right click it to collect it into the Dressing Room. This drawing can be used unlimitedly, and the shifted equipment will be bound.</font>
desc_tab_g_head_075_b_0=Gained from the purchase of the Lore item Golden Snake Raiment. Made on the basis of delicate craftsmanship. Refer to this design to change the style of Jianghu costume. You can rework on equipment to change its style at <font color="#99cc00">Dressing Room</font>. <br><font color="#96a0c8">When the drawing is in your pack, right click it to collect it into the Dressing Room. This drawing can be used unlimitedly, and the shifted equipment will be bound.</font>
desc_tab_g_head_073_b_0=Headwear of lore Dragon Scale Coat. This drawing can shift the style of Jianghu clothes. You can rework on equipment to change its style at <font color="#99cc00">Dressing Room</font>.<br><font color="#96a0c8">When the drawing is in your pack, right click it to collect it into the Dressing Room. This drawing can be used unlimitedly, and the shifted equipment will be bound.</font>
