desc_item_force_002_0=It was written around 6th century BC by the sage Lao Tzu. The text, along with the Zhuangzi, is a fundamental text for both philosophical and religious Taoism. (Used to eliminate the effects that the<font color="#ff0000"> Marriage/Divorce times </font>have on joining the Reclusive Schools, and the <font color="#ff0000">Divorce times</font> on joining Jianghu schools. After holding this item, the Divorce-related titles can no longer be used.)
sl_npcadv100_clone004_2=Sigh... All these years I've done nothing but gambling. I've lost all the money and everything. now I've been poisoned. I'm afraid it's too late for me to change...
desc_item_xw_qd_001_0=You can be exchanged for various acupoint-opening items from <font color="#ffff00">Event Envoy</font> at major cities and the beginner's town.<br><font color="#66CD00">Chengdu </font><s><s><font color="#66CD00">(665,742)</font><br><font color="#66CD00">Luoyang </font><s><s><font color="#66CD00">(1085,677)</font><br><font color="#66CD00">Jinling </font><s><s><font color="#66CD00">(1208,1019)</font><br><font color="#66CD00">Suzhou </font><s><s><font color="#66CD00">(493,369)</font><br><font color="#66CD00">Yanjing </font><s><s><font color="#66CD00">(340,99)</font><br><font color="#66CD00">Qiandeng Town </font><s><s><font color="#66CD00">(879,632)</font><br><font color="#66CD00">Yanyu Villa </font><s><s><font color="#66CD00">(376,1038)</font><br><font color="#66CD00">Jiming Posthouse </font><s><s><font color="#66CD00">(658,363)</font>
desc_tab_g_head_078_b_0=Gained from the purchase of the Lore item Demon Wing Yarn. Made on the basis of delicate craftsmanship. Refer to this design to change the style of Jianghu costume. You can rework on equipment to change its style at <font color="#99cc00">Dressing Room</font>. <br><font color="#96a0c8">When the drawing is in your pack, right click it to collect it into the Dressing Room. This drawing can be used unlimitedly, and the shifted equipment will be bound.</font>
