desc_taskitemadv_009003_0=Plundering others on the boat is the only way to get tokens.
desc_taskitemadv_009004_0=Can be purchased with tokens from the Attendant (266,-520) or sold to a Merchant for silver.
desc_item_khd_xld_001_0=It is illegible. Judging from the pattern, it appears to be a sword manual. Someone may be interested in it. <br>It can be exchanged for a reward at Delightful Island (-65,537).<br>(Sword Skill Fragments can be found in the Vault Treasure Hunt event. One of it will drop once you're defeated. If you leave the event on halfway you will lost all the fragments.)
desc_item_khd_lzj_01_0=This is Wang Zhen's purse. There is enough money to pay for his debt.
desc_tab_b_head_084_b_0=Gained from the purchase of the Lore item Tiger Head Shirt. Made on the basis of delicate craftsmanship. Refer to this design to change the style of Jianghu costume. You can rework on equipment to change its style at <font color="#99cc00">Dressing Room</font>. <br><font color="#96a0c8">When the drawing is in your pack, right click it to collect it into the Dressing Room. This drawing can be used unlimitedly, and the shifted equipment will be bound.</font>
