yd_title_khd_khq_b=The Delightful Spring can be found on the island, though the <font face_b="Default" color_b="#00e5ee" >Massage</font> parlor, and <font face_b="Default" color_b="#00e5ee" >Hot Spring Boiled Egg</font> are something that you should see. <font face_b="Default" color_b="#00FF00" >(Delightful Spring: Helps boost the transferring of cultivation)</font> </font>
