desc_Box_dxxd_ma_zyys_01=You will receive 1000 liang of silver coins, 1 Dayuan Horse (14 days), 1 Outfit Gift Box (7 days), 20 Steamed Bread, 5 Tongming Pills, and 1 Central Plains Hero II.
