desc_key_cjshow_25_0=The box is outside the West Gate (926, 745) of Chengdu.
desc_key_qy_jilegu007_tuzhi_0=According to the mark on the map, the box should be near the Wanderer's Valley (737, 77).
desc_key_qy_jilegu013_yaoshi_0=You can open the box the businessman refers to. The box should be near the Blackwind Mountain in Wanderer's Valley (105, 743).
desc_key_qy_jilegu013_ditu_0=According to the mark on the map, the box should be near the Blackwind Mountain in Wanderer's Valley (105, 743).
desc_key_wudang_yaoshi01_0=This is a golden key of the box which is likely to be near the Wudang's <font color="#FF3333">Heaven Pillar Peak</font> (435 -407) in north of Wudang.
desc_key_wudang_yaoshi02_0=This is a golden Box Key. The box may be near <font color="#FF3333">Ming Army Baggage Camp</font> (-90 360) which is in the eastern part of Wudang.
desc_key_cd_211a_1_0=A letter of recommendation. Take it to Nangong Family in Chengdu and find the expert Nangong Chou (280, 110).
desc_key_cd_008a_01_0=The wooden box containing jewelry is Bao Dating's gift to Ximen Feiyan(1362, 611) of Huanhua Sword Sect in Chendu.
desc_key_cd_021a_01_0=Send the sealed box to Huanhua Sword Sect Chen Yixiao (1299, 723) in Chengdu.
desc_key_cd_203a_1_0=Only the Box Key can open the box (205, 812) in Chengdu.
desc_key_cd_204a_2_0=It is a sealed box. It is unknown what is inside it. Bring it to Situ Jing (751, 617) in Chengdu.
desc_key_qy_suzhou_tiejiangtudi_5_0=The blacksmith told you that he once saw a strange box by the river on the way to visiting the fisherman in the west of the village.
desc_key_qy_suzhou_worldnpc01315_0=Luo'er told you that there were often some strange sounds in the opposite forest. It sounded like a shove? hitting a metal box (957, 1283).
desc_key_qy_tangmen001_1_0=Without the Box Key, you cannot open the box in the pool (800, 134) at the foot of the mountain.
desc_key_qy_tangmen003_1_0=According to the picture, the box is located around the Heaven Treasure Stronghold (850, 445).
desc_key_qy_tangmen017_2_0=There is a tiny locking hole on the delicate box. <br>This should be the Robbed one.
desc_key_qy_tangmen022_1_0=Only the Box Key can open the box in the Snake Cave (167, 140).
desc_key_tangmen_3nei_miling09_0=An encrypted Tangmen letter.<br> The orders within are hidden behind ornate lines of poetry.<br> Find Elder Brother Li Songqian (1356, 859) who will lead you to the Peacock Villa.<br>(You need to enter with a team, and you can only enter the instance five times per hour.)<br><font color="#FF3333">(Abandoning item will cause the task cannot be finished normally.)</font>
desc_key_tangmen_3nei_plan03_0=Letters between Tang Yun and Phantom's Mountain Manor. This is proof that Tangmen has been set up. <br><font color="#FF3333">(if the item is abandoned, the mission will not be successfully completed)</font>
desc_key_tangmen_3nei_plan04_0=Letters between Tang Yun and Phantom's Mountain Manor. This is proof that Tangmen has been set up. <br><font color="#FF3333">(if the item is abandoned, the mission will not be successfully completed)</font>
