desc_ltitem_prize005_0=After knocking on this wooden fish, the Brahma's warning against sin lingers in people's ears. It is awarded to the national runner-up. <font color="#3299CC">Increases balance by 20 points for 50 team members within a 20 meter radius. </font><br><font color="#3299CC">Lasts five minutes.</font>
desc_ltitem_prize019_0=A long lost move, but this move must be cultivated with "Trapped Dragon and Tiger" together. So you'd better just use it for consulting. <font color="#3299CC">Increase 100 points Max Energy for yourself.</font><br><font color="#3299CC">Last 5 minutes.</font>
desc_ltitem_prize033_0=The original picture was the most important treasure of Wudang. But this one is just a copy made by the Wudang Seven Heroes. <font color="#3299CC">Increase 10% Jump Speed for 25 team members in 10 meters radius area.</font><br><font color="#3299CC">Last 5 minutes.</font>
desc_key_qy_qiandengzhen0016_0=A key. There is a box (Qiandeng Town 538, 183) next to it. Maybe it can open the box.
desc_key_qy_qiandengzhen0031_0=The medicine is used to control people by causing them illusions. Put it in the box (Qiandeng Town 564, 672).
desc_key_qy_qiandengzhen0035_0=The prescription writes a lot about the raw materials to make Baleng Pill, an overpowering drug. Put it in the box (Qiandeng Town 564, 672).
desc_key_qy_qiandengzhen0037_0=A Secret Letter. Put it into the Box (564, 672).
desc_key_kongque_hx_0=It's Master Xiong Dahai's figure. Maybe you can find him in Peacock Villa.
desc_key_kongque_hx1_0=It is Du Tiexin's figure. Maybe you can find him in Peacock Villa. You should find the evidence of his crime.
desc_key_kongque_daizi_0=A medicine shovel used for digging out strange herbs in Peacock Villa.
desc_key_kongque_004_0=The poisonous herb picked from Peacock Villa has strong toxicity. Take it to Tang Sigong quickly <font color="#FF3333">(860, 900)</font>.
desc_key_kongque_006_0=They are the deerskin gloves offered by Tang Sigong. Go to the Peacock Villa <font color="#FF3333">(149, 556)</font> and pick up the medicine.
desc_key_kongque_013_0=The haunted person left some clues. Maybe you can find something from Wu Zhetian in Peacock Villa.
desc_key_kongque_014_0=This is the Home Letter from Elder Sister Tang to his son. Put it in Elder Sister Tang's original residence in Peacock Villa <font color="#FF3333">(367, 445)</font>.
desc_key_kongque_016_0=I found some clues on Wu Zhedi's body. The whole thing must be schemed by Wu Zhitian of Peacock Villa.
desc_key_kq_yaoshi_0=A long dusty key, said to unlock a hidden box in Peacock Villa.<font color="#FF3333">(325, 508).</font>
desc_key_kq_wu01_0=The box is filled with the hemp bees' heads. Give it to Tangmen Scene's <font color="#FF3333"> (899 922) </font>Xiao Feng.
desc_useitemkey_luoyang_baoxiang_1=A gorgeous wooden box. The treasure inside is unknown, as it is locked. You can go out of Luoyang (<font color="#FF4500">781 753</font>) to find those <font color="#FF3333">ruffians</font>. Maybe you can get the key there.
desc_useitemkey_luoyang_baoxiang1_1=A quite magnificent Wooden Box. You don't know what's in it.
desc_key_luoyang_baoxiang2_0=A quite magnificent Wooden Box. You don't know what's in it.
desc_key_luoyang_baoxiang3_0=A quite magnificent Wooden Box. You don't know what's in it.
desc_useitemkey_luoyang_baoxiang4_1=A quite magnificent Wooden Box. You don't know what's in it.
desc_key_luoyang_yaopai1_0=It's a token of Xingxiu Sect. Take it and go to Mang Mountain out of Luoyang to threaten those <font color="#FF3333">heads of rebel forces</font>. Ask them to hand over <font color="#FF3333">the secret letter</font>. I don't know whether it is an effectual method.
desc_useitemkey_luoyang_yaoshi_0=The intact key can be used to open the box which <font color="#FF3333">Yan Yu</font> gave to you.
desc_key_luoyang_yishu_0=My name is Du He. I don't think I will live much longer. I hope whoever finds these will realize my wish for me. When I was studying martial arts, I snuck into Wudang and became a disciple of Immortal Wenqing to try to win the position of Incense Leader with the Black Wind.<br> At that time, I fell in love with Lan'er. But I was forced to poison my masters and steal the Zhenwu Seven Sections Array on the day of my wedding. Lan'er died helping me escape. Even worse, the Black Wind wanted to kill me and take the script.<br> "I have been on the run ever since. I hid the script. I hope you will return it to Wudang. Wu Chenzi, the Taoist Mingyue, and Yuan Fu all have pieces of the code telling where it is. When you find it, pour water on the stone by the bucket."
