desc_ng_tbook_jyzj=The unparalleled Kungfu in Wulin is made by Huang Shang in the Northern Song Dynasty. The law of nature is to keep the balance. So vacancy outweighs reality. Shortness outweighs superabundance. Learn the saint's scroll, comprehend its profund meaning,  theorize it with your own understanding and then you can touch the essence of Kungfu.
