desc_cjbook_cs_gb_dgbf_0=This is a Dog Beating Staff Technique (Ancient Manual) scroll fragment. Collect 10 pieces and go to the Jiming Posthouse.
desc_cjbook_cs_em_pxcyz_0=This is a page of the Flying Snow Palm skill book. Collect 10 pages and go to a <font color="#ff0000">painter</font> to combine the pages into <font color="#ffff00">a book.</font>
desc_cjbook_cs_jy_dqd_0=This is a page of the Heartless Seven Skills book. Collect 10 pages and go to a <font color="#ff0000">painter</font> to combine the pages into <font color="#ffff00">a book.</font>
desc_cjbook_cs_jl_fgz_0=<font color="#ffff00">Wanderer's Valley</font> Skill - Bone Corroding Palm Scroll Fragment. Collect 10 fragments and find a <font color="#ff0000">Painter</font> to create a <font color="#ffff00">Skill Page.</font>
desc_book_cs_gb_dgbf_0=Dog Beating Staff Technique (Ancient Manual). It records <font color="#ffff00">"Waving the Dog's Paws", "Swipe The Dog's Back ", "Quick Strike On Dog's Hip", "Luring Dogs To Camp", "Flatten Dog's Back", "Evil Dog Blocks The Way", "Flip The Dog Upside-Down" and "No Dogs Under Heaven "</font>
desc_book_cs_em_pxcyz_0=Flying Snow Palm script, records <font color="#ffff00">"Tenacious Scholar", "Proud Snow Chases the Cloud", "Graceful Beauty", "Falling Snow Turns to Frost", "Noble and Pure", "Goose Steps on Snow", "Ocean Iceberg", "Piquant Melody"</font> these moves
desc_book_cs_jy_dqd_0=Heartless Seven Skills script, it records <font color="#ffff00">"Heartless Blade", "Your Love Ends Here", "Severing Ties with Rage", "Crossing One's Heart", "Merciless World", "Bloodlust", "Heart Breaking Blade"</font>.
desc_book_cs_jl_fgz_0=Bone Corroding Palm Script. It records <font color="#ffff01">"Poison Fist", "Blood Frozen in Seven Steps", "Chisel Bone and Smash Marrow", "Erode Body and Heart", "Poison Fog", "Nail Heart and Pierce Bone", and "Carry Bones and Hear Voice"</font>.
desc_taskitemclone_001105_0=<font color="#ff0000">[Forbidden Instance]</font>A piece of paper of Nightwing residual scroll. It is said that Omniscient Scholar of Peacock Villa is collecting it.[Only available in extra progress of Forbidden Instance Peacock Villa]
desc_taskitemclone_001106_0=<font color="#ff0000">[Forbidden Instance]</font>A piece of paper of Dark Plume residual scroll. It is said that Omniscient Scholar of Peacock Villa is collecting it.[Only available in extra progress of Forbidden Instance Peacock Villa]
desc_taskitemclone_001107_0=<font color="#ff0000">[Forbidden Instance]</font>A piece of paper of Dark Phoenix residual scroll. It is said that Omniscient Scholar of Peacock Villa is collecting it.[Only available in extra progress of Forbidden Instance Peacock Villa]
desc_taskitemclone_001108_0=<font color="#ff0000">[Forbidden Instance]</font>Pass Token of Peacock Villa low level member. It seems to be dug up somewhere.[Show it to Villa Guard to open daily extra progress of normal difficulty of Peacock Villa]
desc_taskitemclone_001109_0=<font color="#ff0000">[Forbidden Instance]</font>Pass Token of Peacock Villa medium level member. It seems to be dug up somewhere.[Show it to Villa Guard to open daily extra progress of hard difficulty of Peacock Villa]
desc_taskitemclone_001110_0=<font color="#ff0000">[Forbidden Instance]</font>Pass Token of Peacock Villa advanced level member. It seems to be dug up somewhere.[Show it to Villa Guard to open daily extra progress of hell difficulty of Peacock Villa]
desc_qy_gcd_12_003_0=This legendary instrument of torture is so sharp it can separate flesh from bone without spilling blood. <br><font color="#ff0000">You can sell it to a merchant.</font>
desc_qy_gcd_11_001_0=A book with some racy content. <br><font color="#ff0000">You can sell it to a merchant.</font>
desc_key_qyb_qxys1_0=This is a key with strange shape. You can go to Green Cloud Castle and open the Poplar Wood Box.
desc_key_qyb_qxys2_0=This is a Black Candlenut key. You can go to Green Cloud Castle and open the Black Candlenut Box.
desc_cw_book_cs_em_pxcyz_0=Flying Snow Palm book fragment. Take 10 of these to a <font color="#ff0000">Painter</font> to create an intact book.
desc_cw_book_cs_gb_dgbf_0=Jianghu Skill Dog Beating Staff Technique (Ancient Manual)'s Annotated Fragment collect 10 pages and go to <font color="#ff0000">Painter</font> to combine into a complete anotatated book.
desc_cw_book_cs_jl_fgz_0=<font color="#ffff00">Wanderer's Valley</font> Skill - Bone Corroding Palm Annotation Book Fragment. Collect 10 fragments and find a <font color="#ff0000">Painter</font> to create a <font color="#ffff00">Skill Page.</font>
desc_key_tsxjl_02_0=Key to the box in the underground palace, behind the secret door in bedroom.
desc_itm_bookbag_fgz=It contains a set of Bone Corrosion Palm Secret Script.
desc_key_qyjysm_gbyf_0=I don't know where these Beggar's Sect Disciples' clothes came from. They were buried under a big stone in front of Beast Villa. It must have something to do with the Villa. See if Lu Wei knows. <br><font color="#FF3333">(You will be unable to complete task if you abandon this item.)</font>
desc_key_qyjysm_gj_0=Go look for the Beggar's Sect disciples' clothes under the big stone (551, 767) in front of Beasts Villa. Give them back to Lu Wei after you use them.<br><font color="#FF3333">(You will be unable to complete this task if you abandon this item.)</font>
