desc_ng_book_jy_00201=Collect Basic Pages 1 to 9 of Tiancan Skill, have them bound at a Calligrapher or Painter in a city, and then you can learn the Internal Mental Skill within.<br> <font color="#FFAE00">If you haven't learned it, you can right-click to learn Tiancan Skill Level 1</font>
