desc_book_cs_jl_fgz01_rm=From the "Bone Corroding Palm" Set. An insidious attack that injects poison into the enemy's bloodstream.
desc_book_cs_jl_fgz02_rm=From the "Bone Corroding Palm" Set. A deadly skill in which poison from the palm attacks the enemy's joints.
desc_book_cs_jl_fgz03_rm=From the "Bone Corroding Palm" Set. Tear the enemy's chest open and fill it with poison.
desc_book_cs_jl_fgz04_rm=From the "Bone Corroding Palm" Set. The skill will poison anyone foolish enough to attack its user.
desc_book_cs_jl_fgz05_rm=From the "Bone Corroding Palm" Set. A terrifying skill which uses the wind to distribute poison all through the battlefield.
desc_book_cs_jl_fgz06_rm=From the "Bone Corroding Palm" Set. Uses Chi to send poison to the enemy's heart.
desc_book_cs_jl_fgz07_rm=From the "Bone Corroding Palm" Set. This skill emits a corrosive poison which destroys the enemy's bones.
desc_book_cs_em_pxcyz01_rm=From the "Flying Snow Palm" Set. Standing still to observe the enemy's movement and strike when the weak point is revealed.
desc_book_cs_em_pxcyz02_rm=From the "Flying Snow Palm" Set. Gather your Chi and deliver a devastating strike to injure the enemy's vital oragans.
desc_book_cs_em_pxcyz03_rm=From the "Flying Snow Palm" Set. The force of the palm will injure the enemy and heal wounds at the same time.
desc_book_cs_em_pxcyz04_rm=From the "Flying Snow Palm" Set. The fist plunges forth silently, injuring surrounding enemies while empowering allies.
desc_book_cs_em_pxcyz05_rm=From the "Flying Snow Palm" Set. Concentrate and circulate the Chi to improve the movement of all team members.
desc_book_cs_em_pxcyz06_rm=From the "Flying Snow Palm" Set. Surround your body with energy to move freely as the wind.
desc_book_cs_em_pxcyz07_rm=From the "Flying Snow Palm" Set. The palm strikes are like snow strom, covering the sky and earth. It can repel and injure enemies.
desc_book_cs_em_pxcyz08_rm=From the "Flying Snow Palm" Set. Leap through the cloud and deal damage to surrounding enemies.
desc_book_cs_jy_dqd01_rm=Training method of the "Heartless Seven Skills" Set. Focus your energy on the blade's point to damage the enemy's chi channels.
desc_book_cs_jy_dqd02_rm=Training method of the "Heartless Seven Skills" Set. This attack steals the enemy's heart and cuts his gallbladder.
desc_book_cs_jy_dqd03_rm=Training method of the "Heartless Seven Skills" Set. The attack is relentless and can only end with the opponent's death.
desc_book_cs_jy_dqd04_rm=Training method of the "Heartless Seven Skills" Set. Attach with the madness of a spurned lover and the ferocity of a raging wind.
desc_book_cs_jy_dqd05_rm=Training method of the "Heartless Seven Skills" Set. In this merciless world, death is the only truth. The blade is the path to salvation.
desc_book_cs_jy_dqd06_rm=Training method of the "Heartless Seven Skills" Set. A cruel heart thirsts only for blood and finds pleasure in murder.
desc_book_cs_jy_dqd07_rm=Training method of the "Heartless Seven Skills" Set. The attack is relentless and can only end with the opponent's death.
desc_book_cs_gb_dgbf01_rm=A skill in the "Dog Beating Staff Technique (Ancient Manual)". A swift strike that leaves the enemy with many wounds.
desc_book_cs_gb_dgbf02_rm=A skill in the "Dog Beating Staff Technique (Ancient Manual)". Gather your strength and attack your enemy from the blind spot.
desc_book_cs_gb_dgbf03_rm=A skill in the "Dog Beating Staff Technique (Ancient Manual)". Attack swiftly with the staff, making it difficult for your enemy to defend.
desc_book_cs_gb_dgbf04_rm=A skill in the "Dog Beating Staff Technique (Ancient Scroll)". Use your staff to stun your enemies.
desc_book_cs_gb_dgbf05_rm=A skill in the "Dog Beating Staff Technique (Ancient Manual)". Attack to weaken your enemies.
desc_book_cs_gb_dgbf06_rm=A skill in the "Dog Beating Staff Technique (Ancient Manual)". Use the full strength to swing the staff and knock off enemy weapons.
desc_book_cs_gb_dgbf07_rm=A skill in the "Dog Beating Staff Technique (Ancient Manual)" set. Wield the staff upward, throwing enemies to the ground preventing them from getting up.
desc_book_cs_gb_dgbf08_rm=A skill in the "Dog Beating Staff Technique (Ancient Manual)". Strike with the speed of lightning to attack all surrounding enemies.
