desc_key_qy_tem001_xin_0=A secret letter indicating the location of the trapped Emei disciples. Emei disciples need this letter to finish their school task.<br><font color="#FF3333">(You will be unable to complete task if you abandon this item.)</font>
desc_ng_book_sl_00301=Collect Basic Pages 1 to 9 of Arhat Demon-Subduing Skill, have them bound at a Calligrapher or Painter in a city, and then you can learn the Internal Mental Skill within.<br> <font color="#FFAE00">If you haven't learned it, you can right-click to learn Arhat Demon-Subduing Skill Level 1</font>
desc_ng_book_sl_00302=Collect Basic Pages 1 to 9 of Arhat Demon-Subduing Skill, have them bound at a Calligrapher or Painter in a city, and then you can learn the Internal Mental Skill within.<br> <font color="#FFAE00">If you have learned Arhat Demon-Subduing Skill Level 1, you can read it at once and learn Arhat Demon-Subduing Skill Level 2</font>
