desc_ng_book_sl_00331=Collect Arhat Demon-Subduing Skill Elder Level Pages 1 to 6 and bind them at the Calligrapher or Painter in the city. Then you can learn the Internal Mental Skill recorded in the script.<br><font color="#FFAE00">If you have learned Arhat Demon-Subduing Skill Level 30 and you are a Shaolin Disciple, you can read it to learn Arhat Demon-Subduing Skill Level 31. </font><br>Go to School Elder <font color="#FFCC00">Chingshan, Ching Yan or Ching Ji</font> and use 2 Pages of this script to understand a higher level page.
desc_ng_book_sl_00332=Collect Arhat Demon-Subduing Skill Elder Level Pages 1 to 6 and bind them at the Calligrapher or Painter in the city. Then you can learn the Internal Mental Skill recorded in the script.<br><font color="#FFAE00">If you have learned Arhat Demon-Subduing Skill Level 31 and you are a Shaolin Disciple, you can read it to learn Arhat Demon-Subduing Skill Level 32. </font><br>Go to School Elder <font color="#FFCC00">Chingshan, Ching Yan or Ching Ji</font> and use 2 Pages of this script to understand a higher level page.
