desc_ng_book_sl_00336=Collect Intermediate Pages 1 to 6 of Arhat Demon-Subduing Skill, have them bound at a Calligrapher or Painter in a city, and then you can learn the Internal Mental Skill within.<br> <font color="#FFAE00">If you have learned Arhat Demon-Subduing Skill Level 35 and you are a Shaolin Disciple, you can read it at once and learn Arhat Demon-Subduing Skill Level 36</font>
