desc_smtzitem_jl05_0=<font color="#FF0000">After you accept the task, this item will be bound to you.</font> This is a mysterious necklace featuring a jade hook just like one half of a yin yang. It is bright and has a special marking. It is used by Wanderer's Valley disciples as proof of duties performed. (When you complete the task associated with this token you can obtain the page for Bone Corrosion Palm Level 6)
desc_smtzitem_jl06_0=<font color="#FF0000">After you accept the task, this item will be bound to you.</font> This is a mysterious necklace featuring a jade hook just like one half of a yin yang. It is bright and has a special marking. It is used by Wanderer's Valley disciples as proof of duties performed. (When you complete the task associated with this token you can obtain the page for Bone Corrosion Palm Level 6)
desc_cjhd_xi_0=To be used at <font color="#FFB428">Expert Herbalist</font> to exchange for Event gift pack <font color="#FFB428">Expert Herbalist</font> can be found in every territory and at entrances to forbidden instances. <br><font color="#ff0000">Joyous</font> is hidden in the Colored Egg gift box from defeating the forces of Jianghu. <br><font color="#FFB428">Joyous New Year Celebration</font> Event duration: <font color="#ff0000">February 22, 2013 to February 27, 2013</font>, please remember to use the items before they expire.
