desc_key_qy_gb304_ditu_0=Go see Tang Dan with this token. He will show you the shortcut to the Peacock Villa. (You must go with your team. This Forbidden Instance only can be entered 5 times an hour.)<br><font color="#FF3333">(You will be unable to complete task if you abandon this item.)</font>
desc_fuli_jl_fgz001_0=Wanderer's Valley special pill, it can enhance sect martial arts. Take it and enhance power of Bone Corrosion Palm - Poison Fist by 10%
desc_fuli_jl_fgz002_0=Wanderer's Valley special pill, it can enhance sect martial arts. Take it and enhance power of Bone Corrosion Palm - Blood Frozen in Seven Steps by 10%
desc_fuli_jl_fgz003_0=Wanderer's Valley special pill, it can enhance sect martial arts. Take it and enhance power of Bone Corrosion Palm - Chisel Bone and Smash Marrow by 10%
desc_fuli_jl_fgz004_0=Wanderer's Valley special pill, it can enhance sect martial arts. Take it and enhance power of Bone Corrosion Palm - Erode Bone and Heart by 10%
desc_fuli_jl_fgz005_0=Wanderer's Valley special pill, it can enhance sect martial arts. Take it and enhance power of Bone Corrosion Palm - Poison Fog by 10%
desc_fuli_jl_fgz006_0=Wanderer's Valley special pill, it can enhance sect martial arts. Take it and enhance power of Bone Corrosion Palm - Carry Bones and Hear Voices by 10%
desc_book_cs_jl_fgz01_rm_a=From the "Bone Corroding Palm" Set. An insidious attack that injects poison into the enemy's bloodstream.
desc_book_cs_jl_fgz02_rm_a=From the "Bone Corroding Palm" Set. A deadly skill in which poison from the palm attacks the enemy's joints.
desc_book_cs_jl_fgz03_rm_a=From the "Bone Corroding Palm" Set. Tear the enemy's chest open and fill it with poison.
desc_book_cs_jl_fgz04_rm_a=From the "Bone Corroding Palm" Set. The skill will poison anyone foolish enough to attack its user.
desc_book_cs_jl_fgz05_rm_a=From the "Bone Corroding Palm" Set. A terrifying skill which uses the wind to distribute poison all through the battlefield.
desc_book_cs_jl_fgz06_rm_a=From the "Bone Corroding Palm" Set. Uses Chi to send poison to the enemy's heart.
desc_book_cs_jl_fgz07_rm_a=From the "Bone Corroding Palm" Set. This skill emits a corrosive poison which destroys the enemy's bones.
desc_book_cs_gb_dgbf01_rm_a=A skill in the "Dog Beating Staff Technique (Ancient Manual)". A swift strike that leaves the enemy with many wounds.
desc_book_cs_gb_dgbf02_rm_a=A skill in the "Dog Beating Staff Technique (Ancient Manual)". Gather your strength and attack your enemy from the blind spot.
desc_book_cs_gb_dgbf03_rm_a=A skill in the "Dog Beating Staff Technique (Ancient Manual)". Attack swiftly with the staff, making it difficult for your enemy to defend.
desc_book_cs_gb_dgbf04_rm_a=A skill in the "Dog Beating Staff Technique (Ancient Scroll)". Use your staff to stun your enemies.
desc_book_cs_gb_dgbf05_rm_a=A skill in the "Dog Beating Staff Technique (Ancient Manual)". Attack to weaken your enemies.
desc_book_cs_gb_dgbf06_rm_a=A skill in the "Dog Beating Staff Technique (Ancient Manual)". Use the full strength to swing the staff and knock off enemy weapons.
desc_book_cs_gb_dgbf07_rm_a=A skill in the "Dog Beating Staff Technique (Ancient Manual)" set. Wield the staff upward, throwing enemies to the ground preventing them from getting up.
desc_book_cs_gb_dgbf08_rm_a=A skill in the "Dog Beating Staff Technique (Ancient Manual)". Strike with the speed of lightning to attack all surrounding enemies.
