desc_jianghu_jindi_jl13=Given by Mrs. Qiu for defeating Taoist Mu in Hell Difficulty. Ideintity "Peacock Hero" is required.
desc_book_cs_em_pxcyz0105=A move from "Flying Snow Palm", regard standing still as a tactic to observe the enemy's movement and entice him to attack. Then exploit his weakness.
desc_book_cs_em_pxcyz0106=A move from "Flying Snow Palm", regard standing still as a tactic to observe the enemy's movement and entice him to attack. Then exploit his weakness.
desc_book_cs_em_pxcyz0205=A move from "Flying Snow Palm" set. Get your chi and blood flowing then attack your enemy's vital organs to weaken him.
desc_book_cs_em_pxcyz0206=A move from "Flying Snow Palm" set. Get your chi and blood flowing then attack your enemy's vital organs to weaken him.
desc_book_cs_em_pxcyz0305=A move from "Flying Snow Palm" skills. The power of the palm is shocking, seriously wounding the enemy while improving the flow of Chi.
desc_book_cs_em_pxcyz0306=A move from "Flying Snow Palm" skills. The power of the palm is shocking, seriously wounding the enemy while improving the flow of Chi.
desc_book_cs_em_pxcyz0405=A move from "Flying Snow Palm". The fist plunges forth silently, injuring surrounding enemies while empowering allies.
desc_book_cs_em_pxcyz0406=A move from "Flying Snow Palm". The fist plunges forth silently, injuring surrounding enemies while empowering allies.
desc_book_cs_em_pxcyz0505=A technique from "Flying Snow Palm". Stand still and concentrate your chi so it spreads to all team members and enable their movement.
desc_book_cs_em_pxcyz0506=A technique from "Flying Snow Palm". Stand still and concentrate your chi so it spreads to all team members and enable their movement.
desc_book_cs_em_pxcyz0605=A technique from "Flying Snow Palm". Your body is surrounded by chi and protected by intense power. Move as freely as the shadows and the wind.
