desc_ng_book_jh_204_rm=Created by Hao Datong, the founder of the Hua Mountain Sect. It is a mental skill for cultivating inner pill. It is also supreme Xuangong of Daoist Martial Art. Kung fu starts from theory of “Yi” and comes from Non-polar diagram. When you finish studying, “Purple light Gang Qi” will be poured into the whole body. It can shock enemies with void inner skill.
