desc_shitu_box_45=Can gain Sandalwood Altar Skill level 1-9 and some School Honor Certificates. Can accept Tier Four Internal Skill quests at <a href="findnpc_new,school08,WorldNpc00212" style="HLStype1">Abbot Xuanhuai</a>. <font color="#3299CC">However, players have to complete level 1-5 quests and exchange Sheepskin scroll fragments for level 10 before they can accept Tier Four Internal Skill Level 41 quest. </font>
