desc_item_wmp_1n_cc_jldet_a_1=Lao Liang give you the martial arts script because he thinks you are talented. Contains the remain moves of the Winds of Fury.
desc_book_cs_jh_fmzf01_1st=From the "Crazed Demon Staff" Skill Set. Stand tall and deliver a powerful sweep.
desc_book_cs_jh_fmzf02_1st=From the "Crazed Demon Staff" Skill Set. A vicious throat strike.
desc_book_cs_jh_fmzf03_1st=From the "Crazed Demon Staff" Skill Set. A reckless, unstoppable strike.
desc_book_cs_jh_fmzf04_1st=From the "Crazed Demon Staff" Skill Set. A flying kick followed by a series of consecutive strikes that sends the enemy flying.
desc_book_cs_jh_fmzf05_1st=From the "Crazed Demon Staff" Skill Set.
desc_book_cs_jh_fmzf06_1st=From the "Crazed Demon Staff" Skill Set. Smash through the enemy's ranks and throw their chi into disorder.
desc_book_cs_jh_fmzf07_1st=From the "Crazed Demon Staff" Skill Set. Unleash a demonic rage upon the enemy.
desc_book_cs_jh_fmzf08_1st=From the "Crazed Demon Staff" Skill Set.
desc_book_cs_jh_fmzf09_1st=From the "Crazed Demon Staff" Skill Set. Lunge at the enemy and deliver a crushing kick.
desc_box_jyz_zhenpai_3_1=Apparently a chest can be found in the box, but the greedy always leave empty handed, so pray to Heaven. (different quality chests can appear)
