desc_ng_book_jh_205_5th=A rare power in Jianghu. "The style of the toad." Toads often remain stationary. They can remain in the ground unmoving to preserve their energy, even when moving about they do not need much nourishment", toad style also looks at preserving poison. It is an extremely difficult discipline of internal skill. If successful, the yang energy is greatly increased , use calm to defend against movement, fight poison with poison, stand firm against opponents.
desc_ng_book_jh_307_5th=One of the most infamous kung fu styles in Jianghu. "The force from the heart, not a hair's width inaccuracy, blood bath and destruction" are the tenets, use evil thoughts to attack, can cause unstoppable bleeding, enemies can drain out if not careful. It is looked down by upright Jianghu members, but its power is considerable.
