desc_book_cs_jh_mlyqj05_f_1st=Life and death together, an eternity becomes an instant, the promise will never be broken.
desc_book_cs_jh_mlyqj08_f_1st=The mountain peaks touch the clouds, wine drowns my bitterness, silently the cold spring flows, I lie with my sword, drunkenly listening to the wind.
