cs_006_008=Besides the Dog Staff, Beggar's Sect is famous for its Eighteen Dragon Subduing Palm. Hope I have a chance to see it.
cj_002_019_001=I have no money now. So I have to join Xingxiu Sect to get some money, even though it is infamous in Jianghu.
cj_002_019_002=I have to join some faction to protect myself in Ruined Valley. So I joined Xingxiu Sect for now.
cj_002_019_003=To find a place to cultivate my internal skill, I joined Xingxiu Sect in Ruined Valley.
cj_002_020_001=I've joined Xiaoyao Cave to get a chance of stealing its Devour the Stars Script.
cj_004_014_001=Xiong Family seems to have a relationship with Hungry Tiger Stronghold. I want to investigate.
cj_004_015_001=I failed to find a job. Thank goodness Hungry Tiger Stronghold adopted me.
cj_004_015_002=Hungry Tiger Stronghold is notorious in Jianghu. I pretend to join them to get detailed information about their leader.
cj_004_015_003=Hungry Tiger Stronghold bandits have been doing business under the table. I must get inside their compound.
cj_004_016_001=Hungry Tiger Stronghold bandits have been doing business under the table. I must get inside their compound.
cj_005_009_003=More people come to challenge Phantom's Mountain Manor. So the leader has to recruit more guards to deal with them.
cj_005_011_001=Phantom's Mountain Manor offers a high salary. So I work there as a servant.
cj_005_011_002=I got into some trouble. To lay low, I joined Phantom's Mountain Manor and worked there as a servant.
cj_005_011_003=It's said that Phantom's Mountain Manor Leader always meets Jianghu people. So I work there as a servant to investigate.
cj_005_012_002=Phantom's Mountain Manor Leader has agreed to share marital arts with me. So I will practice skills here for some time.
cj_005_012_003=To increase the disciples' skills, Phantom's Mountain Manor Leader has invited us to join his exchange program. So I will stay here for a period.
cj_006_003_001=Eighteen Dragon Subduing Palm requires great strength. So I carry water every day to train myself.
cj_006_010_002=Beast Villa is undergoing expansion. Stones are badly needed. So I've started to collect stones in the mountain.
cj_006_011_002=Beast Villa is building cages. Wood is badly needed. So I've started to collect stones in the mountain.
cj_006_011_003=Surrounded by mountains, Beast Villa is rich in rare wood resources.
cj_006_012_003=There are many rare herbs in Beast Villa. So I go to collect rare herbs in the mountains again.
cj_006_013_001=There are many fish in the river between Beggar's Sect and Beast Villa. So I went back to fishing.
cj_006_013_002=The fish here is fat and big. It's a good place to fish.
cj_006_015_001=I'm a guard in Beast Villa now. It's really a good job.
cj_006_015_003=I hunted a rare animal and offered it to the Beast Villa Leader. As a result, I gained a high-salary job of patrolling the villa.
cj_006_017_002=Beast Villa is expanding cages. More craftsmen are needed. So I was recruited.
cj_006_017_003=I hunted a rare animal and offered it to the Beast Villa Leader. That's how I got my job as a servant.
cj_007_004_001=I don't want to stay the wild any more. So I became a guard in Beast Villa.
cj_007_013_003=Surrounded by mountains, Beast Villa is rich in rare wood resources.
cj_012_009_001=I hope I can learn some skills from Mount Song Sword Sect.
cj_012_009_002=I was accepted to share skills with Mount Song Sword Sect.
cj_012_009_003=I won a match against a Mount Song Sword Sect disciple. I was finally accepted to be a disciple there.
cj_012_010_002=Mount Song Sword Sect is undergoing expansion. More craftsmen are needed. So I was recruited.
cj_012_010_003=I work for Mount Song Sword Sect as a servant.
cj_013_026_001=I entered Ancient Tomb Sect by accident. I have to join them for now.
cj_013_026_002=I want to find out the secret of Ancient Tomb Sect. So I joined.
cj_013_026_003=I entered Ancient Tomb Sect by accident. I have to join them for now.
cj_017_028_002=Huanhua Sword Sect has always enjoyed respect and admiration from Jianghu people for the many good deeds it has done. It was a great honor to be able to become one of them.
desc_key_qy_em_jindilingpai_0=A token that allows you to enter Peacock Villa. Talk to Wang Jiamian<font color="#ff0000"> (1337 866) </font>to enter Peacock Villa. (Gather a team. This Forbidden Area can only be entered 5 times per hour.)
desc_yxhy_item_0=After a Spy takes this pill, using Steal the Sun grants them a chance to receive an opponent's Level 1 Internal Skill Secret and increases the chance of obtaining 3 pieces of Information. <font color="#FF0000">(This pill can be purchased from the Elite Patrol next to the Intelligence Officer)</font>
desc_pet_diao_1_0=<font color="#ff0000">[Right-click to move the pet into collection interface]</font><br><font color="#ff0000">Attention: Once in the collection interface, it becomes bound to the player and cannot be removed. If it is a time-limited pet, once the time has run out it will be deleted automatically.</font><br><font face="Default" color="#008B8B" >You cannot summon a pet in the New World. </font><br>When summoned, the player will recover 10 Flying Skill points each second when using Sit and Breathe.<br><font color="#ff0000">(Tip: Once the Age of Wushu Record Tier 2 is available, VIP players who own a pet and have reached "Flows With Chi" can speak with the Beast Villa Guide in Beast Villa to join the faction. (Coordinates: Beggars' Sect 589, 853)</font>
desc_pet_diao_2_0=<font color="#ff0000">[Right-click to move the pet into collection interface]</font><br><font color="#ff0000">Attention: Once in the collection interface, it becomes bound to the player and cannot be removed. If it is a time-limited pet, once the time has run out it will be deleted automatically.</font><br><font face="Default" color="#008B8B" >You cannot summon a pet in the New World. </font><br>When summoned, the player will recover 5 Flying Skill points each second when using Sit and Breathe.<br><font color="#ff0000">(Tip: Once the Age of Wushu Record Tier 2 is available, VIP players who own a pet and have reached "Flows With Chi" can speak with the Beast Villa Guide in Beast Villa to join the faction. (Coordinates: Beggars' Sect 589, 853)</font>
desc_pet_diao_3_0=<font color="#ff0000">[Right-click to move the pet into collection interface]</font><br><font color="#ff0000">Attention: Once in the collection interface, it becomes bound to the player and cannot be removed. If it is a time-limited pet, once the time has run out it will be deleted automatically.</font><br><font face="Default" color="#008B8B" >You cannot summon a pet in the New World. </font><br>When summoned, the player will recover 5 Flying Skill points each second when using Sit and Breathe.<br><font color="#ff0000">(Tip: Once the Age of Wushu Record Tier 2 is available, VIP players who own a pet and have reached "Flows With Chi" can speak with the Beast Villa Guide in Beast Villa to join the faction. (Coordinates: Beggars' Sect 589, 853)</font>
desc_pet_hou_1_0=<font color="#ff0000">[Right click to move the Familiar to Favorite interface]</font><br><font color="#ff0000">Note: When you move the Familiar to Favorite interface, it cannot be taken out and will be bound with you. If the Familiar has time limit, it will be deleted once it expires. </font><br>It jumps up to player's back. A naughty pet. It can beg, dance, and play fist skill. When pet is summoned, player will recover 5 flying skill value when sit and breathe. <br><font color="#ff0000">Tips: When Age of Wushu Record Tier 2 is available, players who own a Familiar and have reached Flows With Chi can talk with Beast Villa Guide in Beast Villa to join the faction. (Coordinates: Beggar's Sect 589 853)</font>
desc_pet_hou_1_qy_0=<font color="#ff0000">[Right click to move the Familiar to Favorite interface]</font><br><font color="#ff0000">Note: When you move the Familiar to Favorite interface, it cannot be taken out and will be bound with you. If the Familiar has time limit, it will be deleted once it expires. </font><br><font face="Default" color="#008B8B" >You cannot summon a pet in the New World.</font><br>It jumps up to player's back. A naughty pet. It can beg, dance, and play fist skill. When pet is summoned, player will recover 5 flying skill value when sit and breathe. <br><font color="#ff0000">Tips: When Age of Wushu Record Tier 2 is available, players who own a Familiar and have reached Flows With Chi can talk with Beast Villa Guide in Beast Villa to join the faction. (Coordinates: Beggar's Sect 589 853)</font>
desc_pet_niao_1_0=<font color="#ff0000">[Right-click to move the pet into collection interface]</font><br><font color="#ff0000">Attention: Once in the collection interface, it becomes bound to the player and cannot be removed. If it is a time-limited pet, once the time has run out it will be deleted automatically.</font><br><font face="Default" color="#008B8B" >You cannot summon a pet in the New World. </font><br> It can help players send letters. When players enter Sit and Breathe, they will recover 5 Flying Skill points each second. <br><font color="#ff0000">(Tip: Once the Age of Wushu Record Tier 2 is available, VIP players who own a pet and have reached "Flows With Chi" can speak with the Beast Villa Guide in Beast Villa to join the faction. (Coordinates: Beggars' Sect 589, 853)</font>
desc_qy_yd_002_0=A book of lots of Random Encounters. Roaming in Jianghu can often increase one's rate of Random Encounters. Opportunities are available for people who are prepared.
desc_item_wssz_rumen_1_0=Beast Villa entry certificate. Players with this certificate can go the Beggar's Sect scene to find the Beast Villa Guide (Coordinate: 587,851) and ask him to join the Beast Villa! <br><font color="#ff0000">[Tip: Players with this item and with the strength of Flows With Chi can join the Beast Villa]</font>
desc_item_wssz_rumen_2_0=Beast Villa entry certificate. Players with this certificate can go the Beggar's Sect scene to find the Beast Villa Guide (Coordinate: 587,851) and ask him to join the Beast Villa! <br><font color="#ff0000">[Tip: Players with this item and with the strength of Flows With Chi can join the Beast Villa]</font>
desc_item_wssz_rumen_3_0=Beast Villa entry certificate. Players with this certificate can go the Beggar's Sect scene to find the Beast Villa Guide (Coordinate: 587,851) and ask him to join the Beast Villa! <br><font color="#ff0000">[Tip: Players with this item and with the strength of Flows With Chi can join the Beast Villa]</font>
desc_box_tab_b_1=This box contains the illustration of a random male costume.
desc_box_tab_g_1=This box contains the illustration of a random female costume.
desc_book_zs_hiddenwp0000301_0=A hidden waepon skill created by the crimson fairy, Li Mochu. Easy to use but so fast and acurate, even the most skilled martial artists struggle to evade it.
desc_book_zs_hiddenwp0000401_0=A hidden weapon skill unique to the Ancient Tomb Sect. It seems harmless but in fact is quite dangerous. The little dragon girl once used it while sparring with her martial arts sister Li Maochu, which gave her a big advantage.
desc_book_zs_hiddenwp0010501_0=Developed by Qiu Qianchi, wife of Heartless Valley's Master, Gongsun Zhi. This technique uses one's inner Energy to hurl the hidden weapon, a method for only exceptionally skilled practitioners.
desc_book_zs_hiddenwp0000301=You need to learn: Normal Hidden Weapon Attack<br><font color="#FFAE00">Read this part and you can learn the Hidden Moves: Level 1 of Ice Soul Needle Technique.</font>
desc_book_zs_hiddenwp0000401=You need to learn: Normal Hidden Weapon Attack<br><font color="#FFAE00">Read this part and you can learn the Hidden Moves: Level 1 of Jade Bee Needle Technique.</font>
desc_book_zs_hiddenwp0001001=You need to learn: Normal Hidden Weapon Attack<br><font color="#FFAE00">Read this part and you can learn the Hidden Moves: Level 1 of White-Browed Needle Technique.</font>
desc_book_zs_hiddenwp0010501=You need to learn: Normal Hidden Weapon Attack<br><font color="#FFAE00">Read this part and you can learn the Hidden Moves: Level 1 of Iron Jujube Pit Technique.</font>
desc_book_zs_hiddenwp0010801=You need to learn: Normal Hidden Weapon Attack<br><font color="#FFAE00">Read this part and you can learn the Hidden Moves: Level 1 of Ice Soul Pellet Technique.</font>
desc_book_zs_hiddenwp0030601=You need to learn: Normal Hidden Weapon Attack<br><font color="#FFAE00">Read this part and you can learn the Hidden Moves: Level 1 of Bone-Penetrating Ziwu Needle Technique.</font>
desc_book_zs_hiddenwp0031001=You need to learn: Normal Hidden Weapon Attack<br><font color="#FFAE00">Read this part and you can learn the Hidden Moves: Level 1 of Gold Snake Awl Technique.</font>
desc_box_cardgift_001_1=<font color="#FFB428">This elegant chest contains 100 Lore collectible cards.</font>
desc_tab_card_001_0=Open the <font color="#FFB428">Scenery Diary Collecting Card</font> and have a chance to get this certificate. You can exchange for Three Star Scenery Diary in the event ambassador. <font color="#FFFF00">Suzhou (486, 366), Chengdu (749, 673), Luoyang (1090, 666), Jinling (1206, 1016) and Yanjing (328, 92).</font>
desc_tab_card_002_0=Open the <font color="#FFB428">Scenery Diary Collecting Card</font> and have a chance to get this certificate. You can exchange for Two Star Scenery Diary in the event ambassador. <font color="#FFFF00">Suzhou (486, 366), Chengdu (749, 673), Luoyang (1090, 666), Jinling (1206, 1016) and Yanjing (328, 92).</font>
sl_jianghu_jdcs001_01=It is dangerous in Peacock Villa. I can only bring you into each level of difficulty once a week.
sl_jianghu_jdcs001_02=I want to go to Peacock Villa.
desc_grouppurchase_item_tpyj_1=Receive a Tier 1 Internal Skill Achievement Methods of a random school.
desc1_sword_leader_jzt_001=<font color="#FFB428" face="font_name_tittle">Scholars Ultimate Weapon</font><br>Wielded by the Leader of Scholars, Xiao Bieqing, it is said the sword was given to him by his late father. When it was made, it was said to have emitted a green light, representing a bad omen
desc1_cosh_leader_gb_001=<font color="#FFB428" face="font_name_tittle">A Beggars' Sect</font> Ultimate Weapon.<br>Forged in Tianshan Cold Jade, it is ensconced in a noble shade of green and wielded only by the leader of the Beggar's Sect. It is a symbol of supreme power.
