wx_menu_210=I want to change "<font color="#ffff00">Dog Beating Staff Technique (Ancient Manual)</font>"
wx_title_210=Use the items below to change the properties of "<font color="#ffff00">Dog Beating Staff Technique (Ancient Manual)</font>".
wx_menu_214=I want to change <font color="#ffff00">"Hu Family Blade"</font>
wx_title_214=Click the following options and you can change the property of the <font color="#ffff00">"Hu Family Blade" </font>that you have learned
wx_menu_219=I want to change <font color="#ffff00">Whirlwind Kick</font>.
wx_title_219=Click the following options to change learned <font color="#ffff00">Whirlwind Kick</font> to the attributes you want.
wx_menu_225=I'm changing <font color="#ffff00">Spirit Step Sword</font>
wx_title_225=Click on an option below to adapt the skill attribute of the skill set <font color="#ffff00">Spirit Step Sword</font> to match the skill attribute.
wx_menu_227=I'm changing <font color="#ffff00">Joined Fingers</font>
wx_title_227=Click on an option below to adapt the skill attribute of the skill set <font color="#ffff00">Joined Fingers</font> to match the skill attribute (Yin, Yang, hardness, Softness, Taichi) of your ready-for-use internal skill, so as to get better power bonus for each skill in the skill set
wx_menu_229=I'm changing <font color="#ffff00">Eight Skills of the Broken Lotus</font>
wx_title_229=Click on an option below to adapt the skill attribute of the skill set <font color="#ffff00">Eight Skills of the Broken Lotus</font> to match the skill attribute (Yin, Yang, hardness, Softness, Taichi) of your ready-for-use internal skill, so as to get better power bonus for each skill in the skill set
wx_menu_233=I'm changing <font color="#ffff00">Curled Branch Sword</font>
