desc_box_power_redeem_1=This treasure box from the Western Frontier contains <font color="#FFB428">Refined Snow Lotus Pills ×1</font>, <font color="#FFB428">Tendon-Relaxing Pill ×10</font>, <font color="#FFB428">Purple-Spirit Pill ×25</font>, <font color="#FFB428">School Honor Certificate (5) ×1</font>. All items bestow power to the player.<br><font color="#FF0000">Warning: this treasure chest will disappear in 1 day. Please open and claim your items as soon as possible.</font>
desc_box_hslj_gift01_0=To Celebrate the "Mount Hua Competition" grand opening, all current players receive a "Mount Hua Competition" gift bag.
