desc_box_oldserver_redeem_1=Medicine made by a mysterious herbalist, including <font color="#FFB428">Refined Snow Lotus Pill×1</font>, <font color="#FFB428">Tendon-Relaxing Pill×10</font>, <font color="#FFB428">Purple Spirit Pill×25</font> and <font color="#FFB428">School Honor Certificate (5) × 1</font>. Use the pills to greatly increase your skills<br><font color="#FF0000">Note: This chest is only available for one day and will be automatically removed once the time has run out. Be sure to use it quickly!</font>
desc_box_novice_redeem_1=Medicine made by a Jianghu hermit, including <font color="#FFB428">Refined Snow Lotus Pill × 1</font>, <font color="#FFB428">Tendon-Relaxing Pill× 10</font> and <font color="#FFB428">Purple Spirit Pill × 25</font>, <font color="#FFB428">School Honor Certificate (5) × 1</font>. Ingest the pills to greatly increase your skills<br><font color="#FF0000">Note: This chest is only available for one day and will be automatically removed once the time has run out. Be sure to use it quickly!</font>
jiuyinzhizhenpai3=I have a Mystic Iron Badge.
jiuyinzhizhenpai4=To obtain a Mystic Iron Badge proves that you are very skilled indeed. Give me the badge, and I shall give you the reward from the Prince.
jiuyinzhizhenpai6=Submit the Mystic Iron Badge
desc_ng_book_jh_507_s2_0=To learn this heavenly power, first brandish a blade and castrate thyself; the forces of heaven and earth will reverse, and new life will begin! This skill was established by a eunuch, and many years later ended up in the hands of the Cultist Dongfang Bubai. He spent many hard years perfecting the Essence of the Flower Shadow and Flower Needle and became a powerful warrior. The price to pay for this skill could not be any higher. A man must lose his prowess for certain passions. But if he successfully learns the movements which flow like wind and strike like lightning, he can be unstoppable. With fists flying like thousands of needles at once, he chants, "The sun rises in the East! I alone am undefeated!" <br>Requirements: Male characters must cleanse themselves. <br>Go to <font color="#EE7600">Jinling (677,241)</font> and ask Shi Chengen about the cleansing process.
desc_ng_book_jh_507_s3_0=To learn this heavenly power, first brandish a blade and castrate thyself; the forces of heaven and earth will reverse, and new life will begin! This skill was established by a eunuch, and many years later ended up in the hands of the Cultist Dongfang Bubai. He spent many hard years perfecting the Essence of the Flower Shadow and Flower Needle and became a powerful warrior. The price to pay for this skill could not be any higher. A man must lose his prowess for certain passions. But if he successfully learns the movements which flow like wind and strike like lightning, he can be unstoppable. With fists flying like thousands of needles at once, he chants, "The sun rises in the East! I alone am undefeated!"
desc_ng_book_jh_306_s2=<font color="#FFAE00">Read this scroll to receive the internal skill: Star Vortex Level 1 to 36</font>
desc_ng_book_jh_306_s2_0=Founded by Sun Moon Cult Leader Ren Woxing, it is an internal mental skill created through a combination of good and evil Chi. If successful, your Chi paths become unobstructed, and the body feels empty and clear, one can freely absorb or dispel energy. It has been said that if successful in learning the skill, one would be one with heaven, with the power to yield the sun and the moon. One can easily absorb or dispel energy from others or effortlessly capture objects in the air. It is indeed an unparalleled, arrogant, and indomitable skill.
desc_ng_book_jh_306_s3=<font color="#FFAE00">Read this scroll to receive the internal skill: Star Vortex Level 37 to 49</font>
desc_ng_book_jh_306_s3_0=Founded by Sun Moon Cult Leader Ren Woxing, it is an internal mental skill created through a combination of good and evil Chi. If successful, your Chi paths become unobstructed, and the body feels empty and clear, one can freely absorb or dispel energy. It has been said that if successful in learning the skill, one would be one with heaven, with the power to yield the sun and the moon. One can easily absorb or dispel energy from others or effortlessly capture objects in the air. It is indeed an unparalleled, arrogant, and indomitable skill.
jhzb_khbd_menu_01=Sir, I hear that you are skilled in the Helianthus Codex. Would you mind giving me a tip or two?
jhzb_khbd_title_01=Everyone wishes to harness the great power of the Helianthus Codex. They only think about how it will benefit them. But they forget that the road is full of pain and agony.
jhzb_khbd_menu_02=What are the powers of the Helianthus Codex?
jhzb_khbd_title_02=Its powers lie in its unsurpassable speed. By the time you sense a punch is about to be thrown, it has already landed!
jhzb_khbd_menu_03=So what is the most practical way to train in this method?
jhzb_khbd_menu_04=How much basic skill do I need to learn the Helianthus Codex?
jhzb_khbd_title_04=Hmm... Seeing as you appear to be a diligent person, I shall teach you the Novice Skills of the Helianthus Codex.
jhzb_khbd_menu_05=I have learned all the Novice Skills of the Helianthus Codex.
jhzb_khbd_title_05=Good. Then let me teach you some more advanced skills of the Helianthus Codex.
jhzb_xxdf_menu_01=Sir, I hear that you are skilled in Star Vortex. Would you mind giving me a tip or two?
jhzb_xxdf_title_01=Everyone wishes to harness the great power of Star Vortex. They only think about how it will benefit them. But they forget that the road is full of pain and agony.
jhzb_xxdf_menu_02=What are the powers of Star Vortex?
jhzb_xxdf_title_02=Its powers lie in the way that the internal skill is gathered for one's own use.
jhzb_xxdf_menu_03=So what is the most practical way to train in this method?
jhzb_xxdf_menu_04=How much basic skill do I need to learn Star Vortex?
jhzb_xxdf_title_04=Hmm... You appear to be a hard worker. I will teach you the Novice Skills of Star Vortex.
jhzb_xxdf_menu_05=I have learned all the Novice Skills of Star Vortex.
jhzb_xxdf_title_05=Good. Then let me teach you some more advanced skills of Star Vortex.
desc_superbook_xxdf_rw_rg01_0=Can neutralize turmoil of internal skills caused by Star Vortex.
desc_superbook_xxdf_rw_rg02_0=Can neutralize turmoil of internal skills caused by Star Vortex.
desc_superbook_xxdf_rw_rg03_0=The neutralizing effect for Star Vortex is temporary. The effect will return after a while.
role_title_1020=Dongfang Bubai
origin_1011_desc=In the state of birth, the Helianthus is a pure spirit with no stray thoughts, and its energy is calm and rounded. Yin and yang are absorbed into the body; 'tis a pure rebirth in which one resembles a newborn infant.
origin_1012_desc=In the state of blossoming, the Helianthus absorbs medicine, its fingers are light, and its gestures are tender. It flows freely like the wind and clouds. It is untroubled.
origin_1013_desc=In the state of metamorphosis, the Helianthus absorbs yin and yang, its features are the most delicate, and its fingers are dainty and exquisite. Yet when strength is needed, it flows unhindered. It is an infinite force from the heavens.
origin_1014_desc=In the state of the sword chi, the Helianthus becomes a swift blade in which Chi and blood work side by side. All is led by Chi and tempered by blood. It is an everlasting embodied by pure, unyielding Chi.
origin_1015_desc=In the state of its spiritual form, the Helianthus is silent and clear, its heart untroubled. The energy of heaven and earth, essence of sun and moon are indomitable and unstoppable.
origin_1016_desc=In the state of divination, the heart of the Helianthus becomes a vast chamber, free from mundane trappings, and Original Simplicity is Recovered. When one can cast off these shackles, what need is there for such a skill? Movement like lightning, death in a single stroke; one with heaven and earth, nothing can stop me!
origin_1021_desc=In the state of origin, when Star Vortex first appears, it is full of mystery and has the answers to life and death. Yin is transformed to Chi and flows throughout the body as its base energy. Its accompanying evil cannot be dispelled.
origin_1022_desc=In the state of empty void, the energy of Star Vortex is condensed to strengthen the pathways of Chi. All is rebuilt, and at this point all seems empty and clear, awaiting rebirth.
origin_1023_desc=In the state of greed and avarice, all of the energy points of the Star Vortex are opened; first they become loosened, then they solidify. Skills are absorbed and taken for the self. This is the easiest stage to lose control, which will cause the energy to consume the self.
origin_1024_desc=In the state of engulfing the cosmos, Star Vortex energy becomes a countless stream that unravels all power and fortifies the body. Skills increase by leaps and bounds, and the individual is transported into a realm of ultimate growth.
origin_1025_desc=In the state of madness, the energy of Star Vortex is concentrated into a single point that absorbs all skills. Training becomes unstoppable, and one's skills increase in every battle. Madness and arrogance reach a pinnacle, causing even the greatest enemies to be viewed as simple fodder.
origin_1026_desc=In the peerless state of an unrivaled contender, the energy of Star Vortex abounds everywhere. Nothing can stand in its path. Space and time become meaningless. Life is comparable to heaven and earth. Nothing upon this earth nor under the heavens can compare to it.
desc_ng_jh_306=Founded by Sun Moon Cult Leader Ren Woxing, it is an internal mental skill created through a combination of good and evil Chi. If successful, your Chi paths become unobstructed, and the body feels empty and clear, one can freely absorb or dispel energy. It has been said that if successful in learning the skill, one would be one with heaven, with the power to yield the sun and the moon. One can easily absorb or dispel energy from others or effortlessly capture objects in the air. It is indeed an unparalleled, arrogant, and indomitable skill.
desc_ng_jh_507=To learn this heavenly power, first brandish a blade and castrate thyself; the forces of heaven and earth will reverse, and new life will begin! This skill was established by a eunuch, and many years later ended up in the hands of the Cultist Dongfang Bubai. He spent many hard years perfecting the Essence of the Flower Shadow and Flower Needle and became a powerful warrior. The price to pay for this skill could not be any higher. A man must lose his prowess for certain passions. But if he successfully learns the movements which flow like wind and strike like lightning, he can be unstoppable. With fists flying like thousands of needles at once, he chants, "The sun rises in the East! I alone am undefeated!"
desc_ng_jh_105=A kind of strange internal skill. Power law practice is extremely harsh, must take the snow mountains, nano world to Yin to the cold air, sink Dantian, penetrating through main and collateral channels, the number of years Kechu into. But after practicing Dacheng, if the body of ice, cold spray, when the enemy to a head, dormant enemy pulse, may be: erosion of bone, muscle, body sealing hundred point dull. It is strange, it is terrible!
desc_ng_jh_205=A rare power in Jianghu. "The style of the toad." Toads often remain stationary. They can remain in the ground unmoving to preserve their energy, even when moving about they do not need much nourishment", toad style also looks at preserving poison. It is an extremely difficult discipline of internal skill. If successful, the yang energy is greatly increased , use calm to defend against movement, fight poison with poison, stand firm against opponents.
desc_ng_jh_307=One of the most infamous kung fu styles in Jianghu. "The force from the heart, not a hair's width inaccuracy, blood bath and destruction" are the tenets, use evil thoughts to attack, can cause unstoppable bleeding, enemies can drain out if not careful. It is looked down by upright Jianghu members, but its power is considerable.
desc_box_wuxue_lhq=<font color="#ff0000">Right-Click to open and receive a random page from level 1-6 Arhat Fist.</font>
qy_qiegao_009=This is the lost secret medicine of the Western Regions. It was made from Bone-Healing Cream and Thousand Years Snow Lotus. It can not only revive men, but also activate Meridians. 1 Liang each. How many do you want?
desc_ydhd_lidan_001=[Intro] A rare item from the Western Region - <font color="#FF0000">Fortune Egg</font>. With this egg, players can play the <font color="#FF8C00">Egg Breaking Activity</font> minigame.<br>[Rewards] Break eggs in the minigame to win <font color="#FF00FF">a work bench, Cultivation Points, medicines, Lucky Runes or other rewards.</font><br>[How to Obtain] You can get eggs by participating in a <font color=""#00FF00"">Challenge Arena</font>, <font color=""#00FF00"">Forbidden Instance</font> or on the <font color=""#00FF00"">Battlefield</font>.<br><font color="#00FFFF">Right-click to open the interface to select the egg.</font>
desc_ydhd_lidan_002=[Intro] A rare item from the Western Region - <font color="#FFFF00">Golden Dragon Egg</font>. With this egg, players can play the <font color="#FF8C00">Egg Breaking Activity</font> minigame.<br>[Rewards] Break eggs in the minigame to win <font color="#FF00FF">a work bench, Cultivation Points, medicines, Lucky Runes or other rewards.</font><br>[How to Obtain] You can get eggs by participating in a <font color=""#00FF00"">Challenge Arena</font>, <font color=""#00FF00"">Forbidden Instance</font> or on the <font color=""#00FF00"">Battlefield</font>.<br><font color="#00FFFF">Right-click to open the interface to select the egg.</font>
desc_ydhd_lidan_003=[Intro] A rare item from the Western Region - <font color="#00FF00">Jade Egg</font>. With this egg, players can play the <font color="#FF8C00">Egg Breaking Activity</font> minigame.<br>[Rewards] Break eggs in the minigame to win <font color="#FF00FF">a work bench, Cultivation Points, medicines, Lucky Runes or other rewards.</font><br>[How to Obtain] You can get eggs by participating in a <font color=""#00FF00"">Challenge Arena</font>, <font color=""#00FF00"">Forbidden Instance</font> or on the <font color=""#00FF00"">Battlefield</font>.<br><font color="#00FFFF">Right-click to open the interface to select the egg.</font>
desc_cs_jh_mlyqj05_m=Life and death together, an eternity becomes an instant, the promise will never be broken.
desc_cs_jh_mlyqj08_m=The mountain peaks touch the clouds, wine drowns my bitterness, silently the cold spring flows, I lie with my sword, drunkenly listening to the wind.
desc_cs_jh_mlyqj05_f=Life and death together, an eternity becomes an instant, the promise will never be broken.
desc_cs_jh_mlyqj08_f=The mountain peaks touch the clouds, wine drowns my bitterness, silently the cold spring flows, I lie with my sword, drunkenly listening to the wind.
desc_box_card_4001_1=<font color="#FFB428">Exquisite Treasure Box - Includes a Flying Cloud Horse, Dragon Scale Robe (Male), two diagrams for Snow Feather Crown (Male), Dragon Scale Robe (Female), two diagrams for Blue Teardrops Chain (Female) and a Twin Saddle.</font>
desc_box_battle_zadan_1=Battlefield Reward: Open to earn one of 3 eggs: A Fortune Egg, Golden Dragon Egg or a Jade Egg. And there is a chance to get one among Silver Hammer, Gold Hammer, or Jade Hammer.
desc_box_wnhd_fmzf=Documents the <font color="#FFFF00">Madness Staff</font>.
desc_box_hd_aqsf=Open to receive a randomly assigned <font color="#FFFF00">Hidden Weapon Booklet</font> and <font color="#FFFF00">Hidden Weapon Component</font>
desc_item_qywx_003_0=An ancient and mysterious iron ore. It can be used to create unique weapons.
desc_gamety_item_book_zhenfa_jh_005=The designer is Gongsun Zhi who is the leader of Heartless Valley. There are eight people in the array. Two people in a group stand at the four directions. They change steps skillfully to bottle up the enemy. The enemy is like trapped fish. It's very hard to escape.
desc_zhenfa_fq_03=The Couples Array famed throughout Jianghu, inspired by the Book of Houhan: "The husband always there; the wife she nourishes, together as one, neither before the other." A husband and wife must always work together as one! After the array is activated, not only can the married couple share damage, they can also work together to increase their power.
desc_baoxiang1012=A treasure chest containing Flying Cloud Horse Lore and a double saddle
