desc_book_CS_jl_fgz0508=Bone Corroding Palm training method. A terrifying skill which uses the wind to distribute poison all through the battlefield.
desc_book_CS_jl_fgz0509=Bone Corroding Palm training method. A terrifying skill which uses the wind to distribute poison all through the battlefield.
