desc_box_wnhd_czlb04_1=<font color="#FFB428">Cornucopia filled with gifts; open to get Top-up Reward Gift Pack(includes Zichen Pill*1, Spy Pill*2, Random Artifact*3), with a chance to get Top-up Reward "Artifact Gift Pack" (includes Zichen Pill*1, Gold Ingot Revival Pill *1, Random Artifact*5), Top-up Reward "Pet Gift Pack"(not bound)(Use to get "Jiangnan Monkey" Pet or "Mink of Lightning" Pet), Top-up Reward "Flying Cloud Horse Gift Pack"(not bound)(includes Flying Cloud Horse Lore*1).</font>
desc_box_match_school_pingzhen_02_0=Right click to open bag to get 5 <font color="#00FF00">School Honor Certificates</font> <font color="#00FF00">or Good Reward Evil Punishment Order</font>.
