desc_box_wnhd_sllb06_1=Age of Wushu welcomes your return.<br><font color="#FFB428">Gift Pack includes Reputation Voucher (10,000), Random Artifactx3, Silver Coins 200 Liang, abalone noodle soupx10, Strengthened Aromatic Powderx10, Dihuang Pillx10, Show The Tail But Hide The Headx10, Horse whistle "Dawan Horse" (14 days), Ruthless Set (14 days).Red Makeup Set (14 days).</font>
desc_pet_ying_1_0=<font color="#ff0000">[Right-click to move the pet into collection interface]</font><br><font color="#ff0000">Attention: Once in the collection interface, it becomes bound to the player and cannot be removed. If it is a time-limited pet, once the time has run out it will be deleted automatically.</font><br><font face="Default" color="#008B8B" >You cannot summon a pet in the New World. </font><br> It can help players send letters. When players enter Sit and Breathe, they will recover 5 Flying Skill points each second. <br><font color="#ff0000">(Tip: Once the Age of Wushu Record Tier 2 is available, VIP players who own a pet and have reached "Flows With Chi" can speak with the Beast Villa Guide in Beast Villa to join the faction. (Coordinates: Beggars' Sect 589, 853)</font>
desc_equip_weapon_cheap_501_0=The Nine Heavens Darksteel is extremely rare and valuable, and can be used as essence for equipment. <br>This essence material is suitable for weaponized silver armors under <font color=""#00FF00"">level 5</font>. <br><font color=""#00FF00"">Enhance costs will decrease 6 liang</font><br><font color=""#00FF00""> of bronze armor. Enhance costs will decrease 7 liang</font><br><font color=""#00FF00""> of iron armor. Enhance costs will decrease 8 liang</font><br><font color=""#00FF00""> of wooden armor. Enhance costs will decrease 8 taels</font><br>. Route to obtain: pass the <font color=""#00FF00"">Tiguan and drop off at the Forbidden Instance</font> to obtain.
qygp_title_jmy003=Please don't go! If you don't want Buddha's Fist, I have the Eighteen Dragon Subduing Palm, Nine-Yang Skill, and Xiao Li's Flying Blade…
