desc_ng_book_jh_201_9th=An Internal Skill created by Bai Zizai, the founder of Snow Mountain Sect. He believed in the saying “When you lack direction, lose something to gain something else.” You can use this skill to turn disaster into happiness or vice versa. You can also use it on enemies.
desc_ng_book_jh_201_10th=An Internal Skill created by Bai Zizai, the founder of Snow Mountain Sect. He believed in the saying “When you lack direction, lose something to gain something else.” You can use this skill to turn disaster into happiness or vice versa. You can also use it on enemies.
