desc_ng_book_jh_201_12th=An Internal Skill created by Bai Zizai, the founder of Snow Mountain Sect. He believed in the saying “When you lack direction, lose something to gain something else.” You can use this skill to turn disaster into happiness or vice versa. You can also use it on enemies.
desc_ng_book_jh_204_9th=Created by Hao Datong, the founder of the Hua Mountain Sect. It is a mental skill for cultivating inner pill. It is also supreme Xuangong of Daoist Martial Art. Kung fu starts from theory of “Yi” and comes from Non-polar diagram. When you finish studying, “Purple light Gang Qi” will be poured into the whole body. It can shock enemies with void inner skill.
desc_ng_book_jh_204_10th=Created by Hao Datong, the founder of the Hua Mountain Sect. It is a mental skill for cultivating inner pill. It is also supreme Xuangong of Daoist Martial Art. Kung fu starts from theory of “Yi” and comes from Non-polar diagram. When you finish studying, “Purple light Gang Qi” will be poured into the whole body. It can shock enemies with void inner skill.
