title_qygp_mlyqj_f_003=That night, I tended to Shan Er's wounds in the Tiger Forest, and Shan Er kept on asking me whether I was hurt. I watched her soft body and caring eyes, and I thought about protecting her for the rest of her life. We talked for the entire night. After returning back to Wudang the next day, Shan Er made a paper butterfly for me, and I drew a painting for Shan Er. Although we did not say it out loud, we both know that we have quietly wished to marry each other. Later in Wudang, we learned a couple's sword routine in isolation and named it the Spirit Step Sword... (Ling Guchong stares at the sky softly with some moisture in his eyes) Too bad, those are all just memories now. I will draw a painting each day when I think of her. I look at the woman in the painting and pretend that she is also looking at me...
title_qygp_mlyqj_m_003=That night, Disciple Chong helped me tend to my leg wound in the Tiger Forest. I felt so warm watching him carefully taking care of me. I am always so moved when I think about his battle with the tiger. We talked for the entire night that night. After returning back to Wudang the next day, I made a paper butterfly for Disciple Chong and he drew a painting of me. Although we did not say it out loud, we both know that we quietly wished to marry each other. Later in Wudang, we learned a couple's sword routine in isolation and named it the Spirit Step Sword... (Yue Lingshan stares at the sky softly with some moisture in her eyes) Too bad, those are all just memories now. Each day when I think of him, I will make a paper butterfly and quietly put it on my chest pretending I have given it to him...
desc_Item_qygp_dgb_000_0=Cover the whole chicken with lotus leaf, and mud it and bake it. It's very delicious.(<font color="#FF0000">Evil Men's Valley (541 391)</font>There is an old beggar is collecting it on the top of snow mountain. Gather 110 of it and visit him.)<br><font color="#00EEEE">(Need to learn Dog Beating Staff Technique Ancient Manual before asking Old Beggar for Dog Beating Staff Technique skills.)</font>
desc_Item_jh_mlyqj01_m_000_0=The exquisitely cut butterflies look lifelike, as if the wings can really flutter. The paper has a faint fragrance that elicits wonderful memories. <br>This paper cutting is made by Yue Lingshan and is filled with her longing for Ling Guchong. <br><font color="#EEAD0E">Legend has it that a wanderer at Suzhou, Biluo Forest (1115,948), is very interested in this. Collect 10 to try to find him. </font><br><font color="#00EEEE">(Ask for directions from Ling Guchong. The Spirit Step Sword Skill requires a couple to learn the Spirit Step Sword Skill moves)</font><br><font color="#FF0000">This random encounter can only be triggered by a male character)</font>
desc_Item_jh_mlyqj01_f_000_0=In the meticulous painting, the woman appears delightful, elegantly dressed, and is well liked by the people. <br>This painting is drawn by Ling Guchong and is filled with his longing for Yue Lingshan. <br><font color="#EEAD0E">Legend has it that a wanderer in the Biluo Forest of Suzhou, (1115,948), is very interested in this. Collect 10 to try to find her. </font><br><font color="#00EEEE">(Ask for directions from Yue Lingshan. The Spirit Step Sword Skill requires a couple to learn the Spirit Step Sword Skill moves)</font><br><font color="#FF0000">This random encounter can only be triggered by a female character)</font>
