desc_box_wnhd_gnhk02_1=Thank you for your continual support of Age of Wushu!<br><font color="#FFB428">Gift Box includes Random Artifact*5, Repairing Tool*20, Show The Tail But Hide The Head*5, Spy Pill*5.</font>
desc_box_wnhd_gnhk05_1=<font color="#FFB428">Gift Pack includes Qi Hai Concentration Pill*5, Large Ruyi Pill*2, Gold Ingot Revival Pill *2, Show The Tail But Hide The Head*5, Silver Coins 50 Liang.</font>
desc_box_power_redeem_new_1=This treasure box from the Western Frontier contains <font color="#FFB428">Refined Snow Lotus Pills ×1</font>, <font color="#FFB428">Tendon-Relaxing Pill ×10</font>, <font color="#FFB428">Purple-Spirit Pill ×25</font>, <font color="#FFB428">School Honor Certificate (5) ×1</font>. All items bestow power to the player.<br><font color="#FF0000">Warning: this treasure chest will disappear in 1 day. Please open and claim your items as soon as possible.</font>
desc_book_cs_jh_fmzf01_act=From the "Crazed Demon Staff" Skill Set. Stand tall and deliver a powerful sweep.
desc_book_cs_jh_fmzf02_act=From the "Crazed Demon Staff" Skill Set. A vicious throat strike.
desc_book_cs_jh_fmzf03_act=From the "Crazed Demon Staff" Skill Set. A reckless, unstoppable strike.
desc_book_cs_jh_fmzf04_act=From the "Crazed Demon Staff" Skill Set. A flying kick followed by a series of consecutive strikes that sends the enemy flying.
desc_book_cs_jh_fmzf05_act=From the "Crazed Demon Staff" Skill Set.
