desc_box_exchange_01_1=Rewards are given to those who have made significant contributions to school script stealing or protection. These can be: Royal Guards Martial Arts Skills, a certain chance to obtain Royal Guards Internal Skills or annotated martial arts scripts. (Requires scroll from the Royal Guards Regular Collection. Item is bound to player.)
desc_box_exchange_02_1=Rewards are given to those who have made significant contributions to school script stealing or protection. These can be: Beggars' Sect Martial Arts Skills, a certain chance to obtain Beggars' Sect Internal Skills or annotated martial arts scripts. (Requires scroll from the Beggars' Sect Regular Collection. Item is bound to player.)
desc_box_exchange_03_1=Rewards are given to those who have made significant contributions to school script stealing or protection. These can be: Scholars Sect Martial Arts Skills, a certain chance to obtain Scholars Internal Skills or annotated martial arts scripts. (Requires scroll from the Scholars Regular Collection. Item is bound to player.)
desc_box_exchange_05_1=Rewards are given to those who have made significant contributions to school script stealing or protection. These can be: Tangmen Sect Martial Arts Skills, a certain chance to obtain Tangmen Internal Skills or annotated martial arts scripts. (Requires scroll from the Tangmen Regular Collection. Item is bound to player.)
desc_box_exchange_06_1=Rewards are given to those who have made significant contributions to school script stealing or protection. These can be: Emei Sect Martial Arts Skills, a certain chance to obtain Emei Internal Skills or annotated martial arts scripts. (Requires scroll from the Emei Regular Collection. Item is bound to player.)
desc_box_exchange_07_1=Rewards are given to those who have made significant contributions to school script stealing or protection. These can be: Wudang Martial Arts Skills, a certain chance to obtain Wudang Internal Skills or annotated martial arts scripts. (Requires scroll from the Wudang Regular Collection. Item is bound to player.)
desc_box_exchange_08_1=Rewards are given to those who have made significant contributions to school script stealing or protection. These can be: Shaolin Sect Martial Arts Skills, a certain chance to obtain Shaolin Internal Skills or annotated martial arts scripts. (Requires scroll from the Shaolin Regular Collection. Item is bound to player.)
desc_box_exchange_11_1=Rewards are given to individuals who have made significant contribution to protect or seize the books of the schools. After opening, you can obtain rewards such as the Martial Arts Skill of the Royal Guards as well as get a certain chance to obtain the internal skill arts of the Royal Guards and annotated martial arts books.  (You must exchange with an important book of the Royal Guards)
desc_box_exchange_12_1=Rewards are given to individuals who have made significant contribution to protect or seize the books of the schools. After opening, you can obtain rewards such as the Martial Arts Skill of the Beggar's Sect as well as get a certain chance to obtain the internal skill arts of the Beggar's Sect and annotated martial arts books.  (You must exchange with an important book of the Beggar's Sect)
desc_box_exchange_13_1=Rewards are given to individuals who have made significant contribution to protect or seize the books of the schools. After opened, you can obtain rewards such as the Martial Arts Skill of the Scholar's Hall as well as get a certain chance to obtain the internal skill arts of the Scholar's Academy and annotated martial arts books.  (You must exchange with an important book of the Scholar's Academy)
desc_box_exchange_15_1=Rewards are given to individuals who have made significant contribution to protect or seize the books of the schools. After opened, you can obtain rewards such as the Martial Arts Skill of the Tangmen as well as get a certain chance to obtain the internal skill arts of Tangmen and annotated martial arts books.  (You must exchange with an important book of Tangmen)
desc_box_exchange_16_1=Rewards are given to those who have made significant contributions to school script stealing or protection. These can be: Emei Martial Arts Skills, a certain chance to obtain Emei Internal Skills or annotated martial arts scripts. (Requires scroll from the Emei Essential Collection. Item is bound to player.)
desc_box_exchange_17_1=Rewards are given to individuals who have made significant contribution to protect or seize the books of the schools. After opened, you can obtain rewards such as the Martial Arts Skill of Wudang as well as get a certain chance to obtain the internal skill arts of Wudang and annotated martial arts books.  (You must exchange with an important book of Wudang)
desc_box_exchange_18_1=Rewards are given to individuals who have made significant contribution to protect or seize the books of the schools. After opened, you can obtain rewards such as the Martial Arts Skill of Shaolin as well as get a certain chance to obtain the internal skill arts of Shaolin and annotated martial arts books.  (You must exchange with an important book of Shaolin)
desc_box_exchange_21_1=Rewards are given to those who have made significant contributions to School Raid or Script Protection. Rewards: Royal Guards Martial Arts Skills Level 1-5 and a chance to obtain Royal Guards Martial Arts Skills Level 6, Internal Skills, or annotated martial arts scripts. When completing Age of Wushu Record Traces of the Evil Cult incident, there is a chance to receive Royal Guards Martial Arts Skills Level 7. (Requires the Royal Guards Essential Collection.)
desc_box_exchange_22_1=Rewards are given to those who have made significant contributions in a School Raid or Script Protection. Rewards: Beggars' Sect Martial Arts Skills Level 1-5 and a chance to receive a Beggars' Sect Martial Arts Skills Level 6, Internal Skills or annotated martial arts scripts. Upon completing the Age of Wushu Record Traces of the Evil Cult incident, there's a chance to receive a Beggars' Sect Martial Arts Skills Level 7. (Requires the Beggars' Sect Essential Collection.)
desc_box_exchange_23_1=Rewards are given to those who have made significant contributions to the School Raid or Script Protection. Rewards: Scholars Martial Arts Skills Level 1-5 and a certain chance to receive a Scholars Martial Arts Skills Level 6, Internal Skills or annotated martial arts scripts. Upon completing the Age of Wushu Record Traces of the Evil Cult incident, there's a chance to receive a Scholars Martial Arts Skills Level 7. (Requires the Scholars Essential Collection.)
desc_box_exchange_25_1=Rewards are given to those who have made significant contributions to the School Raid or Script Protection. Rewards: A Tangmen Martial Arts Skills Level 1-5 and a chance to receive Tangmen Martial Arts Skills Level 6, Internal Skills or annotated martial arts scripts. Upon completing the Age of Wushu Record Traces of the Evil Cult incident, there's a chance to receive a Tangmen Martial Arts Skills Level 7. (Requires the Tangmen Essential Collection.)
desc_box_exchange_26_1=Rewards are given to those who have made significant contributions to the School Raid or Script Protection. Rewards: An Emei Martial Arts Skills Level 1-5 and a chance to receive an Emei Martial Arts Skills Level 6, Internal Skills or annotated martial arts scripts. Upon completing the Age of Wushu Record Traces of the Evil Cult incident, there's a chance to receive Emei Martial Arts Skills Level 7. (Requires the Emei Essential Collection.)
desc_box_exchange_27_1=Rewards are given to those who have made significant contributions to the School Raid or Script Protection. Rewards: A Wudang Martial Arts Skills Level 1-5 and a chance to obtain a Wudang Martial Arts Skills Level 6, Internal Skills or annotated martial arts scripts. Upon completing the Age of Wushu Record Traces of the Evil Cult incident, there's a chance to receive Wudang Martial Arts Skills Level 7. (Requires the Wudang Essential Collection.)
desc_box_exchange_28_1=Rewards are given to those who have made significant contributions to the School Raid or Script Protection. Rewards: Shaolin Martial Arts Skills Level 1-5 and a chance to receive Shaolin Martial Arts Skills Level 6, Internal Skills or annotated martial arts scripts. Upon completing the Age of Wushu Record Traces of the Evil Cult incident, there's a chance to receive Shaolin Martial Arts Skills Level 7. (Requires the Shaolin Essential Collection.)
desc_yhg_jiangli_xyhn=There are a few Dark Jade Plum Blossom Tokens and a chance to obtain a Palace Leader token.
desc_book_CS_jh_kfdf07_1st=When you hoist the sails to cross the sea, you will ride the winds and cleave the waves.
desc_ng_book_jh_105_1st=A kind of strange internal skill. Power law practice is extremely harsh, must take the snow mountains, nano world to Yin to the cold air, sink Dantian, penetrating through main and collateral channels, the number of years Kechu into. But after practicing Dacheng, if the body of ice, cold spray, when the enemy to a head, dormant enemy pulse, may be: erosion of bone, muscle, body sealing hundred point dull. It is strange, it is terrible!
