desc_ng_yh_001=Clear Jade Divine Skill is the exclusive power of the Palace of Shifting Flowers.
desc_itemschool000001_0=A token of love given by the Demon Blade Elder to Qin Hanzheng. The sword was set into the peak of Mount Tai so that the Demon Blade Elder will go meet Qin Hanzheng when he sees the sword.
desc_baoxiang1013=Luoyang House counterinsurgency reward of precious medicine. You also have the chance to win a chapter between 1 and 4 of the "Heartless Seven Skills" script, any novice style of the "Green Cloud Palm" skill set and any introductory chapter of the "Five Elements Mental Skill".
desc_baoxiang1014=Luoyang House counterinsurgency reward of precious medicine. You also have the chance to win a chapter between 1 and 4 of the "Heartless Seven Skills" script, any novice style of the "Green Cloud Palm" skill set, any style from chapter 4 of the "Green Cloud Palm" script or any novice or apprentice chapter of the "Five Elements Mental Skill" set.
desc_baoxiang1015=Luoyang House counterinsurgency reward of precious medicine. You also have the chance to win a single chapter of Heartless Seven Skills (Chapters 1 through 6), any one novice style of Green Cloud Palm, any one style of Green Cloud Palm (Chapters 4 through 6), any one novice, apprentice, student, or elder chapter of the Five Elements Mental Skill.
desc_baoxiang1017=Luoyang House counter-attack reward: A Ling Yuan Pill and  chance to win a single chapter of "Heartless Seven Skills" (Chapters 1 through 8), any one novice style of the "Green Cloud Palm", any one style of the "Green Cloud Palm" (Chapters 4 to 8), and any one novice, apprentice, student or elder chapter scroll fragments of the "Five Elements Mental Skill" set.
desc_item_wgm_huxindan_1=Pull oneself together. <br>Reduces chance of being Critical Hit. When receiving damage, there is a chance to trigger Heart Protection to withstand 10% of the damage. During Heart Protection, you will additionally get 10% of Crit Damage Reduction. Heart Protection effect can be triggered only once every 30 seconds.
title_wgm_020_01=The Red-Eyed Ice Toad is an extremely rare and poisonous item, and it has excellent supplemental for practicing the Deviant Vampire. An adult Red-Eyed Ice Toad help the Deviant Vampire to exert maximum power. Therefore, it is deemed as a rare treasure of the faction.
desc_box_thd_tf=Open for the chance to get a Peach Blossom Token, Island Leader Token, and the "Sound of the Blue Waves" skill set annotation book.
desc_box_yhg_hgyx_1=Materials required for novice Palace of Shifting Flowers disciples include chapters 1 to 9 of the Clear Jade Divine Skill Scroll.
desc_tqsj_tgsr_box03=Open the chest to receive Jianghu martial arts: one move from the Madness Staff technique
desc_tqsj_tgsr_box04=Open the chest to receive 10 faction certificates of world reputation
desc_tqsj_tgsr_box05=Open the chest to receive 1 sheepskin fragment
desc_tqsj_tgsr_box06=Open the chest to receive Jianghu martial arts: one move from the Drifting Sand technique
desc_tqsj_tgsr_box07=Open the chest to receive Jianghu Internal skills: one move from the Hidden Prowess technique
desc_tqsj_tgsr_box0801=Chest obtained from the Cao Zhengqing incident. Open the chest and get a chance to win a variety of treasures.
desc_tqsj_tgsr_box0802=Chest obtained from the Cao Zhengqing incident. Open the chest and get a chance to win a variety of treasures. This chest can be exchanged during the second internal stage. Treasures from subsequent stages will be better than treasures from the previous stage.
desc_tqsj_tgsr_box0803=Chest obtained from the Cao Zhengqing incident. Open the chest and get a chance to win a variety of treasures. This chest can be exchanged during the third internal stage. Treasures from subsequent stages will be better than treasures from the previous stage.
desc_tqsj_tgsr_box0804=Chest obtained from the Cao Zhengqing incident. Open the chest and get a chance to win a variety of treasures. This chest can be exchanged during the fourth internal stage. Treasures from subsequent stages will be better than treasures from the previous stage.
desc_CS_jh_kfdf07=When you hoist the sails to cross the sea, you will ride the winds and cleave the waves.
role_title_2341=Beast Student
desc_reduce_schoolrule_14_0=Beast Villa repentance letter. If players have violated the rules of their faction, they can repent, but must not make the same mistakes again. <br>(Right-click to read. Can reduce the Discipline Value by 10 points)
desc_inscription_wp_003_0=The Thousand Year Darksteel is the necessary material for the Mu Family to inscribe the <font color="#f9fc00">weapons</font>. The young master of the Mu Family and the master blacksmith of Suzhou have been close lately and often drink and party together. I wonder what they are up to. You can go to Suzhou (635.470). This young master is well studied in this art. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Can be used to change the name, description, and creator of the equipment. </font><br><font color="#3299CC">Path to obtain: Forbidden instances, event activities, etc. </font>
school_rule_event_23=faction rule violation: You cannot kill players surrounding the Beast Villa
school_rule_event_24=faction rule violation: You cannot kill animals surrounding the Beast Villa
desc_book_cs_jl_fgz0106_01=Bone Corroding Palm training method. An insidious attack that injects poison into the enemy's bloodstream.
desc_book_cs_jl_fgz0107_01=Bone Corroding Palm training method. An insidious attack that injects poison into the enemy's bloodstream.
desc_book_cs_jl_fgz0206_01=Bone Corroding Palm training method. A deadly skill in which poison from the palm attacks the enemy's joints.
desc_book_cs_jl_fgz0207_01=Bone Corroding Palm training method. A deadly skill in which poison from the palm attacks the enemy's joints.
desc_book_cs_jl_fgz0306_01=Bone Corroding Palm training method. Tear the enemy's chest open and fill it with poison.
desc_book_cs_jl_fgz0307_01=Bone Corroding Palm training method. Tear the enemy's chest open and fill it with poison.
desc_book_cs_jl_fgz0406_01=Bone Corroding Palm training method. The skill will poison anyone foolish enough to attack its user.
desc_book_cs_jl_fgz0407_01=Bone Corroding Palm training method. The skill will poison anyone foolish enough to attack its user.
desc_book_cs_jl_fgz0506_01=Bone Corroding Palm training method. A terrifying skill which uses the wind to distribute poison all through the battlefield.
desc_book_cs_jl_fgz0507_01=Bone Corroding Palm training method. A terrifying skill which uses the wind to distribute poison all through the battlefield.
desc_book_cs_jl_fgz0606_01=Bone Corroding Palm training method. Uses Chi to send poison to the enemy's heart.
desc_book_cs_jl_fgz0607_01=Bone Corroding Palm training method. Uses Chi to send poison to the enemy's heart.
desc_book_cs_jl_fgz0706_01=Bone Corroding Palm training method. This skill emits a corrosive poison which destroys the enemy's bones.
desc_book_cs_jl_fgz0707_01=Bone Corroding Palm training method. This skill emits a corrosive poison which destroys the enemy's bones.
