desc_item_wssz_001_0=Certificate made from unknown animal teeth to reward those who have contributed to the villa. <br>You can go to the trader in Beast Villa,<font color="#FFFF00"> Peng Jian (594,928)</font>, to exchange for the Villa Martial Arts, Internal skills, and other related items.
desc_item_wssz_021_0=This specially processed beast fang is of glittering and translucent appearance. It is a reward for those who have made significant contributions to the villa. <br>You can go to find Xu Ziqing (556,920) <font color="#FFFF00">at Beast Villa</font> to trade for advanced level equipment of the villa.
desc_item_wssz_rumen_4_0=Beast Villa entry certificate. Players with this certificate can go the Beggar's Sect scene to find the Beast Villa Guide (Coordinate: 587,851) and ask him to join the Beast Villa! <br><font color="#ff0000">[Tip: VIP Players with this item and with the strength of Flows With Chi can join the Beast Villa]</font>
