desc_item_wmp_1n_cc_mhy_0=The most often used sedative in Jianghu. The potency is moderate and has a weird smell. Only Free Spirits will be affected by this sedative. Use this drug on offline characters at short distance. There will be a certain chance to knock out the opponent to kidnap them. <font color="#FF0003">(You can buy the sedative needed for kidnapping at any grocery store)</font>
origin_2341_desc=A junior student that has just entered the Beast Villa and still is sometimes afraid of the beasts in the villa.
desc_item_szwe01304=Can obtain the Pure Chi, Practice Martial Arts, and Cultivation Point pills; with some chance to receive the Sunset Swords style
desc_item_szwe01305=Can obtain the Pure Chi, Practice Martial Arts, and Cultivation Point pills; with some chance to receive the Demon Soul Chasing Blade style!
