desc_item_stormwar_003_0=The nameless fragments collected by tornado. I heard that Yue Mingke (801,433) in the desert is collecting these fragments. Give him the fragments to exchange for the novice chapter of Toad Style or breakthrough tips.
desc_item_stormwar_005_0=The nameless fragments collected by tornado. I heard that Yue Mingke (801,433) in the desert is collecting these fragments. Give him the fragments to exchange for the novice chapter of Bloody Blade or breakthrough tips.
