desc_item_stormid_004=Can open the scroll fragments of a random page of the Icy Heart Manual, Toad Style, Chaotic Origin, or Blood Blade
desc_item_stormid_005=Chance to receive one of these Novice level skills: Sunset Swords, Green Cloud Palm, Fading Feather or Drifting Sand
desc_item_stormid_005a=Chance to receive one of these Novice level skills: Sunset Swords, or Green Cloud Palm
desc_item_stormid_006=Chance to receive one of these skills: Sunset Swords, Green Cloud Palm, Fading Feather or Drifting Sand (Pages 4 to 6)
desc_item_stormid_007=Chance to receive one of these skills: Sunset Swords, Green Cloud Palm, Fading Feather or Drifting Sand (Pages 7 to 8)
desc_item_stormid_008=Can randomly open a training method on pages 1 to 4 of the Demon Soul Chasing Blade style and pages 1 to 3 of the Heartless Seven Skills, Flying Snow Palm, or Madness Staff
desc_item_stormid_008a=Can randomly open a training method on pages 1 to 4 of the Demon Soul Chasing Blade style and pages 1 to 3 of the Heartless Seven Skills
desc_item_stormid_009=Can randomly open a training method on pages 5 to 7 of the Demon Soul Chasing Blade style and pages 4 to 6 of the Heartless Seven Skills, Flying Snow Palm, or Madness Staff
desc_item_stormid_010=Can randomly open a training method on pages 8 to 9 of the Demon Soul Chasing Blade style and pages 7 to 8 of the Heartless Seven Skills, Flying Snow Palm, or Madness Staff
desc_item_stormbox_03=Can get any four of Critical Item 1 for the Icy Heart Manual\Toad Style\Chaotic Origin\Blood Blade Manual
desc_item_stormbox_04=Can get Critical Item 2 for the Icy Heart Manual\Toad Style\Chaotic Origin\Blood Blade Manual
desc_item_stormbox_05=Can get Critical Item 3 for the Icy Heart Manual\Toad Style\Chaotic Origin\Blood Blade Manual
desc_item_stormwar_022_0=You can use it and the Blazing Fragment and Frozen Fragment to trade for Purple Rosy Clouds Skill Scroll Fragment with peddlers at the Revival Point of Tornado Scene
EntrySuccess009=Heroes, please enter the Huashan Peak from here
desc_Item_nmp_sjjl001_1=It contains the exclusive Internal skills of the Golden Needle Sect. When opened, you can obtain Chapters 1 to 5 of the Twenty-Four Secrets of the Golden Lock.
desc_item_jzsj_jz_007_0=Used by the Golden Needle Sect to reward disciples who have made significant contributions to the faction. Those who receive acupuncture with Golden Needles can have their meridian channels unclogged. <br>Obtained through the Artifact Herb Event.
desc_item_wssz_skill_051_0=Right-click to capture a beast to use. It requires the target's blood level to be lower than 10%. <br><font color="#FFB428">General traps have a higher chance of capturing ordinary beasts, but the ferocious beasts can break away from them easily.  </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Tip: Use the Path of the Beast method to distinguish the beasts and their strength Levels. </font>
desc_item_wssz_skill_052_0=Right-click to capture a beast to use. It requires the target's blood level to be lower than 10%. <br><font color="#FFB428">Excellent traps have a higher chance of capturing stronger beasts, but ferocious beasts can break away from them easily.  </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Tip: Use the Path of the Beast method to distinguish the beasts and their strength Levels. </font>
desc_item_wssz_skill_053_0=Right-click to capture a beast to use. It requires the target's blood level to be lower than 10%. <br><font color="#FFB428">Sophisticated traps have a higher chance of capturing adult ferocious beasts, but the most ferocious beasts can break away from them easily.  </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Tip: Use the Path of the Beast method to distinguish the beasts and their strength Levels. </font>
desc_box_baohe_bang_1=Open the bound Treasure Box. You have a chance to receive 1 Contraband, 1 Contraband Token and 1 Gorgeous Small Gift Box.
desc_box_baohe_payback_1=Contains Tianyuan Soul Gathering Pill x2, Hidden Head Exposed Tail x2, Travelling Token x2 and Hundred Flower Mind Clearing Pill x1. In addition, you'll have a chance to receive some Canhe Finger Scroll Fragments.
desc_box_baohe_chz01_1=Advanced Scroll Fragment Pack of the skill Joined Fingers. Contains 175 Scroll Fragments of Joined Fingers.
desc_box_baohe_chz02_1=Joined Fingers Scroll Fragment Pack. Contains 70 Joined Fingers Scroll Fragments.
desc_pz_ng_special_11_0=Note: Internal Skills of No School include <font color="#FFFF00">Self Recollection Skill </font>and<font color="#FFFF00"> Ice Chi.</font> No Jianghu Internal Skill is an Internal Skill of No School.
desc_pz_ng_special_12_0=Note: Internal Skills of No School include <font color="#FFFF00">Self Recollection Skill </font>and<font color="#FFFF00"> Ice Chi.</font> No Jianghu Internal Skill is an Internal Skill of No School.
desc_pet_xiaoma_gensui_line_0=<font color="#ff0000">Right-click to move the pet into collection interface</font><br><font color="#ff0000">Attention: Once in the collection interface, it becomes bound to the player and cannot be removed. If it is a time-limited pet, once the time has run out it will be deleted automatically.</font><br><font face="Default" color="#008B8B" >You cannot summon a New World pet in Jianghu. </font><br> When the pet is summoned, the player can recover 5 Flying Skill points per second when using Sit and Breathe. <br><font color="#ff0000">Tip: Once the Age of Wushu Record Tier 2 is available, VIP players who own a pet and have reached "Flows With Chi" can speak with the Beast Villa Guide in Beast Villa to join the faction. (Coordinates: Beggar's Sect 589, 853)</font>
desc_pet_xiaoma_act01_0=Have luck, partner and house right away. (Use this skill and the little horse will perform a random effect)
desc_pet_xiaoma_act02_0=Become rich on the horse, Gain Random Encounter on the horse, Gain salary increase on the horse, Gain promotion on the horse. (Use the skill on the little horse, the Familiar, it will play one of these effects at random.)
desc_item_thd_fish_011_0=The mud fish has very slippery mucus on their skin. They live in rivers, lakes, and paddy fields and often hide in the mud. Their meat is edible. You have a chance to win it within the fish factions of the Peach Pond.
desc_item_thd_fish_012_0=This shrimp loves to live amongst aquatic grass. Therefore, it is called the grass shrimp. The shrimp meat has bruising removing, detoxification, and Yang and Chi improvement effects. You have a chance to win it within the fish factions of the Peach Pond.
desc_box_tianxiabian_qiyilihe02=The mysterious gift box has a chance to receive "5 - of Wushu", "6 - Tempest" and "7 - of Strife" with a smaller chance to receive "1 - Newest", "2 - Expansion", "3 - for" and "4 - Age".
desc_item_wbhd_cfdzt_1n_1=Unearth the reward package through Chao Heng's treasures. Open the package and you will randomly receive a Level 1 tailoring unit.
desc_item_wbhd_tjdzt_1n_1=Unearth the reward package through Chao Heng's treasures. Open the package and you will randomly receive a Level 1 blacksmith unit.
desc_item_wbhd_qjdzt_1n_1=Unearth the reward package through Chao Heng's treasures. Open the package and you will randomly receive a Level 1 craftsman unit.
desc_item_wbhd_cfdzt_2n_1=Unearth the reward package through Chao Heng's treasures. Open the package and you will randomly receive a Level 2 tailoring unit.
desc_item_wbhd_tjdzt_2n_1=Unearth the reward package through Chao Heng's treasures. Open the package and you will randomly receive a Level 2 blacksmith unit.
desc_item_wbhd_qjdzt_2n_1=Unearth the reward package through Chao Heng's treasures. Open the package and you will randomly receive a Level 2 craftsman unit.
desc_item_wbhd_xwtpy_1n_1=Exchange and obtain the reward package through Chao Heng's treasures. Open the package and you will randomly receive a Level 1 bound acupoint breakthrough pill.
desc_item_wbhd_xwtpy_2n_1=Exchange and obtain the reward package through Chao Heng's treasures. Open the package and you will randomly receive a Level 2 bound acupoint breakthrough pill.
desc_box_txb_jhmp_1=<font color="#FFB428">The exquisitely packaged gift box contains a Qi Hai Concentration Pill, Zichen pills, Suit of Loveless(14 days), Plumage Outfit (14 days), Horse Whistle [Dayuan Horse] (14 days). </font>
desc_box_summer_back01_1=<font color="#FFB428">An exquisitely packaged gift box containing 50 Purple-Spirit Pills, 50 Snow Lotus Pills, 8 Random Artifact Medicine, 1 Random Treasure, 3 Challenge Orders and 5 Jinyuan Revival Pills. </font>
desc_box_summer_back02_1=<font color="#FFB428">An exquisitely packaged gift box containing 50 Xuan Spirit Pills, 50 Snow Lotus Pills, 50 Hunyuan Tendon-Relaxing Pills, 8 Random Artifact Medicines, 5 Challenge Orders, 8 Jinyuan Revival Pills, 5 hatched diagrams and 5 Hidden Head Exposed Tails. </font>
desc_box_txb_back01_1=<font color="#FFB428">The exquisitely packaged gift box containing prestige (10000), 5 Random Artifact Medicines, 200 liang of silver coins, 5 Dihuang Pills, "Return to Battle" jade pendant, 10 Hidden Head Exposed Tail, 10 Zichen pills, 10 centennial lotus fruit, 5 Jinyuan Revival Pills, Windrider (3 days), 100 repairing tools and a horse whistle [Dayuan Horse] (14 days). </font>
desc_box_txb_ghry01_1=<font color="#FFB428">The exquisitely packaged gift box contains a Jade Pendant (Peerless Hero), 1 Qi Hai Concentration Pill, 200 laing of silver coins, a Lingxia set (14 days), Suit of Frozen Soul (14 days) and 5 large Ruyi Pills. </font>
desc_box_txb_ghry02_1=<font color="#FFB428">The exquisitely packaged gift box containing a Jade Pendant (Criminal), 1 Qi Hai Concentration Pill, 200 liang of silver coins, Sentian set(14 days), Qingyu set (14 days) and 5 large Ruyi Pills. </font>
desc_box_txb_ghry03_1=<font color="#FFB428">The exquisitely packaged gift box containing a Jade Pendant (Lunatic), 1 Qi Hai Concentration Pill, 200 liang of silver coins, a Liuxiang set (14 days), a Qincheng set (14 days) and 5 large Ruyi Pills. </font>
desc_box_txb_ghry04_1=<font color="#FFB428">The exquisitely packaged gift box containing a Jade Pendant (Inhuman), 1 Qi Hai Concentration Pill, 200 liang of silver coins, a Pingzongxiaying set (14 days), a Fanmo set (14 days) and 5 large Ruyi Pills. </font>
desc_box_txb_snlb01_1=<font color="#FFB428">The exquisitely packaged gift box contains Reputation Scrolls (10000), 3 Random Artifact Medicines, 200 liang of silver coins, 10 abalone noodle soups, 10 Ten Fragrant Warm Powers, 10 Dihuang Pills, 10 Hidden Head Exposed Tail, a Horse Whistle [Dayuan Horse] (14 days), Suit of Loveless (14 days) and a rouge kit (14 days). </font>
desc_box_ffhd_xe01_1=<font color="#FFB428">Exquisitely packaged gift box containing 5 Qi Hai Concentration Pills and a Level 2 Silver Grade garment. (May only be purchased and used once)</font>
desc_box_gchd_cjlb01_1=<font color="#FFB428">Open the overflowing gift box for a chance to win rare items such as: a Lore gift pack, Horse Whistle or a Flying Skill script. </font>
desc_item_exchange_xm_mark_0=The lost masterpiece that was rumored to record the utmost emotions of greed, pride, envy, wrath and evil. It contains hundreds of illustrations and millions of records to reflect the world and to help people understand human nature. A mysterious young man, <font color=""#00FF00"">Chen Jieyun</font>, has recently been wandering around the Suzhou mortuary <font color="#ff0000">(320,729)</font>, potentially to find this object. <br>This item can be obtained by flipping cards after completing the Possessed.
desc_item_exchange_xm_mark_01_0=A nominal sword weapon, though actually a talisman, is known as the Chuyang Rune Sword. Legend claims it is capable of repelling evil and slaying demons; however, since most of such sayings are baseless, they are not taken seriously. A mysterious young man, <font color=""#00FF00"">Chen Jieyun</font>, has recently been wandering around the Suzhou mortuary <font color="#ff0000">(320,729)</font>, potentially to find this object.<br>This item can be obtained by flipping cards after completing the "Possessed". (Activation of </font>"Before the Duel"<font color=""#00FF00""> in the Age of Wushu Record is required. </font>The Internal Skill Points of the player<font color=""#00FF00""> who activates the "Possessed" Instance </font> cannot have less than <font color=""#00FF00"">80 </font>Points)
desc_box_yyhd_qylb01_1=<font color="#FFB428">Generous reward package. Open and you will have a chance to win the YY World Change Imperial Gift Package or the YY World Change Jianghu Package. </font>
nmp_menu_wx_01=Eliminate the effects that <font color="#00FF00">the Helianthus Codex </font>and <font color="#00FF00">Heartless Blade </font>have on joining the faction (<font color="#FFB428">daily task</font>)
nmp_title_wx_01=Learning Helianthus Codex or Heartless Blade will significantly affect the meridian channel. I know Jianghu elder Ren Xiaoyao. You can go ask him about it.
desc_item_force_003_0=A body and mind cultivation masterpiece written by Guiguzi and passed on during the Warring States Period. It describes a philosophy where the spirit is that of the Heavens and appearance is that of the beholder. (Used to eliminate the effects that the <font color="#ff0000">Helianthus Codex</font> and <font color="#ff0000">Heartless Blade</font> have on joining factions, and effects that the <font color="#ff0000">Helianthus Codex</font> and <font color="#ff0000">Eunuchs</font> have on joining reclusive school. When in possession of this item, the Sunflower Manual related titles can no longer be used)
