desc_item_wqzn_01_0=<font color="#FFB428">Gift cards specially prepared during the anniversary period as a reward for anniversary challenge quests. Right-click to randomly receive Tendon-Soothing Pills or official silver. </font><br>(The official silver randomly ranges between 10, 50, 100, and 150 liang of silver. The number of official silver available daily is limited. When you have reached the limit, you can only win pills)<br><font color="#FF0000"> Usage deadline: </font>From 21:00 to 22:00<br><font color="#FF0000"> Cool-down time:</font> 240 seconds
desc_item_wqsx_01_0=<font color="#FFB428">Gift cards specially prepared during the study advancement period as a reward for the study advancement challenge quests. Right-click to randomly receive Tendon-Soothing Pills or official silver. </font><br>The amount of official silver randomly ranges between 10, 50, 100, and 150 liang of silver. The number of official silver available daily is limited. When you have reached the limit, you can only earn pills)<br><font color="#FF0000"> Usage deadline:</font> Starting each day after September 9, 2013 from 21:00-22:00 <br><font color="#FF0000">Cool-down time: </font>240 seconds
desc_item_wqlk_01_0=<font color="#FFB428">This seasonal gift card is a special reward for those who complete the task of Challenging Wu Qing. Right-click to open it and receive Tendon-Soothing Pills or imperial silver at random. </font><br>(The official silver randomly ranges between 10, 50, 100, and 150 liang of silver. The number of official silver available daily is limited. When you have reached the limit, you can only win pills)<br><font color="#FF0000"> Usage deadline: </font>From 21:00 to 22:00<br><font color="#FF0000"> Cool-down time:</font> 240 seconds
desc_taskitem_wmp_wssz_0=This letter is written by distressed monk to the escort of the Beast Villa. Please deliver this letter to the escort's place. <br>Beggar's Sect (589,853)
