desc_box_wnhd_xzlb01_1=<font color="#FFB428">An exquisitely packaged gift box containing an internal master order, 2 Qi Hai Concentration Pills, 5 Challenge Orders, 3 Lingyuan Critical Healing Pills, Dihuang Pills and 5 "Wuqing Graduation" gift cards. </font>
desc_box_wnhd_mysc01_1=<font color="#FFB428">An exquisitely packaged gift box containing 5 Random Artifacts, 3 Qi Hai Concentration Pills, Jinyuan Revival Pill, Green Jade Internal Skill Pill, 10 Highly-Refined Emerald Ginkgo Pills, 10 Compound White Pills, and 10 Nine Turns Pork Intestine.</font>
desc_pet_tz_act03_0=Dig the earth to get the chest in the soil
desc_pet_diao_gensui_0=<font color="#ff0000">Right-click to move the pet into collection interface</font><br><font color="#ff0000">Attention: Once in the collection interface, it becomes bound to the player and cannot be removed. If it is a time-limited pet, once the time has run out it will be deleted automatically.</font><br><font face="Default" color="#008B8B" >You cannot summon a New World pet in Jianghu. </font><br> When the pet is summoned, the player can recover 5 Flying Skill points per second when using Sit and Breathe. <br><font color="#ff0000">Tip: Once the Age of Wushu Record Tier 2 is available, VIP players who own a pet and have reached "Flows With Chi" can speak with the Beast Villa Guide in Beast Villa to join the faction. (Coordinates: Beggar's Sect 589, 853)</font>
pet_tuzi_box=Unearthed Box
desc_pet_tuzi_box=The small rabbit has dug out a chest. The content of which is unknown.
desc_item_mooncake_01=<font color="#3299CC">When consumed, it can restore your Nutrition to 10 and add 30 Points to all attributes of yours for 30 minutes</font><br><font color="#3299CC"> This Effect will be cleared during the Mount Hua Competition)</font>
desc_stuff_jiebang_02_0=These are precious materials which can be used by Wei Manman (872,419)<font color="#3299CC"> at Ruined Valley</font> to make Embroidered Box for Good Reward Evil Punishment Orders and seal Good Reward Evil Punishment Orders into the box with gold threads for sealing.<br>A gold thread for sealing can seal Good Reward Evil Punishment Orders into an Embroidered Box for Good Reward Evil Punishment Orders.<br>The Embroidered Box for Good Reward Evil Punishment Orders obtained by means of exchange are tradable, when it is opened, you will get the Good Reward Evil Punishment Orders inside, which are not tradable.
desc_item_box_paiz_wmp_01=An Embroidered Box that contains 100 Good Reward Evil Punishment Orders. It can be traded for other people's goods
desc_zqtz_box01=Here is the reward from Bu Turen for you, it contains 1 Purple-Spirit Pill. You have a very low chance of winning a Level 1 work bench.
desc_zqtz_box02=Here is the reward from Bu Turen for you, it contains 5 Purple-Spirit Pills. You have a low chance of winning a Level 1 work bench.
desc_zqtz_box03=Here is the reward from Bu Turen for you, it contains 10 Purple-Spirit Pills. You have a high chance of winning a Level 1 work bench.
desc_box_zhongqiu_tz_01=A Moon Festival Promotion Gift Box. Open it to receive 1 Hunyuan Tendon-Relaxing Pill, 1 Inner Cultivation Pill, 2 Intelligence Reports, one of the 5 Artifacts. There is a chance of receiving an extra interactive Emote.
desc_box_zhongqiu_tz_03=A Moon Festival Promotion Gift Box. Open it to receive 5 Hunyuan Tendon-Relaxing Pills, 5 Inner Cultivation Pills, 5 Five-Realm Demon-Slaying Items, or Windrider (3 days). There is a chance of receiving 1 extra Intermediate Intelligence Report. If you are lucky enough, you will receive a Jiangnan Monkey.
desc_box_zhongqiu_tz_2014_1=Open for a chance to receive a Jinyuan Revival Pill, Medium Intelligence Report, Five-Realm Demon-Slaying Items x5, Hunyuan Tendon-Relaxing Pills x2 or a Jiangnan Monkey.
desc_box_wnhd_htxd01_1=<font color="#FFB428">An exquisite Gift Pack containing 3 Qi Hai Concentration Pills, 3 Large Pills of Heaven's Way, 3 Refined Sanbei Pills, 3 Nine Scarlet Pellets and 1 Jubilation Gift Pack. </font>
desc_box_wnhd_zxdt01_1=The intelligence answers a first heavy reward gift box, can acquire after using: Morning Dew Internal Enhancement Pill, or Morning Dew Tendon-Soothing Pill.
desc_box_wnhd_zxdt02_1=The intelligence answers a second heavy reward gift box, can acquire after using: Morning Dew Internal Enhancement Pills, Morning Dew Tendon-Soothing Pill, Qing Yuan Pill, or Chi Stabilization Pill.
desc_box_wnhd_zxdt03_1=The intelligence answers a third heavy reward gift box, can acquire after using: Morning Dew Internal Enhancement Pills, Morning Dew Tendon-Soothing Pill, Qing Yuan Pill, Chi Stabilization Pill, Ganoderma Bodhi Pill, or Purple Spirit Pill.
desc_box_wnhd_zxdt04_1=The intelligence answers a fourth heavy reward gift box, can acquire after using: Morning Dew Internal Enhancement Pills, Morning Dew Tendon-Soothing Pill, Qing Yuan Pill, Dihuang Pill, Chi Stabilization Pill, Ganoderma Bodhi Pill, Purple Spirit Pill, or Hero Token.
desc_box_wnhd_zxdt05_1=The intelligence answers a fifth heavy reward gift box, can acquire after using: Morning Sun Internal Enhancement Pills, Morning Dew Tendon-Soothing Pill, Qing Yuan Pill, Dihuang Pill, Chi Stabilization Pill, Ganoderma Bodhi Pill, Purple Spirit Pill, Hero Token, Traveling Token, Battlefield Points Token, or Five-Realm Demon-Slaying Item.
desc_item_jhdw_ww006_0=This is a special Identity Token that can be acquired at random when you have won certain Affinity with NPCs. It represents their approval of your Faction Relations. The token is a necessity if you want to attain certain Jianghu Position in certain factions.
desc_item_jhdw_level02_0=<font color="#FFB428">This is an exquisitely-made token used by people of a Life Without factions, in their trading with Jianghu fellows. </font><br>It is rumored that anyone who has collected certain number of this token can go to find a<font color="#3299CC"> a Life Without factions Emissary</font> at any Martial Arts faction in major cities and use them to trade for<font color="#3299CC"> Novice Level of the script of Eight skills from a Well, which is a peerless martial arts skill</font>.
desc_item_jhdw_level02_1_0=<font color="#FFB428">This is an exquisitely-made token used by people of a Life Without factions, in their trading with Jianghu fellows. </font><br>It is rumored that anyone who has collected certain number of this token can go to find a<font color="#3299CC"> a Life Without factions Emissary</font> at any Martial Arts faction in major cities and use them to trade for<font color="#3299CC"> Page 4 to Page 6 of the script of Eight skills from a Well, which is a peerless martial arts skill</font>.
desc_item_jhdw_level02_2_0=<font color="#FFB428">This is an exquisitely-made token used by people of a Life Without factions, in their trading with Jianghu fellows</font>. <br><font color="#3299CC">It is rumored that anyone who has collected certain number of this token can go to find a</font> a Life Without factions Emissary<font color="#3299CC"> at any Martial Arts faction in major cities and use them to trade for</font>Page 7 and Page 8 of the script of Eight skills from a Well, which is a peerless martial arts skill.
desc_item_jhdw_jueji01_0=<font color="#FFB428">This is an exquisitely-made token used by people of a Life Without factions, in their trading with Jianghu fellows</font>. <br>It is rumored that anyone who possesses this token can go to find a <font color="#3299CC">a Life Without factions Emissary </font>at any Martial Arts faction in major cities and use it to trade for <font color="#3299CC">Page 7 and Page 8 of the script of Eight skills from a Well, which is a peerless martial arts skill</font>.
