desc_CS_jh_yszd02=Try to soothe Wild Beasts, it is possible that the wild beasts will become quiet.
desc_Item_funqy003_0=This item is a music score that is full of love. When it is played, the evil tendencies around the player will be eliminated. However, only heroic musicians can use it. <br><font color="#FFB90F">special effect: If there is a Snow Ape with Three Claws in the vicinity of this music score when it is played, the player have a chance every 5 seconds to silence the Snow Ape with Three Claw for 5 seconds. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">When the player applies This item, the player will enter the state of playing zither and become immovable, but this state will be cancelled if the player is attacked. </font><br>The Item has a 5-minute CD and the maximum number of This item one can carry in a backpack is 1.
desc_box_power_redeem_0=This treasure box from the Western Frontier contains <font color="#FFB428">Refined Snow Lotus Pills ×1</font>, <font color="#FFB428">Tendon-Relaxing Pill ×10</font>, <font color="#FFB428">Purple-Spirit Pill ×25</font>, <font color="#FFB428">School Honor Certificate (5) or Good Reward Evil Punishment Order (5) ×1</font>. All items bestow power to the player.<br><font color="#FF0000">Warning: this treasure chest will disappear in 1 day. Please open and claim your items as soon as possible.</font>
desc_box_novice_redeem_0=Medicine made by a Jianghu hermit, including <font color="#FFB428">Refined Snow Lotus Pill × 1</font>, <font color="#FFB428">Tendon-Relaxing Pill× 10</font> and <font color="#FFB428">Purple Spirit Pill × 25</font>, <font color="#FFB428">School Honor Certificate (5) or Good Reward Evil Punishment Order (5) × 1</font>. Ingest the pills to greatly increase your skills<br><font color="#FF0000">Note: This chest is only available for one day and will be automatically removed once the time has run out. Be sure to use it quickly!</font>
desc_box_oldserver_redeem_0=Medicine made by a mysterious herbalist, including <font color="#FFB428">Refined Snow Lotus Pill×1</font>, <font color="#FFB428">Tendon-Relaxing Pill×10</font>, <font color="#FFB428">Purple Spirit Pill×25</font> and <font color="#FFB428">School Honor Certificate (5) or Good Reward Evil Punishment Order (5) × 1</font>. Use the pills to greatly increase your skills<br><font color="#FF0000">Note: This chest is only available for one day and will be automatically removed once the time has run out. Be sure to use it quickly!</font>
desc_box_power_redeem_new_0=This treasure box from the Western Frontier contains <font color="#FFB428">Refined Snow Lotus Pills ×1</font>, <font color="#FFB428">Tendon-Relaxing Pill ×10</font>, <font color="#FFB428">Purple-Spirit Pill ×25</font>, <font color="#FFB428">School Honor Certificate (5) or Good Reward Evil Punishment Order (5) ×1</font>. All items bestow power to the player.<br><font color="#FF0000">Warning: this treasure chest will disappear in 1 day. Please open and claim your items as soon as possible.</font>
desc_itmfun_fireworks02_0=A chest full of fireworks. When it is placed on the ground. All people nearby can take fireworks from it and set of them. <font color="#3299CC"> (The chest will disappear in 15 seconds, so hurry up to take the fireworks)</font>
vipserver04_4=Open the chest.
vipserver04_2=The chest is full of fireworks
desc1_origin_dgqb_1_1=Loner Who Seeks Defeat<font color="#FFB428" face="font_name_tittle"></font><br>I'd been learning martial arts for half of my life, <br>but finally stopped and went to the field to farm. <br>I would often think about those people <br>who are peerless and dominating the world, <br>however, I prefer to hide my sword into the box <br>so that I can sing songs and have drinks when free. <br>Throughout my lifetime I have been seeking defeat everywhere but in vain, <br>but now I just laugh and go back to my home.
desc_origin_dgqb_1_1=I'd been learning martial arts for half of my life, but finally stopped and went to the field to farm. I would often think about those people who are peerless and dominating the world, however, I prefer to hide my sword into the box so that I can sing songs and have drinks when free. Throughout my lifetime I have been seeking defeat everywhere but in vain, but now I just laugh and go back to my home.
desc_itm_tianti_01=Right-click to use it and receive the title of "Loner Who Seeks Defeat"
desc_itm_tianti_3057=Right-click to use it and receive the title of "Defeating Five Ultimates With A Mocking Smile"
desc_itm_tianti_3061=Right-click to use it and receive the title of "The Bane of Five Ultimates"
desc_box_tiantijifen_001_1=Identity, Costume, a giant condor and the title of Loner Who Seeks Defeat.
desc_model_cloth_gb_50601_0=<font color="#00FF00">The Rage spent on No Dogs Under Heaven is decreased by 7 points. </font><br>This item can be traded at <font color="#ff0000">your school.</font> This item cannot be used directly.<br>It must be refined <font color="#ff0000">with </font>your school's<font color="#ff0000"> Level 5 Gold Equipment </font>to receive<font color="#ff0000"> Level 6 Gold Equipment of higher quality</font>. <br>Players can disassemble the Raw Jade Item into a Five-Realm Demon-Slaying Item at Cheng Jieyun in Suzhou Mortuary (320,729).
desc_model_cloth_em_50601_0=<font color="#00FF00">The cooldown of Respectful is reduced by 2 seconds. </font><br>This item can be traded at <font color="#ff0000">your school.</font> This item cannot be used directly.<br> It must be refined<font color="#ff0000"> with </font>your school's<font color="#ff0000"> Level 5 Gold Equipment </font>to receive <font color="#ff0000">Level 6 Gold Equipment of higher quality</font>. <br>Players can disassemble the Raw Jade Item into a Five-Realm Demon-Slaying Item at Cheng Jieyun in Suzhou Mortuary (320,729).
desc_model_cloth_jz_50601_0=<font color="#00FF00">The cooldown of Golden Sound and Jade Vibration is reduced by 2.6 seconds.</font><br>This item can be traded at <font color="#ff0000">your school.</font> This item cannot be used directly.<br> It must be refined <font color="#ff0000">with </font>your school's<font color="#ff0000"> Level 5 Gold Equipment </font>to receive<font color="#ff0000"> Level 6 Gold Equipment of higher quality</font>. <br>Players can disassemble the Raw Jade Item into Five-Realm Demon-Slaying Item at Cheng Jieyun in Suzhou Mortuary (320,729).
