desc_pet_tuzi_1_qy_0=<font color="#ff0000">[Right click to move the Familiar to Favorite interface]</font><br><font color="#ff0000">Note: When you move the Familiar to Favorite interface, it cannot be taken out and will be bound with you. If the Familiar has time limit, it will be deleted once it expires. </font><br>Use it to summon Xiaoyi (jade rabbit) to follow the player. The jade rabbit is lovely and loves following the owner. When the Familiar is summoned, the players can recover 5 Flying Skill Points per second by mediation. <br><font color="#ff0000">Tips: When Age of Wushu Record Tier is available, players who own a Familiar and have reached Flows With Chi can talk with Beast Villa Guide in Beast Villa to join the faction. (Coordinates: Beggar's Sect 589 853)</font>
desc_box_xmqy_wdqq01_1=<font color="#FFB428">A big gift pack, open and have a chance to get YY Supremacy Gift Pack or YY Jianghu Gift Pack.</font>
desc_box_yylb_zzlb01_1=<font color="#FFB428">An exquisite gift pack, contains Black Jade Powder, 2 Skill Script Fragment Gift Packs, Horse Whistle [Perish] (15 Days), a random Pet or a Young Donkey (30 days), and 200 Five-Realm Demon-Slaying Items.</font>
desc_box_yylb_jhlb01_1=<font color="#FFB428">An exquisite gift pack, contains Gold Thread Powder, Skill Script Fragment Gift Packs, a random Pet or a Young Donkey (30 days), and 100 Five-Realm Demon-Slaying Items.</font>
desc_item_aqzw_01_1=The "King of Hidden Weapons" Contest has special rewards which, when opened, will offer you the chance to win Level 1 work benches, Jianghu Internal skills, Apprentice Flying Skill Scripts, Jianghu Martial Arts, Cultivation Point Pills, and materials of Hidden Weapons.
desc_item_aqzw_02_1=Xing Junke's Internal Skill Studying Notes, if you comprehend the content, you will have chance to acquire breakthrough secrets.
desc_item_aqzw_03_1=The "King of Hidden Weapons" Contest has special rewards which, when opened, will offer you the chance to win Level 1 work benches, Jianghu Internal skills, Apprentice Flying Skill Scripts, Jianghu Martial Arts, Cultivation Point Pills, and materials of Hidden Weapons.
desc_item_aqzw_04_1=Xing Junke's Internal Skill Studying Notes, if you comprehend the content, you will have chance to acquire breakthrough secrets.
