desc_item_aqzw_07_1=The "King of Hidden Weapons" Contest has special rewards which, when opened, will offer you the chance to win Level 1 work benches, Jianghu Internal skills, Apprentice Flying Skill Scripts, Jianghu Martial Arts, Cultivation Point Pills, and materials of Hidden Weapons.
desc_item_aqzw_08_1=Xing Junke's Internal Skill Studying Notes, if you comprehend the content, you will have chance to acquire breakthrough secrets.
desc_item_aqzw_09_1=A secret casket that contains Peacock Plumes, though the Peacock Plumes inside do not look real. It can cause massive damage to Taoist Mu in the "King of Hidden Weapons" Contest.
desc_useitemwar_lxc005_0=<font color="#4444ff">A rare Earth's Treasure which, when carried, can add 2000 points to your max HP Limit and add Frigid Night damage to your attack. Effect of using the treasure:</font><br><font color="#3299CC"> It has the potential to increase the damage of all skills by 30%, boost critical hit rate by 15%, and put you under the protection of Super Armor Effect at a certain chance. </font><font color="#00FF00">Weight: </font><font color="#3299CC">2</font><br><font color="#FFB428"> (max personal carrying capacity is 25)</font>
desc_useitemwar_lxc012_0=<font color="#4444ff">Rare Water Treasure; when its carrier attacks, they can absorb 15% HP lost by the damage taker. </font><br><font color="#3299CC">Using effect: </font><font color="#00FF00">Spellbound</font><font color="#3299CC">. When attacking, the carrier will absorb 30% HP lost by the damage taker and have a chance to inflict Spellbound into the target, making it take extra damage. When attacked, the carrier will reflect some damage. </font><br><font color="#FFB428">Weight: 2 (Max individual load: 25)</font>
desc_item_lxc_mc_0=These war materials can be used to produce various devices. Enough wood can activate Yun Wang (773,-137) in Lingxiao City, Zuo Heting (1209,616) in Snowy Mountain Holy Region, Qin Zhaoyue (119,1070) in Bloody Blade Clan and Yuan Tianzhi (544,1164) in Ice Spirit Valley. (Can only activate the hero of own alignment)
desc_item_lxc_ks_0=They can be used to produce weapons in the war. Enough ores can activate Xue Hushan (770,-126) in Lingxiao City, Zuo Xiuming (1211,615) in Snowy Mountain Holy Region, Ye Dongyan (120,1067) in Bloody Blade Clan and Gui Suan (543,1168) in Ice Spirit Valley. (Can only activate the hero of own alignment)
desc_item_lxc_cy_0=They can be used to cure injured people in the war. Enough herbs can activate Wan Renjie (775,-124) in Lingxiao City, He Lanya (1207,615) in Snowy Mountain Holy Region, Yin Yuandeng (121,1068) in Bloody Blade Clan and Yao Baigu (546,1166) in Ice Spirit Valley. (Can only activate the hero of own alignment)
desc_item_lxc_ls_0=They are necessary materials in the war. Enough food can activate Xue Lingnv (775,-125) in Lingxiao City, Zuo Wenting (1207,613) in Snowy Mountain Holy Region, Ye Lihao (121,1065) in Bloody Blade Clan and Wu Yunfei (548,1165) in Ice Spirit Valley. (Can only activate the hero of own alignment)
desc_item_lxc_wq_0=They are the commonly-used weapons in the war. Enough weapons can activate Nie Feng (769,-124) in Lingxiao City, He Lanxue (1210,612) in Snowy Mountain Holy Region, Luosang Duoji (122,1066) in Bloody Blade Clan and Xiang Wanqing (546,1167) in Ice Spirit Valley. (Can only activate the hero of own alignment)
zc_menu_lxzc_xb_01b_08=I want to submit 1 piece of Clear Water Tea (5 points)
desc_pet_niao_1_qy_0=<font color="#ff0000">[Right-click to move the pet into collection interface]</font><br><font color="#ff0000">Attention: Once in the collection interface, it becomes bound to the player and cannot be removed. If it is a time-limited pet, once the time has run out it will be deleted automatically.</font><br><font face="Default" color="#008B8B" >You cannot summon a pet in the New World. </font><br> It can help players send letters. When players enter Sit and Breathe, they will recover 5 Flying Skill points each second. <br><font color="#ff0000">(Tip: Once the Age of Wushu Record Tier 2 is available, players who own a pet and have reached "Flows With Chi" can speak with the Beast Villa Guide in Beast Villa to join the faction. (Coordinates: Beggars' Sect 589, 853)</font>
desc_lx_battle_03=You drink and sing as much as you like to enjoy your days, living arrogantly and domineeringly to be a hero. <br>The uniform of Blood Blade Clan Faction.
task_Npc_world_40=After seizing the Peacock Villa, Taoist Mu has been coercing the faction to use Peacock Plumes—the King of Hidden Weapons—to bathe the world with blood. Since then the world is in unprecedented terror and chaos. Taoist Mu then considers himself invincible and stands atop the Luoyang Tower to challenge the entire world, aiming to be the King of Jianghu!
npc_world_menu_city04_move03=After seizing the Peacock Villa, Taoist Mu has been coercing the faction to use Peacock Plumes—the King of Hidden Weapons—to bathe the world with blood. Since then the world is in unprecedented terror and chaos. Taoist Mu then considers himself invincible and stands atop the Luoyang Tower to challenge the entire world, aiming to be the King of Jianghu!
desc_worldwar_xdm_01=Headquarters of Blood Blade Clan, where the faction of Blood Blade Clan entrenches
desc_condition_106911=You need a key to open the chest
desc_taskitem_shitu_001_0=The key to a chest
desc_item_khd_ratrace_01_0=The treasure box in the Delightful Island contains many Rare Jewels and Precious Stones. It can be opened every 30 seconds. It will drop once the owner is killed in the event range. (Non-VIP players can only gain 1 item, while VIP players can gain 3 items at most when they open it.)  <br><font color="#ffff00">The treasure box will be deducted once the players leave the scene or get offline. It can also be deducted if the players leave the event range more than 10 seconds. If they return the event range within 10 seconds, the treasure box will not be deducted.
desc_item_khd_xld_002_0=This key can open some boxes in the secret chamber of the maze in the Delightful Island.
menu_jjwx_laopu_4=To be honest, when I was young, I lived near Wu Royal Tomb, where I had the luck to receive a gift from Wang of Rosy Clouds Villa at Gusu. The gift included all Martial Arts Manuals in the Jade Cave of Lang Huan. However, I could only bring with me approximately 70% to 80% of the manuals when the city was taken by the enemy. I didn't expect what I have seen during my journey back to the Central Plain—the factions of my days have either risen or declined nowadays, and some of their Kung Fu skills do look a bit different to me. Though their essence is still roughly the same!
desc_item_99ww_task001_0=The primary level confidential correspondences issued by Lou Yunqi randomly contain secret order tasks that the players are expected to execute. The secret order tasks in the confidential correspondences are relatively difficult and time-consuming. <br>Completing the secret order tasks will win you 10 <br><font color="#EE9A00">Lou Yun Orders</font>, which can be used to trade for lost Jianghu knowledge.<br><font color="#FF0000"> Right-click to open 1 confidential correspondence </font>(only1 confidential correspondence at a time, regardless of the confidential correspondence's level) and accept 1 secret order task.<br> It takes 48 hours for you to be eligible to buy another one.<br>
desc_item_99ww_task002_0=The intermediate level confidential correspondences issued by Lou Yunqi randomly contain secret order tasks which the players are expected to execute. The secret order tasks in the confidential correspondences are not that difficult and time-consuming. <br>Completing the secret order tasks will win you 10 <br><font color="#EE9A00">Lou Yun Orders</font>, which can be used to trade for lost Jianghu knowledge.<br><font color="#FF0000"> Right-click to open 1 confidential correspondence </font>(only1 confidential correspondence at a time, regardless of the confidential correspondence's level) and accept 1 secret order task.<br> It takes 15 hours for you to be eligible to buy another one.<br>
desc_item_99ww_task003_0=The advanced level confidential correspondences issued by Lou Yunqi randomly contain secret order tasks which the players are expected to execute. The secret order tasks in the confidential correspondences are relatively easy and less time-consuming. <br>Completing the secret order tasks will win you 10 <br><font color="#EE9A00">Lou Yun Orders</font>, which can be used to trade for lost Jianghu knowledge.<br><font color="#FF0000"> Right-click to open 1 confidential correspondence </font>(only1 confidential correspondence at a time, regardless of the confidential correspondence's level) and accept 1 secret order task.<br> It takes 2 hours for you to be eligible to buy another one.<br>
desc_box_khd_chengchuan_002_1=This silver treasure box is gained by in Delightful Island event. Open it to randomly gain Leisure Token, Ghost Shadow Sword, or Eight Skills from a Well etc.
desc_box_khd_chengchuan_003_1=This gold treasure box is gained by in Delightful Island event. Open it to randomly gain Leisure Token, Ghost Shadow Sword, or Eight Skills from a Well etc.
desc_item_box_box_khd_002_1=This locked treasure box is gained by opening Delightful Island Silver Treasure Box. Open it to randomly gain Leisure Token, Ghost Shadow Sword, or Eight Skills from a Well etc.
desc_item_box_box_khd_003_1=This locked treasure box is gained by opening Delightful Island Silver Treasure Box. Open it to randomly gain Leisure Token, Ghost Shadow Sword, or Eight Skills from a Well.
desc_box_sweetemploy_001=A precious chest that contains some interesting small items.
desc_box_sweetemploy_002=An exquisite chest that contains some interesting small items.
desc_box_sweetemploy_003=A gorgeous chest that contains some interesting small items.
desc_box_99wuxue_ttdh=Right-click to receive 5, 10, 25, or 50 Louyun Tokens at random.
desc_box_wnhd_gnhklb01_1=<font color="#FFB428">An exquisite Gift Pack containing the chance to receive precious pills such as the Snow Lotus Pill, Tendon-Soothing Pill, Snow Lotus Fruit, Leaf Dew Gathered Gold, Qi Hai Concentration Pill and Tianshan Snow Lotus Fruit. You will also have the chance to receive Gold Thread Powder and Black Jade Powder. </font>
desc_box_wnhd_qydlb01_1=<font color="#FFB428">An exquisite gift pack. At Age of Wushu Records Tier 1 Internal Skill Stage you have to reach Martial Intuition, and at Tier 2 or above you have to reach Spiritually Balanced to open it. After opening you will randomly receive one of the following: a Zichen Pill, Hero Token or a Five-Realm Demon-Slaying Gift Pack. You may also have the chance to receive an Internal Skill Scroll Fragment or Ancient Manual Scroll Fragment. </font>
desc_box_online_02_0=Open to receive a random Work Bench.
desc_box_online_03_0=Open to receive 1 random piece of Equipment (Gold/Jade quality weapons or armor).
desc_box_wnhd_huaqing_0=Right-click to open the gift pack.<br><font color="#FFB428"> Contains 1 Black Jade Powder, 1 Horse Whistle [Juedi Horse], a set of Costumes, 10 Jinyuan Revival Pills, 10 Hero's Tokens, an Expansion Package Gift Box (3) and 20 Leaf Dew Gathered Gold</font>
desc_box_wnhd_huaqing_1=<font color="#FFB428"> Contains 1 Black Jade Powder, 1 Horse Whistle [Juedi Horse], a set of Costumes, 10 Jinyuan Revival Pills, 10 Hero's Tokens, an Expansion Package Gift Box (3) and 20 Leaf Dew Gathered Gold</font>
desc_box_djlb_qzlb01_1=<font color="#FFB428">A package full of valuable items. Open it to receive 5 Random Artifacts. </font>
desc_box_card_026=Right-click to receive Lore item(s): one <font color="#FFB428">"Flying Cloud Horse"</font> and one <font color="#FFB428">"Golden Snake Raiment"</font> small gift box.
desc_jixiangfudai_box_020_1=There is an Script of Ultimate Skill, the Golden Snake Sword, in this box.
desc_jixiangfudai_box_022_1=There is an Script of Ultimate Skill, Level 1 of Golden Snake Sword, in this box.
desc_jixiangfudai_box_023_1=There is an Script of Ultimate Skill, Level 2 of Golden Snake Sword, in this box.
desc_jixiangfudai_box_024_1=There is an Script of Ultimate Skill, Level 3 of Golden Snake Sword, in this box.
desc_pet_mty_1_0=<font color="#ff0000">Right-click to move the pet into the collection interface</font><br><font color="#ff0000">Attention: When the pet in the collection interface, it cannot be taken out and is bound to the player. If the pet has a time limit, it will be deleted automatically when the time is up.</font><br><font face="Default" color="#008B8B" >You cannot summon a pet in the New World. </font><br>The Owl is a special pet with some differences during day and night. It can send letters and when players enter Sit and Breathe, they will recover 5 Flying Skill points each second. <br><font color="#ff0000">(Tips: When the tier 2 internal skill is active, players with a pet and at level Flows with Chi, may speak with the Beast Villa Recruitment Guide to apply to join (Location: Beggar's Sect 589,853)</font>
desc_pet_mty_2_0=<font color="#ff0000">Right-click to move the pet into the collection interface</font><br><font color="#ff0000">Attention: When the pet in the collection interface, it cannot be taken out and is bound to the player. If the pet has a time limit, it will be deleted automatically when the time is up.</font><br><font face="Default" color="#008B8B" >You cannot summon a pet in the New World. </font><br>The White Owl is a special pet with some differences during day and night. It can send letters and when players enter Sit and Breathe, they will recover 5 Flying Skill points each second. <br><font color="#ff0000">(Tips: When the tier 2 internal skill is active, players with a pet and at level Flows with Chi, may speak with the Beast Villa Recruitment Guide to apply to join (Location: Beggar's Sect 589,853)</font>
desc_model_helmet_wmp_50601_0=<font color="#00ff00">The cooldown of Unstoppable Wind of Winds of Fury is reduced by 2 seconds.</font> <br>This item can be traded at <font color="#ff0000">your school.</font> This item cannot be used directly.<br> It must be refined <font color="#ff0000">with </font>your school's<font color="#ff0000"> Level 5 Gold Equipment </font>to receive<font color="#ff0000"> Level 6 Gold Equipment of higher quality</font>. <br>Players can disassemble the Raw Jade Item into a Five-Realm Demon-Slaying Item at Cheng Jieyun in Suzhou Mortuary (320,729).
desc_jixiangfudai_box_025_1=It is said the box contains special kung fu script - Novice Pages of Golden Snake Sword and Ghost Shadow Sword.
desc_box_sdhd_001_1=Gift bag from Wander Together with Swords. It contains 2 Qi Hai Concentration Pills and 2 Hunyuan Tendon-Relaxing Pills.
desc_box_sdhd_004_1=Gift bag from Wander Together with Swords. It contains 5 Mount Tianshan Snow Lotus, and there is a chance to get 1 Gold Thread Powder, and 1 Black Jade Powder.
desc_condition_106973=Male player whose level reaches Enlightened Virtuoso, and has Palace of Shifting Flowers Flower Prince Invitation, and doesn't carry Dark Jade Plum Blossom - Flower Prince and has never learned Heartless Seven Skills, and has a intact body (Can purchase 14th day to 20 o'clock of 15th day in each month).
yd_menu_khd_ccbx=I've seen many people wandering on the coast. (<font face="Default" color="#00e5ee" >Treasure Box in Sunken Ship</font> Introduction of Gameplay)
yd_title_khd_ccbx=There are some undercurrents in the sea around Delightful Island, so many merchant ships have been sunk when they tried to pass by. So nobody dares to approach the island now. There are chests pushed by wave to beach all the time, and some of them may contain rare treasures. You can try to open the chests, but be warned, there are many other people who want the chests too. <font face_b="Default" color_b="#00FF00" >(Treasure Box in Sunken Ship: There are all kinds of abandoned treasure boxes on Delightful Island and in surrounding sea. They may contain treasures.) </font>
yd_title_khd_dcdb=The Drunk Immortal Pavilion is the unique and biggest tavern here. You can drink there, but you need to be careful of Tu Baishou. He's a freak, and he likes watching people suffer. For the purpose, he built an arena in front of the pavilion and threatened Soft Valley to hand over the most beautiful girl as prize to attract people to contest silk balls. We are just toys! <font face_b="Default" color_b="#00FF00" >(Contest Treasure in Arena: At 10:25-11:00, 20:25-21:00 every day, find Ai Fengwu (-314,561) at Drunk Immortal Pavilion on Delightful Island to join event Contest Treasure in Arena. By contesting treasure box, players can get good rewards.) </font>
desc_item_exchange_zd_0=It is said this thing can bring luck.<br>Take this thing to  <font color=""#00FF00"">A Xianer in Suzhou Mortuary (320,731)</font> to exchange for gift. <br><font color=""#00FF00"">How to get: </font> You will have a chance to get it from <font color=""#00FF00"">Egg Breaking Activity</font>.
desc_item_zd_yinchui_0=[Intro] With this item you may use the <font color="#00FFFF">Silver Hammer</font> for free at the Egg Breaking Activity.<br>[How to Get] You can obtain it from the <font color="#00FF00">Battlefield</font>, <font color="#00FF00">Faction Challenges</font> or a <font color="#00FF00">Forbidden Instance</font>.
desc_item_zd_jinchui_0=[Intro] With this item you may use the <font color="#00FFFF">Gold Hammer</font> for free at the Egg Breaking Activity.<br>[How to Get] You can obtain it from the <font color="#00FF00">Battlefield</font>, <font color="#00FF00">Faction Challenges</font> or a <font color="#00FF00">Forbidden Instance</font>.
desc_item_zd_yuchui_0=[Intro] With this item you may use the <font color="#00FFFF">Jade Hammer</font> for free at the Egg Breaking Activity.<br>[How to Get] You can obtain it from the <font color="#00FF00">Battlefield</font>, <font color="#00FF00">Faction Challenges</font> or a <font color="#00FF00">Forbidden Instance</font>.
talk_spa_0101=Place an egg to start the game. Players need to use mouse to control the left and right buttons below the horizontal stripe to keep the draw runner inside the stripe to cook egg successfully in appointed period, then players can get silver egg, red egg, or gold egg randomly. The eggs can be used to exchange for rewards at Jia Jia.
yd_menu_khd_ccbx_b=I've seen many people wandering on the coast. (<font face="Default" color="#00e5ee" >Treasure Box in Sunken Ship</font> Introduction of Gameplay)
yd_title_khd_ccbx_b=Hmm. There are some undercurrents in the sea around Delightful Island, so many merchant ships have been sunk when they tried to pass by. There are chests pushed by wave to the beach all the time. They only contain some mortal stuffs, but many greedy people fight to contest them. Idiots! <font face_b="Default" color_b="#00FF00" >(Treasure box in sunken ship: There are all kinds of treasure boxes on Delightful Island and in the surrounding sea. They are containing all kinds of good rewards.) </font>
yd_title_khd_dcdb_b=You don't need to flatter me. I won't drink with you. If you want to drink in Drunk Immortal Pavilion, you need to be careful of Tu Baishou. He's a freak who likes watching people fighting each other for a silk ball thrown by a maid in arena and enjoying their screaming and dying lying on the ground. <font face_b="Default" color_b="#00FF00" >(Contest Treasure in Arena: At 10:25-11:00, 20:25-21:00 every day, find Ai Fengwu (-314,561) at Drunk Immortal Pavilion on Delightful Island to join event Contest Treasure in Arena. By contesting treasure box, players can get good rewards.) </font>
desc_box_cardcs_001=Right click to open it to get lore <font color="#FFB428">Green Cicada Clothes</font> and <font color="#FFB428">Whirlwind Kick Kick Gift Bag (Includes Mystical Ice and Flame Wine).</font>
desc_item_exchange_xljs_mark_0=Coarsely covered handbook. It must be written by a hero. It records many strange things happened in Jianghu. <br>With this book, you can find Zhou Yixian at Suzhou Mortuary (320,732) to exchange for pills which can increase internal skill power quickly. <br>How to get: Have a chance to get it when join Jianghu Legends.
desc_box_sshd_xnbz01_1=<font color="#FFB428">Exquisite red gift bag. Open it to get Louyun Gift Box or Fortune Gift Box, and there is a chance to get massive Louyun Tokens. </font>
desc_box_sshd_xnbz03_1=<font color="#FFB428">Exquisite red gift box. By opening it, you may get Intermediate Repairing Tool, Advanced Repairing Tool, Qi Hai Concentration Pill, Hundred Flowers Heart-purifying Pill, Louyun Token and others. </font>
desc_box_gnlh_zyb001=The gift bag contains 5 Qi Hai Concentration Pills, 5 Zichen Pills, 5 Headmaster Orders, 2 Jinyuan Revival Pills, and 1 Five Aggregates and Demon-subduing Item Box.
desc_box_gnlh_zyb002=The gift box contains 1 Wood Horse (7 days), and 5 Leaf Dew Gathered Gold.
desc_box_canjiao_bang_0=Normal treasure box. By opening it, you may get gorgeous fireworks, bound general's treasure broken horn.
desc_box_spy_dhtz_b_jy_1_1=The treasure box is collected by Royal Guards Disciple. Open it to randomly gain Clustered Snow Lotus, Jade Dew Pill, Repairing Tool, a chance to gain a male diagram coming from Huabei area.
desc_box_spy_dhtz_g_jy_1_1=The treasure box is collected by Royal Guards Disciple. Open it to randomly gain Clustered Snow Lotus, Jade Dew Pill, Repairing Tool, a chance to gain a female diagram coming from Huabei area.
