desc_box_spy_dhtz_g_wd_1_1=The treasure box is collected by Wudang Disciple. Open it to randomly gain Clustered Snow Lotus, Jade Dew Pill, Repairing Tool, a chance to gain a female diagram coming from Central Plains area.
