spy_wsszzm_bt=Though we Beast Villa has collected many of them. They are just a drop in the bucket.
desc_box_card_035=Right-click to receive the 2-Star Quarterstaff Lore item <font color="#FFB428">Dark Iron Judge's Brush Sheath</font>
desc_SuperBook_srw_0=This pill can cancel the consumption of 10000 Cultivation Points for using Small or Devour the Stars.  <br>
desc_box_sweetemploy_mkk01=The wooden box contains one of the five secret medicines that can increase the effect of Blazing Fire and Dry Wood Palm at random.  These five medicines conflict against each other. If you take them at the same time, only one of them can work. Besides, there are another two mysterious items in the box.
desc_item_sweetemploy_121=Furious Golem Pill, one of Yan Ganchai's five secret medicine, can increase the critical hit chance of Blazing Fire and Dry Wood Palm by 20%.
desc_box_wgyz_99_1=Contains a skill book randomized from the array of Flying Cloud Sword, Eight Trigrams Staff, Divine Wind, Heavenly Dance, Nine Palaces Sword, Yuanyang Twin Blades. The item Skill Treasure Box is bound, while the item Book Page is unbound
desc_box_wgyz_prize_1=Has a chance to be rewarded with Qi Hai Concentration Pill, Leaf Gew Gathered Gold, a random skill set.
desc_box_meiying_02_1=Open the chest to get a random Ghost Shadow Scroll Fragment or a Hundred-Year Lotus Fruit
desc_item_restrain_03_0=<font color="#FFFF00">(Take advantage of the things around you) </font><br>Reduces the External Attack Damage dealt to up to 10 allies within a 15-meter radius by 10%, and grants immunity from the stunning effect of <font color="#FFAE00">Peacock's Plume Reflected in a Flurry of Blades</font>. Lasts 30 seconds. <br><font color="#eb6100">Costs 10% Energy to use</font><br><font color="#eb6100">Can only be used while in guild war and your own guild's territory</font><br><font color="#eb6100">This effect cannot occur more than once every 10 minutes</font>
desc_haiwai_box_card_001=Right-Click to randomly receive a Lore item of different qualities or other rewards.
desc_haiwai_box_material_002_1=A full box of iron ingots (It contains 400 Iron Ingots, and they are bound.)
desc_haiwai_box_material_003_1=A full box of copper ingots (It contains 400 Copper Ingots, and they are bound.)
desc_haiwai_box_material_004_1=A full box of lead ingots (It contains 80 Lead Ingots, and they are bound.)
desc_haiwai_box_material_005_1=A full box of silver ingots (It contains 80 Silver Ingots, and they are bound.)
desc_haiwai_box_material_006_1=A full box of gold ingots (It contains 80 Gold Ingots, and they are bound.)
desc_haiwai_box_material_007_1=A full box of zinc ingots (It contains 2 Zinc Ingots, and they are bound.)
desc_haiwai_box_material_008_1=A full box of tungsten ingots (It contains 2 Tungsten Ingots, and they are bound.)
desc_haiwai_box_material_009_1=A full box of tin ingots (It contains 1 Tin Ingot, and it is bound.)
desc_haiwai_box_material_010_1=A full box of brass ingots (It contains 1 Brass Ingot, and it is bound.)
desc_haiwai_box_kaiguang_001_1=Box full of blessing materials for blacksmith, but the materials in it are still unknown. (The items will be bound when get looted.)
desc_haiwai_box_kaiguang_002_1=Box full of blessing materials for craftsman, but the materials in it are still unknown. (The items will be bound when get looted.)
desc_haiwai_box_kaiguang_003_1=Box full of blessing materials for tailor, but the materials in it are still unknown. (The items will be bound when get looted.)
desc_haiwai_box_kaiguang_004_1=Box full of blessing materials for herbalist, but the materials in it are still unknown. (The items will be bound when get looted.)
desc_haiwai_box_kaiguang_005_1=Box full of blessing materials for poison maker, but the materials in it are still unknown. (The items will be bound when get looted.)
desc_haiwai_newyear_010_1=It has a Hunyuan Tendon-Relaxing Pill. There's a chance to find other cool stuff, too!
desc_haiwai_newyear_012_1=This has a chance to give you a Work Bench, Black Jade Powder, Gold Thread Powder and other exquisite items!
desc_haiwai_newyear_013_1=It has various things for your journeys through Jianghu or a chance to drop an attractive Snake Scale Robe!
desc_haiwai_newyear_014_1=The white horse ushers in the New Year! This has a marvellous Snake Scale Robe and Flying Cloud Horse Lore!
desc_haiwai_box_horse_001=Open this gift pack and collect a random Horse Whistle.
desc_haiwai_petbox_001_1=Mysterious gift pack which provides a chance to get pet
desc_ng_cjbook_jh_204_n_0=A Scattered Fragment of the skill Purple Rosy Clouds Skill, a collection of 10 can be combined with the NPC <font color="#ff0000">Calligrapher</font> <br><font color="#ffff00">to form the prime Mental Skill for Purple Rosy Clouds Skill</font>
desc_ng_cjbook_jh_205_n_0=A Scattered Fragment of Toad Style, a collection of 10 can be combined with the NPC <font color="#ff0000">Calligrapher</font> <br><font color="#ffff00">to form the prime Mental Skill for Toad Style</font>
desc_ng_cjbook_jh_307_n_0=A Scattered Fragment of the skill Blood Blade Manual, a collection of 10 can be combined with the NPC <font color="#ff0000">Calligrapher</font> <br><font color="#ffff00">to form the prime Mental Skill for Blood Blade Manual</font>
desc_ng_cjbook_jh_204_n2_0=A Scattered Fragment of the Purple Rosey Clouds Skill. Collect 10 fragments and bind them at the <font color="#ff0000">Calligrapher</font> <br><font color="#ffff00">You will receive the prime Mental Skill for Purple Rosey Clouds Skill (Level 76-86)</font>
desc_ng_cjbook_jh_205_n2_0=A Scattered Fragment of Poisonous Toad. Collect 10 fragments and bind them at the <font color="#ff0000">Calligrapher</font> <br><font color="#ffff00">You will receive the prime Mental Skill for Poisonous Toad (Level 76-86)</font>
desc_ng_cjbook_jh_307_n2_0=A Scattered Fragment of the Blood Blade Manual. Collect 10 fragments and bind them at the <font color="#ff0000">Calligrapher</font> <br><font color="#ffff00">You will receive the prime Mental Skill for Blood Blade Manual (Level 76-86)</font>
desc_ng_book_jh_201_13th=An Internal Skill created by Bai Zizai, the founder of Snow Mountain Sect. He believed in the saying “When you lack direction, lose something to gain something else.” You can use this skill to turn disaster into happiness or vice versa. You can also use it on enemies.
desc_ng_book_jh_204_13th=Created by Hao Datong, the founder of the Hua Mountain Sect. It is a mental skill for cultivating inner pill. It is also supreme Xuangong of Daoist Martial Art. Kung fu starts from theory of “Yi” and comes from Non-polar diagram. When you finish studying, “Purple light Gang Qi” will be poured into the whole body. It can shock enemies with void inner skill.
desc_ng_book_jh_205_13th=A rare power in Jianghu. "The style of the toad." Toads often remain stationary. They can remain in the ground unmoving to preserve their energy, even when moving about they do not need much nourishment", toad style also looks at preserving poison. It is an extremely difficult discipline of internal skill. If successful, the yang energy is greatly increased , use calm to defend against movement, fight poison with poison, stand firm against opponents.
desc_ng_book_jh_307_13th=One of the most infamous kung fu styles in Jianghu. "The force from the heart, not a hair's width inaccuracy, blood bath and destruction" are the tenets, use evil thoughts to attack, can cause unstoppable bleeding, enemies can drain out if not careful. It is looked down by upright Jianghu members, but its power is considerable.
desc_ng_book_jh_204_13th_0=<font color="#aaffaa">You must have already learned level 64 Purple Rosy Clouds Skill to understand it.</font>
desc_ng_book_jh_205_13th_0=<font color="#aaffaa">You must have already learned level 64 Poisonous Toad to understand it.</font>
desc_ng_book_jh_307_13th_0=<font color="#aaffaa">You must have already learned level 64 Blood Blade to understand it.</font>
desc_ng_book_jh_201_14th=An Internal Skill created by Bai Zizai, the founder of Snow Mountain Sect. He believed in the saying “When you lack direction, lose something to gain something else.” You can use this skill to turn disaster into happiness or vice versa. You can also use it on enemies.
