menu_Guild_tasknpc_001_1_1=Which requirements are required for accepting guild quest?
title_Guild_tasknpc_001_1_1=<font color="#FFFF00">Jianghu VIP</font> is required to perform guild quests. Enough Power Level is required to claim guild quest according to the current Age of Wushu Record: Tier 1 Requirement is <font color="#ff0000">Realized Potential</font>, Tier 2 Requirement is <font color="#ff0000">High Proficiency</font>, Tier 3 Requirement is <font color="#ff0000">Mentally Balanced</font>, Tier 4 Requirement is <font color="#ff0000">Peak of Power</font>, Tier 5 Requirement is <font color="#ff0000">Divine Talent</font>, and Tier 6 Requirement is <font color="#ff0000">Transcendent</font>.
