desc_box_lzy_smzb_grzb004_1=Reward for won the 4th-10th place in Three Alliances Conquest Personal Weekly Ranking List.<br>Contains <font color="#FFFF00">1 Green Jade Internal Skill Pill, and 1 Personal Weekly Ranking Reward Box (Copper)</font>.
desc_box_lzy_smzb_grzb005_1=Reward for won the 11st-100th place in Three Alliances Conquest Personal Weekly Ranking List.<br>Contains <font color="#FFFF00">1 Green Jade Internal Skill Pill, and 1 Personal Weekly Ranking Reward Box (Iron)</font>.
desc_box_lzy_smzb_grzb_jlh001_0=Reward for won the first place in Three Alliances Conquest Personal Weekly Ranking List.<br>Contains <font color="#FFFF00">100-120 Battle Coins, 1 martial art page of Netherworld Lingering Fragrance Skill, Array Breaking Lunatic Sword, Wind Driving Nine Changes, or General's March, a certain amount of exclusive cultivation perfusion pills (The amount is related to the progress of Age of Wushu Records)</font>, and also have a chance to get <font color="#FFFF00">a certain amount of cultivation, cultivation perfusion, Chi (The amount is related to the progress of Age of Wushu Records), Jianghu Internal Skill Page</font>.
desc_box_lzy_smzb_grzb_jlh002_0=Reward for won the second place in Three Alliances Conquest Personal Weekly Ranking List.<br>Contains <font color="#FFFF00">90-100 Battle Coins, and a certain amount of exclusive cultivation perfusion pills (The amount is related to the progress of Age of Wushu Records)</font>, and also have a chance to get <font color="#FFFF00">a certain amount of cultivation, cultivation perfusion, Chi (The amount is related to the progress of Age of Wushu Records), Netherworld Lingering Fragrance Skill, Array Breaking Lunatic Sword, Wind Driving Nine Changes, or General's March Page, Jianghu Internal Skill Page</font>.
desc_box_lzy_smzb_grzb_jlh003_0=Reward for won the third place in Three Alliances Conquest Personal Weekly Ranking List.<br>Contains <font color="#FFFF00">70-80 Battle Coins, and a certain amount of exclusive cultivation perfusion pills (The amount is related to the progress of Age of Wushu Records)</font>, and also have a chance to get <font color="#FFFF00">a certain amount of cultivation, cultivation perfusion, Chi (The amount is related to the progress of Age of Wushu Records), Netherworld Lingering Fragrance Skill, Array Breaking Lunatic Sword, Wind Driving Nine Changes, or General's March Page, Jianghu Internal Skill Page</font>.
desc_box_lzy_smzb_grzb_jlh004_0=Reward for won the 4th-10th place in Three Alliances Conquest Personal Weekly Ranking List.<br>Contains <font color="#FFFF00">50-60 Battle Coins, and a certain amount of exclusive cultivation perfusion pills (The amount is related to the progress of Age of Wushu Records)</font>, and also have a chance to get <font color="#FFFF00">a certain amount of cultivation, cultivation perfusion, Chi (The amount is related to the progress of Age of Wushu Records), Netherworld Lingering Fragrance Skill, Array Breaking Lunatic Sword, Wind Driving Nine Changes, or General's March Page, Jianghu Internal Skill Page</font>.
desc_box_lzy_smzb_grzb_jlh005_0=Reward for won the 11st-100th place in Three Alliances Conquest Personal Weekly Ranking List.<br>Contains <font color="#FFFF00">30-40 Battle Coins, and a certain amount of exclusive cultivation perfusion pills (The amount is related to the progress of Age of Wushu Records)</font>, and also have a chance to get <font color="#FFFF00">a certain amount of cultivation, cultivation perfusion, Chi (The amount is related to the progress of Age of Wushu Records), Netherworld Lingering Fragrance Skill, Array Breaking Lunatic Sword, Wind Driving Nine Changes, or General's March Page, Jianghu Internal Skill Page</font>.
