desc_item_lzy_smzb_dh001_0=Item that awarded to the well-performed players in Three Alliances Conquest.<br>Can be used for exchanging for cultivation pills, High Level Flying Skill Book, pages of Array Breaking Lunatic Sword, Netherworld Lingering Fragrance Skill, Sword of the Northern Dragon, Flowing Cloud Sword, Wind Driving Nine Changes, General's March, or Xiaoxiang Water And Cloud Music, and Raw Jade Items of Zither at the Exchange page in Three Alliance Conquest interface.
