desc_tab_b_head_179_b_0=Get it by purchasing lore Crimson Demon Flame Outfit. Its Craftsmanship is slightly fine. Refer to this design to change the style of Jianghu costume. The <font color="#99cc00">Secret Tailors</font> in each city can transform Equipment to change the style. <br><font color="#96a0c8">When the equipment exchange drawing is placed in the backpack, right click to store it in the drawing archive. The drawing can then be used an unlimited number of times.</font>
desc_tab_g_head_179_b_0=Get it by purchasing lore Crimson Demon Flame Outfit. Its Craftsmanship is slightly fine. Refer to this design to change the style of Jianghu costume. The <font color="#99cc00">Secret Tailors</font> in each city can transform Equipment to change the style. <br><font color="#96a0c8">When the equipment exchange drawing is placed in the backpack, right click to store it in the drawing archive. The drawing can then be used an unlimited number of times.</font>
