desc_box_lzy_smzb_dzjl_yu_a_0=Rewards of Three Alliances Conquest.<br>Contains <font color="#FFFF00">1 Refined Moon Internal Skill Pill, 2 Qi Hai Concentration Pills, 70 Battle Coins, 1 Bonus Reward Pack, 1 Three Alliance Performance Pack, and a certain amount of cultivation perfusion pills (The amount is related to the progress of Age of Wushu Records)</font>.
