newqy_menu_wgm_01=Brother Zhao!
newqy_title_wgm_01=What's up?
newqy_menu_wgm_02=I will go to Xu Family Manor.
newqy_title_wgm_02=Are you ready?
newqy_menu_wgm_03=I'm ready!
newqy_menu_wgm_04=I will go to Beast Villa.
newqy_title_wgm_04=Are you ready?
newqy_menu_wgm_05=I'm ready!
newqy_menu_wgm_06=I will go to Golden Needle Sect.
newqy_title_wgm_06=Are you ready?
newqy_menu_wgm_07=I'm ready!
newqy_menu_wgm_08=I'm going to capture the fugitive. Please help me.
newqy_title_wgm_08=Are you ready?
newqy_menu_wgm_09=I'm ready!
desc_item_wgm_slcs_0=Traveling Token for the Rootless Clan to challenge other factions (Use it at Zhao Wuji)
newqy_menu_dy_01=What is the matter with you?
newqy_title_dy_01=I'm dying... please save Jiazhu, and take this letter to Jiu...
newqy_menu_dy_02=Hi? Brother?!
newqy_menu_dy_04=Why are you here? Aren't you staying with Elder Jiu Gong?
newqy_title_dy_04=You just came in time. Here is not a suitable place for staying, will you come to me stealthily later?
newqy_menu_dy_05=Why are you so cautious?
desc_item_qynew_dy_01_0=An ancient script, hard to understand it.
desc_item_qynew_dy_09_0=A illegible book, seemed to be useless.
desc_useitem_qynew_dy_02_0=All people, gather at Green Island!
desc_item_qynew_dy_08_0=The lines behind the tablet look like a map.
desc_item_qynew_dy_02_0=It's high noon! Gather at Green Island!
desc_item_qynew_dy_03_0=It is said that this medicine has a miraculous effect on countering poison.
desc_item_qynew_dy_04_0=It is said that this medicine has a miraculous effect on countering poison.
desc_item_qynew_dy_05_0=It is said that this medicine has a miraculous effect on countering poison.
desc_item_qynew_dy_06_0=A pill found from the mysterious person. It should be the antidote.
desc_useitem_qynew_dy_05_0=The pill used for suppressing the poison temporarily.
randadv_NPC_qynew_dy_05=(Coughing)
randadv_yxhd_dy_cds=Young Hero, please wait!
randadv_yxhd_dy_xbt=This matter is quite agonizing.
randadv_NPC_qynew_dy_19=This matter is quite troublesome.
newqy_menu_dy_10=Do you have any more pills?
newqy_title_dy_10=You've used up yours?
newqy_menu_dy_11=Yeah, give me one more.
yxhd_menu_dy_05=Constable Xing, what happened? You seem to be worried.
yxhd_title_dy_05=A philanderer has appeared in Suzhou, and I'm requested to arrest him in three days.
yxhd_menu_dy_06=How is the progress now? Maybe I can help you.
yxhd_menu_dy_07=Have you ever heard about the case of the philanderer?
yxhd_title_dy_07=oh?
yxhd_menu_dy_08=You seem to know about something.
yxhd_title_dy_08=I'll tell you if you drink up this jar of wine.
yxhd_menu_dy_09=No problem.
yxhd_menu_dy_10=Good wine, will you tell me now?
yxhd_title_dy_10=Haha...
yxhd_menu_dy_11=What did you put in the wine?!
yxhd_menu_dy_12=Waiter, do you know anything about the philanderer?
yxhd_title_dy_12=Philanderer? Sorry, I don't know.
yxhd_menu_dy_13=It seems that the information is blocked by the government.
yxhd_menu_dy_14=Heroine, do you know anything about the philanderer?
yxhd_title_dy_14=Philanderer? Sorry, I don't know.
yxhd_menu_dy_15=It seems that the information is blocked by the government.
