dh_jy_fswf_01=Why are you here? I've never seen you before.
dh_jy_fswf_02=I, I came from the Ming dynasty, and am going to the western for further study.
dh_jy_fswf_03=You must be a thief, take this!
task_npc_jy_fsgj_04=What is this place? It looks so jolly.
dh_jy_fswf_04=You look poor. I have some fresh food here, take it.
dh_jy_fswf_05=You're really a kind person, young hero. I have some rewards for you.
dh_jy_fswf_06=Thanks.
task_npc_jypt_006=I have been starving for several days. Please give me some food.
