desc_zither_60301=It's made of light, flexible wood and resembles a large paddle.
desc_zither_60302=A sword which has vanquished many enemies. When you wield it, the blood of all whom it has killed will seep out through the tip and run over the hilt.
desc_zither_60401=Rumored to have been cast by a refugee murderer.
desc_zither_60402="Only air separates us from the Heavens."
desc_zither_60403=It's named Qingyun. It seems awe-inspiring, righteous and peerlessly sharp.
desc_zither_60404=The name means "Drink when the rain falls and be nourished by the Great Mother's milk." This sword is very in tune with the Tao.
desc_zither_60405=Emits a hazy aura when held.
desc_zither_60501=Steel formed from molten lava, refined a hundred times, very hard.
desc_zither_60502=<s>
desc_zither_60503=<s>
