task_home_jj_back=How can I help you?
desc_switch_752=Oath of Friendship Interface Store Switch
desc_home_diaoxiang_01_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Decoration<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>20<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Courtyard Size reaches level 1<br>A majesty stone lion. <br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_diaoxiang_02_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Decoration<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>20<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Courtyard Size reaches level 1<br>A majesty stone lion. <br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_diaoxiang_03_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Decoration<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>40<br><font color="#FFFF00">Requirement: </font>Courtyard Size reaches level 1 <br>Pi Xiu has the meaning of bringing in wealth and treasure.<br>The statue can be obtained by <font color="#FFAE00">Make Furniture</font> function.<br>Right-click to use and store it in your home.
desc_home_penzai_new_01_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Plant<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>20<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Courtyard Size reaches level 1<br>A lovely succulent plant. <br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_penzai_new_02_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Plant<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>30<br><font color="#FFFF00">Requirement: </font>Courtyard Size reaches level 1 <br>An old stump.<br>Pot Plant can be obtained by <font color="#FFAE00">Make Furniture</font> function.<br>Right-click to store items which will automatically be deposited into the home warehouse.
desc_home_penzai_new_03_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Plant<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>30<br><font color="#FFFF00">Requirement: </font>Courtyard Size reaches level 1 <br>The red leaves look like flame.<br>Pot Plant can be obtained by <font color="#FFAE00">Make Furniture</font> function.<br>Right-click to store items which will automatically be deposited into the home warehouse.
desc_home_penzai_new_04_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Plant<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>40<br><font color="#FFFF00">Requirement: </font>Courtyard Size reaches level 1 <br>An old stump.<br>Pot Plant can be obtained by <font color="#FFAE00">Make Furniture</font> function.<br>Right-click to store items which will automatically be deposited into the home warehouse.
desc_home_tree_01_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Plant<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>80<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Courtyard Size reaches level 1<br>A white cherry tree, can be used for decorating the courtyard.<br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_tree_02_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Plant<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>80<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Courtyard Size reaches level 1<br>A red maple tree, can be used for decorating the courtyard.<br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_tree_03_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Plant<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>80<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Courtyard Size reaches level 1<br>A green willow tree, can be used for decorating the courtyard.<br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_tree_04_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Plant<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>80<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Courtyard Size reaches level 1<br>A pink peach tree, can be used for decorating the courtyard.<br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_tianshui_01_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Water Conservancy<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>50<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Courtyard Size reaches level 1<br>A common watering device made by stone and bamboo.<br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_tianshui_02_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Water Conservancy<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>100<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Courtyard Size reaches level 1<br>A watering device made by special materials and makes a melodious sound.<br>Watering device can be obtained by <font color="#FFAE00">Make Furniture</font> function.<br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_tianshui_03_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Water Conservancy<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>150<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Courtyard Size reaches level 1<br>It is said that this watering device's crafting technology comes from a temple in Japan.<br>Watering device can be obtained by <font color="#FFAE00">Make Furniture</font> function.<br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_tengjia_01_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Plant<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>50<br><font color="#FFFF00">Requirement: </font>Courtyard Size reaches level 1 <br>Green leaf vine, used for decorating the courtyard.<br>Pergola can be obtained by <font color="#FFAE00">Make Furniture</font> function.<br>Right-click to store items which will automatically be deposited into the home warehouse.
desc_home_tengjia_02_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Plant<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>100<br><font color="#FFFF00">Requirement: </font>Courtyard Size reaches level 2 <br>Lush purple vine, used for decorating the courtyard.<br>Pergola can be obtained by <font color="#FFAE00">Make Furniture</font> function.<br>Right-click to store items which will automatically be deposited into the home warehouse.
desc_home_jing_01_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Water Conservancy<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>50<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Courtyard Size reaches level 1<br>A common well.<br>Left click to shift and use.
desc_home_jing_02_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Water Conservancy<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>100<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Courtyard Size reaches level 1<br>A well with a bamboo cover.<br>Well can be obtained by <font color="#FFAE00">Make Furniture</font> function.<br>Left click to shift and use.
desc_home_jing_03_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Water Conservancy<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>150<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Courtyard Size reaches level 1<br>This wooden well is more durable.<br>Well can be obtained by <font color="#FFAE00">Make Furniture</font> function.<br>Left click to shift and use.
desc_home_yi_out_01_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Chair<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>20<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Courtyard Size reaches level 1<br>Wooden chair made by stump. <br>You will get Cultivation Points when resting on the stool. The effect differs according to the quality of the stool. The cooldown is six hours. Players will get the buff every 12 hours. <br>When the Home durability is less than half, the effect will be decreased. <br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_yi_out_02_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Chair<br><font color="#FFFF00">Luxury: </font>60<br><font color="#FFFF00">Requirement: </font>Courtyard size has reached level 1 <br>The bench is made by a whole trunk and it can be sat by two people at the same time.<br>Using it will grant a small amount of Cultivation Points(The Cultivation Points received are determined by the chair quality). This buff can be accessed from the item every 6 hours while the effect requires a 12 hour cooldown after using.<br>When home durability is lower than 50%, the furniture effect will be affected.<br>This item can be obtained by using the <font color="#FFAE00">Make Furniture</font> function.<br>Right-click to use. It will be stored in the Home Inventory automatically.
desc_home_table_out_01_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Table & Chair<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>100<br><font color="#FFFF00">Requirement: </font>Home size has reached level 1 <br>Stone table and chairs which are embossed.<br>Using the combination will grant a small amount of Cultivation Points(The Cultivation Points received are determined by the chair quality). This buff can be accessed from the item every 6 hours while the effect requires a 12 hour cooldown after using.<br>When home durability is lower than 50%, the furniture effect will be affected.<br>This item can be obtained by using the <font color="#FFAE00">Make Furniture</font> function.<br>Right-click to use. It will be stored in the Home Inventory automatically.
desc_home_yi_out_03_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Chair<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>100<br><font color="#FFFF00">Requirement: </font>Home size has reached level 1 <br>A rocking chair of the swing style.<br>Using it will grant a small amount of Cultivation Points(The Cultivation Points received are determined by the chair quality). This buff can be accessed from the item every 6 hours while the effect requires a 12 hour cooldown after using.<br>When home durability is lower than 50%, the furniture effect will be affected.<br>This item can be obtained by using the <font color="#FFAE00">Make Furniture</font> function.<br>Right-click to use. It will be stored in the Home Inventory automatically.
