desc_tab_b_head_185_b_0=Purchase Lavender Youth to receive it. Use this diagram to change the appearance of the outfit. Using <font color="#99cc00">Dressing Room</font> function can transform Equipment to change its style. <br><font color="#96a0c8">When the outfit diagram is stowed in the backpack, right-click to add it to the Dressing Room. It will be stored there indefinitely and will have an unlimited number of uses.</font>
desc_tab_g_head_185_b_0=Purchase Lavender Youth to receive it. Use this diagram to change the appearance of the outfit. Using <font color="#99cc00">Dressing Room</font> function can transform Equipment to change its style. <br><font color="#96a0c8">When the outfit diagram is stowed in the backpack, right-click to add it to the Dressing Room. It will be stored there indefinitely and will have an unlimited number of uses.</font>
