desc_home_sd_new_01_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Decoration<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>200<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Courtyard Size reaches level 1<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Area: </font>Courtyard<br>Gorgeous phoenix ice carving, made by hundred-year ice in the extreme north area.<br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_sd_new_02_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Decoration<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>200<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Courtyard Size reaches level 1<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Area: </font>Courtyard<br>This big snowman has an figure of fortune cat.<br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_sd_new_05_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Table & Chair<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>200<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Home Size reaches level 1<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Area: </font>Courtyard<br>Exquisite stone table and chair that carved with dragon designs.<br>You will get Cultivation Points when resting on the stool. The effect differs according to the quality of the stool. The cooldown is six hours. Players will get the buff every 12 hours. <br>When the Home durability is less than half, the effect will be decreased. <br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_sd_new_06_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Plant<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>200<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Courtyard Size reaches level 1<br>The vines fall down from the corridor just like rain.<br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_sd_new_07_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Plant<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>200<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Courtyard Size reaches level 1<br>A heart-shaped tree. People believe that they can achieve their wishes by parrying under the tree<br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
