desc_loop_30302=Made of refined copper, and heavy enough to crush bone.
desc_loop_40302=A simple weapon good for beginners. Popular in Aolai country.
desc_loop_40401=Fine steel infused with silver, heated under the burning sun, tempered in the crystal spring.
desc_loop_40402=Therein it lies, hidden between Heaven and Earth.
desc_loop_40403=There is lightning atop the mountain.
desc_loop_40404=The dragon rests in magma.
desc_loop_40405=It has a strong power. It can kill a man with one hit.
desc_loop_40501=Shuofang's troops fill the city.
desc_loop_40502=From a steel frame cast in molten silver.
desc_loop_40503=It is made from the teeth of Jade Wolf King. It's extremely sharp and full of the smell of blood.
desc_loop_40504=Half spoon of Cold Spring is the Dragon eye. Quenched with the essence of Cold Spring and bathed in the light of the sun and moon, it is extremely sharp.
desc_loop_40505=Soul Spring washes with flower fragrance. Quenched with the essence of Soul Spring and bathed in the light of the sun and moon, it is extremely sharp.
desc_loop_40601=The will to fight the enemy, even with shattered bones. That is a hero.
desc_loop_40602=The bed sheet was soaked with the sweat after they made love. Seeing the blood on the sheet, the pretty girl was sobbing.
desc_loop_40701=It's quenched with the upper spring water, so it is extraordinarily sharp. It's said that it gathers the essence of the sun and the moon.
desc_loop_40702=When the blade weaves back and forth during battle, a brilliant light flows like the River Dragon's body.
desc_loop_40703=Wealth and honor will come to the bearer of this blade.
desc_loop_50302=Travel by the whim of destiny.
desc_loop_50401=Ask and listen to the words.
desc_loop_50402=The dragon hovers over ice and snow.
desc_loop_50403=The clothing is stained with tears.
desc_loop_50404=Forged in a different period.
desc_loop_50405=Forged at the purple mountain.
desc_loop_50501=The violent one commits evil deeds. Without law in his eyes, the innocent suffer.
desc_loop_50502=When you reach a certain state of mind, you shall not be bothered by trivialities. The body is a Bodhi tree and the mind a standing mirror bright. Amitabha!
desc_loop_50503=The essence of red violet, a mountain was flattened to refine the essence, after crystallization becomes crimson beads.
desc_loop_50601=<s>
desc_loop_50602=<s>
desc_loop_50603=Often recite the scriptures without stop and keep in mind that all things are born equal.
desc_loop_50604=<s>
desc_loop_50605=<s>
desc_loop_50701=Durable boots made at home by commoners.
desc_loop_50702=Simple colored boots of average quality.
desc_loop_50703=Bright colored boots of average quality.
desc_loop_50704=Good quality boots used for adventuring.
desc_loop_60301=It's made of light, flexible wood and resembles a large paddle.
desc_loop_60302=A sword which has vanquished many enemies. When you wield it, the blood of all whom it has killed will seep out through the tip and run over the hilt.
desc_loop_60401=Rumored to have been cast by a refugee murderer.
desc_loop_60402="Only air separates us from the Heavens."
desc_loop_60403=It's named Qingyun. It seems awe-inspiring, righteous and peerlessly sharp.
desc_loop_60404=The name means "Drink when the rain falls and be nourished by the Great Mother's milk." This sword is very in tune with the Tao.
desc_loop_60405=Emits a hazy aurua when held.
desc_loop_60501=Steel formed from molten lava, refined a hundred times, very hard.
desc_loop_60502=The one who defeats heaven is feared by heaven and the land trembles, the universe is silent before him.
desc_loop_60503=The momentum of the rainbow spans all lands, it originates in the sky and worshipped in every land.
desc_loop_60601=<s>
desc_loop_60602=<s>
desc_loop_60603=<s>
desc_loop_60604=<s>
desc_loop_60605=Many people have tried to find the origins of this ring without success.
desc_loop_60701=Lightning spirits seem to cling to these boots.
desc_loop_60702=Boots for the prudent wearer.
desc_loop_60703=These boots grant the wearer mysterious power.
desc_loop_60704=Made of blood-soaked silk.
desc_loop_60705=Rare birds are attracted to these boots.
desc_loop_battlefield_50501=It's made by armorsmith master Jin Zhongliang.
desc_loop_battlefield_50601=It's made by weaponsmith master Xiong Jianwu.
desc_loop_battlefield_50701=#N/A
desc_loop_battlefield_60601=The way of heaven is to win without fighting, respond without speaking, come without being beckoned. Said to come from the weapons master.
desc_loop_battlefield_60701=<s>
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_loop_02_1=Read this to learn to make Twin Circles. <br>This weapon is designed for players at the <font color="#00FF00">First Understanding</font> level. <br>Obtainable in Forbidden Instances
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_loop_02_1_1=
desc_hcitem_tj_loop_02_1_0=An ancient weapon crafting book referred to as Taihua. Contains weapon manufacturing techniques and the process.
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_loop_04_01=Read this to learn how to make Twin Circles. <br>This weapon is designed for <font color="#00FF00">Martial Intuition</font> characters. <br>Obtainable in Forbidden Instances
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_loop_04_01_1=
desc_hcitem_tj_loop_04_01_0=The Swallow Plume Twin Circles Record is one volume of the Whirlwind Eight Forges. <br>Only a Blacksmith with the title of <font color="#00FF00">Artisan Blacksmith</font> can read it.
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_loop_03=Read this to learn how to make Twin Circles. <br>This weapon is designed for <font color="#00FF00">Realized Potential</font> characters. <br>Obtainable in Forbidden Instances<br>A Level 1 Workbench is required
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_loop_03_1=
desc_hcitem_tj_loop_03_0=Murong Ye found the anonymous book Exquisite Weapons Record about troop training by chance. After repeated study and application, all the weapons described in this book were exquisite. Twin Circles Record records the method of producing Twin Circles. <br>You may obtain it after passing a Forbidden Instance and Relations Task.
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_loop_04=Read this to learn how to make Twin Circles. <br>This weapon is designed for <font color="#00FF00">Martial Intuition</font> characters. <br>Obtainable in Forbidden Instances<br>A Level 2 Workbench is required
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_loop_04_1=
desc_hcitem_tj_loop_04_0=Legend has it that Ou Yezi, a master sword maker in the Warring States Period, wrote a book detailing the manufacturing techniques for many weapons. This portion covers the Gold Twin Circles.
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_loop_10=
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_loop_10_1=Read this to learn the various methods of making rare twin circles. <br>This weapon is suitable for the <font color="#00FF00">Grand Master</font> level. <br>A Level 3 workbench is required to craft item.
desc_hcitem_tj_loop_10=All rare weapons are forged based on this book. The origin of the book has been lost in history. The weapon forging requires high craftsmanship, superior raw materials, and favorable weather and geographical positions. Divine Weapon Twin Circles Script describes the highest skill of forging the twin circles.
desc_hcitem_tj_loop_10_0=All rare weapons are forged based on this book. The origin of the book has been lost in history. The weapon forging requires high craftsmanship, superior raw materials, and favorable weather and geographical positions. Divine Weapon Twin Circles Script describes the highest skill of forging the twin circles.
