desc_item_2017_hkdhpz_001_1=Certificate that exchanged by Slow-Burning Platforms at Suzhou (315, 733) Donation Merchant. With this certificate you can <font color="#FF3030">exchange for Gratitude Gift Pack (II) at the Donation Merchant. Open the Gratitude Gift Pack (II) you will get one from Qing Yuan Pill, Hundred Flower Mind Clearing Pill, or Hero Token, also have a chance to get 1 Ancient Manual Scroll Fragment Pack (II) or 10 of it. Open Ancient Manual Scroll Fragment Pack (II) you will get one from Secret of the Holy Fire Ancient Manual fragment, Great Vajra Finger fragment, Tai Chi Fist Ancient Manual fragment, or Sea of Blood Demon Blade Ancient Manual fragment.</font>
