yxhd_menu_dy_01=What are you looking for, elder?
yxhd_title_dy_01=Young hero, have your ever seen my little dragon?
yxhd_menu_dy_02=Dragon? Are you sure? How can we see a dragon?
yxhd_title_dy_02=I really saw it. It became a red light and shot under my bed, then disappeared.
yxhd_menu_dy_03=And what happened?
yxhd_title_dy_03=And some items appeared under my bed. I want to see the dragon again. If you can help me with it, I will reward you.
yxhd_menu_dy_04=Ah…all right.
