desc_box_guguji_01=Five chicken which are always in a group. When they are summoned, the player can recover 5 Flying Skill points per second when using Sit and Breathe. <br><font color="#ff0000">Tip: Once the Age of Wushu Record Tier 2 is available, VIP players who own a pet and have reached "Flows With Chi" can speak with the Beast Villa Guide in Beast Villa to join the faction. (Coordinates: Beggar's Sect 589, 853)</font><br>Right-click to get the pet Cuckoo Group.
desc_box_guguji_01_1=
desc_pet_guguji_gensui_0=<font color="#ff0000">[Right click to move the Familiar to Favorite interface]</font><br><font color="#ff0000">Note: When you move the Familiar to Favorite interface, it cannot be taken out and will be bound with you. If the Familiar has time limit, it will be deleted once it expires. </font><br>Use it to summon Cuckoo Group to follow the player. The group is lovely and clumsy. When the Familiar is summoned, the players can recover 5 Flying Skill Points per second by mediation. <br><font color="#ff0000">Tips: When Age of Wushu Record Tier is available, players who own a Familiar and have reached Flows With Chi can talk with Beast Villa Guide in Beast Villa to join the faction. (Coordinates: Beggar's Sect 589 853)</font>
