desc_ltitem_prize003_0=This whistle was made by the descendant of the leader of Peach Blossom Island. It is made of fine Green Jade Bamboo, and they say that its melody can control the tides. <font color="#3299CC">Increase Breath by 20 points for 50 team members within a 20 meters radius.</font><br><font color="#3299CC">Last 5 minutes.</font>
desc_key_qy_suzhou_sz325_0=This box is the Peach Blossom Island Lord's Tribute to the Emperor. It is also the item Murong Sichen wants to use to plant evidence on the Peach Blossom Island Lord.
desc_key_qy_gb002_caoyao_0=Give the herb to <font color="#FF3333">Gong Peng</font> (550, 426) at the Beggars' Sect.
desc_key_qy_gb002_yao_0=Gong Peng developed the medicine to refugees' strange diseases. Give it to Incense Master <font color="#FF3333">Huo Rang</font> (631, 415) who is nearby and distribute the medicine among the diseased refugees.
desc_key_qy_jy106_xin_0=A Confidential letter for Beggar's Sect Leader Xiao (554, 337) . Deliver it to him.
