desc_zhenfa_thd_01=The Peach Blossom Island array that is famous through Jianghu was created by the island leader. The array integrates the essence of the Eight Diagrams of the Five Elements, miraculous shield armor, and trap calculation techniques. If you wonder inside without knowing how to conquer the method, you will become lost within the Peach Tree Forest.
