desc_Item_qygp_lzs_007_0=<font color="#EEAD0E">Take this Item, 100 jars of Daughter's Wine and 10 pages of the Dragon Claw (ancient manual) Scroll Fragments to find the Worldly Monk at No-Man's Taoist Temple (283 1074) in Suzhou to trade for the corresponding book pages.</font>
desc_Item_qygp_lzs_000_0=It is called "Daughter's Wine." It is buried when a daughter is born and it will be taken out at the day the daughter gets married.   (The wine-drinking monk in <font color="#FF0000">Luoyang Fengxian Temple (1807 1001)</font> is collecting this wine. Take 110 bottles of the wine to him) <br><font color="#00EEEE">(You have to learn the movements of Dragon Claw Ancient Manual before you learn Dragon Claw from the wine-drinking monk.)</font>
desc_item_thd_jiemian_01_0=Peach Blossom Island specific item. You can gain Peach Blossom Island reputation after using it. Can only be used by Peach Blossom Island disciples)
desc_item_thd_jiemian_02_0=Peach Blossom Island specific item. You can gain Peach Blossom Island special talent values after using it. Can only be used by Peach Blossom Island disciples)
yhgtaofa_signup_title_002=The School War starts at 16:00 and 21:00 on every Tuesday and Sunday, and only Palace of Shifting Flowers disciples may join. There is a max of participants of 48 players. Defeat the Leader of the Twelve-Linked Fortress to earn a grand reward. You can attend only once a week and failure won't cost the chance.
title_qzyb_01=The treasure hunt requires Peach Blossom Island disciples to collect items instruments, chess, books, and paintings and give them to the island master. The points received for the items differs based on the quality of the items. After the event is over, lucrative rewards will be given according to rank.
desc_box_thd_qzyb_01_a_1=The Peach Blossom Island event reward gift box is presented by the island's owner to disciples who have performed remarkably (This reward is for the 1st to 5th place winners).
desc_box_thd_qzyb_01_b_1=The Peach Blossom Island event reward gift box is presented by the island's owner to disciples who have performed remarkably (This reward is for the 6th to 20th place winners).
desc_box_thd_qzyb_01_c_1=The Peach Blossom Island event reward gift box is presented by the island's owner to disciples who have performed remarkably (This reward is for the 21rst to 100th place winners).
