desc_box_thd_edrq_bd_1=The Peach Blossom Island event reward gift box is presented by the island's owner to disciples who have performed remarkably. (For players who have attained a certain score)
thd_forcequit_menu=I want to leave the Peach Blossom Island.
thd_forcequit_title=Peach Blossom Island is scenic. The many disciples of the island all have excellent skills. The master of the island is an expert in music, chess, poetry, painting, medicine, divination, astronomy, and fortune telling. If you can learn any of these skills, you will be successful in Jianghu. If you leave the Peach Blossom Island, you won't be able to continue your practices. Please think twice before leaving.
thd_forcequit_mainmenu=I have questions regarding to leaving the Peach Blossom Island.
thd_forcequit_quitmenu=I want to leave the Peach Blossom Island.
thd_quitinfo_menu=I want to know how to leave the Peach Blossom Island.
thd_quitinfo_cs_ttile=When your Blue Waves Mental Skill reaches 49, and your Peach Blossom Island reputation reaches 118,080, you can graduate and leave the faction. <br>If you don't reach the requirement, you can exchange for Peach Blossom Island diploma at A-Xiang (Peach Blossom Island -784, -229) if you reach Level 2 identity and then choose Leaving the Island. <br>When you graduate, your Peach Blossom Island Internal Skill, skills and reputation will stay the same, but your Miscellaneous Skills will be removed, your Eight-Diagram Array of the Nine Palaces will keep one level, and you won't be able to rejoin the faction for 24 hours.
thd_quitinfo_ps_title=For disciples who enter Peach Blossom Island for the first time and betray the Island, as well as disciples who are kicked out of Peach Blossom Island due to high Discipline Value, their Inner skills and other skills, reputation and Miscellaneous Skills will be removed. They cannot rejoin the faction for 24 hours.
desc_shengwang_thd_001_0=Peach Blossom Island specific item. You can gain 100 Peach Blossom Island Reputation Points.
desc_shengwang_thd_002_0=Peach Blossom Island specific item. You can gain 1000 Peach Blossom Island Reputation Points.
desc_shengwang_thd_003_0=Peach Blossom Island specific item. You can gain 50 Peach Blossom Island Reputation Points.
desc_item_thdlp_01_0=Specific staff of a Peach Blossom Island disciple. After a certain number is collected, you can use them to exchange for rare items.
desc_item_thdlp_02_0=A sign of high Peach Blossom Island disciple status. After a certain number is collected, you can use them to exchange for rare items.
desc_item_thd_thz_0=It has the Peach Blossom Array's eight door eight color arrangement square diagram of the Peach Blossom Island. It originated from the Peach Blossom Island. It may appear useless, but can be extremely effective with the Peach Blossom Array. (The Peach Blossom Array changes once every 10 minutes. It can only be refreshed by opening the square matrix diagram of This item)
desc_taskitem_thd_009_0=A common wooden food container of the Peach Blossom Island.
desc_taskitem_thd_010_0=Honey collected by the bees of the Peach Blossom Island, suitable to be used with Medicine.
desc_ng_th_001=Tide Code: master's inner cultivation martial arts from Plum Blossom Island.
desc_item_wgm_xld_0=The token seized during training at the Dojo of Shura can be used to exchange for trial rewards with Zhang Qingfeng of the Rootless Clan (42,334). <font color="#ff0000">After the Dojo of Shura has officially started between 19:45 to 20:30, all of your Dojo of Shura tokens will be lost if you arbitrarily leaving the Shura field. </font>
title_wgm_054=<font color="#FF0000">Warning: If you back out of the Shura Taoism during the trial (7:45 PM-20:30), all of your tokens will be deducted. Are you sure you want to back out. </font>
desc_item_thd1_01_0=Peach Blossom Island specific mask that can only be worn by the Peach Blossom Island disciples. You can receive a certain Skill of the Sound of the Blue Waves or increase the power of the Snapping Fingers Skill, and increase the damage points from 20 to 21. <br>(You can only keep one mask effect but can exist simultaneously with the face veil. The mask cool-down time is 1 hour)
desc_item_thd1_02_0=Peach Blossom Island specific mask that can only be worn by the Peach Blossom Island disciples. You can receive a certain Skill of the Sound of the Blue Waves or increase the power of the Snapping Fingers Skill, and increase the damage points by 5%. <br>(You can only keep one mask effect but can exist simultaneously with the face veil. The mask cool-down time is 1 hour)
desc_item_thd1_03_0=Peach Blossom Island specific mask that can only be worn by the Peach Blossom Island disciples. You can receive a certain Skill of the Sound of the Blue Waves or increase the power of the Snapping Fingers Skill, and increase the damage points by 10%. <br>(You can only keep one mask effect but can exist simultaneously with the face veil. The mask cool-down time is 1 hour)
desc_item_basicmask_01_0=Ta Yin Mask: The main materials required by the Peach Blossom Island disciples to make Jianghu masks (benevolent, gloom, leisure).
desc_item_basicmask_02_0=Ta Yin Mask: The main materials required by the Peach Blossom Island disciples to make Jianghu masks (night owl).
desc_item_thd_dan_0=A very odd looking pill. The herbal shop owner named it Clear Water Pill, which works miracles when saving a drowning person. It is said that small boats often overturn near Peach Blossom Island. Perhaps the young hero can visit to see if anyone needs help (-480,186). If you do not know how to reach the Peach Blossom Island, find Yao Cheng in Suzhou (795,750) to ask for directions. <font color="#ff0000">You can access the random encounter quests with this pill without having to meet other conditions. The pill is a required item for the quest and will disappear after use. You can search for the conditions of the random encounter entry quest at Changsun Ziyu's place in Chengdu (680,717). Players are advised to undertake the entry level quests and use the pill in the quest.</font>
desc_item_thd_pu_0=A musical score, holding secrets from the past. According to legend, it was created by one of the ten best musicians in Jianghu. The old fisherman of Peach Blossom Island (-405,284) should know the history of this music score. If you do not know how to reach the Peach Blossom Island, find Yao Cheng in Suzhou (795,750) to ask for directions. <font color="#ff0000">You can access the random encounter quests with this music score without having to meet other conditions. The music score will disappear after the first step of the quest is complete. You can search for the conditions of the random encounter entry quest at Changsun Ziyu's place in Chengdu (680,717). Players are advised to undertake the entry level quests.</font>
desc_item_thd_rmfz_xinwu_1_0=This token is the keepsake of Huang Lingshu, the daughter of the Peach Blossom Island Leader. Take this token to Huang Lingshu's place (-485,-253) at the Peach Blossom Island as ask her why she is looking for you. It is said that whoever obtained this token has a greater chance of joining the Peach Blossom Island. However, the entry conditions are extremely harsh. If you do not know how to reach the Peach Blossom Island, find Yao Cheng in Suzhou (795,750) to ask for directions. <font color="#ff0000">You can access the random encounter quests with this token without having to meet other conditions. The token will disappear after the first step of the quest is complete. You can search for the conditions of the random encounter entry quest at Changsun Ziyu's place in Chengdu (680,717). It is recommended to do this quest first.</font>
desc_item_thd_shlp_0=A peach wood token. Having it means you are qualified to join the Peach Blossom Island.
desc_item_thd_xinwu_1_0=A sparkling and clear piece of jade engraved with ancient lines. It is a symbol of approval from the person who gave it to you.
desc_item_thd_xinwu_2_0=A sparkling and clear piece of jade engraved with ancient lines. It is a symbol of approval from the person who gave it to you.
desc_item_thd_xinwu_3_0=A sparkling and clear piece of jade engraved with ancient lines. It is a symbol of approval from the person who gave it to you.
desc_item_thd_xinwu_4_0=A sparkling and clear piece of jade engraved with ancient lines. It is a symbol of approval from the person who gave it to you.
desc_item_thd_xinwu_5_0=A sparkling and clear piece of jade engraved with ancient lines. It is a symbol of approval from the person who gave it to you.
desc_item_thd_xinwu_6_0=A sparkling and clear piece of jade engraved with ancient lines. It is a symbol of approval from the person who gave it to you.
desc_item_thd_tf_xw_0=A scarf with special designs worn by pirates surrounding the Peach Blossom Island.
desc_item_thd_gb_xw_0=A waist pendant with special designs worn by soldiers surrounding the Peach Blossom Island.
desc_box_thd_tf_1=Peach Blossom Island gift package
desc_tool_thd_fish_01_0=By winning this rod, you can fish at the Peach Blossom Lake (Specific to the Peach Blossom Island Quest)
desc_item_thd_fish_001_0=The bow fish is not big, each weighing 2 to 4 taels. Its meat is soft and tender. It has little bones and it bitter gall is small. It tastes delicious and can be described as fresh, aromatic, and sweet. (Peach Blossom Island quest specific)
desc_item_thd_fish_002_0=Trout generally live in a relatively cool fresh water so their meat is delicious. Long-term injection can treat spleen and stomach problems as well as diarrhea symptoms. (Peach Blossom Island quest specific)
desc_item_thd_fish_003_0=Wuchang Bream has tender meat. It is beautifully delicious, fat-rich, and generally stays at still waters filled with silt sediment and lush plants. (Peach Blossom Island quest specific)
desc_item_thd_fish_004_0=Procypris rabaudi mostly lives at the bottom of the rivers with moderate flows and rocky sediments. Its meat is tender and delicious. (Peach Blossom Island quest specific)
desc_item_thd_fish_005_0=Bamboo fish has a light green body, gray dorsal. It likes to eat duckweed, vegetables, and leaves. Its meat is plump, tender, and smooth and is a good material for cooking. (Peach Blossom Island quest specific)
desc_item_thd_fish_006_0=The kingfish often makes a groaning sound. Its meat is edible and appetizing. It helps the improvement of Chi and eyesight and even has spiritual calming effects. (Peach Blossom Island quest specific)
desc_item_thd_fish_007_0=The small yellow croaker has a brown dorsal, golden belly. It has abundant tender meat and the meat is garlic shaped, has few bones, and tastes delicious. (Peach Blossom Island quest specific)
desc_item_thd_fish_008_0=Snakehead fish has a black and white alternating snakeskin pattern. Its meat is coarse, but has anti-inflammatory effects when eaten. (Peach Blossom Island quest specific)
desc_item_thd_fish_009_0=The perch has delicious meat. Ancients poets used to praising the beauty of this taste with "People that pass though the river love the exquisite taste of the perch." (Peach Blossom Island quest specific)
desc_item_thd_fish_010_0=The dace fish has a slender long body. Its fins are soft and its body grows rapidly. It loves to eat aquatic plants and insects. (Peach Blossom Island quest specific)
desc_reduce_schoolrule_10_0=Peach Blossom Island repentance letter. If players have violated the rules of their faction, they can repent, but must not make the same mistakes again. <br>Right-click to read. Can reduce the Discipline Value by 10 points)
desc_item_thd_xinjian_0=An urgent letter to Zhou Ertong of Shark Islet of Peach Blossom Island.
desc_taskitem_thd_rm_sh_me_0=Peach Blossom Island entry qualification certificate. Those with this token is qualified to join the Peach Blossom Island.
desc_item_thd_train_0=Peach Blossom Island dexterity trial certificate. It can be used to accept trial quests.
desc_box_thd_pkz01_0=Click to receive 1 Air Cutter Cultivation Certificate. <br><font color="#FFFF00">(Can only be used by the Peach Blossom Island disciples)</font>
desc_box_thd_pkz02_0=Click to receive 2 Air Cutter Cultivation Certificates. <br><font color="#FFFF00">(Can only be used by the Peach Blossom Island disciples)</font>
