desc_box_thd_pkz10_0=Click to receive 10 Air Cutter Cultivation Certificates. <br><font color="#FFFF00">(Can only be used by the Peach Blossom Island disciples)</font>
desc_box_thd_pkz11_1=Open to receive 600 Points of Peach Blossom Island Prestige, 10 Peach Blossom Tokens, 4 Island Proprietor's Tokens and 20 Talent Points.
desc_box_thd_pkz12_1=Open to receive 400 Points of Peach Blossom Island Prestige, 8 Peach Blossom Tokens, 3 Island Proprietor's Tokens and 20 Talent Points.
desc_box_thd_pkz13_1=Open to receive 200 Points of Peach Blossom Island Prestige, 5 Peach Blossom Tokens, 2 Island Proprietor's Tokens and 20 Talent Points.
desc_box_thd_taolin01=Open to receive 100 Peach Blossom Island Prestige points, 2 Peach Blossom Tokens and 10 Talent points.
desc_box_thd_taolin01_1=<font color="#FFFF00">Reward for your success in the Peach Tree Forest Challenge</font>
