desc_job_286_001=The Peach Blossom Island is a famous faction and your responsibility to guard the critical areas of the island is of significant importance.
desc_job_286_002=The Kung Fu skills of Peach Blossom Island are of infinite power. If you keep cultivating your skills, you will absolutely become a great hero.
desc_job_286_003=Daily cleaning and cooking are also a part of your cultivation in the Peach Blossom Island.
