desc_sd_286=This faction is located on an island in Tai Lake, a lake southwest to Gusu. The island is planted with much scenic peach trees which are so arranged that they form a Miraculous Shield Armor. Outsiders who trespass into the peach tree forest will get lost and may be trapped in it.
desc_offdaily_28601=The Peach Blossom Island is quite scenic, and  life on the island is befittingly idyllic. The disciples may occasionally play by the lake or ride the fish in the lake.
desc_offdaily_28603=The peach blossoms of the island is not only beautiful but also edible. People of the island use the peach blossoms to make a good wine. The Peach Blossom Wine. But few outsiders have ever had a taste of it.
