desc_box_xshd_gpcj01_1=<font color="#FFB428">A mysterious bladesman collected this precious martial arts scroll fragment pack.  Open it, you will have a chance to gain an Ancient Manual Tai Chi Fist Scroll Fragment, an Ancient Manual Dog Staff Scroll Fragment or an Ancient Manual Dragon Claw Scroll Fragment.  (Players can exchange 4 Bladesman Tokens for it at Suzhou Mortuary.)</font>
