bhzc_xhq_006_1_menu=This should be the Direction Position which the elder mentioned.
bhzc_xhq_006_1_title=Means the direction of houses and graves. Before building a house, you should figure out which direction the house should have according to the terrain. Commonly, face to water and back to mountain, locate at north and face to south are auspicious, but it also depends.
task_Guild_tasknpc_001=Guild members can claim guild quests from me to help Guild Destiny increase (Jianghu VIP is required to perform guild quests. Enough Power Level is required to claim guild quest according to the current Age of Wushu Record: Tier 1 Requirement is Realized Potential, Tier 2 Requirement is High Proficiency, Tier 3 Requirement is Mentally Balanced, Tier 4 Requirement is Peak of Power, Tier 5 Requirement is Divine Talent, and Tier 6 Requirement is Transcendent).
desc_taskitem_yl183_0=Permit to join Ming Cult
desc_taskitem_event_009_0=A shard of a brocade from ancient times. It was stolen by an unknown thief. The elders asked all disciples to retrieve it. This must be important. (Give this item to the Warehouse Elder (-37, 115), and he will give you a reward.)
desc_event_mingjiao001_0=This signal was specially made for each Sect to search for hidden traitors. When it is used close to a spy, the spy will reveal his original identity.
desc1_bow_leader_mj_001=<font color="#FFB90F">Ming Cult Ultimate Weapon</font><br>Chang Yuchun fought against the Mongolian army. He specially searched for the Nanshan mount Millennium Dragon Subduing wood supplemented with giant flood dragon's tendons, and sent it to his sworn friend Han Yuanshu. The bow weighs more than ten kilograms and is more than two meters long. It cannot be drawn without great strength. It has been passed down by the Ming Cult leaders.
wx_menu_240=I want to change "<font color="#ffff00">Nine Yang Ultimate Skill</font>".
wx_title_240=Click the following options. You can change the learned "<font color="#ffff00">Nine Yang Ultimate Skill</font>" to preferred attributes.
wx_menu_691=I want to change "<font color="#ffff00">Nine Yang Ultimate Skill</font>" to be <font color="#ffff00">Yin </font>(requires 4 "Mystical Ice and Flame Wine").
wx_menu_692=I want to change "<font color="#ffff00">Nine Yang Ultimate Skill</font>" to be <font color="#ffff00">Yang </font>(requires 4 "Mystical Ice and Flame Wine").
wx_menu_693=I want to change "<font color="#ffff00">Nine Yang Ultimate Skill</font>" to be <font color="#ffff00">Tai-Chi </font>(requires 4 "Mystical Ice and Flame Wine").
wx_menu_694=I want to change "<font color="#ffff00">Nine Yang Ultimate Skill</font>" to be <font color="#ffff00">Hard </font>(requires 4 "Mystical Ice and Flame Wine").
wx_menu_695=I want to change "<font color="#ffff00">Nine Yang Ultimate Skill</font>" to be <font color="#ffff00">Soft </font>(requires 4 "Mystical Ice and Flame Wine").
desc_box_zhenpai_clone_mj_0=Time reverses. Heaven and earth come together. Ming Cult disciples often take this item with them.<br><font color="#FFFF00">Right click to open it.</font>
desc_item_clone_box_mj_1=A seemingly plain-looking box. It actually holds a hidden treasure inside.
desc_item_clone_box_mj=<font color="#3299CC">Right-click to open.</font>
desc_itembox_drop_clone021_1=A heavy treasure chest. There might be treasure hidden inside.
desc_itembox_drop_clone021=<font color="#3299CC">Right-click to open.</font>
desc_box_ng_04_mj01=<font color="#ff0000">Right click to open and get the item.</font>
desc_box_ng_04_mj01_1=Bag carried by Jianghu people, maybe it includes precious items.
sineijuanxian13=Submit School Honor Certificate (Ming Cult)
taolu_body49_name=Serial Spear
taolu_body49_desc=Reduce "<font color="#FFA500">Everchanging</font>" energy cost by <font color="#FFA500">7%</font>. <br>Reduce "<font color="#FFA500">Slash the Sun</font>" energy cost by <font color="#FFA500">7%</font>. <br>Reduce "<font color="#FFA500">Bright Moon</font>" energy cost by <font color="#FFA500">7%</font>. <br>Reduce "<font color="#FFA500">Reverse the Sky</font>" energy cost by <font color="#FFA500">7%</font>. <br>Reduce "<font color="#FFA500">Fell the Moon</font>" energy cost by <font color="#FFA500">7%</font>. <br>Reduce "<font color="#FFA500">Chase the Sun</font>" energy cost by <font color="#FFA500">7%</font>. <br>Reduce "<font color="#FFA500">Sun Draws the Moon</font>" energy cost by <font color="#FFA500">7%</font>. <br>Reduce "<font color="#FFA500">Sun and Moon Shine Again</font>" energy cost by <font color="#FFA500">7%</font>. <br>
taolu_body50_name=Serial Spear
taolu_body50_desc=Reduce "<font color="#FFA500">Everchanging</font>" energy cost by <font color="#FFA500">15%</font>. <br>Reduce "<font color="#FFA500">Slash the Sun</font>" energy cost by <font color="#FFA500">15%</font>. <br>Reduce "<font color="#FFA500">Bright Moon</font>" energy cost by <font color="#FFA500">15%</font>. <br>Reduce "<font color="#FFA500">Reverse the Sky</font>" energy cost by <font color="#FFA500">15%</font>. <br>Reduce "<font color="#FFA500">Fell the Moon</font>" energy cost by <font color="#FFA500">15%</font>. <br>Reduce "<font color="#FFA500">Chase the Sun</font>" energy cost by <font color="#FFA500">15%</font>. <br>Reduce "<font color="#FFA500">Sun Draws the Moon</font>" energy cost by <font color="#FFA500">15%</font>. <br>Reduce "<font color="#FFA500">Sun and Moon Shine Again</font>" energy cost by <font color="#FFA500">15%</font>. <br>
taolu_body51_name=Serial Spear
taolu_body51_desc=Reduce "<font color="#FFA500">Everchanging</font>" energy cost by <font color="#FFA500">25%</font>, non-parrying targets being hit get <font color="#FFA500">Movement Speed</font> decreased by 30%<br>Reduce "<font color="#FFA500">Slash the Sun</font>" energy cost by <font color="#FFA500">25%</font>. <br>Reduce "<font color="#FFA500">Bright Moon</font>" energy cost by <font color="#FFA500">25%</font>. <br>Reduce "<font color="#FFA500">Reverse the Sky</font>" energy cost by <font color="#FFA500">25%</font>. <br>Reduce "<font color="#FFA500">Fell the Moon</font>" energy cost by <font color="#FFA500">25%</font>. <br>Reduce "<font color="#FFA500">Chase the Sun</font>" energy cost by <font color="#FFA500">25%</font>. <br>Reduce "<font color="#FFA500">Sun Draws the Moon</font>" energy cost by <font color="#FFA500">25%</font>. <br>Reduce "<font color="#FFA500">Sun and Moon Shine Again</font>" energy cost by <font color="#FFA500">25%</font>, skill range increases by 2 meters. <br>
dataosha_systeminfo_special_001=There is a sudden change in the weather. A natural disaster is about to happen. Players in the Snowland shall watch out for it and be careful.
dataosha_systeminfo_special_002=You are in the area of the natural disaster. Please escape from this dangerous area as soon as possible.
dataosha_systeminfo_special_003=The natural disaster seems to disappear.
dataosha_systeminfo_special_004=The chi of treasure is booming. A rare treasure seems to appear. You can look up its location on the map, and hunt for the treasure.
dataosha_systeminfo_special_005=The rare treasure is for the fated person. Congratulations to the mysterious player, who successfully obtained the treasure.
dataosha_systeminfo_special_006=The light of treasure fainted. Too much time has passed. The trace of treasure disappears.
