sys_TaoShaEventTimeLimitType2=Rare treasure appears
ui_TaoShaEventTimeLimitType1=Click M. The map marks the meteorite falling area as a red circle. It's extremely dangerous. Please try to leave this area.
ui_TaoShaEventTimeLimitType2=Click M. The map marks the rare treasure area as a purple circle. The treasure offers abundant goods. Please fight to obtain it.
