tip_dataosha_2=Click M. The map marks the Snowland tornado area as a red circle. It's extremely dangerous. Please try to leave this area.
ui_dataosha_100=Rare treasure appears
tip_dataosha_100=Click M. The map marks the rare treasure as a treasure chest icon. The treasure offers abundant goods. Please fight to obtain it.
