task_chaoswar_testskill_npc_004=In the Cultivation Hall, you can temporarily use <font color="#ff0000">any high level Internal Skill</font> to cultivate martial arts. Please press <font color="#ff0000">K</font>, and select desired Internal Skills in <font color="#ff0000">Internal Skill page</font>.
chaoswar_testskill_npc_005=Martial Artist (Meridians)
task_chaoswar_testskill_npc_005=In the Cultivation Hall, you can temporarily activate <font color="#ff0000">any meridian</font>'s highest level (except special meridians). Please press <font color="#ff0000">K</font>, and activate desired meridians in <font color="#ff0000">meridian page</font>.
chaoswar_testskill_npc_006=Hai Tianlong (Martial Artist)
task_chaoswar_testskill_npc_006=Hey, you! Come here and let me have a look. You are quite strong. Why not exercise more? Come and learn cooking with me!
chaoswar_testskill_npc_006_talk_001=You can ask me if you have any questions.
chaoswar_testskill_npc_007=Leave the Cultivation Hall.
task_chaoswar_testskill_npc_007=Confirm to leave the Cultivation Hall?
chaoswar_testskill_npc_008=Western Region Martial Artist (Abdominal Shrinkage of Scrotum)
task_chaoswar_testskill_npc_008=Central Region's martial arts are really strange. Some are only usable by eunuchs. We Western Region people are even more strange. We invented the method of Abdominal Shrinkage of Scrotum. Who invented this?
