talk_testskill_001=Did you finish picking the martial art skills? I can help you find a few sparring Skill Sets.
talk_testskill_002=I want a few sand-bag sparring persons.
talk_testskill_003=How many sparring persons do you want?
talk_testskill_004=1 sparring person
talk_testskill_005=2 sparring persons
talk_testskill_006=3 sparring persons
talk_testskill_007=4 sparring persons
talk_testskill_008=I want a few expert sparring persons.
talk_testskill_009=In battle, you can't leave the scene.
talk_testskill_010=Stop talking. Did you finish testing? Do you want to leave or test again?
talk_testskill_011=Start sparring again.
talk_testskill_012=Finish sparring.
talk_testskill_013=Searching for sparring persons right now. Can't respond.
talk_testskill_014=Your inputs are too frequent. Please try again later.
talk_testskill_015=I want to test the martial art skills that the eunuchs use. But I don't want to get castrated.
talk_testskill_016=No problem. You strange central plain people. Stand straight. The Abdominal Shrinkage of Scrotum Method hurts a little.
talk_testskill_017=Ah! It feels weird.
talk_testskill_018=Now that you are in Abdominal Shrinkage of Scrotum state, go test out the strange martial arts skills.
talk_testskill_019=Abdominal Shrinkage of Scrotum can only be applied on males. It can't be applied on females.
menu_chaoswar_testskill_npc_006_1_1=I have a few questions. Can you help me answer them?
title_chaoswar_testskill_npc_006_1_1=What do you want to know?
menu_chaoswar_testskill_npc_006_2_1=About what can be done here.
menu_chaoswar_testskill_npc_006_2_2=About my strength.
menu_chaoswar_testskill_npc_006_2_3=About martial art skills and weapons.
menu_chaoswar_testskill_npc_006_2_4=About sparring persons.
menu_chaoswar_testskill_npc_006_2_5=About entering and leaving.
title_chaoswar_testskill_npc_006_2_2=In Cultivation Hall, most martial skills, Internal Skills, and meridians that you have seen can be directly cultivated. But it does not mean that you will be able to learn all those skills. After you leave, your strength will go back to the original state. And for your convenience, when you enter Cultivation Hall, all Internal Skills equivalent to sixth school inner, will be learned, and all normal and reverse meridians (excluding special meridians) will be available.
title_chaoswar_testskill_npc_006_2_4=When you have picked the desired Skill Set, Internal Skill, and meridian settings, you can spar with either Sand-Bag Sparring persons or Expert Sparring persons. Sand-Bag Sparring persons will not use any skills. Expert Sparring persons will use school skills.
title_chaoswar_testskill_npc_006_2_3=You need manually pick martial skill and weapon. For martial skill selection, go to the stone table next to the door. Scripts from various schools and factions are available. They can be used in the same way as in the Snowland Escape. Equip the script in character interface to learn corresponding Skill Set. Weapons are on the weapon rack and can be equipped directly.
chaoswar_testskill_npc_006_2_5_1=Thank you.
chaoswar_testskill_npc_006_2_4_1=Thank you.
chaoswar_testskill_npc_006_2_3_1=Thank you.
chaoswar_testskill_npc_006_2_2_1=Thank you.
chaoswar_testskill_npc_006_2_1_1=Thank you.
