yanwu_systeminfo_10017=Welcome to the Cultivation Hall. Here, you are assumed to have all high level Internal Skills and meridians. Please click K and activate preferred Internal Skill and meridians. Then pick preferred martial Skill Set, weapon, and pill in Temple of Guanyu.
