sys_jianghudaluandou_tips_010=GM action failed.
sys_jianghudaluandou_tips_011=Your number of times to participate has reached maximum. Can't sign up.
sys_jianghudaluandou_tips_012=The battlefield has not be activated. Can't sign up. [Please check battlefield hours.]
sys_jianghudaluandou_tips_013=The queuing period for current battlefield is over. Entering preparation period. Please get ready. The battle is about to begin.
sys_jianghudaluandou_tips_014=The battle ends. Win and loss has been concluded. Please join next time.
sys_jianghudaluandou_tips_015=It has been <font color="#FF0000">10</font> minutes after the battle began. Players will gain <font color="#FF0000">double battlefield points</font>.
sys_jianghudaluandou_tips_016=Can't sign up for the battlefield.
