sys_jianghudaluandou_tips_023=This is not a member of the same camp. Can't team up.
sys_jianghudaluandou_tips_024=Failed to teleport to the cross-server battlefield. Please sign up again.
sys_jianghudaluandou_tips_025=The team leader {@0:name} invites you to join the battlefield. The leader has already entered. Do you want to join? If you reject, you will miss this round.
sys_jianghudaluandou_tips_026=You have successfully invited team members to head to the battlefield.
sys_jianghudaluandou_tips_027=A red light shoots into the sky. Congratulations to {@0:side} for successfully obtaining <font color="#C643FF">{@1:name}</font> and scoring <font color="#FF0000">{@2:num}</font> camp points.
sys_jianghudaluandou_tips_028=Congratulations for scoring {@0:num} individual points.
sys_jianghudaluandou_tips_030=Mysterious expert guards are protecting the enemy camp. It's hard to get close.
sys_jianghudaluandou_tips_031=The battle is about to begin. Please get ready and head to the center of the map to obtain sword forging stoves.
sys_jianghudaluandou_tips_032=
sys_jianghudaluandou_tips_033=The battle has begun. There are sword forging stoves around the blood demon statue in the center of map. Start to obtain them after you have at least 3 more people from your camp, compared to the opposite camp. Successfully obtaining the sword forging stoves will gain points.
sys_jianghudaluandou_tips_034=The battle ends. Please try again next time.
