ui_time_jianghudaluandou_ready=During waiting period, one can not leave the spawning area. During waiting period, after there is a minimum number of players to begin the battle, they will directly enter the preparation period. During waiting period, if there are not enough people to initiate the battle, the preparation period will start after the waiting period is over.
ui_time_jianghudaluandou_tensecond=When the preparation period is over, players enter battle period.
ui_time_jianghudaluandou_over=After finishing period is over, players will be teleported away from the battlefield.
ui_time_jianghudaluandou_ready,ui_time_jianghudaluandou_ready=During waiting period, one <font color="#FF0000">can not leave </font>the spawning area. During waiting period, after there is a minimum number of players to begin the battle, they will directly enter the preparation period. During waiting period, if there are not enough people to initiate the battle, the preparation period will start after the waiting period is over.
ui_time_jianghudaluandou_tensecond,ui_time_jianghudaluandou_tensecond=When the preparation period is over, players enter battle period.
