luandou_rule000_title=<s><s>Only a person that is brave enough to dash ahead is a real hero.
luandou_rule001_title=<s><s>Only a person that is brave enough to dash ahead is a real hero.
luandou_rule002_title=<s><s>Among the people that compete with their sword martial arts, only I am the best.
luandou_rule003_title=<s><s>As soon as one hit lands, leave immediately. This week, there will be a mysterious expert in the arena to gift school rework to players.
luandou_rule004_title=<s><s>In the school martial art competition, many heroes are known to the world. This week, there will be a mysterious expert in the arena to gift school rework to players.
luandou_rule005_title=<s><s>Uniting together offers strength.
luandou_rule006_title=<s><s>Death is not scary. Death without value is scary.
luandou_rule007_title=<s><s>Being alone makes me stronger.
luandou_rule008_title=<s><s>Bloody rain and wind. It's time for battle.
luandou_rule009_title=<s><s>Brothers work together. Their strength can break a metal piece.
luandou_rule010_title=<s><s>The dream brings back the memory of the past and lets the previous fate continue.
luandou_rule011_title=<s><s>What's so joyful about being alive? What's so scary about being dead?
luandou_rule013_title=<s><s>The blade and sword come out of the sheathe. The spear dashes out like a dragon.
luandou_rule014_title=<s><s>This week, there will be a mysterious expert in the arena to gift school rework to players.
luandou_rule016_title=<s><s>Plan well ahead, lure enemies to trap, and then catch them.
factor_buff_001=Exasperated: Obtain a large amount of rage points every 20 seconds. Increase Critical Hit Rate and Critical Hit Damage.
factor_buff_002=Swift as Wind: Reduce flying points consumption by 70%. Increase Accuracy and decrease Evasion.
factor_buff_003=Fierce As Fire: Increase Moving Speed. Increase Damage by 5% every time a Flying Skill is used, and this can be stacked for at maximum 20 times.
factor_buff_004=Slow as Forest: Every friendly player within a 10 meter radius can make you recover 0.3% HP, every 3 seconds.
factor_buff_005=Still As Mountain: Chance to get red armor after being attacked, and will get a certain amount of rage points at the same time.
factor_buff_006=Tooth for a Tooth: Reflect 50% incoming damage.
factor_buff_007=Sacrifice to be Spellbound: Absorb 20% incoming damage, and return the damage to enemies at your death. At the same time, increase your own damage.
factor_buff_008=Fight Separately: Every friendly player within a 10 meter radius can decrease damage you take by 6%, to a maximum of 60%.
factor_buff_009=Sneak to Enemy Rear: Every enemy player within a 10 meter radius can make you increase 5% in Damage Reduction and 10% in your own damage, up to a maximum of 10 stacks.
factor_buff_010=As Shield: Each successful parry will heal your HP, energy, and rage points.
factor_buff_011=View death as final destination: Can't parry. Rage consumption and cooldown of disguise are both decreased.
factor_buff_012=Light like a Swallow: Increase the speed and distance of goose and flying across the cloud. Flying points consumption is reduced by 30%.
factor_buff_014=Return to Battle: When a player has HP below 10% for the first time, incoming damage is reduced by 99%. It lasts 10 seconds.
factor_buff_015=Avenger: If there is any friendly player within 10 meter radius that is severely injured, then you will gain rage and increase your own damage.
factor_buff_016=Madness: Obtain extra rage points when you are taking damage. cooldown of disguise is decreased.
factor_buff_017=A Crucial Moment: The lower the HP, the less the cooldown and rage consumption of disguise.
factor_buff_018=Rampage: The lower the HP, the higher the damage. At the same time, you will Absorb HP from the enemies.
factor_buff_019=Defense Master: Gain yellow armor when parrying. If parry is broken, you will take 50% extra damage.
factor_buff_020=Drink Blood: You will use Drink Blood skill, and in a short time strengthen yourself.
factor_buff_021=Draw a Circle as Prison: You will draw a circle on the ground, and anyone who tries to escape will be stunned.
factor_buff_022=Get More and More Brave: The more players you hit with your skills, the more damage you will cause on the next skill.
factor_buff_023=Swimming Dragon and Playing Phoenix: Every time being attacked will decrease your rage consumption and cooldown of disguise. When disguise costs no rage points, you will gain red armor.
factor_buff_024=Silent Tribute: If you die, the nearby players will be silenced for 5 seconds, during which time their damage will be decreased by 50%.
factor_buff_025=Hatred: If you hit non-parrying enemies, there will be an increase in your own damage. If you are attacked non-parrying, there will be a decrease in your own damage.
factor_buff_026=Hidden Blade: In a short time, if you are continuously attacked for many times, then there is a chance to remove your debuffs and gain red armor.
factor_buff_027=Heavy Body: Affected by gravity, you can't use Flying Skills.
factor_buff_028=Rescue: You can dash to designated area, to knock up enemies and rescue allies.
factor_buff_029=Time Flies: If you learned this skill, there is a high chance to decrease the cooldown time between different Skill Sets.
factor_addskill_001=Barehanded: Can use barehand martial skills.
factor_addskill_002=Flying in Sky and Hidden in Ground: Can use hidden weapon martial skills.
factor_addskill_003=Sword Skill Competition: Can use sword martial skills.
factor_addskill_004=Qimen Dance: Can use qimen martial skills.
factor_addskill_005=School Battle: Can use school martial skills.
factor_addskill_006=Blade Mountain and Fire Sea: Can use blade martial skills.
