factor_addskill_011=Taichi Endless: Taichi Sword and Taichi Fist are allowed.
factor_addskill_012=Royal Guard in the Night: Can use blade, barehand, and hidden weapon martial skills.
factor_addskill_013=Peerless Heaven Sword: Can use sword, blade, and staff martial skills.
