title_rank_choswar_guildscroe_001=Group Martial Arts Competition Guild Ranking Reward
content_rank_choswar_guildscroe_001=<s><s>The leader of the 1st rank guild will be rewarded with a special mount. For guild members whose guild activity points and individual points are both above 60, they will be rewarded with a special outfit.
title_rank_choswar_playerscroe_001=Group Martial Arts Competition Individual Ranking Reward
content_rank_choswar_playerscroe_001=<s><s>Top 3 players will be rewarded with a special title.
ui_rank_5_guild_choswar_guildscroe=Group Martial Arts Competition Guild Points Rank
ui_rank_5_guild_choswar_playerscroe=Group Martial Arts Competition Individual Points Rank
rank_5_guild_choswar_guildscroe_desc=On the first day of every month, the points will be cleared.
rank_5_guild_choswar_playerscroe_desc=Every week, rewards will be sent at 23:50 on Sunday. Every month, points will be cleared on the first day.
rank_5_guild_choswar_guildscroe_publish_time=Every night at 23:50, the rank will be refreshed.
rank_5_guild_choswar_playerscroe_publish_time=Every week at 23:50 on Sunday, the rank will be refreshed.
ui_rank_5_guild_choswar_guildscroe_prize=<s><s>The leader of the top scoring guild in Group Martial Art Competition can obtain the Gold Umbraculum mount. Their guild members, whose guild activity points and battlefield points are both above 60, can get special outfits.
ui_rank_5_guild_choswar_playerscroe_prize=<s><s>Top rank player will get the title <font color="#FFCC00">Jianghu Authority</font>. 2nd rank player will get the title <font color="#FFCC00">Peerless Among Mortals</font>. 3rd rank player will get the title <font color="#FFCC00">Dexterous Disciple</font>.
ui_war_scuffle_desc_001=<s><s>In Group Martial Arts Competition, people from all over the world fight together. <br><s><s>Group Martial Arts Competition is open to <font color="#FF0000">all servers</font>. Players from all servers will battle in the same server. <br><s><s>Every week in Group Martial Arts Competition, there will be unique and special <font color="#FF0000">competition rules</font>. <br><s><s>Participating players need to go to the page of <font color="#FF0000">Battle Strength</font> to set their Skill Sets, Internal Skill, meridians, and gears.
ui_war_scuffle_desc_003=Rules: <br>1. Must choose 3 Skill Sets. <br>2. Can freely change Skill Sets before entering the battlefield. <br>3. Before change to a new Skill Set, must delete an already picked Skill Set. <br>4. Available Skill Sets include fixed <font color="#E8C092">Normal Skills</font>, a daily random group of <font color="#D1982B">Daily Skills</font>, and a weekly available group of <font color="#FF8800">Weekly Skills</font>. <br>5. Can choose at most one of <font color="#D1982B">Daily Skills</font>, and at most one of <font color="#FF8800">Weekly Skills</font>.
ui_war_scuffle_desc_004=Individual player, who wants to sign up, must have joined a guild, must not be in any other event, and must not be in battle.
ui_war_scuffle_desc_005=Group of players can sign up through their team leader. There can be at most 6 people in the team.
ui_war_scuffle_desc_006=Battlefield Win-Loss Reward
ui_war_scuffle_desc_007=Battlefield Win-Loss Reward: The winner will get <font color="#FFCC00">Success Reward</font>, the loser will get <font color="#FFCC00">Failure Reward</font>. <br>Reward content: includes Group Martial Art Competition Tokens, Treasures, Five Aggregate Gift Packs, Costume Gif Packs, etc. Group Martial Art Competition Tokens can be used to trade for cultivation, Cultivation Injection, chi, martial art gift pack, etc.
ui_war_scuffle_desc_008=Weekly Achievement Reward
ui_war_scuffle_desc_009=Weekly Achievement Reward: Players who completed the <font color="#FFCC00">Weekly Goals</font> can get 1 reward gift pack per goal completed. <br>Reward content: Include large amount of Group Martial Art Competition Tokens. Group Martial Art Competition Tokens can be used to trade for cultivation, Cultivation Injection, chi, martial art gift pack, etc.
ui_war_scuffle_desc_010=Guild Ranking Reward
ui_war_scuffle_desc_012=Personal Ranking Reward
