desc_box_chaoswar_zhandou_win_1=Congratulations to the winner of Group Martial Arts Competition. <br><font color=""#FFFF00"">Package content: 25 Group Martial Arts Competition Tokens. A chance to get Treasure Gift Pack, Five Aggregate Gift Pack, Costume Gift Pack, etc. </font><br><font color=""#FFB428"">Ways to obtain the package: Success in Group Martial Arts Competition. </font>
desc_box_chaoswar_zhandou_lose_1=Best wishes for future battles. <br><font color=""#FFFF00"">Package content: 15 Group Martial Arts Competition Tokens. </font><br><font color=""#FFB428"">Ways to obtain the package: Loss in Group Martial Arts Competition. </font>
desc_box_chaoswar_week_01_1=The player has achieved the weekly goal in Group Martial Arts Competition. <br><font color=""#FFFF00"">Package content: 120 Group Martial Arts Competition Tokens. </font><br><font color=""#FFFF00"">Ways to obtain the package: Achieve the weekly goal in Group Martial Arts Competition. </font>
desc_box_chaoswar_week_02_1=The player has achieved the weekly goal in Group Martial Arts Competition. <br><font color=""#FFFF00"">Package content: 40,000 Cultivation points, 40,000 Cultivation Injection, 40,000 chi pills, 1 to 4 Guild Ancient Coins, 2 Five Aggregate Items, and a chance to get Treasure Gift Pack, workbench, gold power, jade powder. </font><br><font color=""#FFFF00"">Guild Ancient Coin: Can be used to exchange for martial art gift pack. Martial art gift packs include Skill Book Pages and corresponding cultivation pills. Currently, the Skill Sets include Drunken Fist, South Ocean Fist, and Disfiguring Kick. </font><br><font color=""#FFB428"">Ways to obtain the package: Achieve the weekly goal in Group Martial Arts Competition. </font>
desc_box_chaoswar_week_03_1=The player has achieved the weekly goal in Group Martial Arts Competition. <br><font color=""#FFFF00"">Package content: 40,000 Cultivation points, 40,000 Cultivation Injection, 40,000 chi pills, 1 to 4 Guild Ancient Coins, 2 Five Aggregate Items, and a chance to get Treasure Gift Pack, workbench, gold power, jade powder. </font><br><font color=""#FFFF00"">Guild Ancient Coin: Can be used to exchange for martial art gift pack. Martial art gift packs include Skill Book Pages and corresponding cultivation pills. Currently, the Skill Sets include Drunken Fist, South Ocean Fist, and Disfiguring Kick. </font><br><font color=""#FFB428"">Ways to obtain the package: Achieve the weekly goal in Group Martial Arts Competition. </font>
desc_box_chaoswar_week_04_1=The player has achieved the weekly goal in Group Martial Arts Competition. <br><font color=""#FFFF00"">Package content: 40,000 Cultivation points, 40,000 Cultivation Injection, 40,000 chi pills, 1 to 4 Guild Ancient Coins, 2 Five Aggregate Items, and a chance to get Treasure Gift Pack, workbench, gold power, jade powder. </font><br><font color=""#FFFF00"">Guild Ancient Coin: Can be used to exchange for martial art gift pack. Martial art gift packs include Skill Book Pages and corresponding cultivation pills. Currently, the Skill Sets include Drunken Fist, South Ocean Fist, and Disfiguring Kick. </font><br><font color=""#FFB428"">Ways to obtain the package: Achieve the weekly goal in Group Martial Arts Competition. </font>
desc_box_chaoswar_week_05_1=The player has achieved the weekly goal in Group Martial Arts Competition. <br><font color=""#FFFF00"">Package content: 40,000 Cultivation points, 40,000 Cultivation Injection, 40,000 chi pills, 1 to 4 Guild Ancient Coins, 2 Five Aggregate Items, and a chance to get Treasure Gift Pack, workbench, gold power, jade powder. </font><br><font color=""#FFFF00"">Guild Ancient Coin: Can be used to exchange for martial art gift pack. Martial art gift packs include Skill Book Pages and corresponding cultivation pills. Currently, the Skill Sets include Drunken Fist, South Ocean Fist, and Disfiguring Kick. </font><br><font color=""#FFB428"">Ways to obtain the package: Achieve the weekly goal in Group Martial Arts Competition. </font>
