desc_item_chaoswar_kuafu_gold_0=With the Guild Ancient Coins obtained from Group Martial Arts Competition, one can exchange martial art skills, relevant cultivation pills, etc. <br><font color=""#FFFF00"">How to use the items: Trade for guild resources at guild administration NPC in the major cities, or trade for Boxes of Group Martial Art Competition Tokens at Chengdu (724, 697). </font><br><font color=""#FFFF00"">Guild resources: Currently can be traded for Drunken Fist, South Ocean Fist, and Disfiguring Kick Martial Gift Packs. Inside each gift pack, there are Skill Book Pages and relevant cultivation pills. </font><br><font color=""#FFB428"">How to obtain the items: Complete weekly goals of Group Martial Art Competition. </font>
