ui_choswar_interface_005=It has not been set.
ui_choswar_interface_006=Selected: <br><font color="#E8C092">{@0:name1}</font><s><font color="#00FF00">{@1:shuxin1}</font><s><font color="#FFB428">{@2:pianxiang1}</font><br><font color="#E8C092">{@3:name2}</font><s><font color="#00FF00">{@4:shuxin2}</font><s><font color="#FFB428">{@5:pianxiang2}</font><br> Current choice: <br><font color="#E8C092">{@6:name3}</font><s><font color="#00FF00">{@7:shuxin3}</font><s><font color="#FFB428">{@8:pianxiang3}</font><br><s><s>Recommend to select Skill Sets of the same attribute (Yin/Soft, Yang/Hard, Taichi) and same damage type.<br><s><s> You can select at most one set from <font color="#D1982B">Today's Skill Sets</font> and at most one set from <font color="#FF8800">This Wee's Skill Sets</font>.
ui_choswar_interface_007=Selected: <br><s><s><font color="#E8C092">{@0:name1}</font><s><s><font color="#FFB428">{@1:pianxiang1}</font><br><s><s><font color="#E8C092">{@2:name2}</font><s><s><font color="#FFB428">{@3:pianxiang2}</font><br><s><s><font color="#E8C092">{@4:name3}</font><s><s><font color="#FFB428">{@5:pianxiang3}</font><br><s><s>When you choose meridians, we recommend the meridians that match the damage type of your Skill Sets.
ui_choswar_interface_008=Selected: <br><s><s><font color="#E8C092">{@0:name1}</font><s><s><font color="#00FF00">{@1:pianxiang1}</font><br><s><s><font color="#E8C092">{@2:name2}</font><s><s><font color="#00FF00">{@3:pianxiang2}</font><br><s><s><font color="#E8C092">{@4:name3}</font><s><s><font color="#00FF00">{@5:pianxiang3}</font><br><s><s>When you choose an Internal Skill, we recommend one with matching attribute (Yin/Soft, Yang/Hard, Taichi) to your Skill Sets. At the same time, please check whether an Internal Skill's main attribute (brawn/breath/dexterity) and your Skill Set's main supporting attribute.
ui_choswar_interface_009=It has not been set.
