ui_chat_channel_43=Group Martial Arts Competition
box_chaoswar_guanzhu_01=Martial Art Cultivation Gift Pack (Group Martial Arts Competition)
desc_box_chaoswar_guanzhu_01_1=Cultivation gift pack, exchanged with Guild Ancient Coins (Group Martial Arts Competition). Open to get 300,000 Cultivation Injection pills. The pills can be used for Drunken Fist, Disfiguring Kick, and South Ocean Fist.
desc_box_chaoswar_guanzhu_01=Right click to open the gift pack.
sys_jianghudaluandou_tips_045=<font color="#C643FF">{@0:name}</font>'s red light is fading. It is ready for the next round of competition in 10 seconds. Please be prepared.
sys_jianghudaluandou_tips_046=The cross-server battlefield is not activated. You can not sign up.
tips_factor_buff_001=Players will gain 50 points of rage every 20 seconds. At the same time, players' Critical Rate increases by 6% and Critical Damage increases by 40%.
tips_factor_buff_002=Players' flying points consumption decreases by 70%. At the same time, players' Accuracy increases and Evasion decreases.
tips_factor_buff_003=Players' movement speed increases by 30%. At the same time, every time players use Flying Skill, they will gain 2 stacks of 2.5% damage increase, which can go at most 20 stacks and last 30 seconds. Every time players use a skill, the buff will be consumed by 5 stacks.
tips_factor_buff_004=Every friendly player within a 10 meter radius can make you recover 0.3% HP, every 3 seconds. The effect can go at most 10 stacks.
tips_factor_buff_005=5% chance to get red armor for 10 seconds after being attacked, and will get 10 extra rage points at the same time. The effect can be triggered once at most every 1 minute.
tips_factor_buff_006=Reflect 50% of incoming damage to the one who caused the damage.
tips_factor_buff_007=Absorb 20% of incoming damage, and return the absorbed damage to enemies at your death. The exploding damage equals to the absorbed damage, and the exploding damage will not be distributed among a few targets. If the player has Golden Buddha Light effect when attacked, the explosion will happen earlier.
tips_factor_buff_008=Every friendly player within a 10 meter radius will decrease damage that you take by 6%, up to 10 stacks.
tips_factor_buff_009=Every enemy player within a 10 meter radius can make you increase 5% in Damage Reduction and 10% in your own damage, up to a maximum of 10 stacks.
tips_factor_buff_010=Each successful parry will heal your 500 points of HP, 40 points of energy, and 2 rage points.
tips_factor_buff_011=Players can't parry. Rage consumption of disguise will decrease by 20 points. cooldown of disguise will decrease by 2 seconds. And your maximum HP will increase by 9000.
tips_factor_buff_012=Increase the speed and distance of goose and flying across the cloud. Flying points consumption is reduced by 30%. When your HP is below 30%, debuffs will be removed if you are attacked, which will be triggered at most once every 1 minute.
tips_factor_buff_014=When a player has HP below 10% for the first time, incoming damage is reduced by 99%. It lasts 10 seconds. This effect will not be triggered again before the player revives.
tips_factor_buff_015=If there is any friendly player within 10 meter radius that died, then you will increase 10% in your damage and an extra 10 rage points. This effect can go at most 3 stacks.
tips_factor_buff_016=When your HP is between 80% and 100%, you don't gain extra rage points and the cooldown for disguise is 1 minute. When your HP is between 50% and 80%, you gain 1 extra rage point upon being attacked, and the cooldown for disguise is 30 seconds. When your HP is between 20% and 50%, you gain 2 extra rage points upon being attacked, and the cooldown for disguise is 10 seconds. When your HP is between 0% and 20%, you gain 5 extra rage points upon being attacked, and the cooldown for disguise is 2 seconds.
tips_factor_buff_026=If you receive 20 or more hits within 3 seconds, there is 10% chance to remove all debuffs and obtain 2 seconds of red armor. This effect can only be triggered once in a period of time.
tips_factor_buff_027=Your second and third stages of jumps will decrease in height.
tips_factor_buff_028=Rescue: You can dash to designated area, to knock up enemies and rescue allies.
tips_factor_buff_029=You will gain 10 seconds of the following effect: high chance to lower the cooldown between different Skill Sets. This effect has a cooldown 4 minutes.
tips_factor_addskill_001=Provide barehand Skill Sets in addition.
tips_factor_addskill_002=Provide hidden weapon Skill Sets in addition.
tips_factor_addskill_003=Provide single sword Skill Sets in addition.
tips_factor_addskill_004=Provide Qi-Men Skill Sets in addition.
tips_factor_addskill_005=Provide school Skill Sets in addition.
tips_factor_addskill_006=Provide single blade Skill Sets in addition.
tips_factor_addskill_011=Players can choose Taichi Fist and Taichi Sword in the Weekly Skill Sets.
tips_factor_addskill_012=Royal Guard in the Night: Can use blade, barehand, and hidden weapon martial skills.
tips_factor_addskill_013=Peerless Heaven Sword: Can use sword, blade, and staff martial skills.
tips_factor_limitskill_001=Only barehand Skill Sets are allowed.
tips_factor_limitskill_002=Only hidden weapon Skill Sets are allowed.
tips_factor_limitskill_003=Only single sword Skill Sets are allowed.
tips_factor_limitskill_004=Only Qi-Men Skill Sets are allowed.
tips_factor_limitskill_005=Only school Skill Sets are allowed.
tips_factor_limitskill_006=Only single blade Skill Sets are allowed.
tips_factor_limitskill_012=Royal Guard in the Night: Can only use blade, barehand, and hidden weapon martial skills.
tips_factor_limitskill_013=Peerless Heaven Sword: Can only use sword, blade, and staff martial skills.
tips_factor_limitskill_014=Continue the Destiny: Can only use martial arts of the old patch.
tips_factor_membernum_001=Battlefield number count is modified to 48 VS 48.
