desc_box_lzy_hyd_zc003_1=Reward of Daily Active Value reaching 500 points. Open to receive <font color="#FFFF00">2 Qi Hai Concentration Pills, 20 Five-Realm Demon-Slaying Items, 300000 Chi, and 10 Bai Xiaosheng's Weapon Manuals (superior)</font>
desc_box_lzy_hyd_zc004_1=Reward of Daily Active Value reaching 250 points. Open to receive <font color="#FFFF00">100000 Cultivation Points, and 10 Hunyuan Tendon-Relaxing Pills</font>
desc_box_lzy_hyd_zc_ew_wxsy001_1=Package which contains a page of Jianghu Martial Art skills. Open to receive a page from <font color="#FFFF00">Heartless Seven Skills</font>
desc_box_lzy_hyd_zc_ew_wxsy002_1=Package which contains a page of Jianghu Martial Art skills. Open to receive a page from <font color="#FFFF00">Heartless Seven Skills, Madness Staff, or Flying Snow Palm</font>
