desc_box_lzy_hyd_zc_ew_qz001_1=A package full of valuable items. Open it to receive <font color="#FFFF00">10 Random Artifacts.</font>
desc_box_lzy_hyd_zc_ew_cyfj001_1=A precious wood box of exquisite workmanship. Open it to receive <font color="#FFFF00">10 Pure Yang Swords.</font>
