desc_box_lzy_hyd_rc002_0=Reward of Daily Active Value reaching 50 points. Open to receive <font color="#FFFF00">1 Qi Hai Concentration Pill, and 1 Reset Ticket</font><br><font color="#00FF00">After the activation of Age of Wushu Records - Pirate Raid, you can additionally get: 4 Jade Doll Quench Tickets</font>
desc_box_lzy_hyd_rc003_0=Reward of Daily Active Value reaching 75 points. Open to receive <font color="#FFFF00">1 Leisure Points Ticket (20), and 1 Expert Points Ticket (20)</font><br>After the activation of Age of Wushu Records - Before the Duel, you can additionally get <font color="#FFFF00">7 Pure Yang Swords</font>
desc_box_lzy_hyd_zc001_0=Reward of Weekly Active Value reaching 750 points. Open to receive <font color="#FFFF00">100000 Cultivation Points, 10 Hunyuan Tendon-Relaxing Pills, and 4 Reset Tickets</font><br><font color="#00FF00">Jianghu VIP has a chance to get get extra rewards according to the Age of Wushu Records:</font><br><font color="#00FF00">After the activation of Age of Wushu Records - Pirate Raid, you can additionally get: 100000 Cultivation Points, 2 Refined Moon Internal Skill Pills, and 4 Jade Doll Quench Tickets</font><br><font color="#00FF00">After the activation of Age of Wushu Records - Plague of Luoyang, you can additionally get: 200000 Cultivation Points, 10 Hunyuan Tendon-Relaxing Pills, 2 Refined Moon Internal Skill Pills, 4 Jade Doll Quench Tickets, and 20 Pure Yang Swords</font>
desc_taskitem_4yuejuqing_002_0=A letter sent by Wulin Alliance Leader Lin Tiannan.<br><img src="gui\special\wyjq\11.png" valign="bottom" />
desc_taskitem_4yuejuqing_001_0=Medicine to Heal the Injured
desc_task_4yuejuqing_001_0=A letter sent by Wulin Alliance Leader Lin Tiannan, seems to writing something about the Foreign Wulin. Go to find Alliance Leader Lin at White Horse Temple, Luoyang and have an ask.
desc_item_wyjuqing_001_0=Outfit left by Foreign Bandits.
xtts_jqfwxjq_002=Luckily the reclusive factions decided to help us in the battle. Approach the Dharma Sect Expert to receive Damage Reduction and Healing effect.
xtts_jqfwxjq_007=You took off your disguise. Teach the leader of Xingxiu Sect a lesson.
xtts_jqfwxjq_009=However Su Bailing is afraid and ask Zhai Xingzi to come out first.
xtts_jqfwxjq_010=You've defeated Zhai Xingzi. The leader of Xingxiu sect will come out soon.
xtts_jqfwxjq_011=Su Bailing has come out, defeat him.
xtts_jqfwxjq_012=You've defeated Su Bailing. Back to report.
xtts_jqfwxjq_013=The Foreign Wulin Thief, Situ Yuchen is attacking disciples of Suyun Palace. Go to prevent him.
xtts_jqfwxjq_015=Elder Yun Yangzi is fighting against the Foreign Expert, Dugu Hua. Go to help Yun Yangzi.
xtts_jqfwxjq_017=Foreign Wulin have invaded into the Kunlun Great Hall, go to help Elder Yun Yangzi to defend them.
xtts_jqfwxjq_018=One of the Six Sages, Hei Baizi came to help you. Defend enemies with him.
xtts_jqfwxjq_021=Gongsun Yu is going to fighting with some bandits in the front. Go to help Gongsun Yu.
