dhs_jqwfjr_004=Did you know the trace about those men in black?
dhs_jqwfjr_005=They've robbed the provisions and are about to escaping now. Let me show you where they are.
dhs_jqwfjr_006=That's alright.
dhs_jqwfjr_010=(How dare the Xingxiu Sect tried to collude with Foreign Wulin, I need to teach them a lesson) I'm the envoy from Foreign Wulin, don't delay and take me to visit your leader.
dhs_jqwfjr_011=Sorry. I'm showing you the way now.
dhs_jqwfjr_012=That's OK!
desc_faculty_shilibuchong_jhhj_002_0=Enhances the efficacious medicine with martial arts skills, and is especially effective with those who currently cultivating martial arts skills. <br>After using it, it will add <font color="#FFFF00">10000 </font>cultivation points for those currently studying martial arts skills.<br>(Can only be used if you practice the following internal skills) <br><font color="#FFB428">Tier 2 or below Internal Skills</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Low Level Reclusive Internal Skill (< level 36)</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Self Recollection Skill</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Chi of Three Purities (< level 51)</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Ice Chi</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Twenty-Four Secrets of the Golden Lock (< level 36)</font>
desc_faculty_shilibuchong_jhhj_003_0=A medicinal material used for improving Martial Arts that can also increase skill cultivation.<br>After using it, it will add up to <font color="#FFFF00">10000</font> Cultivation Conversion points to your current skills being cultivated. The unused portion will be lost. <br>(Can only be used during period as designated by the internal skill you're cultivating)<br><font color="#FFB428">Internal Skill of your school at tier 3 or below</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Low Level Reclusive Internal Skill (Below level 49)</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Self Recollection Skill</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Chi of Three Purities (Below level 61)</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Ice Chi</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Twenty-Four Secrets of the Golden Lock (Below level 46)</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Pronate Chi Skill (Below level 36)</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Clear Jade Divine Skill (Below level 26)</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Blue Waves Mental Skill (Below level 26)</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Deviant Vampire (Below level 26)</font>
desc_faculty_shilibuchong_jhhj_004_0=A medicinal material used for improving Martial Arts that can also increase skill cultivation.<br>After using it, it will add up to <font color="#FFFF00">10000</font> Cultivation Conversion points to your current skills being cultivated. The unused portion will be lost. <br>(Can only be used during period as designated by the internal skill you're cultivating)<br><font color="#FFB428">Internal Skill of your school at tier 4 or below</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Low Level Reclusive Internal Skill (Below level 49), High Level Reclusive Internal Skill (Below level 49)</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Self Recollection Skill</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Chi of Three Purities (Below level 84)</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Ice Chi</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Twenty-Four Secrets of the Golden Lock (Below level 69)</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Pronate Chi Skill (Below level 59)</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Clear Jade Divine Skill (Below level 49)</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Blue Waves Mental Skill (Below level 49)</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Deviant Vampire (Below level 49)</font>
