desc_home_jy_cyb_01_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Mat<br><font color="#FFFF00">Magnificence: </font>5<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Home Size reaches level 1<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Area: </font>Unlimited<br>A common washboard. <br>You will get Cultivation Points when resting on the washboard. The effect differs according to the quality of the washboard. The cooldown is 6 hours. Players will get the buff every 12 hours. <br>When the Home durability is less than half, the effect will be decreased. <br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
