desc_home_yi_tree_01_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Chair<br><font color="#FFFF00">Magnificence: </font>200<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Home Size reaches level 3<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Area: </font>Courtyard<br>The swing swings under the setting sun, just like my flying youth.<br>You will get Cultivation Points when resting on the swing. The effect differs according to the quality of the swing. The cooldown is 6 hours. Players will get the buff every 12 hours. <br>When the Home durability is less than half, the effect will be decreased. <br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_yi_tree_02_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Chair<br><font color="#FFFF00">Magnificence: </font>200<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Home Size reaches level 3<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Area: </font>Courtyard<br>Do you ever remember where is your original intention.<br>You will get Cultivation Points when resting on the swing. The effect differs according to the quality of the swing. The cooldown is 6 hours. Players will get the buff every 12 hours. <br>When the Home durability is less than half, the effect will be decreased. <br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_yi_qqb_01_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Chair<br><font color="#FFFF00">Magnificence: </font>200<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Home Size reaches level 3<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Area: </font>Courtyard<br>The seesaw goes up and down.<br>You will get Cultivation Points when resting on the swing. The effect differs according to the quality of the swing. The cooldown is 6 hours. Players will get the buff every 12 hours. <br>When the Home durability is less than half, the effect will be decreased. <br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_jy_sg_01_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Decoration<br><font color="#FFFF00">Magnificence: </font>5<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Home Size reaches level 1<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Area: </font>Unlimited<br>A big black water tank.<br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_jy_sg_02_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Decoration<br><font color="#FFFF00">Magnificence: </font>30<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Home Size reaches level 1<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Area: </font>Unlimited<br>A big water tank which is made by pure gold, only the riches could afford it.<br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_jy_ymwqj_01_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Decoration<br><font color="#FFFF00">Magnificence: </font>20<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Home Size reaches level 1<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Area: </font>Unlimited<br>This black weapon rack seems to be very heavy.<br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_jy_ymwqj_02_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Decoration<br><font color="#FFFF00">Magnificence: </font>30<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Home Size reaches level 1<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Area: </font>Unlimited<br>Dragon flyings above the sea, tiger roars in the winds.<br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_jy_penzai_02_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Bonsai<br><font color="#FFFF00">Magnificence: </font>100<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Home Size reaches level 1<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Area: </font>Courtyard<br>Keep unyielding though in the prison.<br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_light_zhiwu_01_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Lamp<br><font color="#FFFF00">Magnificence: </font>200<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Home Size reaches level 3<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Area: </font>Unlimited<br>This lantern look delicious.<br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
