mailinfo_4yjq_task_accept=All the people know that the Foreign Wulin is going to invade into the central plains. Now, I've sent hero invitations to all the heroes over the world with my name of the alliance leader. Help you who received the letter can come to Luoyang (293, 572) to discuss about how to defend them.
