desc_home_jy_wdwz_01_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Wooden Dummy<br><font color="#FFFF00">Magnificence: </font>200<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Home Size reaches level 1<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Area: </font>Unlimited<br>This wooden dummy is used by martial artists to practice their skills.<br>You will get Cultivation Points when using the wooden dummy. The cooldown is 6 hours. Players will get the buff every 12 hours.<br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_jy_wdwz_02_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Wooden Dummy<br><font color="#FFFF00">Magnificence: </font>120<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Home Size reaches level 1<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Area: </font>Unlimited<br>This wooden dummy is used by martial artists to practice their skills.<br>Your inner cultivating speed will increase after using the wooden dummy. The cooldown is 23 hours. Players will get the buff every 23 hours.<br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_jy_wdwz_03_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Wooden Dummy<br><font color="#FFFF00">Magnificence: </font>100<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Home Size reaches level 1<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Area: </font>Unlimited<br>This wooden dummy is used by martial artists to practice their skills.<br>You will get Chi when using the wooden dummy. The cooldown is 23 hours. Players will get the buff every 23 hours.<br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_jy_wdwz_04_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Wooden Dummy<br><font color="#FFFF00">Magnificence: </font>40<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Home Size reaches level 1<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Area: </font>Unlimited<br>This wooden dummy is used by martial artists to practice their skills.<br>Your experience conversion rate will increase after using the wooden dummy. The cooldown is 23 hours. Players will get the buff every 23 hours.<br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
