desc_item_guj_20170418_0=This token can be used for Activity Value Exchange event. Click the Nine Character at the main interface and enter Activity Value Exchange page to exchange.<br>How to Get: <br><font color="#A2FF6C">1. VIP players can get Activity Token from the gift pack of Activity Value reaching.</font><br><font color="#A2FF6C">2. Jianghu VIP and Young Hero Master players can claim Activity Token from Sima Haohong, Chengdu (879, 656) everyday.</font><br><font color="#A2FF6C">3. You can exchange Activity Shards which you may get from Build New Horse Farm event for Activity Tokens at Yanjing Horse Farm Administer, Yanjing (-214, -245).</font><br><font color="#A2FF6C">4. You can exchange for Activity Tokens with Working Medals you got from Model of Marital Practice event at Shang Wu, Suzhou (389, 768).</font>
