desc_Tab_b_head_190_b_0=Purchase Snake Scale Robe to receive it. Use this diagram to change the appearance of the outfit. Using <font color="#99cc00">Dressing Room</font> function can transform Equipment to change its style. <br><font color="#96a0c8">When the outfit diagram is stowed in the backpack, right-click to add it to the Dressing Room. It will be stored there indefinitely and will have an unlimited number of uses.</font>
desc_Tab_g_head_190_b_0=Purchase Snake Scale Robe to receive it. Use this diagram to change the appearance of the outfit. Using <font color="#99cc00">Dressing Room</font> function can transform Equipment to change its style. <br><font color="#96a0c8">When the outfit diagram is stowed in the backpack, right-click to add it to the Dressing Room. It will be stored there indefinitely and will have an unlimited number of uses.</font>
desc_box_card_289=Right-click to receive the Lore item <font color="#FFB428">Inky Jade Dust Shirt</font> and a costume change design for your gender.
desc_box_card_289_1=Ink-like black clouds cannot cover the mountains. Pure white immortal requires centuries of cultivation.
desc_box_card_290=Right-click to receive the Lore item <font color="#FFB428">Whisking Willow Flower Robe</font> and a costume change design for your gender.
desc_box_card_290_1=The green silk robe is decorated with willow flower. Play a sword and overlook my homeland.
desc_tab_b_head_191_b_0=Purchase Green Willow Whisking Follow Robe to receive it. Use this diagram to change the appearance of the outfit. Using <font color="#99cc00">Dressing Room</font> function can transform Equipment to change its style. <br><font color="#96a0c8">When the outfit diagram is stowed in the backpack, right-click to add it to the Dressing Room. It will be stored there indefinitely and will have an unlimited number of uses.</font>
desc_tab_g_head_191_b_0=Purchase Green Willow Whisking Follow Robe to receive it. Use this diagram to change the appearance of the outfit. Using <font color="#99cc00">Dressing Room</font> function can transform Equipment to change its style. <br><font color="#96a0c8">When the outfit diagram is stowed in the backpack, right-click to add it to the Dressing Room. It will be stored there indefinitely and will have an unlimited number of uses.</font>
desc_item_gujcbt_ydbz001_0=Key dropped from Shen Tuda in single treasure map.
desc_item_wbwf_qyyzh_sx_0=Has better effect on healing snake bites.<br><font color="#f9fc00">Effect One: Recover a small amount of HP</font><br><font color="#f9fc00">Effect Two: Remove the Old Wound Return effect</font><br>Right click to use, only effective on <font color="#FF3030">Yata Musula</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_04_01=It's the fate that we met. I'll help you.
talk_xuex_cbt_04_02=The Next Step
talk_xuex_cbt_04_03=<font color="#99CC00">You entered the land of Ouyang Zhi. Defeat her to get treasure. You may invite 1-2 friends to help you.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_04_04=<font color="#99CC00">Ouyang Zhi has been defeated. Go to get your treasures.</font>
