title_xuex_cbt_05_01=Defeat Treasure Robbers
tip_xuex_cbt_05_01=Defeat Long Haoxiong, Baili Wuji, and Yan Yinyou.
title_xuex_cbt_05_02=Minion
tip_xuex_cbt_05_02=Defeat all the Heelers
talk_xuex_cbt_06_01=<font color="#99CC00">Yata Musula is seeking for help. Save him and get the treasures as rewards. You may invite 1-2 friends to help you.</font>
sys_xuex_cbt_06_01=Remaining Time
sys_xuex_cbt_06_01_1=The challenge will fail if Yata Musula is dead or you failed to cure him within the appointed time.
title_xuex_cbt_06_01=Save the Sufferer
tip_xuex_cbt_06_01=Collect herbs nearby and heal Yata Musula's HP to full.
title_xuex_cbt_06_02=Defeat Viper
tip_xuex_cbt_06_02=Defeat Viper of Appointed Number
title_xuex_cbt_06_03=Defeat King Viper
tip_xuex_cbt_06_03=Defeat King Viper
title_xuex_cbt_06_04=Defeat Viper Trainer
tip_xuex_cbt_06_04=Defeat Viper Trainer
talk_xuex_cbt_06_02=<font color="#99CC00">You've saved Yata Musula. Go to get your treasures.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_06_03=Yata Musula died because of poison.
talk_xuex_cbt_leave=Time up. Now you will be transported back to the big world.
talk_xuex_cbt_06_04=<font color="#99CC00">Yata Musula is suffering from poison. Find herbs to help him.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_06_05=<font color="#99CC00">Viper Trainer has arrived. Defeat her to get mysterious treasures.</font>
sys_xuex_cbt_07_01=Remaining Time
sys_xuex_cbt_07_01_1=The challenge will fail if Liu Zhengying is dead or time is up.
title_xuex_cbt_07_01=The First Wave
title_xuex_cbt_07_02=The Second Wave
title_xuex_cbt_07_03=The Third Wave
title_xuex_cbt_07_04=The Fourth Wave
title_xuex_cbt_07_05=The Final Wave
talk_xuex_cbt_07_01=<font color="#99CC00">Protect Liu Zhengying. Defeat all the enemies and get the treasures as rewards. You may invite 1-2 friends to help you.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_07_02=<font color="#99CC00">All the enemies have been defeated. Go to get your treasures.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_07_03=You failed. Liu Zhengying is dead.
talk_xuex_cbt_07_04=I'm trapped here with my brothers. I'll award you if you can save us.
talk_xuex_cbt_07_05=I'd like to help you.
talk_xuex_cbt_07_06=Thank you. I'll remember your kindness.
talk_xuex_cbt_07_07=<font color="#99CC00">Liu Zhengying's HP is below </font>75%<font color="#99CC00">. Please protect her.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_07_08=<font color="#99CC00">Liu Zhengying's HP is below </font>50%<font color="#99CC00">. Please protect her.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_07_09=<font color="#99CC00">Liu Zhengying's HP is below </font>25%<font color="#99CC00">. Please protect her.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_08_01=<font color="#99CC00">You're face the test of Lu Ban's successor. After solving the mechanism successfully for four times you can get treasures as rewards. You may invite 1-2 friends to help you.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_08_02=<font color="#99CC00">All the mechanisms have been solved. Go to get your treasures.</font>
sys_xuex_cbt_08_01=Remaining Time
sys_xuex_cbt_08_01_1=The challenge will fail if you failed to solve the mechanism for an appointed times within time.
title_xuex_cbt_08_01=Solve Mechanism
talk_xuex_cbt_08_03=I have two hobbies, making puppets and poems. Would you like to receive my test?
talk_xuex_cbt_08_04=Please teach me.
talk_xuex_cbt_08_21=<font color="#99CC00">Challenge started. Talk to Lu Ban's successor to get the first clue.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_08_22=<font color="#99CC00">Mechanism solved. Talk to Lu Ban's successor to get the next clue.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_08_23=Good, you're so smart. These treasures are useless to me, I'd like to present you with them.
sys_xuex_cbt_09_01=Remaining Time
sys_xuex_cbt_09_01_1=The challenge will fail if you failed to collect enough raw meat by hunting beasts within the appointed time.
title_xuex_cbt_09_01=Collect Raw Meat
tip_xuex_cbt_09_01=Obtain by hunting beasts. Eat it near the grill to recover 40% of HP. Each time costs one.<br><font color="#99CC00">Note: Please search of Hunting Knife, Medical Book, or Trap nearby for they may help you.</font>
title_xuex_cbt_09_02=Death Times
tip_xuex_cbt_09_02=When you got enough raw meat, if your Death Times is 0, you can immediately get the treasures; if your Death Times is more than 0, you have to face a final battle. The more times you died, the more difficult the final battle.
title_xuex_cbt_09_03=Bounty Hunter
tip_xuex_cbt_09_03=Defeat the Bounty Hunter Head (-133, -1)
talk_xuex_cbt_09_01=<font color="#99CC00">You're in an unknown place. Try to survive. You may invite 1-2 friends to help you.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_09_02=<font color="#99CC00">The day breaks and the beasts have left. Go to get your treasures.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_09_03=One of your partner has died.
talk_xuex_cbt_09_04=<font color="#99CC00">Hunter beasts to get raw meat before the environment became worse.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_09_05=<font color="#99CC00">You can eat cooked meat with the grill to recover HP.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_09_06=<font color="#FF3030">Elite Beasts have appeared. Try to avoid them with traps.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_09_08=It's getting dark and the beasts will come out soon. You must cooperate with me if you want to get the treasure.
talk_xuex_cbt_09_09=We're ready now.
talk_xuex_cbt_09_10=I lost some tools nearby. You can try to find them.<br><font color="#99CC00">Please search of Hunting Knife, Medical Book, or Trap nearby for they may help you.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_09_11=Someone has come. I have to leave at first.
talk_xuex_cbt_09_12=<font color="#99CC00">You got a raw meat. Use it on the grill to recover HP</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_09_13=A sharp hunting knife which can increase the bringer's damage and Crit Rate.<br><font color="#99CC00">Notice: You can only pick up one from Hunting Knife, Medical Book, or Trap.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_09_14=An old medical book which records some skills of removing debuffs.<br><font color="#99CC00">Notice: You can only pick up one from Hunting Knife, Medical Book, or Trap.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_09_15=A loose trap seems to be effective on dealing with powerful beasts. You can dismantle it and then reset it.<br><font color="#99CC00">Notice: You can only pick up one from Hunting Knife, Medical Book, or Trap.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_09_16=Pick up Now
talk_xuex_cbt_09_17=<font color="#99CC00">You got the Hunting Knife. Go to hunt some beasts and store the raw meat.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_09_18=<font color="#99CC00">You got the Medical Book. It can disperse debuffs but has a long cooldown. Please use it reasonably.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_09_19=<font color="#99CC00">You got the Trap. It can help you deal with powerful beasts.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_09_20=You cannot take items anymore.
talk_xuex_cbt_09_21=This is a grill. Cook raw meat here and eat to recover your HP.
talk_xuex_cbt_09_22=Cook a piece of raw meat and eat
talk_xuex_cbt_09_23=You do not have any raw meat. Try to get some by hunting beasts.
talk_xuex_cbt_09_24=<font color="#99CC00">You performed not well in the survive stage and the Bounty Hunter Head has arrived for the treasures.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_09_25=<font color="#99CC00">The day breaks and you escaped from danger. Go to get your treasures.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_09_26=<font color="#99CC00">The beasts started to appear. Try to survive by hunting them and collecting raw meat.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_09_27=<font color="#99CC00">Please search of Hunting Knife, Medical Book, or Trap nearby for they may help you.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_09_28=<font color="#99CC00">Your living environment became extremely worse. Please speed up for collecting raw meat.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_09_29=<font color="#99CC00">You got two pieces of raw meat. Use it on the grill to recover HP</font>
talk_sx_cbt_10_01=There are many mounds or clitter in the cave. You may find something after having a dig.
sys_xuex_cbt_10_01=Remaining Time
sys_xuex_cbt_10_01_1=The challenge will fail if you failed to find the treasure within the appointed time.
title_xuex_cbt_10_01=Treasure Clue
tip_xuex_cbt_10_01=Digging the Suspicious Mound or Clitter may give you clues. When the clues are full, you can challenge Treasure Defender.<br><font color="#99CC00">The final battle will be triggered whether Treasure Clue or Triggered Treasure Thief are full.</font>
title_xuex_cbt_10_02=Triggered Treasure Thief
tip_xuex_cbt_10_02=Treasure Thief Leader will be attracted if you triggered Treasure Thief for 10 times.<br><font color="#99CC00">The final battle will be triggered whether Treasure Clue or Triggered Treasure Thief are full.</font>
title_xuex_cbt_10_03=Defeat Situ Ling
tip_xuex_cbt_10_03=You can get the treasures after defeating Situ Ling.
title_xuex_cbt_10_04=Defeat the Defender
tip_xuex_cbt_10_04=You can get the treasures after defeating Zhongsun Xiangcheng.
talk_xuex_cbt_10_01=<font color="#99CC00">It is said that there are many great treasures buried here. Try to dig out more clues. You may invite 1-2 friends to help you.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_10_02=<font color="#99CC00">The Treasure Defender has arrived. Defeat him to get the treasure.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_10_03=<font color="#FF3030">The Treasure Thief Head has arrived. Defeat him to get the treasure.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_10_04=<font color="#99CC00">You found nothing from this digging.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_10_05=<font color="#99CC00">You find a piece of clue about the treasures.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_10_06=<font color="#99CC00">You triggered the noxious fume here.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_10_07=<font color="#99CC00">You made too much noisy and a Treasure Thief has arrived.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_10_08=<font color="#99CC00">Situ Ling has been defeated. Go to get the treasure.</font>
talk_xuex_cbt_10_09=<font color="#99CC00">Zhongsun Xiangcheng has been defeated. Go to get the treasure.</font>
desc_item_bzt_001_0=A common treasure map, no one knows what can be dug out.<br>Main Resource: Open the Nine Character at main interface, accept solo treasure map quest at Treasure Map Anecdote page and complete to get.<br>Have a chance to get items, trigger noxious fume, or trigger mysterious treasure event.<br>Right click to use <font color="#FF0000">(Jianghu VIP is required)</font>
desc_item_bzt_002_0=A rare treasure map, seems to hide many treasures.<br>Main Resource: Obtain from Active Value rewards.<br>Must trigger mysterious treasure event, after completing you can get abundant rewards.<br>Right click to use <font color="#FF0000">(Jianghu VIP is required)</font>
desc_item_bzt_003_0=An old treasure map, but it contains great information about treasures.<br>Main Resource: When combine the treasure map shards obtained from Active Value rewards, there is a small chance to get it.<br>Must trigger secret area event, after completing you can get abundant rewards.<br>Right click to use <font color="#FF0000">(Jianghu VIP is required)</font>
desc_item_bzsp_001_0=Main Resource: Obtain from Active Value Quest Reward.<br>Combining Rules: <font color="#FF0000">"4"</font> treasure map shards are required for synthesizing a treasure map.<br>Right click to synthesize <font color="#FF0000">(Jianghu VIP is required)</font>
desc_item_bzsp_002_0=Main Resource: Obtain from Active Value Quest Reward.<br>Combining Rules: <font color="#FF0000">"4"</font> treasure map shards are required for synthesizing a treasure map.<br>Right click to synthesize <font color="#FF0000">(Jianghu VIP is required)</font>
desc_item_bzsp_003_0=Main Resource: Obtain from Active Value Quest Reward.<br>Combining Rules: <font color="#FF0000">"4"</font> treasure map shards are required for synthesizing a treasure map.<br>Right click to synthesize <font color="#FF0000">(Jianghu VIP is required)</font>
desc_item_lzy_cbt_dhdj001_0=Personal Letters left by a reclusive expert which records his experience on cultivating.<br><font color="#00ff00">Tavern Host seems to be collecting this. After collecting a certain amount, you can click the Nine Character at main interface and exchange for items in the Treasure Map Anecdote page.</font>
desc_item_lzy_cbt_dhdj002_0=A famous calligrapher's work.<br><font color="#00ff00">Tavern Host seems to be collecting this. After collecting a certain amount, you can click the Nine Character at main interface and exchange for items in the Treasure Map Anecdote page.</font>
desc_useitem_lzy_xiuwei_cbt001_0=It comes from the deep forest and looks crystal clear. If you take this, you will get <font color="#FFFF00">100000</font> Cultivation Points.
desc_useitem_lzy_neixiu_cbt001_1=It comes from the Snow-capped Mountains and formed only after one hundred years, a rare item in this world.<br>On taking it, you will get a 300% increase in inner cultivation speed. Lasts 60 minutes. Offline Cultivation is not affected by this.
desc_useitem_lzy_neixiu_cbt001=Right click to use
desc_item_lzy_cbtdrwf_tsbd001_0=A rusty blade, can barely cut woods.
desc_item_lzy_cbtdrwf_tsbd002_0=Broken wood sticks that can be ignited.
desc_item_lzy_cbtdrwf_tsbd003_0=Old pages which records the content about mechanisms, seem to be useless.
desc_item_lzy_cbtdrwf_tsbd004_0=An ignited wood stick, be careful of fire.
desc_item_lzy_cbtdrwf_tsbd005_0=A stone key, maybe it can open something.
desc_box_gmp_msxl_01_1=Ancient Tomb quests rewards, include <font color="#FFFF00">5 Jade Bee Tokens, and 5 Ancient Tomb Sect Contribution Tokens (Won't be affected by Doubled Event)</font>.
desc_box_gmp_msxl_01=Right-click to open.
desc_box_gmp_msxl_02_1=Ancient Tomb quests rewards, include <font color="#FFFF00">2 Jade Bee Tokens, and 1 Ancient Tomb Sect Contribution Token (Won't be affected by Doubled Event)</font>.
desc_box_gmp_msxl_02=Right-click to open.
desc_switch_855=Age of Wushu Records Control the Upper Limit of Weapon Manual's Damage
desc_box_card_291=Right-click to receive 1 Lore item <font color="#FFB428">Hidden Pattern Shirt - Nightmare</font> and 1 Diagram with unlimited use for the corresponding sex, 1 Lore item <font color="#FFB428">Chasing Cloud - Wei</font>, and Rose Gift Pack.
desc_box_card_291_1=Hidden Pattern, show your love.
desc_box_card_292=Right-click to open.
desc_box_card_292_1=Right click to obtain 10 Roses.
ui_card_desc_455=Confucius said that we shouldn't peep at others, talk behind others, eavesdrop others, and Yan Yuan said he will follow these rules.
desc_box_card_293_1=A decorated pack.
desc_box_card_293=Right click to obtain a mask Obey Your Words.
desc_item_lzy_cbt_yddy001_1=Right click to use
desc_item_lzy_cbt_yddy001=The Foreign Wulin buried many treasure on the land of central plains. The treasure maps are now spreading in Jianghu, if you're lucky enough, you may find the rare treasure.<br>On taking it, you will get a 200% increase in inner cultivation speed. Lasts 1 hour. Offline Cultivation is not affected by this.
desc_box_xfzx_zx4_madh_1=<font color="#FFFF00">Jianghu VIP</font> whose might has reached <font color="#FFFF00">First Understanding</font> may open.
desc_item_lzy_cbtdrwf_yczk001_0=A copper key, it may be able to open some mechanism.
desc_item_lzy_cbtdrwf_yczk002_0=A silver key, it may be able to open some mechanism.
desc_item_lzy_cbtdrwf_yczk003_0=A gold key, it may be able to open some mechanism.
desc_box_card_295=Can receive 1 Lore item <font color="#FFB428">Jade Leisure</font> and 1 Tianshan Snow Lotus Fruit.
desc_box_card_295_1=Right-click to open.
desc_box_card_296=Can get 1 <font color="#FFB428">"Sage Snow Small Gift Box"</font> and 1 White Condor.
desc_box_card_296_1=Right-click to open.
desc_box_card_297=Can get 1 <font color="#FFB428">"Sage Snow Small Gift Box"</font>, 1 <font color="#FFB428">Wind and Moon Veil-Hao</font>, and 1 <font color="#FFB428">Chasing Cloud</font>.
desc_box_card_297_1=Right-click to open.
desc_box_lzy_cbt_dh001=Right-click to use
desc_box_lzy_cbt_dh002=Right-click to use
desc_box_lzy_cbt_dh003=Right-click to use
desc_box_lzy_cbt_dh004=Treasure box containing martial art script.
desc_box_lzy_cbt_dh001_1=A package prepared by the Tavern Host to exchange for your rare items.<br>Open to get <font color="#FFFF00">2 Deep Mountain Ginseng</font>.<br><font color="#00ff00">Each Deep Mountain Ginseng can provide 100000 Cultivation Points after being taken.</font>
desc_box_lzy_cbt_dh002_1=A package prepared by the Tavern Host to exchange for your rare items.<br>Open to get <font color="#FFFF00">5 Snow Mountain Ginseng</font>.<br><font color="#00ff00">Each Snow Mountain Ginseng can increase Inner Cultivating Speed by 300% for 60 minutes after being taken.</font>
desc_box_lzy_cbt_dh003_1=A package prepared by the Tavern Host to exchange for your rare items.<br>Open to get <font color="#FFFF00">one martial art page</font>.
desc_box_lzy_cbt_dh004_1=A package prepared by the Tavern Host to exchange for your rare items.<br>Right click to open and get one random Basic school skill script or Jianghu skill page.
desc_box_lzy_cbt_dh007_0=A package prepared by the Tavern Host to exchange for your rare items.<br>Open to get different amount of <font color="#FFFF00">Faction Reputation</font> according to your faction. <font color="#FF3030">(Joining a Jianghu Faction is required to open)</font>
desc_box_lzy_cbt_dh008_0=A package prepared by the Tavern Host to exchange for your rare items.<br>Open to get different amount of <font color="#FFFF00">Faction Exchange Tokens</font> according to your faction. <font color="#FF3030">(Joining a Jianghu Faction is required to open)</font>
desc_box_lzy_cbt_dh005_0=A package prepared by the Tavern Host to exchange for your rare items.<br>Open to get one page of Central Plains or Foreign Martial Arts.
desc_useitem_lzy_neixiu_cbt002_1=Right-click to use
desc_useitem_lzy_neixiu_cbt002=Fine wine made by the Tavern Host himself.<br>On taking it, you will get a 100% increase in inner cultivation speed. Lasts 60 minutes. Offline Cultivation is not affected by this.
desc_box_2017_dwhd_slqyb_001_1=Gift pack obtained by completing Dragon Boat Festival event. Open to <font color="#FF3030">randomly get a bound Random Encounter Joining Item of Rootless Clan, Palace of Shifting Flowers, Peach Blossom Island, or Beast Villa (Male players won't get the item for Palace of Shifting Flowers while female players won't get the item for Rootless Clan).</font>
desc_box_2017_dwhd_slqyb_001=Right click to open
desc_box_2017_dwhd_4nei_001=Right click to open
desc_box_2017_dwhd_5nei_001=Right click to open
desc_box_2017_dwhd_6nei_001=Right click to open
desc_box_2017_dwhd_dwjsbx_001_1=Gift pack obtained by completing Dragon Boat Festival event. <font color="#FF3030">Jianghu VIP is required to open it. Open to get 1 Refined Moon Internal Skill Pill, and one from 5 Hunyuan Tendon-Relaxing Pills, 1 Tianshan Snow Lotus Fruit, or 10 Five-Realm Demon-Slaying Items.</font>
desc_box_2017_dwhd_dwjsbx_001=Right click to open
desc_box_2017_dwhd_dwjsbx_002_1=Gift pack obtained by completing Dragon Boat Festival event. <font color="#FF3030">Jianghu VIP is required to open it. Open to get 1 Refined Moon Internal Skill Pill, and one from 5 Hunyuan Tendon-Relaxing Pills, or 1 Tianshan Snow Lotus Fruit, also have a chance to get 1 Faction Random Encounter Reward Pack (The pack is unbound but the item it contains is bound). Open the pack to randomly get a bound Random Encounter Joining Item of Rootless Clan, Palace of Shifting Flowers, Peach Blossom Island, or Beast Villa (Male players won't get the item for Palace of Shifting Flowers while female players won't get the item for Rootless Clan). Only Elite VIP Players may get Faction Random Encounter Reward Pack.</font>
desc_box_2017_dwhd_dwjsbx_002=Right click to open
desc_box_2017_dwhd_dwjsbx_003_1=Gift pack obtained by completing Dragon Boat Festival event. <font color="#FF3030">Jianghu VIP is required to open it. Open to get 1 Refined Moon Internal Skill Pill, and one from 5 Hunyuan Tendon-Relaxing Pills, or 1 Tianshan Snow Lotus Fruit, also have a chance to get 1 Faction Random Encounter Reward Pack (The pack is unbound but the item it contains is bound). Open the pack to randomly get a bound Random Encounter Joining Item of Rootless Clan, Palace of Shifting Flowers, Peach Blossom Island, or Beast Villa (Male players won't get the item for Palace of Shifting Flowers while female players won't get the item for Rootless Clan). Only Elite VIP Players may get Faction Random Encounter Reward Pack. There is also a chance to get 1 Workbench Embroidered Box (The box is bound but you can get unbound Workbench from it).</font>
desc_box_2017_dwhd_dwjsbx_003=Right click to open
desc_box_2017_dwhd_dwjsbx_004=Right click to open
desc_box_2017_dwhd_dwjsbx_005=Right click to open
desc_box_2017_dwhd_dwjsbx_006=Right click to open
desc_item_cbt_repute_yihua_0=Use to receive <font color="#FFFF00">100</font> Palace of Shifting Flowers Reputation points.
desc_item_cbt_repute_taohua_0=Use to receive <font color="#FFFF00">150</font> Peach Blossom Island Reputation points.
desc_item_cbt_repute_wugen_0=Use to receive <font color="#FFFF00">900</font> Rootless Clan Reputation points.
