desc_box_201706_lzy_qxkl_xwgz_0=Package that contains cultivation perfusion pills. You can obtain different amounts of pills according to the stage of Age of Wushu Records. <br><font color="#FF3030">Open to get 10 Tendon-Relaxing Pills (1000000 Cultivation Perfusion) when the Age of Wushu Records is at Tier 1 Internal Skill stage.</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Get 20 Tendon-Relaxing Pills at Tier 2 Internal Skill stage (2000000 Cultivation Perfusion).</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Get 30 Tendon-Relaxing Pills at Tier 3 Internal Skill stage (3000000 Cultivation Perfusion).</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Get 40 Tendon-Relaxing Pills at Tier 4 Internal Skill stage (4000000 Cultivation Perfusion).</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Get 50 Tendon-Relaxing Pills at Tier 5 Internal Skill stage (5000000 Cultivation Perfusion).</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Get 60 Tendon-Relaxing Pills at Tier 6 Internal Skill stage (6000000 Cultivation Perfusion).</font>
