desc_box_clmy_wddhrw_mdh=Open to get Windrider (7 days), 5 In Hiding, 10 Traveling Tokens, 10 Advanced Repairing Tools, 1 Pure Yang Five-Realm Box, 30 Hero Tokens, 5 Ten Aroma Pills, 5 Refined Moon Internal Skill Pills, 10 Large Ruyi Pills, and 1 School Support Pack.
desc_box_clmy_wddhgk_mdh=Open to get 3 Traveling Tokens, 5 Costus Chi Potions, 5 Warmth Bringer, 5 Advanced Repairing Tools, 3 Qi Hai Concentration Pills, 3 Refined Moon Internal Skill Pills, 2 Large Ruyi Pills, 20 Lingxin Pills, and 1 Body Form Pill Embroidered Box.
