desc_xueweitool_0501_0=One of the martial arts classics written based on the medical tantra Lingshu. When read by a martial arts practitioner, the reader can instantly gain insight and unclog the meridian channels of the body, and eventually open up <font color="#FFCC00">Shang Yang</font>, the <font color="#FFCC00">first</font> acupoint of the <font color="#FFCC00">Yang Brightness Large Intestine Hand</font>. <br>Cultivation points required for usage: <font color="#FFFF00">500000</font>
desc_xueweitool_0502_0=One of the martial arts classics written based on the medical tantra Lingshu. When read by a martial arts practitioner, the reader can instantly gain insight and unclog the meridian channels of the body, and eventually open up <font color="#FFCC00">Er Jian</font>, the <font color="#FFCC00">second</font> acupoint of the <font color="#FFCC00">Yang Brightness Large Intestine Hand</font>. <br>Cultivation points required for usage: <font color="#FFFF00">1000000</font>
desc_xueweitool_0503_0=One of the martial arts classics written based on the medical tantra Lingshu. When read by a martial arts practitioner, the reader can instantly gain insight and unclog the meridian channels of the body, and eventually open up <font color="#FFCC00">He Gu</font>, the <font color="#FFCC00">third</font> acupoint of the <font color="#FFCC00">Yang Brightness Large Intestine Hand</font>. <br>Cultivation points required for usage: <font color="#FFFF00">1500000</font>
desc_xueweitool_0504_0=One of the martial arts classics written based on the medical tantra Lingshu. When read by a martial arts practitioner, the reader can instantly gain insight and unclog the meridian channels of the body, and eventually open up <font color="#FFCC00">Pianli</font>, the <font color="#FFCC00">fourth</font> acupoint of the <font color="#FFCC00">Yang Brightness Large Intestine Hand</font>. <br>Cultivation points required for usage: <font color="#FFFF00">2000000</font>
desc_xueweitool_0505_0=One of the martial arts classics written based on the medical tantra Lingshu. When read by a martial arts practitioner, the reader can instantly gain insight and unclog the meridian channels of the body, and eventually open up <font color="#FFCC00">Shou San Li</font>, the <font color="#FFCC00">fifth</font> acupoint of the <font color="#FFCC00">Yang Brightness Large Intestine Hand</font>. <br>Cultivation points required for usage: <font color="#FFFF00">2500000</font>
desc_xueweitool_0506_0=One of the martial arts classics written based on the medical tantra Lingshu. When read by a martial arts practitioner, the reader can instantly gain insight and unclog the meridian channels of the body, and eventually open up <font color="#FFCC00">Qu Chi</font>, the <font color="#FFCC00">sixth</font> acupoint of the <font color="#FFCC00">Yang Brightness Large Intestine Hand</font>. <br>Cultivation points required for usage: <font color="#FFFF00">3000000</font>
desc_ng_book_mj_00101=Ming Cult novice internal skill. It's purpose is to control fire of heart and lay the foundation against demonic possession for the later practice of deeper internal skills. When this internal skill is trained to the extreme, fire of heart is taken and given with ease, attached to the internal skill, and imperceptibly hurts the enemy.
