desc_ng_book_mj_00301_1=Ming Cult internal skill epitome that roots from an ancient Persian religious teachings. The cultivation conditions are very harsh, and it is extremely difficult for people without great perseverance to practice it. Later, after being carefully modified and purified by a generation of masters, practice of this discipline became available to many cult's disciples.
