desc_ng_book_mj_003_rm_0=The diagram recording Scorching Sun Heart Sutra level 1 to 9. Read it to learn Scorching Sun Heart Sutra - Novice.
desc_ng_book_mj_003_jj_0=The diagram recording Scorching Sun Heart Sutra level 10 to 18. Read it to learn Scorching Sun Heart Sutra - Apprentice.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Must learn Scorching Sun Heart Sutra - Novice to use this item. </font>
desc_ng_book_mj_003_zj_0=The diagram recording Scorching Sun Heart Sutra level 19 to 30. Read it to learn Scorching Sun Heart Sutra - Student.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Must learn Scorching Sun Heart Sutra - Apprentice to use this item. </font>
desc_ng_book_mj_003_gj_0=The diagram recording Scorching Sun Heart Sutra level 31 to 36. Read it to learn Scorching Sun Heart Sutra - Elder.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Must learn Scorching Sun Heart Sutra - Student and be part of the Ming Cult to use this item. </font>
