desc_item_clone_exchange_mj_0=Mysterious token, made of material similar to iron. It looks ordinary, but weighs heavy. The text on the token says "Command Everyone in the World". Rumor has it that, in the old times, various factions from central plain and western region would pay respect upon its appearance. <br>Ming Cult disciples can use the token to exchange the school set <font color="#FF3030">Divine Arrow Nine Skills</font>, at <font color="#FF3030">Force Transmitting Elder (Ming Cult: -23, 238)</font>.
desc_pz_ng_mj_001_0=<font color="#00FF00">The attributes increased by Annotation Book are subject to the internal skill attributes. </font>
desc_pz_ng_mj_002_0=<font color="#00FF00">The attributes increased by Annotation Book are subject to the internal skill attributes. </font>
desc_pz_ng_mj_003_0=<font color="#00FF00">The attributes increased by Annotation Book are subject to the internal skill attributes. </font>
desc_pro_ng_mj_001_1=Ming Cult novice internal skill. It's purpose is to control fire of heart and lay the foundation against demonic possession for the later practice of deeper internal skills. When this internal skill is trained to the extreme, fire of heart is taken and given with ease, attached to the internal skill, and imperceptibly hurts the enemy.
desc_pro_ng_mj_002_1=Ming Cult legendary internal skill. It was created by an elder hiding at the top of snowy mountain peak. It was a set of methods to induce Yang fire to resist extreme cold. In his later years the elder was invited to Ming Cult and spread this mental skill to the disciples.
desc_pro_ng_mj_003_1=Ming Cult internal skill epitome that roots from an ancient Persian religious teachings. The cultivation conditions are very harsh, and it is extremely difficult for people without great perseverance to practice it. Later, after being carefully modified and purified by a generation of masters, practice of this discipline became available to many cult's disciples.
desc_pro_ng_mj_001_1b=Ming Cult novice internal skill. It's purpose is to control fire of heart and lay the foundation against demonic possession for the later practice of deeper internal skills. When this internal skill is trained to the extreme, fire of heart is taken and given with ease, attached to the internal skill, and imperceptibly hurts the enemy.
desc_pro_ng_mj_002_1b=Ming Cult legendary internal skill. It was created by an elder hiding at the top of snowy mountain peak. It was a set of methods to induce Yang fire to resist extreme cold. In his later years the elder was invited to Ming Cult and spread this mental skill to the disciples.
desc_pro_ng_mj_003_1b=Ming Cult internal skill epitome that roots from an ancient Persian religious teachings. The cultivation conditions are very harsh, and it is extremely difficult for people without great perseverance to practice it. Later, after being carefully modified and purified by a generation of masters, practice of this discipline became available to many cult's disciples.
desc_pro_ng_mj_001_1_0=Right click to use. Learn [Blazing Flame] Training Script.
desc_pro_ng_mj_002_1_0=Right click to use. Learn [Sunburst Skill] Training Script.
