desc_cw_book_CS_jh_mjh_0=Annotation fragment of <font color="#ffff00">Ming Cult</font> martial art skill Enlightened Shadowblade. Collect 10 fragments and combine them into a complete annotation book at <font color="#ff0000">a painter</font>.
desc_cw_book_CS_jh_lydgd_0=Annotation fragment of <font color="#ffff00">Ming Cult</font> martial art skill Flickering Light Stab. Collect 10 fragments and combine them into a complete annotation book at <font color="#ff0000">a painter</font>.
desc_cw_book_CS_jh_ldg_0=Annotation fragment of <font color="#ffff00">Ming Cult</font> martial art skill Fallen Goose Bow. Collect 10 fragments and combine them into a complete annotation book at <font color="#ff0000">a painter</font>.
desc_ssf_tasknpc_01_0=Ice spirit of internal power. It's very cold. If it's applied on people, they will be in extreme pain. <br><font color="#ffd700">Source: Exchanged at shop of Twelve Swallows in the Snow [Lingxiao City (526, 171)]. </font><br><font color="#ffd700">Use: Right click to take the quest "Life and Death Rune - Rune Slave". Once completed, it will give 5 runes. Runes obtained from quest will count toward the daily rune limit. </font><br><font color="#ffd700">Rules of use: </font><br>When Age of Wushu Record <font color="#00ff00">Pirate Raid</font> is activated, it requires that the user's item-related meridian should be practiced to <font color="#00ff00">72 cultivation cycles</font>. <br>When Age of Wushu Record <font color="#00ff00">Soul Smashed Ninefold</font> is activated, it requires that the user's item-related meridian should be practiced to <font color="#00ff00">108 cultivation cycles</font>. <br>When Age of Wushu Record <font color="#00ff00">Plague of Luoyang</font> is activated, it requires that the user's item-related meridian should be practiced to <font color="#00ff00">144 cultivation cycles</font>. <br>When Age of Wushu Record <font color="#00ff00">Traces of the Evil Cult</font> is activated, it requires that the user's item-related meridian should be practiced to <font color="#00ff00">180 Cultivation cycles</font>.
desc_useitem_ssfnpc_dy_01_0=Messy Heart Dust, given by Xin Yuanhang. It's used to punish the people who invade Lingxiao City.
desc_useitem_ssfnpc_dy_02_0=Right click to obtain 5 runes. <font color="#00ff00">They will count toward the daily rune limit. If the rune points exceed 270 on that day, then one can't use runes anymore.</font>
desc_box_2017xrlb_001_1=An exquisite gift pack. <font color="#FF3030">Open to get 5 Plum Syrup, 5 Green Bean Porridge, 5 Green Tea, 1 Package Box, 1 Rushing Cloud (7 days), 30 Hero Tokens, 20 Five-Realm Demon-Slaying Items, and 3 Large Ruyi Pills (First Understanding is required to open it)</font>
desc_box_2017xrlb_001=Right click to open
desc_item_2017xrhd_sm_001_0=Plum Syrup that contained in the Summer Gift Pack which you can get from Lin Liang. <font color="#FF3030">Use to increase inner cultivating speed by 100% for 1 hour.</font>
desc_item_2017xrhd_ld_001_0=Green Bean Porridge that contained in the Summer Gift Pack which you can get from Lin Liang. <font color="#FF3030">Use to increase Experience Conversion Speed by 150% for 1 hour.</font>
desc_item_2017xrhd_lc_001_0=Green Tea that contained in the Summer Gift Pack which you can get from Lin Liang. <font color="#FF3030">Use to increase all attributes by 20 for 1 hour. (It will replace the effect of other worldly pills)</font>
desc_signup_schoolpose_09_0=A certificate that allows you to join the Ming Cult disciples' competition. With it, you can enroll in the first stage of the competition which will be held at 21:30 every Sunday.
desc_box_paiz_mj_01=The package contains 100 Ming Cult certificates. The package is tradable.
desc_box_paiz_mj_01_1=
desc_mingjiao_panshi_03=Requirements for Betraying School: <br>Tier 2 Internal Skill is available. <br>Not an Acting Headmaster in the school. <br>Not a Deacon in the school. <br>Not an Elder in the school. <br>Not in an ongoing training-away task. <br>Not in an ongoing disguise task. <br>Has been more than 30 days since you left a school last time.
desc_mingjiao_panshi_05=Compensation for betraying a master: <br>When a player got away from a school through master betrayal and joined other schools, the player will obtain the martial arts strength equivalent to that deleted for the betrayal as compensation in order to accelerate the player's practice of the new school martial arts studies.
desc_mingjiao_panshi_06=Ming Cult: <br>If you want to return to Ming Cult in future, you are welcome to do so anytime. Find <a href="findnpc_new,school20,npc_mjwy_005" style="HLStype1">Lei Ri</a>, and you can decide whether to betray school.
desc_mingjiao_xiashan_02=Jianghu Related: <br>By training away from school, you can join the new Jianghu factions, such as the <a href="findnpc_new,city05,xjz_021" style="HLStype1">Xu Family Manor</a>, Golden Needle Sect, <a href="findnpc_new,school02,wssz_132" style="HLStype1">Beast Villa</a> etc. I have no info about hidden factions. You will have to search in Jianghu by yourself.
desc_mingjiao_xiashan_03=Requirements to Train Away from School: <br>Tier 2 Internal Skill is available. <br>Not an Acting Headmaster in the school. <br>Not a Deacon in the school. <br>Not an Elder in the school. <br>Not in an ongoing betrayal task. <br>Not in an ongoing disguise task. <br>More than 30 days have passed since the last time that you left a school. <br>Level has reached Peak of Power.
desc_mingjiao_xiashan_05=Compensation for training away from school: <br>Players will have all of their martial arts strengths returned to the previous level before they left the previous faction. Of course, you can obtain extra precious items during your training quest. You may make a small fortune.
desc_mingjiao_yirong_02=Jianghu Related: <br>By disguise, you can join the new Jianghu factions, such as the <a href="findnpc_new,city05,xjz_021" style="HLStype1">Xu Family Manor</a>, Golden Needle Sect, <a href="findnpc_new,school02,wssz_132" style="HLStype1">Beast Villa</a> etc. I have no info about hidden factions. You will have to search in Jianghu by yourself.
desc_mingjiao_yirong_04=Punishment of disguise:<br>Delete identity title of the school.<br>Delete some tasks of the school.<br>Cannot betray, go downhill, or disguise again within 30 days.
desc_mingjiao_yirong_05=Disguise compensation: <br>The martial arts strengths for players who leave under disguise will not be affected. They can also enjoy easy face change services.  They can also quickly return back to their schools
tips_duyao_buff_mjpoison_01=After getting hit, the target has a {@0:num}% probability to drop HP by 1% every 3 seconds for 15 seconds. There are {@1:num} remaining uses.
tips_duyao_buff_mjpoison_02=After getting hit, the target has a {@0:num}% probability to drop Energy by 1% every 3 seconds for 15 seconds. There are {@1:num} remaining uses.
tips_duyao_buff_mjpoison_03=After getting hit, the target has a {@0:num}% probability to get explode effect, damaging all targets within 3 meters range once for 3% HP. There are {@1:num} remaining uses.
tips_duyao_buff_mjpoison_04=After getting hit, the target has a {@0:num}% probability to drop in internal and external defense by 5% for 8 seconds. There are {@1:num} remaining uses.
tips_duyao_buff_mjpoison_05=After getting hit, the target has a {@0:num}% probability to drop in Evasion rate by 7% for 8 seconds. There are {@1:num} remaining uses.
