desc_box_qlyx2017_madh_001_1=Open to get 5 Steamed Bread, and 1 Large Heaven Undertaking Pill.
desc_box_qlyx2017_madh_002_1=Open to get 1 Dark Plum Juice, and 1 Congee with Mungbean.
desc_box_qlyx2017_madh_003_1=Open to get 1 Green Tea, and 3 Hero Tokens.
desc_box_qlyx2017_madh_004_1=Open to get 3 Treasure Reset Tickets, and 1 Reset Ticket.
desc_box_qlyx2017_madh_005_0=<font color="#FF3030">Players in Tier 1 and Tier 2 Internal Skill Servers</font> will get 1 Demon Banishing Order, 1 Tianshan Snow Lotus Fruit, and 1 Summer Days Token.<br><font color="#FF3030">Players in Tier 3, Tier 4, Tier 5 and Tier 6 Internal Skill Servers</font> will get 1 Demon Banishing Order, 2 Gift Egg Embroidered Boxes, and 1 Summer Days Token.
