desc_ng_book_mj_00401_1=It used to be an advanced skill of a certain school hundreds of years ago. The school was destroyed in the chaos of the previous dynasty, and the Scripts after being scattered over Jianghu came into possession of Ming Cult. The original name was lost, but once this skill is practiced, the sparks become a prairie fire, transforming the corruptible into mysterious life, hence the name, "Prairie Fire Miracle".
