desc_ng_book_mj_00501_1=A unique internal skill created by a Ming Cult elder hailing from the Western Regions. This skill is very different from the Central Plains authentic internal skills. Having a secret Buddhist teaching as a background, it focuses on the three methods of righteous, strange and evil. The body of the user gains heavenly Buddha protection. In such a state stone will yield to them and no harm will be taken.
