desc_ng_book_mj_00601_1=Ming Cult rare miraculous skill. Created by the joint effort of the first three generations of the Central Plains Ming Cult leaders. At it's highest level, the blood circulates and spreads pure intentions. There is an ability to move through the vessels, gather and unload the energy of Chi, reverse the hard and soft, and reverse the power of Yin and Yang. The non-perceptive will overlook mystery.
