desc_model_pants_mj_50601_0=<font color="#00FF00">The rage consumption of Thousands of Celestial Arrow decreases by 7 points. </font><br>The item can be obtained at <font color="#ff0000">School Exchange. </font><br>The item can not be directly equipped. It must be used to upgrade <br>a <font color="#ff0000">school</font>'s <font color="#ff0000">class 5 gold equipment</font>. You will get <font color="#ff0000">class 6 gold equipment</font>.
