desc_model_bow_50601_0=A unique item. <br>This item may <font color="#ff0000">drop in forbidden instances, or be exchanged at Fang Pingting (Yanjing 1625,863). </font><br>This item cannot be directly equipped. It must be used to upgrade a <font color="#ff0000">life produced</font> <font color="#ff0000">class 5 gold equipment</font>. You will get <font color="#ff0000">class 6 gold equipment</font>. <br>You can go to Suzhou Mort <font color=""#00FF00"">(320,732)</font>, find <font color=""#00FF00"">Zhou Yixian</font>, and exchange this item for pure yang swords. (Obtained pure yang swords are bound.)
