desc_model_bow_battlefield_50601_0=This Item can be traded for from Gu Mu the Battlefield Merchant. <br>It can be refined with <font color="#ff0000">Level 5 Gold Fighting Soul Equipment </font>to get <font color="#ff0000">Level 6 Gold Fighter's Soul Equipment of higher quality</font>.  The effect of refined Fighter's Soul Equipment is as shown above. <br>Players can disassemble the Raw Jade Item into Five-Realm Demon-Slaying Item at Cheng Jieyun in Suzhou Mortuary (320,729).
desc_model_bow_battlefield_50701_0=This item can be traded at Gu Mu the Battlefield Merchant (Suzhou 537,435). <br>It can be refined with the same type <font color="#ff0000">Level 6 Gold Fighter's Soul Equipment </font>to get <font color="#ff0000">Level 7 Gold Dace Equipment of higher quality</font>.
desc_model_bow_battlefield_60601_0=This Item can be traded for from Gu Mu the Battlefield Merchant. <br>It can be refined with <font color="#ff0000">Level 5 Jade Fighter's Spirit Equipment </font>to get <font color="#ff0000">Level 6 Jade Fighter's Spirit Equipment of higher quality</font>. The effect of refined Fighter's Soul Equipment is as shown above. <br>Players can disassemble the Raw Jade Item into Five-Realm Demon-Slaying Item at Cheng Jieyun in Suzhou Mortuary (320,729).
desc_model_bow_battlefield_60701_0=This item can be traded at Zhang Sheng the Battlefield Master (Suzhou 538,436). <br>This Item cannot be used directly. It can be refined with the same type <font color="#ff0000">Level 6 Jade Fighter's Spirit Equipment </font>to get <font color="#ff0000">Level 7 Jade Wyvern Equipment of higher quality</font>.
desc_condition_116216=The school is Ming Cult.
task_SMSY_School20=<s><s><s> To teach is to dispel confusion. Our school is one with profound knowledge, therefore you should work even harder. Please arrive promptly for School Instructions. (<font color="#ff0000">To sign up, you must be a Ming Cult disciple, and not in Beginner's Protection status. You will receive cultivation points and credits, which you can use to exchange for various items. VIP will get more cultivation points and credits, and need fewer credits to exchange for items. </font>)
spyshop_mj=To avoid loss always, Ming Cult must know the situations in Jianghu first.
desc_box_spy_dh_paizi_10=Right click to use
desc_box_spy_dh_paizi_10_1=The box is exchanged by other School Honor Certificates. Open it to gain 4-8 Ming Cult Honor Certificate at random.
desc_switch_884=Ming Cult scene switch
desc_qizhen_0114=The item has a strengthening effect on <font color="#00aa00">Yang Brightness Large Intestine Hand Meridian</font>. Artifact needs to be used with a medicine catalyst, purchase the catalyst with Silver taels for better effect.
desc_qizhen_0114_0=Branchless and leafless. Golden and yellow in color. Hidden deep in the soil. Extremely difficult to be found. Consuming it will strengthen the chi and increase longevity.
