origin_1451_desc=Ming Cult Followers. They are Wulin people that are deluded by Ming Cult. And they are the first ones to sacrifice for Ming Cult's goal.
origin_1452_desc=Ming Cult Members. They are busy with the great goal of uniting the Jianghu for the cult. They like to study non-righteous tricks.
origin_1454_desc=Green Fire Altar Independents. They have odd personalities.
origin_1455_desc=Green Fire Altar Experts. They are extremely evil.
origin_1456_desc=Green Fire Altar Dharmapalas. They are strange and malicious.
origin_1457_desc=Green Fire Altar Leaders. They laugh at the ordinary people, and have their own free spirit.
origin_1458_desc=Black Sun Altar Disciples. Their weapons are powerful, and they are not restricted by any rules.
origin_1460_desc=Black Sun Altar Experts. They are a class of their own, and don't leave a trace.
origin_1461_desc=Black Sun Altar Dharmapalas. They are extremely strict and have no sympathy.
origin_1462_desc=Black Sun Altar Leaders. They are in charge of the life and death of the disciples.
origin_1463_desc=Red Sun Manager, who is in charge of the promotion and reward. The manager is knowledgeable and famous.
origin_1464_desc=Burning Sun Manager, who is in charge of penalty and punishment. The manager is emotionless and fair.
origin_1465_desc=Defender Emissary, who is fast, mysterious, and malicious in martial skills. The emissary is in charge of the life.
origin_1466_desc=One of Ming Cult's 3 Deacons, who are in charge of disciples' cultivation.
origin_1467_desc=One of Ming Cult's 3 Deacons, who are in charge of disciples' cultivation.
origin_1468_desc=One of Ming Cult's 3 Deacons, who are in charge of disciples' cultivation.
origin_1469_desc=One of Ming Cult's 3 Elders, who are in charge of school's martial art scripts.
origin_1470_desc=One of Ming Cult's 3 Elders, who are in charge of school's martial art scripts.
origin_1471_desc=One of Ming Cult's 3 Elders, who are in charge of school's martial art scripts.
origin_1472_desc=Ming Cult Executive Headmaster, who is in overall charge of the school.
tips_obj_school_mingjiao=Ming Cult
