desc_mingjiao01=Outfit for Ming Cult followers. Elegant and beautiful. If people wear it, they will feel as if the spring breeze comes by.
desc_mingjiao02=It is colorful and elegant. The person who wears it will feel relaxed and his power will be enhanced.
desc_mingjiao03=Light and delicate. Surrounded by mysterious chi.
desc_mingjiao04=Glimmer twinkles around the outfit made of green jade and white brocade. It looks like the willow tree just have its new sprouts in the spring season.
desc_mingjiao05=The outfit is made of gold, silk, and silk brocade. It's elegant and refreshing.
desc_mingjiao06=Music comes out from the thick fog. Wine is warm and suitable for the spring season. A blossom branch appears at the window.
desc_mingjiao07=The Molten spider silk, the brocade of lots all colors, the decoration is like being stamped by the Skyfire. The Rosy clouds can be seen. Luxurious and refined.
desc_mingjiao08=The color is far better than the common silk. Water will not wet it, and fire will not burn it.
desc_mingjiao09=Wielding with Yulu and Wine, writing poems with wind flowing the hair, the moon and the stars shining. The warbler songs at the window. Frost has been condensed on the body.
desc_mingjiao10=It's early morning. The servant just sent the clothes to the emperor. When the palace is open, ambassadors from all different countries are ready to greet the emperor.
desc_item_mjzyb_001_0=Plum blossom needle.
desc_item_mjzyb_002_0=Top quality tea.
desc_item_mjzyb_003_0=Herb.
desc_item_mjzyb_004_0=Awake Blood Clot Worm.
desc_item_mjzyb_005_0=Heart-steal Lotus.
desc_item_mjzyb_006_0=Antidote.
desc_useitem_mjzyb_001_0=Pill.
desc_useitem_mjzyb_002_0=Pill.
desc_useitem_mjzyb_003_0=Un-awake Blood Clot Worm. It needs a lot of blood to wake it up.
desc_useitem_mjzyb_004_0=Drug.
desc_bookitem_exchange_mj_0=Use the reward certificates you have won through script stealing and protecting events. Speak with the book guardian disciples to exchange for Ming Cult skills.
desc_bookitem_exchange_mj01_0=Use the reward certificates you have won through script stealing and protecting events. Speak with the book guardian disciples to exchange for Ming Cult skills.
desc_box_exchange_mj_1=Right click to open and you can obtain the school martial art skill rewards
desc_box_exchange_mj_2=Right click to open and you can obtain the school martial art skill rewards
desc_box_exchange_mj_3=Right click to open and you can obtain the apprentice school martial art skill rewards
desc_box_exchange_mj_1_1=Rewards are given to those who have made significant contributions to school script stealing or protection. These can be: Ming Cult Martial Arts Skills, a certain chance to obtain Ming Cult Internal Skills or annotated martial arts scripts. <br><font color="#FF0000">(Requires scroll from the Royal Guards Regular Collection. Item is bound to player.)</font>
desc_box_exchange_mj_2_1=Rewards are given to those who have made significant contributions to school script stealing or protection. These can be: Ming Cult Martial Arts Skills, a certain chance to obtain Ming Cult Internal Skills or annotated martial arts scripts. <br><font color="#FF0000">(Requires scroll from the Royal Guards Regular Collection.)</font>
desc_box_exchange_mj_3_1=Rewards are given to those who have made significant contributions to school script stealing or protection. These can be: Ming Cult Martial Arts Skills, a certain chance to obtain Ming Cult Internal Skills or annotated martial arts scripts. <br><font color="#FF0000">(Requires scroll from the Royal Guards Regular Collection.)</font>
desc_pet_niao_1_qy_01_0=<font color="#ff0000">[Right-click to move the pet into collection interface]</font><br><font color="#ff0000">Attention: Once in the collection interface, it becomes bound to the player and cannot be removed. If it is a time-limited pet, once the time has run out it will be deleted automatically.</font><br><font face="Default" color="#008B8B" >You cannot summon a pet in the New World. </font><br> It can help players send letters. When players enter Sit and Breathe, they will recover 5 Flying Skill points each second. <br><font color="#ff0000">(Tip: Once the Age of Wushu Record Tier 2 is available, players who own a pet and have reached "Flows With Chi" can speak with the Beast Villa Guide in Beast Villa to join the faction. (Coordinates: Beggars' Sect 589, 853)</font>
desc_pet_niao_1_qy_02_0=<font color="#ff0000">[Right-click to move the pet into collection interface]</font><br><font color="#ff0000">Attention: Once in the collection interface, it becomes bound to the player and cannot be removed. If it is a time-limited pet, once the time has run out it will be deleted automatically.</font><br><font face="Default" color="#008B8B" >You cannot summon a pet in the New World. </font><br> It can help players send letters. When players enter Sit and Breathe, they will recover 5 Flying Skill points each second. <br><font color="#ff0000">(Tip: Once the Age of Wushu Record Tier 2 is available, players who own a pet and have reached "Flows With Chi" can speak with the Beast Villa Guide in Beast Villa to join the faction. (Coordinates: Beggars' Sect 589, 853)</font>
