task_act818_mj_001=Wherever there are people, there is Jianghu. Wherever there is Jianghu, there is love and hate. <font color="#FF3030">(If you want to improve your strength, I have a few quests for you. You can take them if you don't have a full list of 25 quests already.)</font>
desc_box_20170818_shmzqmzl_001_1=At tier 1 or 2 internal stage, open to get 5 Tianyuan Soul Gathering Pills, 10 Purple Spirit Pills, 1 Good Quality Expansion Package, 200 Repair Tools, 5 Ten Aroma Pills, 1 Juedi (15 Days), and 1 Holy Fire Bright Elder (permanent); At tier 3 internal stage, open to get 10 Tianyuan Soul Gathering Pills, 20 Purple Spirit Pills, 1 Good Quality Expansion Package, 200 Repair Tools, 5 Ten Aroma Pills, 1 Juedi (15 Days), and 1 Holy Fire Bright Elder (permanent); At tier 4 internal stage, open to get 15 Tianyuan Soul Gathering Pills, 30 Purple Spirit Pills, 1 Good Quality Expansion Package, 300 Repair Tools, 5 Ten Aroma Pills, 1 Juedi (15 Days), and 1 Holy Fire Bright Elder (permanent); At tier 5 internal stage, open to get 20 Tianyuan Soul Gathering Pills, 50 Purple Spirit Pills, 1 Good Quality Expansion Package, 400 Repair Tools, 5 Ten Aroma Pills, 1 Juedi (15 Days), and 1 Holy Fire Bright Elder (permanent); At tier 6 internal stage, open to get 20 Tianyuan Soul Gathering Pills, 50 Purple Spirit Pills, 1 Good Quality Expansion Package, 500 Repair Tools, 5 Ten Aroma Pills, 1 Juedi (15 Days), and 1 Holy Fire Bright Elder (permanent).
desc_box_20170818_shmzqmzl_001=Right click to open
