desc_caiyao10201_1=Obtain happiness effect after use: Internal Critical Rate decreased by 5.5%, internal Accuracy rate increased by 11%, Internal Defense increased by 14, and nutrition recovered by 10. <br>The effect will last for an hour. <br><font color="#08E905">When nutrition is above 130, eating this food will not recover any more nutrition.</font>
desc_caiyao10202_1=Obtain happiness effect after use: Internal Critical Rate decreased by 6.25%, internal Accuracy rate increased by 12.5%, Internal Defense increased by 14, and nutrition recovered by 10. <br>The effect will last for an hour. <br><font color="#08E905">When nutrition is above 130, eating this food will not recover any more nutrition.</font>
desc_caiyao10203_1=Obtain happiness effect after use: Internal Critical Rate decreased by 6.75%, internal Accuracy rate increased by 13.5%, Internal Defense increased by 15, and nutrition recovered by 10. <br>The effect will last for an hour. <br><font color="#08E905">When nutrition is above 130, eating this food will not recover any more nutrition.</font>
