desc_yaopin10256_1=Effect: Brawn increased by 36, external Accuracy rate increased by 5%. <br>The effect lasts for an hour.
desc_yaopin10257_1=Effect: Resilience increased by 12. Extra effect: Chance of being critically hit reduced by 3%. <br>The effect lasts for an hour.
desc_yaopin10258_1=Effect: Resilience increased by 13. Extra effect: Chance of being critically hit reduced by 3%. <br>The effect lasts for an hour.
desc_yaopin10259_1=Effect: Resilience increased by 14. Extra effect: Chance of being critically hit reduced by 3%. <br>The effect lasts for an hour.
