desc_yaopin10262_1=Effect: Resilience increased by 22. Extra effect: Chance of being critically hit reduced by 5%. <br>The effect lasts for an hour.
desc_duyao30006_1=Effect: Internal Defense decreased by 87, breath increased by 61. Effect lasts for 20 seconds. <br>Crafted by poison makers. The recipe can be obtained in instances.
desc_duyao30007_1=Effect: Internal Defense decreased by 102, spirit increased by 69. Effect lasts for 20 seconds. <br>Crafted by poison makers. The recipe can be obtained in instances.
desc_duyao30008_1=Effect: Brawn increased by 90, external Accuracy increased by 10%, dexterity decreased by 30. Effect lasts for 20 seconds. <br>Crafted by poison makers. The recipe can be obtained in instances.
desc_duyao30009_1=Effect: Breath increased by 20, internal Accuracy increased by 30%, Internal Defense decreased by 50. Effect lasts for 20 seconds. <br>Crafted by poison makers. The recipe can be obtained in instances.
desc_caiyao10201=Delicious, fragrant, and good for people of all ages.<br>Prepared by a chef. The recipe can be obtained from instances.
desc_caiyao10202=The taste is a bit salty and quite fresh. The soup is white and thick. The meat is soft and fat. The bamboo shoots are fragrant and tender. In general, the taste is quite rich. <br>Prepared by a chef. The recipe can be obtained from instances.
desc_caiyao10203=Pan-fried eel is a simple everyday homemade dish. The main ingredients are eel slices. They are good to refill energy. <br>Prepared by a chef. The recipe can be obtained from instances.
desc_caiyao10204=Sour, spicy, fresh, tender. The dish is famous. <br>Prepared by a chef. The recipe can be obtained from instances.
desc_caiyao10207=Made from cabbages grown in the northern area. Light in flavor, rich in fragrance, thick in soup. This is a refreshing dish, that is neither oily nor greasy. <br>Prepared by a chef. The recipe can be obtained from instances.
desc_caiyao10206=It's simple to cook this dish, but you must pick fresh ingredients. It's both delicious and nutritious. <br>Prepared by a chef. The recipe can be obtained from instances.
desc_caiyao10205=Well stewed meat, combined with tender and smooth tofu. The dish is tasty and of low cost. <br>Prepared by a chef. The recipe can be obtained from instances.
desc_caiyao10208=Tofu with green onions is a everyday homemade dish. It's tasty, nutritious, and of a low cost.<br>Prepared by a chef. The recipe can be obtained from instances.
desc_caiyao10209=This dish drives away the heat and foul, and brings back joy and energy. It's quite refreshing. <br>Prepared by a chef. The recipe can be obtained from instances.
desc_caiyao10210=Chinese agaric with yam is a tasty dish of the Han people. It has a fresh taste and is full of nutrition. <br>Prepared by a chef. The recipe can be obtained from instances.
desc_caiyao10211=The soup is white and thick. The meat is fat and tender. The taste is fresh and rich. <br>Prepared by a chef. The recipe can be obtained from instances.
desc_caiyao10212=Simmered eggplant is soft, and a bit of both salty and sweet. It is a common everyday dish. <br>Prepared by a chef. The recipe can be obtained from instances.
desc_caiyao10213=Langya Candy is pretty even in thickness, as thin as paper. It will melt as soon as you put it in mouth. It's delicate and pure. <br>Prepared by a chef. The recipe can be obtained from instances.
desc_caiyao10214=Seasoned lettuce is simple to cook. It's fresh and tender, and is a very healthy dish. <br>Prepared by a chef. The recipe can be obtained from instances.
desc_caiyao10215=Spicy and sour cabbage is easy to cook. It's fresh and crunchy. You can taste both sour and spicy flavors. <br>Prepared by a chef. The recipe can be obtained from instances.
desc_item_20170818_atsxmsp_0=Fragment of Heavenly Steed. During event, players can go to the "Nine" icon, enter the "Wander Jianghu for Divine Horse" interface, and use this item to light up diagrams. <br>Players can got o Suzhou Yun Xiao (430, 798) to exchange Snow Lotus Pills.
desc_box_20170818_atsxmsp=Right click to open
desc_box_20170818_atsxmsp_1=A package that contains Fragments of Heavenly Steed. Open it to obtain <font color="#FFFF00">1 Fragment of Heavenly Steed</font>.
desc_box_card_324_1=Crimson Cloud Golden Outfit Firework
desc_box_card_324=Right click to get 1 outfit lore card <font color="#FFB428">Crimson Cloud Golden Outfit</font> and 1 outfit design of your gender.
desc_tab_b_head_193_b_0=A fine design for those who have bought the Crimson Cloud Golden Outfit. You can use the design to change the appearance of your Jianghu outfit. Go to <font color="#99cc00">dressing room</font> to change the appearance of your gears. <br><font color="#96a0c8">If the design is in your bag, right click to collect it into the dressing room. Then the design can be used for infinite times and will not disappear. Unbound gears will become bound, if you use this design to change its appearance.</font>
desc_tab_g_head_193_b_0=A fine design for those who have bought the Crimson Cloud Golden Outfit. You can use the design to change the appearance of your Jianghu outfit. Go to <font color="#99cc00">dressing room</font> to change the appearance of your gears. <br><font color="#96a0c8">If the design is in your bag, right click to collect it into the dressing room. Then the design can be used for infinite times and will not disappear. Unbound gears will become bound, if you use this design to change its appearance.</font>
desc_box_card_326_1=Wind comes by the lotus, the spring season comes by the river bank. Wee would like to become the love birds in the heaven pond, and fly together over the blue clouds.
desc_box_card_326=Right click to get 1 cape lore card <font color="#FFB428">"Green Cloud Shadow"</font>.
desc_box_card_327_1=Cherry blossoms fall as the spring season comes to an end. The flower petals look like flying golden pink butterflies.
desc_box_card_327=Right click to get 1 cape lore card <font color="#FFB428">"Peerless Phantom"</font>.
desc_box_card_328_1=
desc_box_card_328=When the pet is summoned, the player can recover 5 Flying Skill points per second when using Sit and Breathe. <br><font color="#ff0000">Tips: When Age of Wushu Record Tier 2 is available, players who own a Familiar and have reached Flows With Chi can talk to the Guide in Beast Villa to join the faction. (Coordinates: Beggar's Sect 589 853)</font> <br>Right click to use the pet Bai Ling'er.
desc_pet_peacock_gensui_0=<font color="#ff0000">Right click to move the pet into the collection interface.</font> <br><font color="#ff0000">Attention: When the pet is in the collection interface, it cannot be taken out and is bound to the player. If the pet has a time limit, it will be deleted automatically when the time is up.</font> <br>The Bai Ling'er follows the player around upon being summoned. When the player uses Sit and Breathe, 5 Flying Skill points will be recovered each second. <br><font color="#ff0000">Tips: When Age of Wushu Record Tier 2 is available, players who own a Familiar and have reached Flows With Chi can talk to the Guide in Beast Villa to join the faction. (Coordinates: Beggar's Sect 589 853)</font>
desc_xueweitool_0501_xmp001_0=One of the martial arts classics written based on the medical tantra Lingshu. When read by a martial arts practitioner, the reader can instantly gain insight and unclog the meridian channels of the body, and eventually open up <font color="#FFCC00">Shang Yang</font>, the <font color="#FFCC00">first</font> acupoint of the <font color="#FFCC00">Yang Brightness Large Intestine Hand</font>. <br>Cultivation points required for usage: <font color="#FFFF00">500000</font>
desc_xueweitool_0502_xmp001_0=One of the martial arts classics written based on the medical tantra Lingshu. When read by a martial arts practitioner, the reader can instantly gain insight and unclog the meridian channels of the body, and eventually open up <font color="#FFCC00">Er Jian</font>, the <font color="#FFCC00">second</font> acupoint of the <font color="#FFCC00">Yang Brightness Large Intestine Hand</font>. <br>Cultivation points required for usage: <font color="#FFFF00">1000000</font>
desc_xueweitool_0503_xmp001_0=One of the martial arts classics written based on the medical tantra Lingshu. When read by a martial arts practitioner, the reader can instantly gain insight and unclog the meridian channels of the body, and eventually open up <font color="#FFCC00">He Gu</font>, the <font color="#FFCC00">third</font> acupoint of the <font color="#FFCC00">Yang Brightness Large Intestine Hand</font>. <br>Cultivation points required for usage: <font color="#FFFF00">1500000</font>
desc_xueweitool_0504_xmp001_0=One of the martial arts classics written based on the medical tantra Lingshu. When read by a martial arts practitioner, the reader can instantly gain insight and unclog the meridian channels of the body, and eventually open up <font color="#FFCC00">Pianli</font>, the <font color="#FFCC00">fourth</font> acupoint of the <font color="#FFCC00">Yang Brightness Large Intestine Hand</font>. <br>Cultivation points required for usage: <font color="#FFFF00">2000000</font>
desc_xueweitool_0505_xmp001_0=One of the martial arts classics written based on the medical tantra Lingshu. When read by a martial arts practitioner, the reader can instantly gain insight and unclog the meridian channels of the body, and eventually open up <font color="#FFCC00">Shou San Li</font>, the <font color="#FFCC00">fifth</font> acupoint of the <font color="#FFCC00">Yang Brightness Large Intestine Hand</font>. <br>Cultivation points required for usage: <font color="#FFFF00">2500000</font>
desc_xueweitool_0506_xmp001_0=One of the martial arts classics written based on the medical tantra Lingshu. When read by a martial arts practitioner, the reader can instantly gain insight and unclog the meridian channels of the body, and eventually open up <font color="#FFCC00">Qu Chi</font>, the <font color="#FFCC00">sixth</font> acupoint of the <font color="#FFCC00">Yang Brightness Large Intestine Hand</font>. <br>Cultivation points required for usage: <font color="#FFFF00">3000000</font>
