desc_jiezhi_ph_05_0=On July 7th in the lunar calendar, a breeze comes around. <br>The setting sun and the floating clouds make a beautiful scene, like in a painting and like in a poem. <br>Magpies pick up jade pieces, and create the river of stars. <br>The bridge and the couple in the fairytale shall be like this. <br>Use it to quickly teleport to your spouse.
