desc_yaopin10256=Ancient recipe sacred pill. Products can help calm mind, and are popular among martial art people.
desc_yaopin10257=Jianghu sacred pill. The materials have to be collected before morning dew disappears, thus the pill gets the name of Wind Dew.
desc_yaopin10258=Jianghu sacred pill. It's made from extracts of hundred flowers, thus the pill has a refreshing fragrance.
desc_yaopin10259=Jianghu sacred pill. The taste of half processed pill is bitter, but after fully processed, the pill has a light fragrance of osmanthus.
desc_yaopin10260=Sacred pill recorded in the Snowland special recipe. It is icy cold, and has the effect to soothe meridians.
desc_yaopin10261=Sacred pill made based on ancient method. It can strengthen the body.
desc_yaopin10262=Wulin valuable sacred pill. It can strengthen the foundation, and is very helpful for martial art people.
desc_duyao30006=Evil mysterious pill. It can stimulate meridians, and lead to a sudden increase in breath.
desc_duyao30007=Evil mysterious pill. It can stimulate the inner of martial art people and make them strong for a short while.
desc_duyao30008=Jianghu mysterious pill. Its taste is strong. It can stimulate the meridians, and lead to a sudden increase in brawn.
desc_duyao30009=Weird herbal powder. It has a mysterious fragrance, and can catch people's attention. It can help people stay focused for a short while.
desc_ng_booktag_mj_002_rm_fc=Ming Cult legendary internal skill. It was created by an elder hiding at the top of snowy mountain peak. It was a set of methods to induce Yang fire to resist extreme cold. In his later years the elder was invited to Ming Cult and spread this mental skill to the disciples.
desc_ng_booktag_mj_002_jj_fc=Ming Cult legendary internal skill. It was created by an elder hiding at the top of snowy mountain peak. It was a set of methods to induce Yang fire to resist extreme cold. In his later years the elder was invited to Ming Cult and spread this mental skill to the disciples.
desc_ng_booktag_mj_002_zj_fc=Ming Cult legendary internal skill. It was created by an elder hiding at the top of snowy mountain peak. It was a set of methods to induce Yang fire to resist extreme cold. In his later years the elder was invited to Ming Cult and spread this mental skill to the disciples.
desc_ng_booktag_mj_002_rm_fc_0=The diagram records Sunburst Skill level 1 to 9. Read it to learn Sunburst Skill - Novice. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Only Ming Cult players can use it.</font>
desc_ng_booktag_mj_002_jj_fc_0=The diagram records Sunburst Skill level 10 to 18. Read it to learn Sunburst Skill - Apprentice. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Only Ming Cult players who have learned Sunburst Skill - Novice can use it.</font>
desc_ng_booktag_mj_002_zj_fc_0=The diagram records Sunburst Skill level 19 to 30. Read it to learn Sunburst Skill - Student. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Only Ming Cult players who have learned Sunburst Skill - Apprentice can use it.</font>
