desc_SC_ITEMBAG_taosha_1=A heavy item box, crafted by an expert craftsman. It looks ordinary, but is in fact of special structure. It can expand inventory by 18 slots.
desc_SC_EQUIPBAG_taosha_1=A heavy equipment box, crafted by an expert craftsman. It looks ordinary, but is in fact of special structure. It can expand inventory by 18 slots.
desc_SC_ITEMBAG_taosha_1_8=A heavy item box, crafted by an expert craftsman. It looks ordinary, but is in fact of special structure. It can expand inventory by 18 slots.
desc_SC_EQUIPBAG_taosha_1_8=A heavy equipment box, crafted by an expert craftsman. It looks ordinary, but is in fact of special structure. It can expand inventory by 18 slots.
desc_taosha_zhuanyong_001_1=When in riding mode <font color="#3299CC">[Right click to equip saddle]</font>
desc_taosha_fuzhu_001_1=After use, you will gain some boost effects for internal attributes <br>(Breath +28, Spirit +28, Stamina +28, Internal Critical Value +138, Internal Accuracy Value +214, Dodge Value +214, Hard Defense +183, Yang Defense +183, Yin Defense +183, Soft Defense +183, Internal Skill Defense +21, Ignore Internal Skill Defense +21, Internal Critical Damage +14%, Critical Damage Received reduced by 14%)
desc_taosha_fuzhu_001=Right click to use.
desc_taosha_fuzhu_002_1=After use, you will gain some boost effects for external attributes <br>(Brawn +28, Resilience +138, Dexterity+18, Stamina +28, External Critical Value +138, External Accuracy Value +138, Dodge Value +214, Hard Defense +183, Yang Defense +183, Yin Defense +183, Soft Defense +183, Internal Skill Defense +21, Ignore Internal Skill Defense +21, External Critical Damage +14%, Critical Damage Received Reduced by 14%)
desc_taosha_fuzhu_002=Right click to use.
desc_anqi_taosha_001_0=Throw this at an enemy. It will deal normal damage. <font color="#00ff00">You can have 3 hidden weapons at a time.</font>
desc_anqi_taosha_002_0=Throw the lantern oil bottle at a target within 10 meters range. The target will be slowed by 50%, and will get the debuff <font color="#f9fc00">lantern oil</font>. <br>It will last 10 seconds.<font color="#00ff00">You can have 3 hidden weapons at a time.</font>
desc_anqi_taosha_003_0=Set fire on a target within 10 meters range. For 10 seconds, the target will lose 100 HP per 2 seconds. <br>If the target has <font color="#f9fc00">lantern oil</font> debuff, then it will <font color="#f9fc00">burn</font> the target: For 20 seconds, the target will lose 2% HP per 2 seconds, and <font color="#FF3030">location will be exposed</font> on map.<font color="#00ff00">You can have 3 hidden weapons at a time.</font>
desc_anqi_taosha_004_0=Throw the hidden weapon at a target within 30 meters. The target will be <font color="#f9fc00">stunned</font> for 5 seconds. <font color="#00ff00">You can have 3 hidden weapons at a time.</font>
desc_anqi_taosha_005_0=Throw at a target within 30 meters. The target will be <font color="#f9fc00">knocked off mount</font>. And for 15 seconds, the target <font color="#f9fc00">can not mount</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">can not use Flying Skills</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You can have 3 hidden weapons at a time.</font>
desc_anqi_taosha_006_0=Throw the hidden weapon at a target within 30 meters. For 10 seconds, the target will be <font color="#f9fc00">slowed</font>, and <font color="#f9fc00">Accuracy of the target is significantly reduced</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You can have 3 hidden weapons at a time.</font>
desc_anqi_taosha_007_0=Use special method to stimulate acupoint around your own eyes. For 10 seconds, it significantly <font color="#f9fc00">increases your Accuracy</font>, and <font color="#f9fc00">exposes disguise effect of Dragon Secret Pill</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You can have 3 hidden weapons at a time.</font>
desc_anqi_taosha_008_0=Within 30 meters, you can seriously damage an enemy. For 1 minute, the target will lose 5% HP per 10 seconds. <br>When the effect ends, <font color="#f9fc00">Hidden Power will explode</font>: If the enemy has less than 50% HP left, then the enemy will directly be <font color="#FF3030">seriously injured</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You can have 3 hidden weapons at a time.</font>
desc_anqi_taosha_009_0=Within 30 meters, if the target is seriously injured, then an item from the <font color="#f9fc00">equipment slots</font> will randomly <font color="#FF3030">drop</font>, and its previous effect on the target will be removed. <font color="#00ff00">You can have 3 hidden weapons at a time.</font>
desc_anqi_taosha_010_0=Within 30 meters, if the target is seriously injured, then an item from the <font color="#f9fc00">task slots</font> will randomly <font color="#FF3030">drop</font>, and its previous effect on the target will be removed. <font color="#00ff00">You can have 3 hidden weapons at a time.</font>
desc_anqi_taosha_011_0=Within 30 meters, an item from the <font color="#f9fc00">equipped items</font> will randomly <font color="#FF3030">drop</font>, and its previous effect on the target will be removed. <font color="#00ff00">You can have 3 hidden weapons at a time.</font>
desc_yaopin_taosha_001_1=After use, you will gain "Stop Bleeding": For 12 seconds, <font color="#FFAE00">you heal 10% HP per 3 seconds</font>. Once you are attacked, the effect will be removed.
desc_yaopin_taosha_002_1=After use, you will <font color="#FFAE00">immediately recover 50% HP</font>.
desc_yaopin_taosha_003_1=After use, you will gain "Serenade the Moon": For 12 seconds, <font color="#FFAE00">you heal 10% energy per 3 seconds</font>. Once you are attacked, the effect will be removed.
desc_yaopin_taosha_004_1=After use, you will <font color="#FFAE00">immediately recover 50% energy</font>.
desc_yaopin_yaoji_001_1=After use, you will become <font color="#FF3030">hidden from others</font>, and clear Hatred. If you attack or get attacked, you will be <font color="#FFAE00">exposed</font>. The effect lasts 40 seconds. If you are affected by <font color="#f9fc00">Clear the Disguise</font>, you will not be able to use this.
desc_yaopin_yaoji_002_1=After use, you will immediately recover 100 <font color="#f9fc00">flying points</font>.
