desc_item_gqhd_sjlp_001_1=How to get Double Festival Token: During the event period, VIP players who have reached "Untapped Potential" can visit the Event Ambassador Lin Liang in any of the main cities to receive "Double Festival Celebration Gift Bag". Open it to receive one Double Festival Celebration Token. The token can be used to <font color="#FF3030">exchange for exquisite gifts from Lin Liang.</font>
