desc_item_gqhd_sjlp_002_1=How to get Double Festival Return Token: During the event period, VIP players can visit the Event Ambassador Lin Liang in any of the main cities to receive Colorful Holiday Quest. Upon completion one Double Festival Return Token will be given. The token can be used to <font color="#FF3030">exchange for exquisite gifts from Lin Liang.</font>
desc_item_gqhd_sjlp_002=Double Festival Return Token
