ui_jysg_richeng=Nine Yang Ultimate Skill Cultivation Progress
desc_jysg_title_001=Nine Yang Ultimate Skill Preview
desc_jysg_title_002=Cultivation Rules
desc_jysg_title_003=Chapter 1 The Siege of Evil Sect
desc_jysg_title_004=Chapter 2 Healing in the Flower Valley
desc_jysg_title_005=Chapter 3 Ancient Tomb Cultivation
desc_jysg_text_001=Participation Requirement:
desc_jysg_text_002=Only players who have Nine Yang Order are qualified to cultivate Nine Yang Ultimate Skill.
desc_jysg_text_003=How to get Nine Yang Order:
desc_jysg_text_004=On the day before cultivation time starts, at 20:00 server time, treasure boxes will appear near Maple Forest, Huanxiu Mountain Villa,
desc_jysg_text_005=Relic of Wu Nation King Tomb in Suzhou; West Mountain Hunting Ground, Yanjing Agile Cavalry Camp, Dongfang Family Village in Yanjing;
desc_jysg_text_006=Rat Gate, White Horse Temple, Mang Mountain Imperial Mausoleum in Luoyang; Kema Market,
desc_jysg_text_007=East Suburb, Beggar's Sect's Area in Chengdu; The treasure boxes have a chance of containing
desc_jysg_text_008=Nine Yang Order. (Treasure boxes exists 4 hours)
desc_jysg_text_009=Event Rules:
desc_jysg_text_010=All servers that have reached Age of Wushu Record Tier 2 are eligible to cultivate Nine Yang Ultimate Skill. Everyday
desc_jysg_text_011=3 servers are picked for this event.
desc_jysg_text_012=Registration Rules:
desc_jysg_text_013=On the starting day of the event after 20:50 server time players who have Nine Yang Order can go to
desc_jysg_text_014=Bai Xiaosheng (166,-46) in Yanjing to register. Registration time lasts 9 minutes. After
desc_jysg_text_015=the registration time is over players have 1 minute of preparation time. (Can invite players for help) Event officially starts at 21:00.
desc_jysg_text_060=The max level available for cultivation is limited by the progress of Age of Wushu Record. Age of Wushu Record Tier 2 can be studied up to level 3.
desc_jysg_text_061=Age of Wushu Record Tier 3 to level 6, Age of Wushu Record Tier 4 to level 8, Age of Wushu Record Tier 5 to level 10,
desc_jysg_text_062=Age of Wushu Record Tier 6 to level 12. (Levels of cultivation are calculated based on available Cultivation Points)
desc_jysg_text_063=When cultivated level has reached the limit correspondent to Age of Wushu Record, registration
desc_jysg_text_064=will be denied.
desc_jysg_text_016=Intruder Summoning Rules:
desc_jysg_text_017=After the event begins all players satisfying the strength requirement will be invited.
desc_jysg_text_018=The first 100 players who have accepted will be transported to event server to interfere with
desc_jysg_text_019=the learning of Nine Yang Ultimate Skill.
desc_jysg_text_020=Intruder Setting:
desc_jysg_text_021=The invited players will receive pre-modified NPCs to use in the battle. The NPCs' power
desc_jysg_text_022=is given randomly and it can't be used to participate in any other activities in the server.
desc_jysg_text_023=Win/Lose Judgment:
desc_jysg_text_024=The cultivator wins if the defense against intruders is successful. Else the intruders win.
desc_jysg_text_025=Cultivator's Reward:
desc_jysg_text_026=Receive 20 free perfusion and cultivation comprehension points after winning.
desc_jysg_text_059=Receive 10 free perfusion points and Nine Yang Training Pill after losing.
desc_jysg_text_029=Assistant Reward:
desc_jysg_text_032=Intruder Reward:
desc_jysg_text_035=Synopsis:
desc_jysg_text_036=Nine Yang Ultimate Skill is the most treasured martial arts script of Taoism. It is rumored to be written by Quanzhen founder Lu Chunyang.
desc_jysg_text_037=Few were successful in its comprehension. The script was lost during the war years with Yuan dynasty and only recently was recovered by Quanzhen successor Chi Yangzi,
desc_jysg_text_038=from the hands of western region evil sects.
desc_jysg_text_039=Now those infuriated sects are all after Chi Yangzi. As a last resort the Nine Yang Orders are being handed out.
desc_jysg_text_040=The one possessing the order is qualified to study the Nine Yang Ultimate Skill.
desc_jysg_text_041=Chapter Opening:
desc_jysg_text_042=The holder of Nine Yang Order doesn't have enough Cultivation Points to cultivate first level.
desc_jysg_text_043=Story Objective:
desc_jysg_text_044=Activate five-colors array eye
desc_jysg_text_045=Keep Chi Yangzi alive
desc_jysg_text_046=Server Reward:
desc_jysg_text_047=Intruder Reward:
desc_jysg_text_048=Chi Yangzi was ambushed by foreign region experts and heavily injured. He is now recovering in Flowers Valley.
desc_jysg_text_049=The rumors of Nine Yang Ultimate Skill have been circulating in Jianghu since the last battle with those evil sects.
desc_jysg_text_050=As a result many people have gathered around Flowers Valley
desc_jysg_text_051=and they are up to no good.
desc_jysg_text_052=There is blood in the air.
desc_jysg_text_053=The holder of Nine Yang Order doesn't have enough Cultivation Points to cultivate fourth level.
desc_jysg_text_054=Protect the Yuanyang Grass until it is ripe
desc_jysg_text_055=Use the Yuanyang Grass to heal Chi Yangzi
desc_jysg_text_056=Nine Yang Ultimate Skill Comprehension
desc_jysg_text_057=Talk to Bai Xiaosheng (166,-46) in Yanjing to take you to Chi Yangzi for comprehension
desc_jysg_text_058=Cultivation Points and silver are needed for Nine Yang Ultimate Skill comprehension.
desc_jysg_text_065=After taking the Yuanyang Grass at Flowers Valley, Chi Yangzi not only is fully recovered,
desc_jysg_text_066=but also made a major martial arts breakthrough. However practicing the Nine Yang Ultimate Skill has imbued his body with too much Yang energy,
desc_jysg_text_067=and the balance of Yin Yang is at risk. To solve this problem, he went to Ancient Tomb Sect in Yanjing
desc_jysg_text_068=so he could use the Yin energy from the tomb to balance the abundant Yang energy in his body.
desc_jysg_text_069=Many people of Jianghu are closing in behind him, and are plotting to steal the treasured script.
desc_jysg_text_071=Disperse the redundant Yin energy
desc_item_jiuyangling_001_0=<font color="#00ff00">A mysterious token. Made of precious metal and warm all year round. It's rumored to be connected to the whereabouts of Nine Yang Ultimate Skill. Many people are fighting for it</font>. <font color="#FF3030">It's rumored that Quanzhen successor Chi Yangzi left this token in Jianghu. Whoever holds this token can go to Bai Xiaosheng (166, -46) in Yanjing to find out the whereabouts of Chi Yangzi and learn Nine Yang Ultimate Skill.</font>
