desc_item_jysg_ssbb_001_0=A miraculous pill made with elaborate care. <font color="#FF3030">Recharge 100 flying points after use. (If Deity's Assistance of Wild Shot Fist is learned, using this pill will add one stack. Else only flying points will be recharged)</font>
desc_box_lzy_tiguan_dual_zc001_0=Right-click to open and receive reward according to current progress of Age of Wushu Record. <br>Age of Wushu Record Tier 1-3:<font color="#FFFF00"> 50,000 Cultivation Points, 50,000 Cultivation Perfusion. </font><br>Age of Wushu Record Tier 4-6:<font color="#FFFF00"> 80,000 Cultivation Points, 80,000 Cultivation Perfusion.</font>
desc_box_lzy_tiguan_dual_gpcj001=Right-click to open and receive one random Ancient Script Fragment.
desc_box_lzy_tiguan_dual_phb001_0=Right-click to open and receive <font color="#FFFF00">Title "Peerless Dragon Head" (7 Days), Colorful Majestic Robe (7 Days), 1 Martial Arts Treasure Box. </font><br>Receive reward according to current progress of Age of Wushu Record. <br>Age of Wushu Record Tier 1-3:<font color="#FFFF00"> 350,000 Cultivation Perfusion. </font><br>Age of Wushu Record Tier 4-6:<font color="#FFFF00"> 600,000 Cultivation Perfusion. </font><br>After the activation of Age of Wushu Records - Pirate Raid, you can additionally get: <font color="#FFFF00">Dragon Head Points (25).</font>
desc_box_lzy_tiguan_dual_phb002_0=Right-click to open and receive <font color="#FFFF00">Title "Guaranteed Success" (7 Days), 1 Martial Arts Treasure Box.</font><br> Receive reward according to current progress of Age of Wushu Record. <br>Age of Wushu Record Tier 1-3:<font color="#FFFF00"> 300,000 Cultivation Perfusion. </font><br>Age of Wushu Record Tier 4-6:<font color="#FFFF00"> 450,000 Cultivation Perfusion. </font><br>After the activation of Age of Wushu Records - Pirate Raid, you can additionally get: <font color="#FFFF00">Dragon Head Points (20).</font>
