desc_box_lzy_tiguan_dual_gpcj001_1=Right-click to use
desc_faculty_yanwu_lzyltzb001_0=Medicine made to improve martial arts. Especially effective to skills currently being cultivated. <br>After using it, it will add<font color="#FFFF00"> 10000 </font>Cultivation Points to the currently cultivated martial arts skill<br> (Can only be used if you are practicing <font color="#FFCC00">Golden Snake Sword</font>, <font color="#FFCC00">Eight Diagram Blade</font>).
desc_origin_tiguan_1_1=Heaven Net Cult costume.<br> Buddha won't save me. I will save Buddha.
desc_origin_tiguan_2_1=Tianwaitian costume.<br> Sword slashes out of the sky. God walks without a trace.
desc_origin_tiguan_3_1=Lord Qin's Residence costume.<br> The sky is a tent and earth is a carpet. I sleep with the sun, the moon, and the stars.
desc_origin_tiguan_4_1=Suyun Palace costume.<br> A lavish and meaningless life is just like clouds passing over your eyes.
tiguan_talk_shp_001=Thanks for saving me. I have told you how to defeat the enemy and I hope it will help you. Good bye.
tiguan_talk_shp_002=Who dares come make trouble in Tianwaitian and destroy our stone array? Defend against the enemy, disciples!
task_tiguan_npc_event_shp_002=Those evil women destroyed my home and locked me here because they want to find my family heirloom. I haven't learned any martial arts or roamed in Jianghu, but my ancestors recorded the weaknesses of those evil women martial arts. Help me out of here and I will tell you how to easily defeat them.
menu_tiguan_npc_event_shp_002_1_1=Stay calm. I will help you. But how will you escape by yourself?
title_tiguan_npc_event_shp_002_1_1=Don't worry. As long as you keep those she-devils busy I won't have trouble escaping this place. Good bye.
tiguan_npc_event_shp_002_1_1_1=Take care.
