desc_item_jysg_xlds_001_0=Miracle pill of Wulin. Refined by using 81 kinds of pure yang creatures and radiates with warmth. It works wonders for Nine Yang cultivators. Players can obtain it from Nine Yang Ultimate Skill Cultivation victory reward. Using this pill will cost <font color="#00ff00">300 Liang</font> and Nine Yang Ultimate Skill cultivation point will be increased by <font color="#00ff00">3</font>.<font color="#FF3030"> (If available silver in the bag is less than 300 Liang then the pill will be unusable.)</font>
desc_yaopin_yaoji_003_1=Miracle pill of Snowland. After use commands the force of ice and snow to remove all <font color="#f9fc00">Dragon Secret Medicine</font> fade out effect within 25 meters for 2 seconds and disables all affected targets from using <font color="#f9fc00">Dragon Secret Medicine</font> for 15 seconds.
desc_yaopin_yaoji_003=Miracle pill of Snowland
