desc_box_drop_ding_xyts_qmzl=Open it to receive <br><font color="#00ff00">Age of Wushu Record Tier 1, 2: 5 Mount Tianshan Snow Lotus, 10 Purple Spirit Pill, 20 Five Aggregates And Demon-Subduing Item, 1 Package Box, 100 Repairing Tools, 5 Ten Fragrance Life Returning Pill, 1 Rushing Cloud (7 days), 1 Snowland Assassin (Permanent) </font><br><font color="#00ff00">Age of Wushu Record Tier 3, Advanced School Skill: 10 Mount Tianshan Snow Lotus, 20 Purple Spirit Pill, 50 Five Aggregates And Demon-Subduing Item, 1 Package Box, 200 Repairing Tools, 5 Ten Fragrance Life Returning Pill, 1 Rushing Cloud (7 days), 1 Snowland Assassin (Permanent) </font><br><font color="#00ff00">Age of Wushu Record Tier 4 Internal, 6: 15 Mount Tianshan Snow Lotus, 30 Purple Spirit Pill, 100 Five Aggregates And Demon-Subduing Item, 1 Package Box, 300 Repairing Tools, 5 Ten Fragrance Life Returning Pill, 1 Rushing Cloud (7 days), 1 Snowland Assassin (Permanent) </font><br><font color="#00ff00">Age of Wushu Record Tier 5 Internal, Eight Schools: 20 Mount Tianshan Snow Lotus, 50 Purple Spirit Pill, 150 Five Aggregates And Demon-Subduing Item, 1 Package Box, 400 Repairing Tools, 5 Ten Fragrance Life Returning Pill, 1 Rushing Cloud (7 days), 1 Snowland Assassin (Permanent) </font><br><font color="#00ff00">Age of Wushu Record Tier 6 Internal, 7: 20 Mount Tianshan Snow Lotus, 50 Purple Spirit Pill, 200 Five Aggregates And Demon-Subduing Item, 1 Package Box, 500 Repairing Tools, 5 Ten Fragrance Life Returning Pill, 1 Rushing Cloud (7 days), 1 Snowland Assassin (Permanent)</font>
desc_item_20171105bq_xia_1_0=After using, player's label changes to <font color="#f9fc00">Heroic</font> and the label <font color="#f9fc00">decreases one level</font>. (Check the details in <font color="#f9fc00">Self-Alignment</font> of <font color="#f9fc00">Jianghu Alignment</font>)<br>Can only use it when the Alignment Value reaches 200.
