desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jh_liusha03_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Steady Accumulation - Red Land</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. The charging of this skill becomes faster.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Red Land] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jh_liusha09_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Sand Tornado - Red Land</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. Lifts non-parrying enemy into the sky upon hit.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Red Land] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jh_liusha08_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Deadly Quicksand - Red Land</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Decreases the in-land target's internal defense by 20%.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Red Land] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jh_cyjf02_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Chi of the Returning Sword - Dusk</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. When Blazing Sword is activated you can pass 4 Blazing Chi to your enemy.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Dusk] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jh_cyjf05_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Grievous Lament - Dusk</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. When Blazing Sword is activated you can pass 4 Blazing Chi to your enemy.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Dusk] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jh_cyjf06_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">The Red Dragon - Dusk</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. If the enemy does not parry, it will be imbued with 2 stacks of Blazing Sword, and the pyre will be created even if the enemy is parrying.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Dusk] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jh_hyjf03_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Snow Storm - Snow Trace</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. You can knock the target into air if you have Proud Snow state.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Snow Trace] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jh_hyjf04_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Walking in the Snow - Snow Trace</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Releasing skill becomes faster. Using the skill will add you with 3 stacks of Proud Snow (The state will be added only when you've used Facing Wind and Snow).<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Snow Trace] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jh_hyjf07_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Traceless Snow - Snow Trace</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. The speed of charging and releasing skill become faster. Increases the target's fall-down duration by 1 second.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Snow Trace] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jy_dqd02_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Your Love Ends Here - Wind Drive</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. Decreases non-parrying enemy's External Defense by 15% for 7 seconds upon hit.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Wind Drive] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jy_dqd06_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Bloodlust - Wind Drive</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. The skill won't deduct the enemy's <font color="#FFAE00">"Heartless"</font> Chi upon hitting non-parrying enemy, and the last will hit will add the enemy with 5 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Heartless"</font> Chi.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Wind Drive] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jy_dqd04_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Crossing One's Heart - Wind Drive</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. The skill won't deduct the enemy's <font color="#FFAE00">"Heartless"</font> Chi upon hitting non-parrying enemy, and you will add the enemy with full stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Heartless"</font> Chi if you break the enemy's parry successfully.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Wind Drive] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_sl_lhq02_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Wild Horse Chases the Wind - Buddha's Rage</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br/>Slightly increases skill damage. The dash of the skill becomes faster.<br><font color="#FF0000"> Activate in Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Use Conditions:<br><font color="#FFFF00"> Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_sl_lhq03_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Yellow Bull Turns a Horn - Buddha's Rage</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br/>Slightly increases skill damage. Every level of the skill can throw enemies away when breaking parrying successfully. The height of throwing increases with the skill level.<br><font color="#FF0000"> Activate in Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Use Conditions:<br><font color="#FFFF00"> Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_sl_lhq06_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Kasyapa's Smile - Buddha's Rage</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br/>Skill turns to a Overt Move which can deal damage to nearby enemies and throw away the enemy without parrying.<br><font color="#FF0000"> Activate in Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Use Conditions:<br><font color="#FFFF00"> Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jh_lyjf03_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Broken Rain and Remnant Cloud - Reach Clouds</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br/>Slightly increases skill damage. The skill effect range becomes bigger.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Reach Clouds] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jh_lyjf04_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Clouds Rise and Dragon Dances - Reach Clouds</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br/>Slightly increases skill damage. Releasing skill becomes faster.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Reach Clouds] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jh_lyjf07_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Annihilation - Reach Clouds</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br/>Slightly increases skill damage. Increases times of throwing.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Reach Clouds] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jh_slbwj03_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">New Moon - Sky Extermination</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br/>During the period <font color="#FFAE00">New Moon</font>, when being attacked, there is a chance to inflict the attacker with <font color="#f9fc00">Skill Disabled</font> for 2 seconds (This effect can be triggered only once every 10 seconds). <br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jh_slbwj04_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Terrorize Souls - Sky Extermination</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br/>Slightly increases skill damage. If break enemies' parrying successfully, make them receive 25% more damage dealt by the skills of this set within 4 seconds.<br><font color="#FF0000"> Activate in Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Use Conditions:<br><font color="#FFFF00"> Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jh_slbwj06_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Collapsed Heaven and Earth - Sky Extermination</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br/>Slightly increases skill damage. Upon hitting inflicts <font color="#f9fc00">Skill Disabled</font> for 2 seconds. <br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
