desc_book_wj_combo_CS_xy_jlsd04_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Avalanche - Chase the Deer</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br/>Slightly increases skill damage. Using skill the first time can disable the target's skills for 2 seconds, using skill the second time can paralyze the target for 2 seconds.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Chase the Deer] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_xy_jlsd06_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Raging Flame - Chase the Deer</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br/>If you have less than 3 stacks of Raging Flame state, using the skill will straightly give you 3 stacks of Raging Flame state.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Chase the Deer] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_xy_jlsd07_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Skyfall - Chase the Deer</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br/>Slightly increases skill damage. If you have 3 or more stacks of Raging Flame state, using the skill will consume 3 stacks of Raging Flame state to knock down the target.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Chase the Deer] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
