desc_item_cy2017_cyg_0=Increases inner cultivation speed by 200% for 1 hour after use. (Can also be used to exchange for items with Elder Four-Arts in Chengdu (955,791)).
desc_item_cy2017_zyct_0=Increases experience conversion speed by 200% for 1 hour after use. (Can also be used to exchange for items with Elder Four-Arts in Chengdu (955,791)).
desc_item_cy2017_zyg_0=Ask Jiu Jiu (under a tree at Wang's Cattle Farm in Jinling 1284,382) to exchange it for ingredients to make Double Ninth Cake (Event) or Cornel Tea Soup (Event).
desc_item_cy2017_zyh_0=Gather a certain amount to exchange them for items with Elder Four-Arts in Chengdu (955,791).
desc_box_cy2017_zyz_1=Right-click to use
desc_box_cy2017_zyz=Open to receive 1-5 Cornel Fruit (Event) and also have a chance to receive 1 Cornel Flower (Event).
desc_useitem_cyjhd_juhuajiu_0=Use it to increase <font color="#00ff00">all attributes by 30</font>, lasts <font color="#00ff00">1 hour</font><br>. Can also be used to exchange for items with Elder Four-Arts in Chengdu (955,791).
desc_useitem_cyjhd_jhqc_0=Use it to <font color="#00ff00">increase inner cultivation speed by 300%</font>, lasts <font color="#00ff00">1 hour</font>.
desc_useitem_cyjhd_jhhb_0=Can exchange for items with <font color="#00ff00">Jiu Jiu at Jinling (1284,382)</font>.
desc_home_jy_jt_01_sm=Aged Daughter's Wine with tempting aroma. The jar is signed "Lu" on the bottom. Makes one wonder about its history.
desc_home_jy_jt_02_sm=Fine wine is poured into fine cups during the feast. The musicians playing pipa set a good mood for the party. The soldiers are ready to fight for their country. We must be happy today and maybe even sleep on the battlefield drunk. Because for this war, no one have plans of coming back.
desc_home_jy_wg_01_sm=A common crock. Maybe use it to make pickles?
desc_home_jy_wg_02_sm=So many crocks. If they are all used to make pickles there will be enough to last a whole year!
desc_home_jy_sb_01_sm=Fresh chrysanthemum on the first level and fresh tea on the second level. Where to put the lentils? I heard there are shelves with three layers!
desc_home_jy_sb_02_sm=Ah… Three layers. You are one layer more than two layers. Shelf with three layers are the best!
desc_home_jy_sj_01_sm=I heard sleeping on a rope can make you pretty!
desc_home_jy_zt_01_sm=Steamed lamb, steamed bear paws, steamed deer tail, roasted duck...
desc_home_jy_jj_01_sm=Fine wine needs a fine cup just like a beauty needs her lover.
desc_home_jy_tdm_01_sm=Oh, the ubiquitous God, please protect my land!
desc_home_jy_qs_01_sm=Flowers can talk but are troublesome. Stones are silent but pleasant.
desc_home_jy_sg_01_sm=A big black water tank.
desc_home_jy_sg_02_sm=A water tank made of gold. Owned by only the wealthy.
desc_home_jy_ymwqj_01_sm=A heavy looking black weapon shelf.
desc_home_jy_ymwqj_02_sm=Clouds fly over the sea and the dragon swallows mercury. Wind smashes the cliff and the tiger leaps to lead.
desc_home_jy_tree_01_sm=Green cedar trees are like a house and red flower bushes are like its walls.
desc_home_jy_tree_02_sm=The pine tree stands steady on the cliff and does not budge to the cold winds from the valley.
desc_home_jy_tree_03_sm=Two trees born together and connected forever.
desc_home_jy_tree_04_sm=Lights are everywhere on the night of the Lantern Festival. The gates are opened and the stone bridge outside are painted red. The horses kick away dust as the people gather and the moon shows up.
desc_home_jy_penzai_02_sm=Don't bend under pressure.
desc_home_jy_cyb_01_sm=Simple but finely made. Useful both indoors and outdoors.
desc_home_jy_cyb_02_sm=Simple but finely made. Useful both indoors and outdoors.
desc_home_jy_cyb_03_sm=Simple but finely made. Useful both indoors and outdoors.
desc_home_jy_cyb_04_sm=Simple but finely made. Useful both indoors and outdoors.
desc_home_jy_cyb_05_sm=Lavishly designed. Useful both indoors and outdoors.
desc_home_jy_cyb_06_sm=Lavishly designed. Useful both indoors and outdoors.
desc_home_light_zhiwu_01_sm=This lamp looks delicious!
desc_home_light_zhiwu_02_sm=You think it's a mushroom, but actually...
desc_home_jy_wdwz_01_sm=It's rumored to be made by master She Wenhao. This dummy can withstand any weapon, and it can be used to practice martial arts by the most elite fighters.
desc_home_jy_wdwz_02_sm=It's rumored to be made by master She Wenhao. This dummy can withstand any weapon, and it can be used to practice martial arts by the most elite fighters.
desc_home_jy_wdwz_03_sm=It's rumored to be made by master She Wenhao. This dummy can withstand any weapon, and it can be used to practice martial arts by the most elite fighters.
desc_home_jy_wdwz_04_sm=It's rumored to be made by master She Wenhao. This dummy can withstand any weapon, and it can be used to practice martial arts by the most elite fighters.
desc_home_yi_tree_01_sm=Reminds me of my past days on the swing. My lost youth!
desc_home_yi_tree_02_sm=A colorful past roaming Jianghu on a horse. We are full of energy and hope when we were young.
desc_home_yi_qqb_01_sm=I tried long and hard to find him. I turn my head and miraculously see him.
desc_condition_29448=It's not event period, you are not Jianghu VIP, you haven't left beginners' protection, or you are under Life Skill Protection.
desc_condition_29449=It's not event period, you are not Jianghu VIP, you haven't left beginners' protection, or you are under Life Skill Protection. Unable to collect.
