desc_box_card_345=Right-click to receive 1 Lore item <font color="#FFB428">General Heng</font>.
desc_box_card_345_1=A bully in town.
desc_box_card_346=Right-click to receive 1 Lore item <font color="#FFB428">Finding Qing Chen</font>.
desc_box_card_346_1=If I fell asleep while drunk you can leave. Come back tomorrow with the piano if you want and we continue the party.
desc_box_card_347=Right-click to receive 1 Lore item <font color="#FFB428">Red Devil</font>.
desc_box_card_347_1=How pitiful to be interested in demons and not in people.
desc_box_card_348=Right-click to receive 1 Lore item <font color="#FFB428">Day Devil</font>.
desc_box_card_348_1=The sun and moon drowns in the ocean. The devil lives among us in the day.
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_gb_dgbf02_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Swipe the Dog's Back - Demented</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br/>Slightly increases skill damage. Upon hitting non-parrying enemy, this skill will deduct the enemy's 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Taunt</font> to inflict <font color="#f9fc00">Skill Disabled</font> for 3 seconds.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Demented] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_gb_dgbf07_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Flip the Dog Upside-Down - Demented</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. Skill now can be used in the air. If the skill is interrupted, then within 3 seconds, enemies who try to attack you will be <font color="#f9fc00">Disarmed</font> for 3 seconds.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Demented] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_gb_dgbf08_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">No Dogs Under Heaven - Demented</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. Upon hitting non-parrying enemies, <font color="#f9fc00">Disable their Flying Skills</font> for 2 seconds.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Demented] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_wd_tjq06_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">The Wyvern Leaves The Sea - Inaction</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br/>Slightly increases skill damage. Skill now can be used in the air. If you use the skill within 5 seconds of a successful block, you can also <font color="#f9fc00">Knock Down</font> enemies without parrying.<br><font color="#FF0000"> Activate in Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Use Conditions:<br><font color="#FFFF00"> Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_wd_tjq08_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Opening The Tai Chi - Inaction</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br/>Slightly increases skill damage. Increases skill effective range by 1 meter.<br><font color="#FF0000"> Activate in Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Use Conditions:<br><font color="#FFFF00"> Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_wd_tjq03_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Two Peaks Through One's Ears - Inaction</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br/>Slightly increases skill damage. If break enemies' parrying successfully, inflict them with <font color="#f9fc00">Skill Disabled</font> for 3 seconds.<br><font color="#FF0000"> Activate in Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Use Conditions:<br><font color="#FFFF00"> Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_sl_lzs04_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Conserve the Scarce - Telepathy</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br/>Each stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Incomplete</font> also decreases the target's Internal Skill Conversion by 10 points.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Telepathy] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_sl_lzs06_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Chasing Shadow - Telepathy</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br/>Slightly increases skill damage. The skill can knock down airborne target regardless of parrying, and deals additional damage.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Telepathy] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_sl_lzs07_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Throat Strike - Telepathy</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br/>Slightly increases skill damage. The last hit will inflict <font color="#FFAE00">Incomplete</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">Void</font> to the non-parrying enemy.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Telepathy] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jh_ldg02_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Cry of the Bow - Arrow Wind</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. Instantly adds a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Bow's Cry</font> to target. When skill is changed into 3-shot mode and hits a non-parry target it will clear most of target's <font color="#f9fc00">Damage Reduction</font>.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Arrow Wind] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jh_ldg05_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Cloud Piercing Arrow - Arrow Wind</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. Increase <font color="#f9fc00">Stiffness</font> effect by 1 second. If skill is interfered <font color="#f9fc00">Knock Back</font> all nearby targets.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Arrow Wind] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jh_ldg01_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Arrow Sky - Arrow Wind</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. Skill changes into 25 meter single target hit. After successful break parry gives self <font color="#f9fc00">Arrow Rain</font>, accuracy is greatly increased.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Arrow Wind] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
