desc_zhenqi_item_005_0=This is a medicine for cultivating Meridians, which can enhance people's Chi. <font color="#FFFF00">You can only use it when cultivating Accumulating Chi to Tanden Meridians</font>.<br><font color="#ff0000">This item can be sold.</font>
desc_teamfaculty_event_01_0=Great pill at upgrading skills, with special affect on current skill cultivation.<br>After using this pill, when cultivating adds <font color="#FFFF00">8000</font> cultivation points to currently cultivating skills. The side effect is will increase the group practice fatigue.<br><font color="#3299CC">Overuse might result in the pill backfire, so when fatigue is full, you are forbidden to use it.</font>
desc_faculty_event_01_0=A medicine for increasing martial arts skills, especially effective for the skill you are cultivating now. <br>Use it to increase <font color="#FFFF00">8000</font> Cultivation Conversion at most.
desc_faculty_event_02_0=A medicine for increasing martial arts skills, especially effective for the skill you are cultivating now. <br>Use it to increase <font color="#FFFF00">10000</font> Cultivation Conversion at most.
desc_faculty_event_02_4_0=A medicine for increasing martial arts skills, especially effective for the skill you are cultivating now. <br>Use it to increase <font color="#FFFF00">10000</font> Cultivation Conversion at most.
desc_faculty_event_02_b_0=A medicine for increasing martial arts skills, especially effective for the skill you are cultivating now. <br>Use it to increase <font color="#FFFF00">10000</font> Cultivation Conversion at most.
desc_faculty_event_02_c_0=A medicine for increasing martial arts skills. <br>It can increase at most <font color="#FFFF00">10,000</font> Cultivation Converting for current cultivating skill.
desc_faculty_event_02_5_0=A medicine for increasing martial arts skills, especially effective for the skill you are cultivating now. <br>Use it to increase <font color="#FFFF00">10000</font> Cultivation Conversion at most (Can be obtained from Xu Family Manor's event. You can use at most 20 of it every week).
desc_teamfaculty_xld_box01_1=Brocade Bag with <font color="#FFFF00">10</font> <font color="#F9FC00">Xiaolian Pills</font>.<br>After using the Xiaolian Pills, it will add up to <font color="#FFFF00">8,000</font> points of Cultivation Conversion to your current Martial Cultivation. Side effects include added fatigue in the day's Team Practice.
desc_faculty_event_02_1_0=A medicine for increasing martial arts skills, especially effective for the skill you are cultivating now. <br>Use it to increase <font color="#FFFF00">10000</font> Cultivation Conversion at most.
desc_faculty_event_02_2_0=Gift from a strange man, it will recover lost strength and potential.<br>Adds up to <font color="#FFFF00">10,000</font> Cultivation to the current cultivating skill.
desc_item_clone_exchange_sl_0=An iron puppet with delicately crafted mechanisms. Can sit or stand, punch or kick, laugh or cry, be active or calm, and have different expressions. There are tiny words carved on it. The fine lines can still be clearly seen. <br>Shaolin disciples can exchange it for the manual of <font color="#FF3030">Dragon Claw</font> at Shaolin <font color="#FF3030">Force Transmitting Elder (721, 375)</font>. (Disciples who bear the title "Jianghu VIP" can receive a discounted exchange)
desc_item_clone_exchange_wd_0=Tai Chi created two forces, the two forces created four forms, the four forms presented eight diagrams, the Seal of Tai Chi is a continued whole. <br>Wudang disciples can trade it with <font color="#FF3030">Force Transmitting Elder (369, 334)</font> for the manual of <font color="#FF3030">Tai Chi Fist</font> at Wudang. (Disciples who bear the title "Jianghu VIP" can receive a discounted exchange)
desc_item_clone_exchange_em_0=The painting of the woman in the scroll is graceful and life-like, with an unhidden melancholy clouding her brow, her movements are elegant, with a martial arts feel, but she is difficult to decipher. <br>Emei disciples can trade it with <font color="#FF3030">Force Transmitting Elder (277, 111)</font> for the manual of the <font color="#FF3030">Virgin Blade</font> at Emei. (Disciples who bear the title "Jianghu VIP" can receive a discounted exchange)
desc_item_clone_exchange_jz_0=This ancient text is by an unknown author and covers a diverse range of subjects from music to calligraphy, and astrology to medicine. <br>Scholar's Academy disciples can trade it with <font color="#FF3030">Force Transmitting Elder (542, 453)</font> for the manual of <font color="#FF3030">Jade Flute Swordsmanship</font> at Scholar's Academy. (Disciples who bear the title "Jianghu VIP" can receive a discounted exchange)
desc_item_clone_exchange_gb_0=This was a gift from the old emperor to thank the Beggar's Sect for their heroic deeds and to pray for the continued peace of the people. <br>Beggar's Sect disciples can trade it with <font color="#FF3030">Force Transmitting Elder (619, 224)</font> for the manual of <font color="#FF3030">Dog Beating Staff Technique</font> at Beggar's Sect. (Disciples who bear the title "Jianghu VIP" can receive a discounted exchange)
desc_item_clone_exchange_tm_0=Tangmen is fair in both rewards and punishments. To those who did well, the rewards are generous; for those who failed, the punishments are harsh. Such is the law of Tangmen. <br>Tangmen disciples can trade it with <font color="#FF3030">Force Transmitting Elder (1067,-133)</font> for the manual of <font color="#FF3030">Hell King Patch</font> at Tangmen. (Disciples who bear the title "Jianghu VIP" can receive a discounted exchange)
desc_item_clone_exchange_jy_0=The content is complex and almost undecipherable. It is extremely difficult to understand. Possibly a special code is needed to understand its meaning. <br>Royal Guard disciples can exchange it for the manual of <font color="#FF3030">Executioner's Blade</font> at <font color="#FF3030">Force Transmitting Elder (354,-126)</font> at the Royal Guards . (Disciples who bear the title "Jianghu VIP" can receive a discounted exchange)
desc_item_clone_exchange_jl_0=It appears to be a copy of the original. The fragments are incomplete. It can be vaguely seen as a manual for forging unparalleled weaponry. There is also an accompanying martial arts manual. <br>Wanderer's Valley disciples can exchange it for <font color="#FF3030">Lethal Thirteen Swords</font> manual at <font color="#FF3030">Force Transmitting Elder (134,42)</font> in Wanderer's Valley. (Disciples who bear the title "Jianghu VIP" can receive a discounted exchange)
desc_faculty_event_02_3_0=A medicine for increasing martial arts skills, especially effective for the skill you are cultivating now. <br>Use it to increase <font color="#FFFF00">10000</font> Cultivation Conversion at most.
desc_kuafu_bcitem003_0=A medicine for increasing martial arts skills, especially effective for the skill you are cultivating now. <br>Use it to increase <font color="#FFFF00">500</font> Cultivation Conversion at most.
desc_additem_0022_0=A medicine for increasing martial arts skills, especially effective for the skill you are cultivating now. <br>Use it to increase <font color="#FFFF00">7500</font> Cultivation Conversion at most.
desc_additem_0023_0=A medicine for increasing martial arts skills, especially effective for the skill you are cultivating now. <br>Use it to increase <font color="#FFFF00">12000</font> Cultivation Conversion at most.
desc_additem_0024_0=A medicine for increasing martial arts skills, especially effective for the skill you are cultivating now. <br>Use it to increase <font color="#FFFF00">20000</font> Cultivation Conversion at most.
desc_duyao31001=Increase external and internal attack accuracy by 20%, external defense decreases by 500, internal defense decreases by 50, Duration: 20 seconds.
desc_faculty_yanwu_01_0=Enhances the efficacious medicine with martial arts skills, and is especially effective with those who currently cultivating martial arts skills. <br>After using it, it will add <font color="#FFFF00">5000 </font>cultivation points for those currently studying martial arts skills.<br>(Can only be used if you practice the following internal skills) <br><font color="#FFB428">Tier 1 School Internal Skills </font><br><font color="#FFB428">Self Recollection Skill</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Chi of Three Purities (< level 36)</font>
desc_faculty_yanwu_02_0=Enhances the efficacious medicine with martial arts skills, and is especially effective with those who currently cultivating martial arts skills. <br>After using it, it will add <font color="#FFFF00">5000 </font>cultivation points for those currently studying martial arts skills.<br>(Can only be used if you practice the following internal skills) <br><font color="#FFB428">Tier 2 or below Internal Skills</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Self Recollection Skill</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Chi of Three Purities (< level 51)</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Ice Chi</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Twenty-Four Secrets of the Golden Lock (< level 36)</font>
