desc_teamfaculty_event_05_0=Great pill at upgrading skills, with special affect on current skill cultivation.<br>After using this pill, when cultivating adds <font color="#FFFF00">4000</font> cultivation points to currently cultivating skills. The side effect is will increase the group practice fatigue.<br><font color="#3299CC">Overuse might result in the pill backfire, so when fatigue is full, you are forbidden to use it.</font>
desc_faculty_yanwu_xekx_1_0=Enhances the efficacious medicine with martial arts skills, and is especially effective with those who currently cultivating martial arts skills. <br>After using it, it will add <font color="#FFFF00">10000 </font>cultivation points for those currently studying martial arts skills.<br>(Only for use by those studying the first 30 levels of  internal skill <font color="#FFCC00">Icy Heart Manual</font>, <font color="#FFCC00">Executioner's Blade Scripture</font>, <font color="#FFCC00">Chaotic Origin</font>, and <font color="#FFCC00">Poisonous Toad Technique</font>.)
desc_faculty_yanwu_xekx_2_0=Enhances the efficacious medicine with martial arts skills, and is especially effective with those who currently cultivating martial arts skills. <br>After using it, it will add <font color="#FFFF00">10000 </font>cultivation points for those currently studying martial arts skills.<br>(Only for use by those studying the first 36 levels of  internal skill <font color="#FFCC00">Icy Heart Manual</font>, <font color="#FFCC00">Executioner's Blade Scripture</font>, <font color="#FFCC00">Chaotic Origin</font>, and <font color="#FFCC00">Poisonous Toad Technique</font>.)
desc_faculty_yanwu_tq_1_0=A medicine for increasing martial arts skills, especially effective for the skill you are cultivating now. <br>Use it to increase <font color="#FFFF00">20000</font> Cultivation Conversion at most.
desc_faculty_yanwu_gld01_0=Special medicine for upgrading current cultivating skills.<br>Use it and you can at most add <font color="#FFFF00">10000</font> cultivation points to currently cultivating skills.<br>(You can use it for cultivating each school's <font color="#FFCC00">Tier 3 and lower tier Internal Skills</font> only.)
desc_faculty_yanwu_qiandao_01_0=This miraculous medicine helps players recover strength. <br>When using this, you compensate for a loss of internal skill cultivation. It can increase the first internal skill cultivation for all schools by <font color="#FFFF00">10,000 </font>cultivation points.
desc_faculty_yanwu_qiandao_02_0=This miraculous medicine helps players recover strength. <br>When using this, you compensate for a loss of internal skill cultivation. It can increase the first and second internal skill cultivations for all schools by <font color="#FFFF00">10,000 </font>cultivation points.
desc_faculty_yanwu_qiandao_03_0=This miraculous medicine helps players recover strength. <br>When using this, you compensate for a loss of internal skill cultivation. It can increase the first, second, third and fourth (Available at Tier Five Internal Skill Stage) internal skill cultivations for all schools by <font color="#FFFF00">10,000 </font>cultivation points.
desc_faculty_event_02_new_2_0=Gift from a strange man, it will recover lost strength and potential.<br>Adds up to <font color="#FFFF00">10,000</font> Cultivation to the current cultivating skill.
desc_faculty_yanwu_tg_1_0=Enhances the efficacious medicine with martial arts skills, and is especially effective with those who currently cultivating martial arts skills.  <br>After using it, it will add <font color="#FFFF00">10000 </font>cultivation points for those currently studying martial arts skills.<br>(Only for use by those studying the first 3 Levels of the <font color="#FFCC00">Mantis Fists</font>, <font color="#FFCC00">Demon Sting</font>, <font color="#FFCC00">Endless Evil Fist style Jianghu</font> routines)
