desc_faculty_yanwu_jzsj_01_0=The secret pill formula of the Golden Needle Sect can enhance the martial arts level and is especially effective for martial art practitioners.  <br>After using it, it will add <font color="#FFFF00">50000 </font>cultivation points for those currently studying martial arts skills.
desc_item_force_004_0=The 88 Buddhas are the lords of penance for all beings in Buddhism. People can tell them of their repentance and changed evil desires. Ancient law stipulates that 108 ceremonies are required to read "The Text of Repentance". (Collect 1 to exchange for a whole book at Jinling Lingxu (Enlightened One). <font color="#ff0000">(1151.544) </font>This item can be obtained once a day through completing the quests)
desc_item_force_005_0=During the Spring and Autumn Period, Laozi wrote that respect is the primary essence of Taoism. The spirit of Taoism is philosophical and focuses on the forces of extremes such as the cultivation of one mind, sitting in forgetfulness, and acceptance. (Collect 1 to exchange for a whole book at Jinling Lingxu (Enlightened One). <font color="#ff0000">(1151.544) </font>This item can be obtained once a day through completing the quests)
desc_item_force_006_0=The body and mind cultivation masterpiece passed on during the Warring States Period was written by Guiguzi. It describes the philosophy where the spirit is that of the heavens, and appearance is that of the beholder. (Collect 1 to exchange for a whole book at Jinling Lingxu (Enlightened One). <font color="#ff0000">(1151.544) </font>This item can be obtained once a day through completing the quests)
