desc_faculty_wqzn_01_0=A medicine for increasing martial arts skills, especially effective for the skill you are cultivating now. <br>Use it to increase <font color="#FFFF00">1000</font> Cultivation Conversion at most.
desc_shaolin_panshi_03=School betrayal requirements: <br>Tier 2 Internal Skill is available<br>Not an acting grandmaster, <br>deacon, or elder<br>Not leaving faction for further training, or under disguise<br>It has been over 30 days since the last time you betrayed a faction.
desc_xiashan=Wander outside the school
desc_shaolin_xiashan_02=Jianghu related: <br>Through training away from factions, you can join the new factions of Jianghu, such as the <a href="findnpc_new,city05,xjz_021" style="HLStype1">Xu Family Manor</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,city05,WorldNpc100048" style="HLStype1">Golden Needle Sect</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school02,wssz_132" style="HLStype1">Beast Villa, </a>etc. I have no news regarding to the hidden factions. You need to find out about them in Jianghu yourself.
desc_shaolin_xiashan_03=Leaving faction for further training requirements: <br>Tier 2 internal Skill is active.<br>Not an Acting Grandmaster, Deacon or Elder in the school.<br>Not betraying school, or under disguise<br>It has been more than 30 days since the last time betrayed a faction.<br>Level reaches Peak of Power.
desc_shaolin_xiashan_05=Compensation for training away from school: <br>Players will have all of their martial arts strengths returned to the previous level before they left the previous faction. Of course, you can obtain extra precious items during your training quest. You may make a small fortune.
desc_shaolin_yirong_02=Jianghu related: <br>By going away from factions in disguise, you can join the new factions of Jianghu, such as the<a href="findnpc_new,city05,xjz_021" style="HLStype1"> Xu Family Manor</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,city05,WorldNpc100048" style="HLStype1">Golden Needle Sect</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school02,wssz_132" style="HLStype1">Beast Villa</a>, etc. I have no news regarding to the hidden factions. You need to find out about them in Jianghu yourself.
desc_shaolin_yirong_04=Punishment of disguise:<br>Delete identity title of the school.<br>Delete some tasks of the school.<br>Cannot betray, go downhill, or disguise again within 30 days.
desc_emei_panshi_03=School betrayal requirements: <br>Tier 2 Internal Skill is available<br>Not an acting grandmaster, <br>deacon, or elder<br>Not leaving faction for further training, or under disguise<br>It has been over 30 days since the last time you betrayed a faction.
desc_emei_xiashan_02=Jianghu related: <br>Through training away from factions, you can join the new factions of Jianghu, such as the <a href="findnpc_new,city05,xjz_021" style="HLStype1">Xu Family Manor</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,city05,WorldNpc100048" style="HLStype1">Golden Needle Sect</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school02,wssz_132" style="HLStype1">Beast Villa, </a>etc. I have no news regarding to the hidden factions. You need to find out about them in Jianghu yourself.
