desc_tangmen_panshi_06=Tangmen:<br>You may return at any time. Find <a href="findnpc_new,school05,tm089" style="HLStype1">Tang Huan</a> to betray. If you betray and were not a disciple of any faction, you will become a vagrant and live a life without factions.
