desc_gaibang_yirong_02=Jianghu related: <br>By going away from factions in disguise, you can join the new factions of Jianghu, such as the<a href="findnpc_new,city05,xjz_021" style="HLStype1"> Xu Family Manor</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,city05,WorldNpc100048" style="HLStype1">Golden Needle Sect</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school02,wssz_132" style="HLStype1">Beast Villa</a>, etc. I have no news regarding to the hidden factions. You need to find out about them in Jianghu yourself.
desc_gaibang_yirong_04=Punishment of disguise:<br>Delete identity title of the school.<br>Delete some tasks of the school.<br>Cannot betray, go downhill, or disguise again within 30 days.
desc_jilegu_panshi_03=School betrayal requirements: <br>Tier 2 Internal Skill is available<br>Not an acting grandmaster, <br>deacon, or elder<br>Not leaving faction for further training, or under disguise<br>It has been over 30 days since the last time you betrayed a faction.
desc_jilegu_panshi_06=Wanderer's Valley:<br>If you wish to return you can at anytime. Speak with <a href="findnpc_new,school04,jlg093" style="HLStype1">Xu Tangci</a> to betray. If you betray and were not a disciple of any faction, you will become a vagrant and live a life without factions.
desc_jilegu_xiashan_02=Jianghu related: <br>Through training away from factions, you can join the new factions of Jianghu, such as the <a href="findnpc_new,city05,xjz_021" style="HLStype1">Xu Family Manor</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,city05,WorldNpc100048" style="HLStype1">Golden Needle Sect</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school02,wssz_132" style="HLStype1">Beast Villa, </a>etc. I have no news regarding to the hidden factions. You need to find out about them in Jianghu yourself.
