desc_junzitang_panshi_06=Scholars:<br>If you want to return, you may at any time. Speak with <a href="findnpc_new,school03,JZTNPC150" style="HLStype1">Wu Qingyun</a> to betray. If you choose to betray and are not a disciple of any faction, you will become a vagrant and live a life without factions.
