desc_jinyiwei_panshi_03=Requirements for Betraying School: <br>Tier 2 Internal Skill is available. <br>Not an Acting Headmaster in the school. <br>Not a Deacon in the school. <br>Not an Elder in the school. <br>Not in an ongoing training-away task. <br>Not in an ongoing disguise task. <br>Has been more than 30 days since you left a school last time.
