desc_yihuagong02=The treasured clothes from Palace of Shifting Flowers, fresh and beautiful. Palace Lord Token and Young Master Token can be used to exchange for it at Pavilion Leader Ziliao. <font face="Default" color="#FFFAFA" >(Palace Costume, no identity limit. You can wear it even when you leave the faction.) </font><font color="#ff6600">Don't wear it when you finish apprenticeship or betray the school.</font>
desc_yaopin91003_1=Increases Brawn by 65 and Critical Hit Rate by 5%. <br>Lasts one hour.
desc_duyao91003_1=Decreases Internal and External Crit Rate by 3%, increases Dodge Rate by 33%, increases Dexterity by 7. <br>Lasts 20 seconds. <br>Made by Poison Maker.
