desc_tianti_special_003_0=Extra Times: increases the maximum number of Sky Ladder Times for the current day by <font color="#3299CC">1</font>. The effect will be nullified at midnight of the current day. Cooldown: 3 minutes. Can by purchased from the<font color="#EEEE00"> Sky Ladder Merchant</font> in Suzhou.<br><font color="#ff0000">Can only be used between 14:01 and 21:50</font>
