desc_home_sd_new_04_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Lamp<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>200<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Home Size reaches level 1<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Area: </font>No limit<br>A crescent lamp, looks like a moon when lighted up at night. <br>Right-click lantern to turn it on or off.<br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_sd_new_03_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Chair<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>200<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Home Size reaches level 1<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Area: </font>No limit<br>Delicate stone stool, can be used as both footstool and lamp. <br>You will get Cultivation Points when resting on the stool. The effect differs according to the quality of the stool. The cooldown is 6 hours. Players will get the buff every 12 hours.<br>When the Home durability is less than half, the effect will be decreased. <br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
