desc_jysg_text_072=In Ancient Tomb, Sage Chiyang intended to combine the yin chi from the tomb and the yang chi from himself.
desc_jysg_text_073=It was messed up by some people. Sage Chiyang took in too much yin chi.
desc_jysg_text_074=He had no choice but had to use his own cultivation to suppress the yin chi by force. Then he headed to Chilly Wind Valley.
desc_jysg_text_075=Even though he managed to escape, some soldiers were still chasing him.
desc_jysg_text_076=The situation was rather dangerous.
desc_jysg_text_077=Nine Yang Token holder does not have enough cultivation points to cultivate level 11.
desc_jysg_text_079=As the battle in Chilly Wind Valley ended, Sage Chiyang successfully defeated his mind demon.
desc_jysg_text_080=Even though the process was dangerous, Sage Chiyang managed to gain a lot despite of the challenge and now had a clear understanding of the special skill.
desc_jysg_text_081=Sage Chiyang had everything ready. He just had to activate Nine Yang chi to pass through the meridians.
desc_jysg_text_082=Then the special skill would be fully done.
desc_jysg_text_083=At the same time, numerous jianghu experts can't hold back anymore.
desc_jysg_text_084=They decided to take away the mysterious script. The final battle is on.
desc_jysg_text_085=Nine Yang Token holder have enough cultivation points to cultivate level 11.
desc_jysg_text_086=Help Sage Chiyang to activate meridians.
