desc_gn_Procon_new_01_0=It's said to be the remaining materials when firewash platforms are forged into valuable items. Experienced craftsmen recycle it to forge strong and light items, which can be used to change internal attribute of gold and jade equipments. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Can be used to change internal attribute of Class 3 Gold and Jade Equipments. </font><br><font color="#3299CC">Ways to obtain: expert points.</font>
