desc_blade_sjy_50301=Normal military blade. Plain looks. Pretty sharp.
desc_blade_sjy_50401=Normal military blade. Blade back is thick, and blade edge is thin. Powerful when being wielded.
desc_blade_sjy_50501=Made of good quality iron. Only the ones with strong arms can wield it.
desc_blade_sjy_50601=Made of cold iron from the northern area. The blade edge has a icy glow. Quite heavy.
desc_blade_sjy_50701=Sharp weapon. Made of a mix of iron and coal. Decorated with gold. Very powerful.
desc_blade_sjy_50801=Famous treasure blade. There are blood patterns on the blade body, which gives the blade killing chi.
desc_gun_sjy_50301=Special military spear, with a wooden handle and iron ends on both sides.
desc_gun_sjy_50401=Special military spear, made of pure iron and with saw shape edge on both ends.
desc_gun_sjy_50501=Famous military spear. Made of iron. It has two wings at the spear end. Extreme sharp.
desc_gun_sjy_50601=Famous military spear. Has a silver glow. The edge is shaped like wolf fang. Can deal serious damage.
desc_gun_sjy_50701=Crafted by famous military craftsmen. Made of many different metals and stones. The tip can even cut through iron and rocks.
desc_gun_sjy_50801=Made of divine iron. Decorated with gold. With it, one can dominate in the battlefield.
