npc_shenji_panshi_2_1_1=Betray the School
npc_shenji_panshi_2_2_1=Graduate and return to Ming Cult. (If you have not reached the 10th identity, then you will need Shenji Camp Graduation Certificate.)
npc_shenji_panshi_2_3_1=Graduate and return to Jianghu. (If you have not reached the 10th identity, then you will need Shenji Camp Graduation Certificate.)
menu_npc_shenji_panshi_1_1=I want to leave Shenji Camp.
title_npc_shenji_panshi_1_1=Leaving Shenji Camp will lead to punishment.
menu_npc_shenji_panshi_2_1=I want to betray my school.
title_npc_shenji_panshi_2_1=Betrayal will reduce levels of your Shenji Camp internals, skill sets, and miscellaneous skills. If you have done Shenji Camp Origin quest, then your Ming Cult skills will be deleted. Do you confirm to betray?
menu_npc_shenji_panshi_2_2=I want to graduate and return to Ming Cult.
title_npc_shenji_panshi_2_2=After you graduate, your Shenji Camp skill sets will be kept, and your Shenji Camp miscellaneous skills will be removed. Are you sure to graduate?
menu_npc_shenji_panshi_2_3=I'd like to leave and return to the world at large.
title_npc_shenji_panshi_2_3=After you graduate, your Shenji Camp skill sets will be kept, and your Shenji Camp miscellaneous skills will be removed. If you have done Shenji Camp Origin quest, then your Ming Cult skills will be deleted. Do you confirm to graduate?
desc_item_nmp_cspz_shenji_0=Certificate for Shenji Camp members below 10th identity to graduate.
npc_shenji_panshi_2_2_2=Graduate and return to Ming Cult. <font color="#FF0000">(If you have not reached the 10th identity, then you will need Shenji Camp Graduation Certificate.)</font>
