desc_tbook_CS_jh_cqgf01_1st_notfc=Take a feint movement.  Wave your fist in the air and the strength will hit the enemy before your fist touches him.
desc_tbook_CS_jh_cqgf02_1st_notfc=Heavy attack with Chi, strong and powerful.
desc_tbook_CS_jh_cqgf03_1st_notfc=Stand steady and raise your arms to deflect enemy attacks. Once activated, this skill will be used automatically when you defend.
desc_tbook_CS_jh_cqgf04_1st_notfc=Chi is fierce and devastating. With it one can hit the enemy in the twinkling of an eye.
desc_tbook_CS_jh_cqgf05_1st_notfc=A quick flurry of powerful attacks.
desc_tbook_CS_jh_cqgf06_1st_notfc=This is a common kung fu stance using both the hands and legs that can intimidate the inexperienced.
desc_tbook_CS_jh_cqgf07_1st_notfc=Wild roar, explosive potential. The mountains tremble as you deter provoke fear in the enemy.
