desc_tbook_CS_jh_cqgf0109_notfc_1=Take a feint movement.  Wave your fist in the air and the strength will hit the enemy before your fist touches him.
desc_tbook_CS_jh_cqgf0209_notfc_1=Heavy attack with Chi, strong and powerful.
desc_tbook_CS_jh_cqgf0309_notfc_1=Stand steady and raise your arms to deflect enemy attacks. Once activated, this skill will be used automatically when you defend.
desc_tbook_CS_jh_cqgf0409_notfc_1=Chi is fierce and devastating. With it one can hit the enemy in the twinkling of an eye.
desc_tbook_CS_jh_cqgf0509_notfc_1=A quick flurry of powerful attacks.
desc_tbook_CS_jh_cqgf0609_notfc_1=This is a common kung fu stance using both the hands and legs that can intimidate the inexperienced.
