task_newmp_sjy_njxl_001=Recently there are a group of mysterious assassins who aim for Shenji Camp disciples. Lure them out through this dangerous training. The assassins are quite strong. Make good use of the Shenji Cannons to defeat them.
task_newmp_sjy_njxl_002=Shenji Camp is a military base. It is normally well guarded. But right now most of the soldiers went out to train. I suspect some assassins sneaked in camp. Go and have a check.
sjyzc_swdy_001=We are ready.
sjyzc_swdy_002=You are ready. Let's start. (Keep in mind that you are a team.)
sjyzc_swdy_003=Yes
swdy_sjy_tj_001=You do not meet the requirement and can not be teleported.
desc_jn_sjy_huopao=Fire
