njxl_sjy_dyjd_001=Assassins appear near (-17, 43). Use fire cannon to defeat them.
newmp_sjy_njxl_002=Wu Sheng (Camp Guarding Envoy)
sjyzc_njxl_001=Is there anything I can help with?
sjyzc_njxl_002=After the training starts, I will hide fire cannon near platform. Don't go too far away from there. And to make it realistic, I will disable your skills for now. Understood?
sjyzc_njxl_003=Understood. Let's start.
