desc_ng_book_jm_13=Study this book to activate <font color="#44ff44">Yin Heel Vessel - Hidden</font>. <br><font color="#FFFF00">The Yin and Yang Heel Vessel - Hidden Age of Wushu Record must have been activated.</font>
desc_ng_book_jm_13_1=All people have eight meridians. These meridians are all of Yin attribute. Yang attribute is required to balance and activate those meridians.
