desc_item_2017ch_zgqh_001_0=Jade pendant that represents jianghu status. Use it to obtain the title [Spear Ghost].
desc_box_2017hd_zgqh_001_1=Right click to use
desc_box_2017hd_zgqh_001=Open it to receive the following. <br><font color="#00ff00">Age of Wushu Record Tier 1 and 2 Internal: 5 Tianyuan Soul-Gathering Pills, 5 Refined Moon Internal Skill Pills, 1 Package Box, 200 Repairing Tools, 30 Hero Tokens, 1 Horse Whistle - Juedi (15 Days), and 1 permanent title [Spear Ghost].</font> <br><font color="#00ff00">Age of Wushu Record Tier 3 Internal and Advanced School Skill: 10 Tianyuan Soul-Gathering Pills, 10 Refined Moon Internal Skill Pills, 1 Package Box, 200 Repairing Tools, 60 Hero Tokens, 1 Horse Whistle - Juedi (15 Days), and 1 permanent title [Spear Ghost].</font> <br><font color="#00ff00">Age of Wushu Record Tier 4 Internal and Class 6 Equipment: 15 Tianyuan Soul-Gathering Pills, 15 Refined Moon Internal Skill Pills, 1 Package Box, 300 Repairing Tools, 90 Hero Tokens, 1 Horse Whistle - Juedi (15 Days), and 1 permanent title [Spear Ghost].</font> <br><font color="#00ff00">Age of Wushu Record Tier 5 Internal and Eight Subsects: 20 Tianyuan Soul-Gathering Pills, 20 Refined Moon Internal Skill Pills, 1 Package Box, 400 Repairing Tools, 120 Hero Tokens, 1 Horse Whistle - Juedi (15 Days), and 1 permanent title [Spear Ghost].</font> <br><font color="#00ff00">Age of Wushu Record Tier 6 Internal and Class 7 Equipment: 20 Tianyuan Soul-Gathering Pills, 30 Refined Moon Internal Skill Pills, 1 Package Box, 500 Repairing Tools, 150 Hero Tokens, 1 Horse Whistle - Juedi (15 Days), and 1 permanent title [Spear Ghost].</font>
role_title_4160=Spear Ghost
