desc_box_guj_hd_kxxxr_001_1=Sign-in Reward (1). <br> Jianghu VIP players can open it to get <font color="#FFFF00">1 Snow Lotus, 3 Hunyuan Pills (1 Day), and 1 Activity Token</font>. <br>Young Master VIP players can in addition get <font color="#FFFF00">1 Activity Token</font>.
