desc_box_lzy_zgjh001_1=A package with abundant rewards. Based on different Age of Wushu Records, the amount may vary. <br><font color="#00ff00">1st internal stage: 1 Snow Lotus Fruit, 20 Shenji Tokens, 5 Bai Xiaosheng's Weapon Manuals (Superior). </font><br><font color="#00ff00">2nd internal stage: 2 Snow Lotus Fruits, 40 Shenji Tokens, 10 Bai Xiaosheng's Weapon Manuals (Superior). </font><br><font color="#00ff00">3rd internal stage: 3 Snow Lotus Fruits, 60 Shenji Tokens, 20 Bai Xiaosheng's Weapon Manuals (Superior). </font><br><font color="#00ff00">4th internal stage: 3 Snow Lotus Fruits, 80 Shenji Tokens, 40 Bai Xiaosheng's Weapon Manuals (Superior). </font><br><font color="#00ff00">5th internal stage: 4 Snow Lotus Fruits, 100 Shenji Tokens, 60 Bai Xiaosheng's Weapon Manuals (Superior). </font><br><font color="#00ff00">6th internal stage: 5 Snow Lotus Fruits, 120 Shenji Tokens, 80 Bai Xiaosheng's Weapon Manuals (Superior). </font>
