home_sd_17new_01=Stars in the Dream
desc_home_sd_17new_01_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Lamp. <br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>200. <br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Home Size reaches level 1. <br>Right-click lantern to turn it on or off. <br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
home_sd_17new_02=Cuddling Bear
desc_home_sd_17new_02_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Chair. <br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>200. <br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Home Size reaches level 1. <br>A flurry bear. <br>Using the Cuddling Bear will increase cultivation speed within a certain time. The item's cool down is 6 hours. The player's cool down is 12 hours. <br>When the durability of the falcon is below half, the effect will be affected. <br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
home_sd_17new_03=Childhood Friends
desc_home_sd_17new_03_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Chair. <br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>200. <br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Home Size reaches level 1. <br>Using the chair will gain some cultivation points. The amount gained varies depending on the quality of the chair. The item's cool down is 6 hours. The player's cool down is 12 hours. <br>When the durability of the falcon is below half, the effect will be affected. <br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
