desc_qy_item_change_1=Can get one of 5 Jackdaw Herbs, 25 Jackdaw Herbs, 55 Jackdaw Herbs, 105 Jackdaw Herbs. <br>There is a chance to get <font color="#00ff00">[Ancient Taichi] Fragment, [Ancient Dragon Claw] Fragment</font>.
qy_menu_dynew_01=Who are you? Why are you following me?
qy_title_dynew_01=I find that you have a good potential for practicing martial arts. Here is a nice thing for you. Remember to work hard on practicing. We will eventually meet again.
qy_menu_dynew_02=Hey, don't leave.
qy_menu_dynew_03=Sister Qiuhe, it's been a while. I miss you a lot. You have become more beautiful than the past.
qy_title_dynew_03=You are so sweet. I got a good thing recently. Since you made me happy, I will gift it to you.
qy_menu_dynew_04=Thank you, Sister Qiuhe. Come and visit me often.
qy_menu_dynew_05=Uncle Dandan, are you feeling better?
qy_title_dynew_05=Thank you for asking. I've got better. You helped my lord last time. My lord is very grateful and asks me to send this gift to you.
qy_menu_dynew_06=I will take it. Please pass my greetings to Mr. Qin.
qy_menu_dynew_07=Mr. Yue, I've heard a lot about you. Why are you looking for me today?
qy_title_dynew_07=It's nothing much. I just find you interesting. It shall be a good idea for this item to be at your possession.
qy_menu_dynew_08=I fine you interesting too. I trust your view.
desc_switch_961=Distribution of the new random encounter ancient fragment.
desc_shizhuang_0002_0=The proud skills from the legendary beggar Gu Qilong. They are scattered in bags around the world and wait for people to find out. <br>Items in top-rated Beggar's bags. Collect 10 and exchange them for 1 move of the Dragon Subduing Slap set at the Mysterious Beggar Gu Qilong.
desc_shizhuang_0003_0=The proud skills from the legendary beggar Gu Qilong. They are scattered in bags around the world and wait for people to find out. <br>Skill fragments in Beggar's bags. Collect 10 and find the delicious wine that the Mysterious Beggar wants, then exchange them for 1 move of Drunken Fist set at the Mysterious Beggar Gu Qilong.
