desc_pet_keji_gensui_0=<font color="#ff0000">Right-click to move the pet into the collection interface. </font><br><font color="#ff0000">Attention: When the pet is added to the collection interface, it cannot be taken out and is bound to the player. If the pet has a time limit, it will be deleted automatically when the time is up. </font><br>After summoning, Ke Xiaomeng will follow players. When players sit and breathe, they will recover 5 Flying Skill Points each second. <br><font color="#ff0000">(Tips: When the tier 2 internal skill is activated, players with a pet and at level Flows with Chi may speak with the Beast Villa Recruitment Guide to join the faction (Location: Beggar's Sect 589,853).)</font>
