desc_box_201804jq_001=Rewards from the Silent Temple. Click to open.
desc_box_201804jq_001_1=It has 1,000,000 cultivation points, universal cultivation injection pills 200,000, and main meridian 1st and 2nd acupoint tools. If you haven't learn the new flying skills Imaginary World, you will receive Imaginary World.
desc_box_201804jq_002=Rewards from the Silent Temple. Click to open.
desc_box_201804jq_002_1=It has 1,000,000 cultivation points, 3rd internal cultivation injection pills 1,000,000, and 5 Reset Vouchers. If you haven't learn the new flying skills Imaginary World, you will receive Imaginary World.
desc_box_201804jq_003=Rewards from the Silent Temple. Click to open.
desc_box_201804jq_003_1=It has 1,000,000 cultivation points, 20 Treasure Skill Reset Vouchers, and an exchange certificate for class 3 jade equipment. If you haven't learn the new flying skills Imaginary World, you will receive Imaginary World.
desc_box_201804jq_004=Rewards from the Silent Temple. Click to open.
desc_box_201804jq_004_1=It has 2,000,000 cultivation points, universal cultivation injection pills 400,000, and main meridian 3rd acupoint tool. If you haven't learn the new flying skills Imaginary World, you will receive Imaginary World.
desc_box_201804jq_005=Rewards from the Silent Temple. Click to open.
desc_box_201804jq_005_1=It has 2,000,000 cultivation points, 4th internal cultivation injection pills 2,000,000, and 10 Reset Vouchers. If you haven't learn the new flying skills Imaginary World, you will receive Imaginary World.
desc_box_201804jq_006=Rewards from the Silent Temple. Click to open.
desc_box_201804jq_006_1=It has 2,000,000 cultivation points, 30 Treasure Skill Reset Vouchers, 1 Refined Quality Binding Agent, and 1 Jade Powder. If you haven't learn the new flying skills Imaginary World, you will receive Imaginary World.
desc_box_201804jq_007=Rewards from the Silent Temple. Click to open.
desc_box_201804jq_007_1=It has 3,000,000 cultivation points, universal cultivation injection pills 600,000, and tools for main meridian 4th and 5th acupoint and reversed meridian 1st and 2nd acupoint. If you haven't learn the new flying skills Imaginary World, you will receive Imaginary World.
desc_box_201804jq_008=Rewards from the Silent Temple. Click to open.
desc_box_201804jq_008_1=It has 3,000,000 cultivation points, 5th internal cultivation injection pills 3,000,000, and 15 Reset Vouchers. If you haven't learn the new flying skills Imaginary World, you will receive Imaginary World.
desc_box_201804jq_009=Rewards from the Silent Temple. Click to open.
desc_box_201804jq_009_1=It has 3,000,000 cultivation points, 40 Treasure Skill Reset Vouchers, 1 Refined Quality Binding Agent, and 2 Jade Powders. If you haven't learn the new flying skills Imaginary World, you will receive Imaginary World.
desc_box_201804jq_010=Rewards from the Silent Temple. Click to open.
desc_box_201804jq_010_1=It has 4,000,000 cultivation points, universal cultivation injection pills 800,000, and reversed meridian 3rd acupoint tool. If you haven't learn the new flying skills Imaginary World, you will receive Imaginary World.
desc_box_201804jq_011=Rewards from the Silent Temple. Click to open.
desc_box_201804jq_011_1=It has 4,000,000 cultivation points, 6th internal cultivation injection pills 2,000,000, and 20 Reset Vouchers. If you haven't learn the new flying skills Imaginary World, you will receive Imaginary World.
desc_box_201804jq_012=Rewards from the Silent Temple. Click to open.
desc_box_201804jq_012_1=It has 4,000,000 cultivation points, 50 Treasure Skill Reset Vouchers, 400 Pure Yang Swords, 1 Refined Quality Binding Agent, and 1 Jade Powder. If you haven't learn the new flying skills Imaginary World, you will receive Imaginary World.
desc_box_201804jq_013=Rewards from the Silent Temple. Click to open.
desc_box_201804jq_013_1=It has 5,000,000 cultivation points, universal cultivation injection pills 1,000,000, and reversed meridian 4th and 5th acupoint tools. If you haven't learn the new flying skills Imaginary World, you will receive Imaginary World.
desc_box_201804jq_014=Rewards from the Silent Temple. Click to open.
desc_box_201804jq_014_1=It has 5,000,000 cultivation points, 6th internal cultivation injection pills 3,000,000, and 30 Reset Vouchers. If you haven't learn the new flying skills Imaginary World, you will receive Imaginary World.
