desc_box_201804jq_015_1=It has 5,000,000 cultivation points, 60 Treasure Skill Reset Vouchers, 1000 Pure Yang Swords, 1 Refined Quality Binding Agent, and 2 Jade Powders. If you haven't learn the new flying skills Imaginary World, you will receive Imaginary World.
