my_home_duihuan_01_20=Building Token (Tree House)
desc_my_home_duihuan_01_20_0=Find the <font color="#00FF00">Ming Building Officer</font>. This is required for building a Home. <br>It can be obtained from the <font color="#FFAE00">Building Officer or Building Merchant</font> in Yanjing (323,33). <br>You can find the Building Officer to build a Home at the following maps: <font color="#FFAE00">Tangmen and Emei</font>. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Note: Remaining quantity of houses are limited.</font>
my_home_duihuan_01_21=Basic Expansion Token (Tree House)
desc_my_home_duihuan_01_21_0=Required for upgrading a <font color="#00FF00">tree house</font> to <font color="#00FF00">Level 2</font>. <br>Can be purchased from the <font color="#FFAE00">Building Officer</font> in Yanjing (323,33).
my_home_duihuan_01_22=Advance Expansion Token (Tree House)
desc_my_home_duihuan_01_22_0=Required for upgrading a <font color="#00FF00">tree house</font> to <font color="#00FF00">Level 3</font>. <br>Can be purchased from the <font color="#FFAE00">Building Officer</font> in Yanjing (323,33).
my_home_kuojian_07=Backyard Expansion Token (Tree House)
desc_my_home_kuojian_07_0=Required for upgrading the courtyard scale of a <font color="#00FF00">tree house</font>. <br>Can be purchased from the <font color="#FFAE00">Building Officer</font> in Yanjing (323,33).
my_home_duihuan_03_ju=Ming Dynasty Forest Residence Permission Token
desc_my_home_duihuan_03_ju_0=Required when redeeming a Special House Exchange Voucher from the <font color="#FFAE00">Building Officer</font> in Yanjing (323,33)<br>Can be found in forbidden instances.
item_newhouse_003=Special Housing Exchange Voucher
desc_item_newhouse_003_0=Certificate to redeem a <font color="#00FF00">Building Token (Tree House)</font> . <br>It can be obtained from the <font color="#FFAE00">Building Officer</font> in Yanjing (323,33). Can only be <font color="#FFAE00">redeemed once</font>.
my_home_duihuan_03_hj=Special Tael Exchange Voucher
desc_my_home_duihuan_03_hj_0=Sold at the <font color="#FFAE00">Building Merchant</font> in Yanjing (323,33). Used to redeem a <font color="#00FF00">Building Token (Tree House)</font>
