desc_item_xjqrw_001_0=(Use on Lu Xin and drink wine with him.)
dhs_xjqrwdh_001=I will come and help you.
dhs_xjqrwdh_002=I am not happy that they gossip about the Wulin Alliance Leader.
dhs_xjqrwdh_003=I am willing to help you to give them a lesson.
dhs_xjqrwdh_004=You are one of the people that I beat up in the Luoyang restaurant.
dhs_xjqrwdh_005=Previously someone from Lord Qin Manor backed you up. Now you are alone. You will have a hard time.
dhs_xjqrwdh_006=You are just a rogue. I'm not afraid.
xtts_xjqrw_001=Some jianghu people hear others think little of them, and want to beat others up. Go and defeat those Jianghu people.
xtts_xjqrw_002=Successfully defeated the Jianghu people. Leave the scene.
xtts_xjqrw_003=A group of Dark Star Gang members see you come in person. They plan to give you a lesson. Beat them up.
xtts_xjqrw_004=Successfully defeated the Dark Star Gang members. Leave the scene.
xtts_xjqrw_005=You feel some killing chi. A man in black flies off from Luoyang city wall. Be careful.
xtts_xjqrw_006=The figure seems familiar. Could it be Brother Lu from Lord Qin Manor?
xtts_xjqrw_007=Successfully defeated the man in black. Leave the scene.
xtts_xjqrw_008=Time is up. Leave the scene.
task_npc_xjqrw_006=The useless people in jianghu like to spread rumors.
task_npc_xjqrw_007=I will guard the manor well.
task_npc_xjqrw_008=task_npc_xjqrw_008
task_npc_xjqrw_009=Dark Star Gang is famous in Luoyang.
task_npc_xjqrw_010=You will die today.
task_npc_xjqrw_014=What is jianghu?
task_npc_xjqrw_015=Brother Lu is an expert in the manor. I respect him a lot. I didn't expect what he did today.
fzdhs_xjqrw_001=I can send you away. Do you want to leave?
fzdhs_xjqrw_002=Yes. I am leaving.
task_npc_xjqrw_001_a=You break it, you buy it and the jug next to it.
dhs_xjqrw_csdhs_001=I am heading to Luoyang (Lord Qin Manor) to collect some updated information about wulin.
dhs_xjqrw_csdhs_002=I can send you to Luoyang (Lord Qin Manor) to collect some updated information about wulin. Do you confirm to go?
dhs_xjqrw_csdhs_003=I am going.
home_dingdan=/
home_dingdan1=In a day, completing 1st time of the order will gain a stack of getting a special order. After 15 stacks, you will get a special order.
