desc_faculty_yanwu_lzy_tqwf_jlrs001_0=A medicine for increasing martial arts skills, especially effective for the skill you are cultivating now. <br>Use it to increase <font color="#FFFF00">10000</font> Cultivation Conversion at most.
desc_faculty_yanwu_lzy_tqwf_jlrs002_0=A medicine for increasing martial arts skills. <br>It can increase at most <font color="#FFFF00">1000</font> Cultivation Converting for current cultivating skill.
desc_faculty_lzy_tqwf_jlrs001_0=It comes from the snow mountains and is a fruit from hundred of years. It can add cultivation to martial players. Receive <font color="#FFFF00">10,000</font> cultivation points.
desc_zhenqi_lzy_tqwf_jlrs001_0=Potion for charging Qi, is helpful to channel all Meridians.<br>After being used, it can increase <font color="#FFFF00">10000</font> Qi, which will consume the Qi amount of that day. When the meridian has been cultivated to the top, the extra part not absorbed will be lost.
