desc_box_lzy_tqwf_jlrsdh001_0=Right click to open. <br>Based on current Age of Wushu Record, you will get various number of cultivation points, cultivation injection, chi injection, jianghu martial art pages. There is a chance to get school honor certificates, hidden weapon materials, jianghu internal page, jianghu internal fragment, etc, items.
desc_box_lzy_tqwf_jlrsdh002_0=Right click to open. <br>Based on current Age of Wushu Record, you will get various number of cultivation injection pills.
