desc_box_lzy_tqwf_jlrsngcj001_1=Open to get one internal fragment.
ui_Desc_Boss_clone040_wy=He was born poor and used to be a normal disciple of Dishu School. Since the young age, he has been to many ancient tombs with fellow disciples. He is known for being evil, even his own school mates do not like him. A few years ago, a nameless ancient tomb with powerful martial arts and mysterious books appeared. He harmed fellow school mates and claimed everything for himself. After that, Wu Yin disappeared for many years. When he showed up again, he is already a powerful jianghu expert. He found many evil people to work for him and were trying to find a big secret.
ui_Desc_Boss_clone040_ws=Delicate puppet. Made by Gongshu family decades ago. It's different from normal puppets. Wei Su does use dangerous hidden weapons to kill people. Instead, it can flexibly practice martial arts like real human beings. Wei Su is said to have killed many jianghu experts for a Silent Temple. But many years ago, Gong Shuxuan suddenly disappear. And Wei Su has been missing since then.
ui_Desc_Boss_clone040_dmym=An underground rare beast that is only recorded in books. It's said that this strange snake has super stiff skins. Its body is as thick as a stagecoach and is as long as a few of ten meters. Some people in the ancient time respect it and value it as god.
ui_Desc_Boss_clone040_gsx=Successor of Gongshu family, who is good at mechanism. Used to work for the Silent Temple. He used almost all his life time to transform an ancient tomb in Mountain Qin into a dangerous underground palace. Gong Shuxuan saw that the clan leader killed everyone related to this matter on the day when the palace was finished, so Gong Shuxuan activated the mechanism and locked himself inside the palace. He warned the Silent Temple leader that anyone who tried to enter the palace would be dead.
scene_clone040_1=Cloud Valley
ui_StoryClone040=It's said there is an ancient tomb from Qin Dynasty in the Mountain Qin. Many years ago, the Silent Temple found the tomb and claimed all the treasures there. They also made good use of the tomb, because the tomb has unique location and various special mechanism inside. <br>After the Silent Temple took over the tomb, they found numerous craftsmen to transform it into a huge underground palace. But they give the palace up afterwards for some unknown reason. Even though most people involved in the building were killed, the news about this palace still got out. Rumor says the Silent Temple uses it as an important gathering place and hide many treasures there. <br>Even though jianghu people talk about it, they can't find the entrance to the palace.
