home_mine_001=<font color="#00ff00">Special Event: </font><br>The exploration will cost: <br>a random one of iron ore, copper ore, lead ore, silver ore. <br>The more materials it costs, the higher chance for abundant rewards. <br>The number of materials cost for each tier of rewards: 2, 5, 10.
home_mine_003=<font color="#00ff00">Special Event: </font><br>The exploration will cost: <br>a random one of dendrite, obsidian, Moire Stone, Orchid Stone. <br>The more materials it costs, the higher chance for abundant rewards. <br>The number of materials cost for each tier of rewards: 2, 5, 10.
home_mine_002=<font color="#00ff00">Special Event: </font><br>The exploration will cost: <br>a random one of coarse cloth, linen, Guazhou Green, Nine Clouds Satin. <br>The more materials it costs, the higher chance for abundant rewards. <br>The number of materials cost for each tier of rewards: 2, 5, 10.
home_mine_004=<font color="#00ff00">Special Event: </font><br>The exploration will cost: <br>a random one of Mint, Kuqing Flowers, Wormwood, White Atractylodes Rhizome. <br>The more materials it costs, the higher chance for abundant rewards. <br>The number of materials cost for each tier of rewards: 2, 5, 10.
home_mine_005=<font color="#00ff00">Special Event: </font><br>The exploration will cost: <br>a random one of gaultheria, Heartbroken Flower, Du Yiwei, Nux vomica. <br>The more materials it costs, the higher chance for abundant rewards. <br>The number of materials cost for each tier of rewards: 2, 5, 10.
home_mine_006=Explore this area to obtain: <br> blacksmith enchant materials (Pupil Ingot, Black-Burning Ingot, Heavy-Forging Stone, Coagulate Stone, Highly-Refined Ingot). <br><font color="#00ff00">In 3rd internal stage: </font><br>There is a chance for rare treasure (random) and eggs. <br>Explore special event to obtain: <br><font color="#00ff00">In 1st internal stage: </font><br>blacksmith enchant materials and long lost secret blacksmith recipe. <br><font color="#00ff00">In 2nd internal stage: </font><br>blacksmith enchant materials and long lost secret blacksmith recipe. <br>There is a chance to get: <br>Gold Powder, Jade Powder, hidden weapon materials. <br><font color="#00ff00">In 3rd internal stage: </font><br>blacksmith enchant materials and long lost secret blacksmith recipe. <br>There is a chance to get: <br>Gold Powder, Jade Powder, hidden weapon materials, rare treasures, eggs. <br><font color="#00ff00">In 4th internal stage: </font><br>blacksmith enchant materials and long lost secret blacksmith recipe. <br>There is a chance to get: <br>Gold Powder, Jade Powder, hidden weapon materials, rare treasures, eggs, sheepskin scraps. <br><font color="#00ff00">In 5th internal stage: </font><br>blacksmith enchant materials and long lost secret blacksmith recipe. <br>There is a chance to get: <br>Gold Powder, Jade Powder, hidden weapon materials, rare treasures, eggs, Martial Merit Tokens, He Family Jade Fragments. <br><font color="#00ff00">In 6th internal stage: </font><br>blacksmith enchant materials and long lost secret blacksmith recipe. <br>There is a chance to get: <br>Gold Powder, Jade Powder, hidden weapon materials, rare treasures, eggs, Demon Gate Tokens, Desolate Beast Stones.
home_mine_008=Explore this area to obtain: <br> craftsman enchant materials (mixed beads, One-Yuan Stone, Double-Inset Bead, Green Lotus Jade, Maoyue Crystal). <br><font color="#00ff00">In 3rd internal stage: </font><br>There is a chance for rare treasure (random) and eggs. <br>Explore special event to obtain: <br><font color="#00ff00">In 1st internal stage: </font><br>craftsman enchant materials and long lost secret craftsman recipe. <br><font color="#00ff00">In 2nd internal stage: </font><br>craftsman enchant materials and long lost secret craftsman recipe. <br>There is a chance to get: <br>Gold Powder, Jade Powder, hidden weapon materials. <br><font color="#00ff00">In 3rd internal stage: </font><br>craftsman enchant materials and long lost secret craftsman recipe. <br>There is a chance to get: <br>Gold Powder, Jade Powder, hidden weapon materials, rare treasures, eggs. <br><font color="#00ff00">In 4th internal stage: </font><br>craftsman enchant materials and long lost secret craftsman recipe. <br>There is a chance to get: <br>Gold Powder, Jade Powder, hidden weapon materials, rare treasures, eggs, sheepskin scraps. <br><font color="#00ff00">In 5th internal stage: </font><br>craftsman enchant materials and long lost secret craftsman recipe. <br>There is a chance to get: <br>Gold Powder, Jade Powder, hidden weapon materials, rare treasures, eggs, Martial Merit Tokens, He Family Jade Fragments. <br><font color="#00ff00">In 6th internal stage: </font><br>craftsman enchant materials and long lost secret craftsman recipe. <br>There is a chance to get: <br>Gold Powder, Jade Powder, hidden weapon materials, rare treasures, eggs, Demon Gate Tokens, Desolate Beast Stones.
home_mine_007=Explore this area to obtain: <br> tailor enchant materials (Hanxiang Cloth, Xuewen Satin, Fine-Spun Cloth, Flower-Weaved Silk Cloth, Rose Brocade). <br><font color="#00ff00">In 3rd internal stage: </font><br>There is a chance for rare treasure (random) and eggs. <br>Explore special event to obtain: <br><font color="#00ff00">In 1st internal stage: </font><br>tailor enchant materials and long lost secret tailor recipe. <br><font color="#00ff00">In 2nd internal stage: </font><br>tailor enchant materials and long lost secret tailor recipe. <br>There is a chance to get: <br>Gold Powder, Jade Powder, hidden weapon materials. <br><font color="#00ff00">In 3rd internal stage: </font><br>tailor enchant materials and long lost secret tailor recipe. <br>There is a chance to get: <br>Gold Powder, Jade Powder, hidden weapon materials, rare treasures, eggs. <br><font color="#00ff00">In 4th internal stage: </font><br>tailor enchant materials and long lost secret tailor recipe. <br>There is a chance to get: <br>Gold Powder, Jade Powder, hidden weapon materials, rare treasures, eggs, sheepskin scraps. <br><font color="#00ff00">In 5th internal stage: </font><br>tailor enchant materials and long lost secret tailor recipe. <br>There is a chance to get: <br>Gold Powder, Jade Powder, hidden weapon materials, rare treasures, eggs, Martial Merit Tokens, He Family Jade Fragments. <br><font color="#00ff00">In 6th internal stage: </font><br>tailor enchant materials and long lost secret tailor recipe. <br>There is a chance to get: <br>Gold Powder, Jade Powder, hidden weapon materials, rare treasures, eggs, Demon Gate Tokens, Desolate Beast Stones.
home_mine_009=Explore this area to obtain: <br> herbalist enchant materials (bandage, medicated gauze, Dressing, Homeostatic Gauze, Detoxifying Gauze). <br><font color="#00ff00">In 3rd internal stage: </font><br>There is a chance for rare treasure (random) and eggs. <br>Explore special event to obtain: <br><font color="#00ff00">In 1st internal stage: </font><br>herbalist enchant materials and long lost secret herbalist recipe. <br><font color="#00ff00">In 2nd internal stage: </font><br>herbalist enchant materials and long lost secret herbalist recipe. <br>There is a chance to get: <br>Gold Powder, Jade Powder, hidden weapon materials. <br><font color="#00ff00">In 3rd internal stage: </font><br>herbalist enchant materials and long lost secret herbalist recipe. <br>There is a chance to get: <br>Gold Powder, Jade Powder, hidden weapon materials, rare treasures, eggs. <br><font color="#00ff00">In 4th internal stage: </font><br>herbalist enchant materials and long lost secret herbalist recipe. <br>There is a chance to get: <br>Gold Powder, Jade Powder, hidden weapon materials, rare treasures, eggs, sheepskin scraps. <br><font color="#00ff00">In 5th internal stage: </font><br>herbalist enchant materials and long lost secret herbalist recipe. <br>There is a chance to get: <br>Gold Powder, Jade Powder, hidden weapon materials, rare treasures, eggs, Martial Merit Tokens, He Family Jade Fragments. <br><font color="#00ff00">In 6th internal stage: </font><br>herbalist enchant materials and long lost secret herbalist recipe. <br>There is a chance to get: <br>Gold Powder, Jade Powder, hidden weapon materials, rare treasures, eggs, Demon Gate Tokens, Desolate Beast Stones.
home_mine_010=Explore this area to obtain: <br> poison maker enchant materials (Poisonous Stone, Killing Stone, Envenom Stone, Curse Stone, Blood Jade). <br><font color="#00ff00">In 3rd internal stage: </font><br>There is a chance for rare treasure (random) and eggs. <br>Explore special event to obtain: <br><font color="#00ff00">In 1st internal stage: </font><br>poison maker enchant materials and long lost secret poison maker recipe. <br><font color="#00ff00">In 2nd internal stage: </font><br>poison maker enchant materials and long lost secret poison maker recipe. <br>There is a chance to get: <br>Gold Powder, Jade Powder, hidden weapon materials. <br><font color="#00ff00">In 3rd internal stage: </font><br>poison maker enchant materials and long lost secret poison maker recipe. <br>There is a chance to get: <br>Gold Powder, Jade Powder, hidden weapon materials, rare treasures, eggs. <br><font color="#00ff00">In 4th internal stage: </font><br>poison maker enchant materials and long lost secret poison maker recipe. <br>There is a chance to get: <br>Gold Powder, Jade Powder, hidden weapon materials, rare treasures, eggs, sheepskin scraps. <br><font color="#00ff00">In 5th internal stage: </font><br>poison maker enchant materials and long lost secret poison maker recipe. <br>There is a chance to get: <br>Gold Powder, Jade Powder, hidden weapon materials, rare treasures, eggs, Martial Merit Tokens, He Family Jade Fragments. <br><font color="#00ff00">In 6th internal stage: </font><br>poison maker enchant materials and long lost secret poison maker recipe. <br>There is a chance to get: <br>Gold Powder, Jade Powder, hidden weapon materials, rare treasures, eggs, Demon Gate Tokens, Desolate Beast Stones.
home_mine_011=<font color="##FF0000">Play Details: </font><br><font color="#00ff00">Dispatch: </font><br>1. Everyday you can only do 1 dispatch. Special event and normal dispatch share cool down. <br><br>2. Each dispatch costs 4 hours. <br><br>3. Only after you claim the dispatch rewards will you be able to go to the next dispatch. <br><font color="#00ff00">Special Event: </font><br>Special events spawn randomly everyday in random areas. <br><font color="#00ff00">Dispatch Rewards: </font><br>1. The rewards for normal dispatch and special event are calculated separately. <br><br>2. For example, when the special event spawns in area 1, if you click area 5, then you will get the reward for normal dispatch in area 5 and the reward for special event in area 1. <br><br>3. The rewards for special event vary based on the material cost. The more materials it cost, the more abundant the rewards will be. <br><font color="#00ff00">Dispatch Progress: </font><br>Each area has a dispatch progress. Only when the previous area's dispatch progress is at 1/1 will you be able to go to the next area's dispatch.
desc_box_jywffc_cf_001_0=Right click to obtain: <br>tailor enchant materials (Hanxiang Cloth, Xuewen Satin, Fine-Spun Cloth, Flower-Weaved Silk Cloth, Rose Brocade). <br><font color="#00ff00">In 3rd internal stage: </font><br>There is a chance for rare treasure (random) and eggs.
desc_box_jywffc_cf_002_0=Right click to obtain: <br><font color="#00ff00">In 1st internal stage: </font><br>tailor enchant materials and long lost secret tailor recipe. <br><font color="#00ff00">In 2nd internal stage: </font><br>tailor enchant materials and long lost secret tailor recipe. <br>There is a chance to get: <br>Gold Powder, Jade Powder, hidden weapon materials. <br><font color="#00ff00">In 3rd internal stage: </font><br>tailor enchant materials and long lost secret tailor recipe. <br>There is a chance to get: <br>Gold Powder, Jade Powder, hidden weapon materials, rare treasures, eggs. <br><font color="#00ff00">In 4th internal stage: </font><br>tailor enchant materials and long lost secret tailor recipe. <br>There is a chance to get: <br>Gold Powder, Jade Powder, hidden weapon materials, rare treasures, eggs, sheepskin scraps. <br><font color="#00ff00">In 5th internal stage: </font><br>tailor enchant materials and long lost secret tailor recipe. <br>There is a chance to get: <br>Gold Powder, Jade Powder, hidden weapon materials, rare treasures, eggs, Martial Merit Tokens, He Family Jade Fragments. <br><font color="#00ff00">In 6th internal stage: </font><br>tailor enchant materials and long lost secret tailor recipe. <br>There is a chance to get: <br>Gold Powder, Jade Powder, hidden weapon materials, rare treasures, eggs, Demon Gate Tokens, Desolate Beast Stones.
