desc_item_mzwy_001_0=Wulin Alliance Leader sends you to Shaolin to investigate Zucheng's case. This letter will let Abbot Xuanhuai trust you.
desc_item_mzwy_002_0=A box found from Zu Cheng's Former Residence. Open to see if there is any valuable evidence.
desc_item_mzwy_003_0=A letter that Zucheng was planning to send to the Silent Temple. It contains a big secret.
desc_item_mzwy_004_0=<font color="#00ff00">(Not much information is on it. You can delete it.)</font>
