task_xqj_cf_002=Sit tight. My stagecoach is fast.
task_xqj_cf_003=I'm ready. Let's go.
desc_xueweitool_2501_0=One of the martial arts classics written based on the medical tantra "Lingshu." When read by a martial arts practitioner, the reader can instantly gain insight and unclog the meridian channels of the body, and eventually open up <font color="#FFCC00">Ying Xiang</font>, the <font color="#FFCC00">first</font> acupoint of the <font color="#FFCC00">Yangming Large Intestine Meridian of Hand - Reversed</font>. <br>Cultivation points required for usage: <font color="#FFFF00">1,000,000</font>. <br><font color="#FFFF00">Can only use the book after the corresponding normal meridian has been cultivated to level 180.</font>
desc_xueweitool_2502_0=One of the martial arts classics written based on the medical tantra "Lingshu." When read by a martial arts practitioner, the reader can instantly gain insight and unclog the meridian channels of the body, and eventually open up <font color="#FFCC00">Tian Ding</font>, the <font color="#FFCC00">second</font> acupoint of the <font color="#FFCC00">Yangming Large Intestine Meridian of Hand - Reversed</font>. <br>Cultivation points required for usage: <font color="#FFFF00">1,500,000</font>. <br><font color="#FFFF00">Can only use the book after the corresponding normal meridian has been cultivated to level 180.</font>
desc_xueweitool_2503_0=One of the martial arts classics written based on the medical tantra "Lingshu." When read by a martial arts practitioner, the reader can instantly gain insight and unclog the meridian channels of the body, and eventually open up <font color="#FFCC00">Bi Nao</font>, the <font color="#FFCC00">third</font> acupoint of the <font color="#FFCC00">Yangming Large Intestine Meridian of Hand - Reversed</font>. <br>Cultivation points required for usage: <font color="#FFFF00">2,000,000</font>. <br><font color="#FFFF00">Can only use the book after the corresponding normal meridian has been cultivated to level 180.</font>
desc_xueweitool_2504_0=One of the martial arts classics written based on the medical tantra "Lingshu." When read by a martial arts practitioner, the reader can instantly gain insight and unclog the meridian channels of the body, and eventually open up <font color="#FFCC00">Zhou Liao</font>, the <font color="#FFCC00">fourth</font> acupoint of the <font color="#FFCC00">Yangming Large Intestine Meridian of Hand - Reversed</font>. <br>Cultivation points required for usage: <font color="#FFFF00">3,000,000</font>. <br><font color="#FFFF00">Can only use the book after the corresponding normal meridian has been cultivated to level 180.</font>
desc_xueweitool_2505_0=One of the martial arts classics written based on the medical tantra "Lingshu." When read by a martial arts practitioner, the reader can instantly gain insight and unclog the meridian channels of the body, and eventually open up <font color="#FFCC00">Qu Chi</font>, the <font color="#FFCC00">fifth</font> acupoint of the <font color="#FFCC00">Yangming Large Intestine Meridian of Hand - Reversed</font>. <br>Cultivation points required for usage: <font color="#FFFF00">4,000,000</font>. <br><font color="#FFFF00">Can only use the book after the corresponding normal meridian has been cultivated to level 180.</font>
desc_xueweitool_2506_0=One of the martial arts classics written based on the medical tantra "Lingshu." When read by a martial arts practitioner, the reader can instantly gain insight and unclog the meridian channels of the body, and eventually open up <font color="#FFCC00">Shou San Li</font>, the <font color="#FFCC00">sixth</font> acupoint of the <font color="#FFCC00">Yangming Large Intestine Meridian of Hand - Reversed</font>. <br>Cultivation points required for usage: <font color="#FFFF00">5,000,000</font>. <br><font color="#FFFF00">Can only use the book after the corresponding normal meridian has been cultivated to level 180.</font>
