desc_item_lzy_hd_cfsl_001=Use to speed up internal cultivation rate by 50%. The effect lasts 30 minutes. Offline cultivation is not affected.
desc_item_lzy_hd_cfsl_002=Use to speed up internal cultivation rate by 200%. The effect lasts 1 hour. Offline cultivation is not affected.
desc_item_lzy_hd_cfsl_003=Use to speed up internal cultivation rate by 50%. The effect lasts 30 minutes.
desc_item_lzy_hd_cfsl_004=Use to speed up internal cultivation rate by 200%. The effect lasts 60 minutes.
desc_box_lzy_hd_cfsl_yetu=<font color="#00ff00">Use to obtain 1 wild rabbit head. Chance to obtain wild rabbit meat or wild rabbit blood.</font>
desc_box_lzy_hd_cfsl001=Rewards for hunting. <br>It contains <font color="#FFFF00">50 Bai Xiaosheng's Weapon Manuals (Superior), 100 Five Aggregate Demon Slaying Items, 1 Black Jade Powder, and 1 Hunting Reward</font>. <br>Hunting Reward One has a chance to give 1 unbound Black Jade Powder. After 2nd school internal is activated, it has a chance to give 1 ancient scroll pack.
desc_box_lzy_hd_cfsl002=Rewards for hunting. <br>It contains <font color="#FFFF00">20 Bai Xiaosheng's Weapon Manuals (Superior), 50 Five Aggregate Demon Slaying Items, and 1 Refined Quality Binding Agent</font>.
desc_box_lzy_hd_cfsl003=Rewards for hunting. <br>It contains <font color="#FFFF00">10 Bai Xiaosheng's Weapon Manuals (Superior), 20 Five Aggregate Demon Slaying Items, and 1 Good Quality Binding Agent</font>.
desc_box_lzy_hd_cfsl005=Different rewards based on the progress of Age of Wushu Record. <br>1st internal: 1 unbound Black Jade Powder. <br>2nd internal: ancient scroll pack.
desc_item_lzy_hd_cfsl_dh001_0=A proof certificate of participating in the Spring Hunting and receiving some rewards. Go to <font color="#ff0000">Jinling Royal Hunting Ground (2110, 1559)</font> and find <font color="#ff0000">Gongsun Chang</font> to exchange for Spring Hunting Rewards.
desc_item_lzy_hd_cfsl_dh002_0=Take this item, go to <font color="#ff0000">Jinling Royal Hunting Ground (2110, 1559)</font> and find <font color="#ff0000">Gongsun Chang</font> to exchange for Spring Hunting Certificate.
desc_item_lzy_hd_cfsl_dh003_0=Take this item, go to <font color="#ff0000">Jinling Royal Hunting Ground (2110, 1559)</font> and find <font color="#ff0000">Gongsun Chang</font> to exchange for Spring Hunting Certificate.
desc_skillitem_zhongqiu_tuzi_06_0=Hunting Net. Strong and durable. Once you have the hunting net, talk to Gongsun Chang to participate in the Spring Hunting. This net can only be used in the Spring Hunting scene. <font color="#00FF00">Gongsun Chang is in Jinling Royal Hunting Ground (2110, 1559).</font>
