desc_item_ghkh_xdj_001_1=Wood materials that treasure chests in the game have a chance to drop. <font color="#FF3030">Everyday from 10:00 to 21:00, players can go to the Hermit in Jinling (1482, 70) and submit [Bonfire Wood] for the Bonfire Party that happens everyday from 21:00 to 22:00. Each submit will reward 1 Bonfire Certificate and 1 Snow Lotus Fruit. Everyday after the Bonfire Party starts, the Hermit will pick one out of all the donators and reward 1 Jianghu Internal Scroll Pack.</font>
desc_item_ghkh_xdj_001=Bonfire Wood
desc_item_ghkh_xdj_002_1=During the event, players can submit Bonfire Wood to the Hermit in Jinling (1482, 70) to obtain this certificate. <font color="#FF3030">Everyday from 21:00 to 22:00, players can go to the Hermit in Jinling (1482, 70) and exchange various items with Bonfire Certificate.</font>
desc_item_ghkh_xdj_002=Bonfire Certificate
desc_item_ghkh_xdj_003_1=An item obtained by exchanging five aggregate demon slaying items at the Hermit in Jinling. <font color="#FF3030">Everyday from 21:00 to 22:00, players can go to the Hermit in Jinling (1482, 70) and exchange various items with the Hermit Blessing</font>
desc_item_ghkh_xdj_003=The Hermit Blessing
desc_box_ghkh_ghjj_001_1=A gift pack obtained at the Hermit in Jinling (1482, 70) by submitting Bonfire Wood and being luckily chosen one. <font color="#FF3030">1st internal stage: 1 unbound Black Jade Powder. 2nd internal and on: 1 Jianghu Internal Scroll Pack. You will receive 1 random jianghu internal fragment (unbound).</font>
desc_box_ghkh_ghjj_001=Right click to open
task_npc_ghkh_hd_001=I set bonfire here and hope that players will bring me some Bonfire Wood. I will reward the donators. <font color="#FF3030">(Everyday from 10:00 to 21:00, players can submit Bonfire Wood to me. From 21:00 to 22:00, players can exchange items from me.)</font>
