desc_item_0606qx_ding_001_1=When daily activity reaches 100 points, Jianghu VIP players can in addition get 1 Cloud Cliff Token. Cloud Cliff Tokens can be used to exchange for cultivation tools and <font color="#00ff00">souvenir lores</font> at Lin Liang in major cities. You can also use them to exchange for valuable items at the activity points exchange in the red nine character.
