item_dfjzcj_mp001=Battle Invitation (Peak Scramble)
desc_item_dfjzcj_mp001_0=<s><s><s><s>All the guilds in the world wish to join this Peak Scramble. Jianghu Baixiao Hall knew that you want to join, and thus specially sends you the invitation to join the battle. <br><font color="#FFFF00">Use of the tool: During the preparation period of the Peak Scramble, use it to gain the eligibility to join the Peak Scramble. </font><br><font color="#FFB428">Ways to obtain the tool: During the Guild Territory war this week, accumulative time of claiming the Imperial Flag reaches 30 minutes. And at least 20 active members reach Keep Your Own Council.</font>
