desc_key_111225_tm_tqanqi_0=Tang Qing's unique hidden weapon. It has a special appearance. Go and meet with Tang Yufeng (1078, -344). He knows whether it is Tang Guanqun's evil deeds.
desc_key_111225_tm_kmg_0=Kin Muguang's unique hidden weapon. The murderer has already died. Take this token to meet with Tang Yufeng (1078, -344). You probably will receive some rewards.
desc_key_111225_tm_lx_0=Liu Xun's unique hidden weapon. The murderer has already died. Take this token to meet with Tang Yufeng (1078, -344). You probably will receive some rewards.
desc_key_111225_tm_ywh_0=Ye Wuhua's unique hidden weapon. The murderer has already died. Take this token to meet with Tang Yufeng (1078, -344). You probably will receive some rewards.
desc_item_revise_name_0=Official Regulation: To change one's name, an application form for the name change must be filled in and approved by the local official. <br>After satisfying the criteria for the name change, file a formal application at the Jinling Department.<br><br><font color="#FFFF00">Requirement for changing name</font>:<br>Unlocked the secondary password.<br>Level reaches <font color="#FFFF00">First Understanding</font>.<br>Haven't published a wanted note, and is not a constable or wanted criminal.<br>Not a guild's leader.<br>Isn't occupying a position in school.<br>Isn't joining any event.<br>Hasn't joined a bet or isn't running a shop.<br>There isn't any unreceived important letter.<br>Others.<br><font color="#FF3333">Changing name will make the workbench you're currently using unable to send the products to you.</font>
desc_guild_chase_tool_07_0=Used for guild killing. It disappears after being used. After guild killing starts, within 1 hour the members of the guilds that started the killing and the guilds that are being chased will not gain infamy. The item will expire after 15 days.
desc_guild_chase_tool_08_0=Used for guild killing. It disappears after being used. After guild killing starts, within 1.5 hours the members of the guilds that started the killing and the guilds that are being chased will not gain infamy. The item will expire after 15 days.
desc_guild_chase_tool_09_0=Used for guild killing. It disappears after being used. After guild killing starts, within 2 hours the members of the guilds that started the killing and the guilds that are being chased will not gain infamy. The item will expire after 15 days.
desc_guild_chase_tool_10_0=Used for guild killing. It disappears after being used. After guild killing starts, within 2.5 hours the members of the guilds that started the killing and the guilds that are being chased will not gain infamy. The item will expire after 15 days.
desc_guild_chase_tool_11_0=Used for guild killing. It disappears after being used. After guild killing starts, within 3 hours the members of the guilds that started the killing and the guilds that are being chased will not gain infamy. The item will expire after 15 days.
