desc_tqsj_duihuan_01_0=Token from killing Cao Zhengqing. It can be used to exchange for reward at Jinling (500, 1089).
desc_taohua03=This shirt is refined and elegant, it enables the Peach Blossom Island disciples to showcase the beauty of "Peach Shadow Sword" Skill.
desc_taohua05=Peach Blossom Island disciples wearing this dress appears extremely chic in the blowing wind.
desc_taohua07=The universe is filled with mysteries, but what do they mean? Wearing this shirt, the Peach Blossom Island disciples can further showcase its extraordinary style.
desc_box_wnhd_xsff01_1=<font color="#FFB428">An exquisitely packaged gift box containing 10 Qi Hai Concentration Pills, an Internal Skill Annotation Book (7 days), Good Item Bag (7 days), 200 repairing tools and a Windrider (3 days). (Each player can only purchase and use this once.)</font>
desc_box_tiantiLv_end04_1=500 Competition Points, have a chance to get <font color="#00FFFF">bound or unbound</font> <font color="#00FF00">Dragon Claw (Ancient Manual) Martial Skill, Dog Beating Staff Technique (Ancient Manual) Martial Skill, Tai Chi Fist (Ancient Manual) Martial Skill, Dragon Kung Fu Sword Martial Skill, Flowing Cloud Sword Martial Skill, Golden Deer Blade Martial Skill, or Arhat Fist Martial Skill</font>
desc_box_tiantiLv_end05_1=500 Competition Points, have a chance to get <font color="#00FFFF">bound or unbound</font> <font color="#00FF00">Dragon Claw (Ancient Manual) Martial Skill, Dog Beating Staff Technique (Ancient Manual) Martial Skill, Tai Chi Fist (Ancient Manual) Martial Skill, Dragon Kung Fu Sword Martial Skill, Flowing Cloud Sword Martial Skill, Golden Deer Blade Martial Skill, or Arhat Fist Martial Skill</font>
desc_item_wmp_wxxl_0=This token is to recognize the diligent cultivators in Jianghu. Go to Xiao Yicheng (847, 250) for daily tasks to obtain this token. <br> Token holders can go to Tan Sihui in the Evil Men's Valley (848, 261) to exchange for rewards.
desc_event_item_aqzw_05_0=Token from the event [King of Hidden Weapons]. Go to Xu Yuanzi in Luoyang (1032, 906) to exchange for rewards.
desc_event_item_aqzw_06_0=Get recognition from Xin Junke in the event [King of Hidden Weapons]. Go to Xu Yuanzi in Luoyang (1032, 906) to exchange for rewards.
desc_item_jianghu_clone_key_0=You have made diligent and meritorious efforts to give advice and instructions to Novices. It is rare and commendable for someone like you to do such deeds, which are a blessing for the Wulin world. In consideration of this, you are awarded with This item. This item can be used as a ticket to the Forbidden Instance and when you do so, your weekly quota of access to the Forbidden Instance will not be deducted (the item will be consumed when you save your Forbidden Instance Progress). <br><font color="#FF3030">When your remaining weekly quota of access to the Forbidden Instance is 0, the item will be ineffective. </font><br><font color="#FF3030">The item will be ineffective in the following Forbidden Instance: </font><font color="#FFFF00">Yanmen Pass Rebel's Path, Bat Cave, Wuzheng Secret Area, Hidden Valley, Qingyao Palace (Single), or Desert Ghost Town.</font>
desc_item_honor_yhgslboss03_0=Exchange certificate. When you've collected enough of the certificates, you can exchange for a Flower Prince Silk Ball at Hua Lianxin (526,835). <font color="#44ff44">Use limit: It can be exchanged from 8th to 27th of each month, but a player can only exchange for one silk ball every day. </font><font color="#FF0000">(Note: Flower Prince Silk Ball expires immediately on the 28th of the month.)</font>
qy_menu_0tm5nei_lili00=It takes quite a while to go to Mount Hua.
desc_box_revenge_pignzheng_1=Sky Ladder Daily Treasure Box, a chance to receive one of the following number of Sky Ladder Honor Certificates: 5, 10, 50, 100, also a chance to receive Sky Ladder Item Award Pack. It can be obtained by completing Sky Ladder Daily Task.
desc_box_revenge_newitem_1=Sky Ladder Item Award Pack, a chance to receive a Sky Ladder Item. It might be obtained by completing Sky Ladder Daily Task.
desc_item_ngw_ngcj_tips_1=Guild Territory Gain will randomly produce Against Worldly Evil Scroll Fragment, Hidden Prowess Scroll Fragment, Purple Rosy Clouds Skill Scroll Fragment, Sunset Skill Scroll Fragment, Chaotic Origin Scroll Fragment and Five Elements Mental Skill Scroll Fragment. <font color="#ff0000">(Tianchang and Diyan territory can produce it 100%, and Xuanhuang Stronghold territory have a chance to produce it.) </font>
desc_item_ngw_yjtz_tips_1=Guild Territory Gain will produce Jinling Chopping Block, Jinling Loom and Jinling Workbench. <font color="#ff0000">(Tianchang and Diyan territory can produce it 100%, and Xuanhuang Stronghold territory have a chance to produce it.) </font>
desc_item_ngw_ejtz_tips_1=Guild Territory Gain will produce Jinling Pig-Iron Chopping Block, Jinling Exquisite Loom and Jinling Ruyi Workbench. <font color="#ff0000">(Tianchang and Diyan territory can produce it 100%, and Xuanhuang Stronghold territory have a chance to produce it.) </font>
task_Guild_shouyi_001=Defend the territory. All the guild members can get the Territory Income from me between 9:30 and 11:30 p.m. every Saturday. The guild leader can start Saint Weapon Edge.
