desc_box_lzy_smzb_bhjdb_bz002_1=Reward pack that presented to the leader of the second place guild on the Three Alliances Conquest Guild Season Ranking List.<br>Contains <font color="#FFFF00">4 Ancient Script Fragment, 1 Heavenly Zither Score (Jade), 3 Heavenly Zither Score (Gold), and 3 Heavenly Zither Score (Silver)</font>.
desc_box_lzy_smzb_bhjdb_gpcj_jd002_1=Reward pack that presented to the second place guild on the Three Alliances Conquest Guild Season Ranking List. Distributed to the well-performed members by the leader as a encouragement.<br>Contains <font color="#FFFF00">4 Ancient Script Fragment, 1 Heavenly Zither Score (Jade), 3 Heavenly Zither Score (Gold), and 3 Heavenly Zither Score (Silver)</font>.
factor_addskill_014=Continue the Destiny: Can use martial arts of the old patch.
ui_war_scuffle_desc_011=Guild Ranking Reward: On the 1st day in a month, rank will be released based on combined points of guild members. Top rank guild will get abundant rewards, and at the same time <font color="#FFCC00">points will be cleared</font>. <br>Reward content: Leader of the top rank guild will get Gold Umbraculum mount. Members of the top rank guild, whose guild activity points and battle points both have reached 60, will get special outfits.
ui_war_scuffle_desc_013=Individual Ranking Reward: On the 1st day in a month, rank will be released based on individual points in the battlefield. Top 3 players will get title rewards, and at the same time <font color="#FFCC00">points will be cleared</font>. <br>Reward content: Top rank player will get the title <font color="#FFCC00">Jianghu Authority</font>. 2nd rank player will get the title <font color="#FFCC00">Peerless Among Mortals</font>. 3rd rank player will get the title <font color="#FFCC00">Seeking for a Failure</font>.
tips_factor_buff_018=When your HP is between 60% and 80%, your damage is increased by 5%, and at the same time you Absorb 10% of it into your HP. When your HP is between 40% and 60%, your damage is increased by 10%, and at the same time you Absorb 15% of it into your HP. When your HP is between 0% and 40%, your damage is increased by 15%, and at the same time you Absorb 20% of it into your HP. When your HP is below 20%, your damage is increased by 20%, and at the same time you Absorb 25% of it into your HP.
tips_factor_addskill_014=Continue the Destiny: Can use martial arts of the old patch.
desc_item_2017yrzxl_001_1=Token obtained by completing Cultivate Often. <font color="#FF3030">You can exchange for Snow Lotus fruit, Cultivate Often Burden Alleviating Token, Souvenir Martial Art Pack (Disfiguring Kick and 500000 Cultivation) (can be exchanged only at or before Age of Wushu Records Tier 5 Internal Skill), Cultivation Perfusion Pack (3000000 Cultivation Perfusion) (can be exchanged only after Age of Wushu Records Tier 5 Internal Skill) at Lin Liang the Event Ambassador, or Lady Token (Exchange at Suzhou (647, 389) Tan Yuzhi).</font>
desc_item_beauty_madh_0=A peerless beauty who enamors the city and the nation. <br><font color="#FF0000">Only female players may obtain.</font><br>Can exchange for Year 2017 the Women's Day special title at Suzhou (646, 391) Yan Yuzhi.
desc_item_h_fragrance_madh_0=National beauty and heavenly fragrance.<br>Can be exchanged with Jackdaw Herb.<br>Can exchange for Year 2017 the Women's Day special title at Suzhou (646, 391) Yan Yuzhi.
desc_box_wuji_longzhua_01=Right-click to use.<br>You will receive a <font color="#00FFFF">Bound</font><font color="#00FF00"> Martial Skill Book - Conserve the Scarce].</font>
desc_box_wuji_longzhua_02=Right-click to use.<br>You will receive a <font color="#00FFFF">Bound</font><font color="#00FF00"> Martial Skill Book - Chasing Shadow].</font>
desc_box_wuji_longzhua_03=Right-click to use.<br>You will receive a <font color="#00FFFF">Bound</font><font color="#00FF00"> Martial Skill Book - Throat Strike].</font>
desc_box_wuji_dagoubajue_01=Right-click to use.<br>You will receive a <font color="#00FFFF">Bound</font><font color="#00FF00"> Martial Skill Book - Swipe the Dog's Back].</font>
desc_box_wuji_dagoubajue_02=Right-click to use.<br>You will receive a <font color="#00FFFF">Bound</font><font color="#00FF00"> Martial Skill Book - Flip the Dog Upside-Down].</font>
desc_box_wuji_dagoubajue_03=Right-click to use.<br>You will receive a <font color="#00FFFF">Bound</font><font color="#00FF00"> Martial Skill Book - No Dogs Under Heaven].</font>
desc_box_tiantileitai_wincount_06_1=Can get 400 Competition Points, have a chance to get <font color="#00FFFF">bound or unbound</font> <font color="#00FF00">Dragon Claw (Ancient Manual) Martial Skill, Dog Beating Staff Technique (Ancient Manual) Martial Skill, Tai Chi Fist (Ancient Manual) Martial Skill, Dragon Kung Fu Sword Martial Skill, Flowing Cloud Sword Martial Skill, Golden Deer Blade Martial Skill, or Arhat Fist Martial Skill</font><br>Tier 3 to Tier 4 Internal Skill Stage: 350000 Cultivation Points<br>Tier 5 Internal Skill Stage: 750000 Cultivation Points<br>Tier 6 Internal Skill Stage: 1100000 Cultivation Points, and 750000 Cultivation Perfusion
desc_match_reward_01=Achieve 3 victories every month.
desc_match_reward_02=Achieve 12 victories every month.
desc_match_reward_03=Achieve 30 victories every month.
desc_match_reward_04=Achieve 60 victories every month.
desc_match_reward_05=Achieve 90 victories every month.
desc_match_reward_06=Achieve 150 victories every month.
desc_match_reward_07=Sky Ladder Score reaches 11000
desc_match_reward_08=Sky Ladder Score reaches 14000
desc_match_reward_09=Sky Ladder Score reaches 17000
desc_match_reward_10=Sky Ladder Score reaches 10000 at the end of season
desc_match_reward_11=Sky Ladder Score reaches 12000 at the end of season
desc_match_reward_12=Sky Ladder Score reaches 15000 at the end of season
desc_item_lzy_cbt_dhdj003_0=Gold shards, still shining.<br><font color="#00ff00">Tavern Host seems to be collecting this. After collecting a certain amount, you can click the Nine Character at main interface and exchange for items in the Treasure Map Anecdote page.</font>
desc_box_lzy_cbt_reword_suijin001_0=A pack of splintery gold. Open to get <font color="#FFFF00">2 Splintery Gold</font>, also have a chance to get martial art pages.
desc_box_lzy_cbt_reword_suijin002_1=A pack of splintery gold. Open to get <font color="#FFFF00">1 Splintery Gold</font>.
desc_box_lzy_cbt_reword_ngcj_1=Open to get a random Jianghu Internal Skill Scroll Fragment.
desc_item_ssf_shouyangming_z_0=Congealed by energy, the Ice Spirit can have the target suffer great pain. <br><font color="#ffd700">Item Origin: Twelve Swallows in the Snow [Lingxiao City (526,171)]Exchange</font><br><font color="#ffd700">Item Uses: After using, the user will get Unmarked Runes and the used will get Marked Runes (both can be exchanged at the Peak interface) </font><br><font color="#ffd700">How to use: </font><br>This item can only be used on players affected by Life and Death Runes for less than 5 times at the day <font color="#00ff00">outside battle, during events, with a stall, or if seriously inured, </font>by <font color="#00ff00">players</font>. <br>When Age of Wushu Record <font color="#00ff00">Pirate Raid</font> is activated, it requires that the user's item-related meridian should be practiced to <font color="#00ff00">72 cultivation cycles</font> and the target's power should reach <font color="#00ff00">Mentally Balanced</font>. <br>When Age of Wushu Record <font color="#00ff00">Soul Smashed Ninefold</font> is activated, it requires that the user's item-related meridian should be practiced to <font color="#00ff00">108 cultivation cycles</font> and the target's power should reach <font color="#00ff00">Enlightened Virtuoso</font>. <br>When Age of Wushu Record <font color="#00ff00">Plague of Luoyang</font> is activated, it requires that the user's item-related meridian should be practiced to <font color="#00ff00">144 cultivation cycles</font> and the target's power should reach <font color="#00ff00">Peerless</font>. <br>When Age of Wushu Record <font color="#00ff00">Traces of the Evil Cult</font> is activated, it requires that the user's item-related meridian should be practiced to <font color="#00ff00">180 cultivation cycles</font> and the target's power should reach <font color="#00ff00">Awe of the Universe</font>. <br><font color="#ffd700">Lord of Lingxiao City boards calculate Unmarked Runes at 00:30am on the first of each month.</font>
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_arrow_01_1=Read the book to learn various normal Flying Arrow crafting methods. <br>The hidden weapon will be suitable for characters of <font color="#00FF00">Weak Body and Mind</font>. <br>The book can be purchased at blacksmith.
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_arrow_02_1=Read the book to learn various delicate Flying Arrow crafting methods. <br>The hidden weapon will be suitable for characters of <font color="#00FF00">First Understanding</font>.
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_arrow_03_1=Read the book to learn various enhanced Flying Arrow crafting methods. <br>The hidden weapon will be suitable for characters of <font color="#00FF00">Realized Potential</font>.
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_arrow_04_1=Read the book to learn various normal Flying Arrow crafting methods. <br>The hidden weapon will be suitable for characters of <font color="#00FF00">Martial Intuition</font>.
desc_jysg_title_006=Chapter 4 Teachings at Qinshui
desc_jysg_title_007=Chapter 5 Cold Breeze Prevails
desc_jysg_text_070=The holder of Nine Yang Order doesn't have enough Cultivation Points to cultivate seventh level.
desc_box_20171010_ryfyb_guj_001_0=Gift pack that contains many tools.<br>Right-click to use.<br><font color="#00ff00">Contains 1 Demon Banishing Order, 2 Gift Egg Embroidered Boxes (not yet activated Tier 3 Age of Wushu Record servers will get 1 Heavenly Snow Lotus). </font><br><font color="#ff0000">Jianghu VIP is required to open.</font>
