desc_box_guildwar_difen_sm_01_1=Warrior Rank Winning Rewards. <br><font color=""#FFFF00"">Usage: Open to get 10 Striving Edge Scriptures, and Martial Arts Cultivation Gift Pack. </font><br><font color=""#FFB428"">How to Obtain: Participate in the Striving Edge Tournament and win one round.</font>
