desc_box_guildwar_difen_sm_03_1=Master Rank Winning Rewards. <br><font color=""#FFFF00"">Usage: Open to get 20 Striving Edge Scriptures, and Martial Arts Cultivation Gift Pack. </font><br><font color=""#FFB428"">How to Obtain: Participate in the Striving Edge Tournament and win one round.</font>
desc_box_guildwar_difen_sm_01_lose_1=Warrior Rank Losing Rewards. <br><font color=""#FFFF00"">Usage: Open to get 5 Striving Edge Scriptures, and Martial Arts Cultivation Gift Pack. </font><br><font color=""#FFB428"">How to Obtain: Participate in the Striving Edge Tournament and lose one round.</font>
desc_box_guildwar_difen_sm_02_lose_1=Elite Rank Losing Rewards. <br><font color=""#FFFF00"">Usage: Open to get 8 Striving Edge Scriptures, and Martial Arts Cultivation Gift Pack. </font><br><font color=""#FFB428"">How to Obtain: Participate in the Striving Edge Tournament and lose one round.</font>
