desc_box_guildwar_difen_mid_01_1=In Warrior Rank of Striving Edge Tournament, the rewards for the number one guild of the day within the group. <br><font color=""#FFFF00"">Usage: Open to get 35 Striving Edge Scriptures, 5 Snow Lotus Pills, and 2 Hunyuan Tendon-Relaxing Pills. </font><br><font color=""#FFB428"">How to Obtain: Results counting rewards for the Striving Edge Tournament.</font>
