desc_box_guildwar_difen_big_01_1=The rewards for the guilds that are in the Warrior Rank (Dark Tier) by the end of season in the Striving Edge Tournament. <br>Note: You must have participated at least 6 days in the current season to obtain this reward. <br><font color=""#FFFF00"">Usage: Open to get 240 Striving Edge Scriptures, and 10 Snow Lotus Pills. </font><br><font color=""#FFB428"">How to Obtain: Seasonal rewards for the Striving Edge Tournament.</font>
