desc_taskitem_event_010_0=A piece of a brocade from ancient times. Stolen by an unknown thief, the elders have asked all disciples to retrieve it. This must be important. (Give this item to the Warehouse Elder (1245, 998), and he will give you a reward.)
desc_event_tianshan001_0=This signal was specially made for each Sect to search for hidden traitors. When it is used close to a spy, the spy will reveal his original identity.
