desc1_sword_leader_ts_001=<font color="#FFB90F">Tianshan Sect Ultimate Weapon</font><br>Sword which was owned by the founder of Tianshan Sect, Ye Qingtian. Made of ebony steel of Western Regions, this prime weapon yields to none. This artifact was later passed on to the sect leader’s successor Bai Tianjing.
