taolu_body52_desc=When you use the skill <font color="#FFA500">Frozen Snow in Cold Night</font>, the energy cost will be reduced by <font color="#FFA500">7%</font>. <br>When you use the skill <font color="#FFA500">Falling Snow in Clear Autumn</font>, the energy cost will be reduced by <font color="#FFA500">7%</font>. <br>When you use the skill <font color="#FFA500">Frozen Snow on White Wrist</font>, the energy cost will be reduced by <font color="#FFA500">7%</font>. <br>When you use the skill <font color="#FFA500">Falling Snow with Departing Sorrow</font>, the energy cost will be reduced by <font color="#FFA500">7%</font>. <br>When you use the skill <font color="#FFA500">Frozen Snow in Raging Tides</font>, the energy cost will be reduced by <font color="#FFA500">7%</font>. <br>When you use the skill <font color="#FFA500">Frozen Lotus with Clear Glitter</font>, the energy cost will be reduced by <font color="#FFA500">7%</font>. <br>When you use the skill <font color="#FFA500">Dark Snow on Dimmed Flag</font>, the energy cost will be reduced by <font color="#FFA500">7%</font>. <br>When you use the skill <font color="#FFA500">Dusk Snow in Forgotten Years</font>, the energy cost will be reduced by <font color="#FFA500">7%</font>.<br>
taolu_body53_name=Tianyue Sword Skill
taolu_body53_desc=When you use the skill <font color="#FFA500">Frozen Snow in Cold Night</font>, the energy cost will be reduced by <font color="#FFA500">15%</font>. <br>When you use the skill <font color="#FFA500">Falling Snow in Clear Autumn</font>, the energy cost will be reduced by <font color="#FFA500">15%</font>. <br>When you use the skill <font color="#FFA500">Frozen Snow on White Wrist</font>, the energy cost will be reduced by <font color="#FFA500">15%</font>. <br>When you use the skill <font color="#FFA500">Falling Snow with Departing Sorrow</font>, the energy cost will be reduced by <font color="#FFA500">15%</font>. <br>When you use the skill <font color="#FFA500">Frozen Snow in Raging Tides</font>, the energy cost will be reduced by <font color="#FFA500">15%</font>. <br>When you use the skill <font color="#FFA500">Frozen Lotus with Clear Glitter</font>, the energy cost will be reduced by <font color="#FFA500">15%</font>. <br>When you use the skill <font color="#FFA500">Dark Snow on Dimmed Flag</font>, the energy cost will be reduced by <font color="#FFA500">15%</font>. <br>When you use the skill <font color="#FFA500">Dusk Snow in Forgotten Years</font>, the energy cost will be reduced by <font color="#FFA500">15%</font>.<br>
taolu_body54_name=Tianyue Sword Skill
taolu_body54_desc=When you use the skill <font color="#FFA500">Frozen Snow in Cold Night</font>, the energy cost will be reduced by <font color="#FFA500">25%</font>. <br>When you use the skill <font color="#FFA500">Falling Snow in Clear Autumn</font>, the energy cost will be reduced by <font color="#FFA500">25%</font>. <br>When you use the skill <font color="#FFA500">Frozen Snow on White Wrist</font>, the energy cost will be reduced by <font color="#FFA500">25%</font>. <br>When you use the skill <font color="#FFA500">Falling Snow with Departing Sorrow</font>, the energy cost will be reduced by <font color="#FFA500">25%</font>. <br>When you use the skill <font color="#FFA500">Frozen Snow in Raging Tides</font>, the energy cost will be reduced by <font color="#FFA500">25%</font>. <br>When you use the skill <font color="#FFA500">Frozen Lotus with Clear Glitter</font>, the energy cost will be reduced by <font color="#FFA500">25%</font>. <br>When you use the skill <font color="#FFA500">Dark Snow on Dimmed Flag</font>, the energy cost will be reduced by <font color="#FFA500">25%</font>. <br>When you use the skill <font color="#FFA500">Dusk Snow in Forgotten Years</font>, the energy cost will be reduced by <font color="#FFA500">25%</font>.<br>
