desc_item_ssf_zutaiyang_z_0=Congealed by energy, the Ice Spirit can have the target suffer great pain. <br><font color="#ffd700">Item Origin: Twelve Swallows in the Snow [Lingxiao City (526,171)]Exchange</font><br><font color="#ffd700">Item Uses: After using, the user will get Unmarked Runes and the used will get Marked Runes (both can be exchanged at the Peak interface) </font><br><font color="#ffd700">How to use: </font><br>This item can only be used on players affected by Life and Death Runes for less than 5 times at the day <font color="#00ff00">outside battle, during events, with a stall, or if seriously inured, </font>by <font color="#00ff00">players</font>. <br>When Age of Wushu Record <font color="#00ff00">Pirate Raid</font> is activated, it requires that the user's item-related meridian should be practiced to <font color="#00ff00">72 cultivation cycles</font> and the target's power should reach <font color="#00ff00">Mentally Balanced</font>. <br>When Age of Wushu Record <font color="#00ff00">Soul Smashed Ninefold</font> is activated, it requires that the user's item-related meridian should be practiced to <font color="#00ff00">108 cultivation cycles</font> and the target's power should reach <font color="#00ff00">Enlightened Virtuoso</font>. <br>When Age of Wushu Record <font color="#00ff00">Plague of Luoyang</font> is activated, it requires that the user's item-related meridian should be practiced to <font color="#00ff00">144 cultivation cycles</font> and the target's power should reach <font color="#00ff00">Peerless</font>. <br>When Age of Wushu Record <font color="#00ff00">Traces of the Evil Cult</font> is activated, it requires that the user's item-related meridian should be practiced to <font color="#00ff00">180 cultivation cycles</font> and the target's power should reach <font color="#00ff00">Awe of the Universe</font>. <br><font color="#ffd700">Lord of Lingxiao City boards calculate Unmarked Runes at 00:30am on the first of each month.</font>
desc_qizhen_0115=This item has a strengthening effect on <font color="#00aa00">Taiyang Bladder Meridian of Foot</font>. Artifact needs to be used with a medicine catalyst, purchase the catalyst with silver taels for better effect.
desc_qizhen_0115_0=desc_qizhen_0115_0
