desc_bookitem_exchange_ts_0=Use the reward certificates you have won through Script stealing and protecting events. Speak with the book guardian disciples to exchange for Tianshan Sect skills.
desc_bookitem_exchange_ts01_0=Use the reward certificates you have won through Script stealing and protecting events. Speak with the book guardian disciples to exchange for Tianshan Sect skills.
desc_box_exchange_ts_1=Right click to open and you can obtain the school martial art skill rewards
desc_box_exchange_ts_2=Right click to open and you can obtain the school martial art skill rewards
desc_box_exchange_ts_3=Right click to open and you can obtain the apprentice school martial art skill rewards
desc_box_exchange_ts_1_1=Rewards are given to those who have made significant contributions to school script stealing or protection. These can be: Tianshan Sect Martial Arts Skills, a certain chance to obtain Tianshan Sect Internal Skills or annotated martial arts scripts. <br><font color="#FF0000">(Requires scroll from the Tianshan Sect Regular Collection. Item is bound to player.)</font>
desc_box_exchange_ts_2_1=Rewards are given to individuals who have made significant contribution to protect or seize the books of the schools. After opening, you can obtain rewards such as the Martial Arts Skill of the Tianshan Sect as well as get a certain chance to obtain the internal skill arts of the Tianshan Sect and annotated martial arts books. <br><font color="#FF0000"> (You must exchange with Tianshan Sect Essential Collection.)</font>
desc_box_exchange_ts_3_1=Rewards are given to individuals who have made significant contribution to protect or seize the books of the schools. After opening, you can obtain rewards such as the Martial Arts Skill of the Tianshan Sect as well as get a certain chance to obtain the internal skill arts of the Tianshan Sect and annotated martial arts books. <br><font color="#FF0000"> (You must exchange with Tianshan Sect Essential Collection.)</font>
desc_tsp_fhmp_box_1=After one day examine period is over, you can click the token to check whether you passed the examination.
desc_tsp_fhmp_box_1_1=<font color="#FF0000">The examination token for disciples who returned from training away. Can be opened after one day examine period.</font>
