desc_tianshan_panshi_01=The purpose of betraying the master: <br>Players generally rebel to get out of the faction and obtain qualification for entering into the other six major factions or join the new forces of Jianghu. Betraying the master is the only way to join the other six major factions.
desc_tianshan_panshi_03=Requirements for Betraying School: <br>Tier 2 Internal Skill is available. <br>Not an Acting Headmaster in the school. <br>Not a Deacon in the school. <br>Not an Elder in the school. <br>Not in an ongoing training-away task. <br>Not in an ongoing disguise task. <br>Has been more than 30 days since you left a school last time.
desc_tianshan_panshi_04=Punishments for Betraying the School:<br>The following school-related materials will be removed<br>Inner Skills<br>Martial Arts sets<br>status and titles.<br><br>You will be banned from participating in a Disciple Rebellion or similar event.
desc_tianshan_panshi_05=Compensation for betraying a master: <br>When a player got away from a school through master betrayal and joined other schools, the player will obtain the martial arts strength equivalent to that deleted for the betrayal as compensation in order to accelerate the player's practice of the new school martial arts studies.
desc_tianshan_panshi_06=Tianshan Sect: <br>Should you desire to return to the Tianshan Sect, we will always welcome you back. To rejoin, you can speak with <a href="findnpc_new,school22,npc_tsguj_005" style="HLStype1">Tian Jiaguan</a>.
desc_tianshan_xiashan_01=Purpose for training away from factions: <br>You can get away from the old faction by training away from factions and then join the new Jianghu forces. However, the player cannot join the other seven major factions. Compared to faction betrayal, punishment for training away from factions is relatively less severe.
desc_tianshan_xiashan_02=Jianghu related: <br>Through training away from factions, you can join the new factions of Jianghu, such as the <a href="findnpc_new,city05,xjz_021" style="HLStype1">Xu Family Manor</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,city05,WorldNpc100048" style="HLStype1">Golden Needle Sect</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school02,wssz_132" style="HLStype1">Beast Villa, </a>etc. I have no news regarding to the hidden factions. You need to find out about them in Jianghu yourself.
desc_tianshan_xiashan_03=Leaving faction for further training requirements: <br>Tier 2 internal Skill is active.<br>Not an Acting Grandmaster, Deacon or Elder in the school.<br>Not betraying school, or under disguise<br>It has been more than 30 days since the last time betrayed a faction.<br>Level reaches Peak of Power.
desc_tianshan_xiashan_04=Punishments for training away from school:<br>Internal Skill level will be decreased<br>Ultimate Martial Arts level will be decreased<br>Identity titles will be removed<br>Certain school tasks will be removed.
desc_tianshan_xiashan_05=Compensation for training away from school: <br>Players will have all of their martial arts strengths returned to the previous level before they left the previous faction. Of course, you can obtain extra precious items during your training quest. You may make a small fortune.
desc_tianshan_xiashan_06=Tianshan Sect: <br>Should the donor desire to return to the Shaolin temple after having successfully left and trained, they may speak with <a href="findnpc_new,school22,npc_tsguj_005" style="HLStype1">Tian Jiaguan</a>.
desc_tianshan_yirong_01=The purpose for going in disguise: <br>You can leave the faction by going away from faction. Join the new Jianghu forces. You cannot join other seven major factions. Disguised quests are difficult and expensive, but you will not receive punishment for it.
desc_tianshan_yirong_02=Jianghu related: <br>By going away from factions in disguise, you can join the new factions of Jianghu, such as the<a href="findnpc_new,city05,xjz_021" style="HLStype1"> Xu Family Manor</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,city05,WorldNpc100048" style="HLStype1">Golden Needle Sect</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school02,wssz_132" style="HLStype1">Beast Villa</a>, etc. I have no news regarding to the hidden factions. You need to find out about them in Jianghu yourself.
desc_tianshan_yirong_04=Punishment of disguise:<br>Delete identity title of the school.<br>Delete some tasks of the school.<br>Cannot betray, go downhill, or disguise again within 30 days.
desc_tianshan_yirong_05=Disguise compensation: <br>The martial arts strengths for players who leave under disguise will not be affected. They can also enjoy easy face change services.  They can also quickly return back to their schools
desc_tianshan_yirong_06=Tianshan Sect: <br>If the donor wishes to leave in disguise, you can to the Ruined Valley to look for the pill master of Jianghu, Chun Yucang. He is rumored to love abalone noodle soup. Just bring some when you go to find him and nothing will go wrong.
