desc_xueweitool_1201_0=One of the martial arts classics written based on the medical tantra "Lingshu." When read by a martial arts practitioner, the reader can instantly gain insight and unclog the meridian channels of the body, and eventually open up <font color="#FFCC00">Meichong</font>, the <font color="#FFCC00">first</font> acupoint of the <font color="#FFCC00">Taiyang Bladder Meridian of Foot</font>. <br>Cultivation points required for usage: <font color="#FFFF00">500,000</font>
desc_xueweitool_1202_0=One of the martial arts classics written based on the medical tantra "Lingshu." When read by a martial arts practitioner, the reader can instantly gain insight and unclog the meridian channels of the body, and eventually open up <font color="#FFCC00">Tongtian</font>, the <font color="#FFCC00">second</font> acupoint of the <font color="#FFCC00">Taiyang Bladder Meridian of Foot</font>. <br>Cultivation points required for usage: <font color="#FFFF00">1,000,000</font>
desc_xueweitool_1203_0=One of the martial arts classics written based on the medical tantra "Lingshu." When read by a martial arts practitioner, the reader can instantly gain insight and unclog the meridian channels of the body, and eventually open up <font color="#FFCC00">Luoque</font>, the <font color="#FFCC00">third</font> acupoint of the <font color="#FFCC00">Taiyang Bladder Meridian of Foot</font>. <br>Cultivation points required for usage: <font color="#FFFF00">1,500,000</font>
desc_xueweitool_1204_0=One of the martial arts classics written based on the medical tantra "Lingshu." When read by a martial arts practitioner, the reader can instantly gain insight and unclog the meridian channels of the body, and eventually open up <font color="#FFCC00">Tianzhu</font>, the <font color="#FFCC00">fourth</font> acupoint of the <font color="#FFCC00">Taiyang Bladder Meridian of Foot</font>. <br>Cultivation points required for usage: <font color="#FFFF00">2,000,000</font>
desc_xueweitool_1205_0=One of the martial arts classics written based on the medical tantra "Lingshu." When read by a martial arts practitioner, the reader can instantly gain insight and unclog the meridian channels of the body, and eventually open up <font color="#FFCC00">Fengmen</font>, the <font color="#FFCC00">fifth</font> acupoint of the <font color="#FFCC00">Taiyang Bladder Meridian of Foot</font>. <br>Cultivation points required for usage: <font color="#FFFF00">2,500,000</font>
desc_xueweitool_1206_0=One of the martial arts classics written based on the medical tantra "Lingshu." When read by a martial arts practitioner, the reader can instantly gain insight and unclog the meridian channels of the body, and eventually open up <font color="#FFCC00">Shenshu</font>, the <font color="#FFCC00">sixth</font> acupoint of the <font color="#FFCC00">Taiyang Bladder Meridian of Foot</font>. <br>Cultivation points required for usage: <font color="#FFFF00">3,000,000</font>
