desc_item_syjqzyb_003_0=A sachet.
desc_zhenqi_activity_002_d_tianlundan_0=After you use Sky Wheel Bead, it will help improve your martial arts cultivation. <br> Increase <font color="#FFFF00">100000</font> chi. <br>Items with different expiry times can not be stacked together.
desc_pro_ng_jh_108_d=Chaotic Yuan is a simplified "Kaihe Method", where the essential tenets of traditional Kaihe is condensed and crystallized to form the style that embodies "a confident and all-rounded energy" Once training has been completed successfully, the body's defenses are increased to the point of being unstoppable. Each move is unhindered and flows freely like a rushing river.
desc_pro_ng_jh_209_d=Icy Heart belongs to the style of Emptiness, the core is "heart of ice, nothing surprises, all change is static, calm energy, unblemished, uninfluenced, clear, empty, unburdened, free. After completing it successfully, when enemies are encountered, blood can be transformed into life force. It is truly a defensive and protective power.
desc_pro_ng_jh_205_d=A rare power in Jianghu. "The style of the toad." Toads often remain stationary. They can remain in the ground unmoving to preserve their energy, even when moving about they do not need much nourishment", toad style also looks at preserving poison. It is an extremely difficult discipline of internal skill. If successful, the yang energy is greatly increased , use calm to defend against movement, fight poison with poison, stand firm against opponents.
desc_pro_ng_jh_307_d=One of the most infamous kung fu styles was said to be created by the Blood Blade Father. "the force from the heart, not a hair's width inaccuracy, blood bath and destruction" are the tenets, use evil thoughts to attack, can cause unstoppable bleeding, enemies can drain out if not careful. It is looked down by upright Jianghu members, but its power is considerable.
desc_pro_ng_jh_203_d=This mantra is based on the laws of nature. Once you master it, you will be able to harness nature's energy.
desc_pro_ng_jh_204_d=Created by Hao Datong, the founder of the Hua Mountain Sect. It is a mental skill for cultivating inner pill. It is also supreme Xuangong of Daoist Martial Art. Kung fu starts from theory of “Yi” and comes from Non-polar diagram. When you finish studying, “Purple light Gang Qi” will be poured into the whole body. It can shock enemies with void inner skill.
desc_pro_ng_jh_108_d_0=Right click to learn Chaotic Yuan's Breakthrough Method. Only when <font color="#aaffaa">you have learned Level 49</font>, then you can learn this.
desc_pro_ng_jh_209_d_0=Right click to learn Icy Heart's Breakthrough Method. Only when <font color="#aaffaa">you have learned Level 49</font>, then you can learn this.
desc_pro_ng_jh_205_d_0=Right click to learn Poison Toad's Breakthrough Method. Only when <font color="#aaffaa">you have learned Level 49</font>, then you can learn this.
desc_pro_ng_jh_307_d_0=Right click to learn Blood Blade's Breakthrough Method. Only when <font color="#aaffaa">you have learned Level 49</font>, then you can learn this.
desc_pro_ng_jh_203_d_0=Right click to learn Five Element's Breakthrough Method. Only when <font color="#aaffaa">you have learned Level 49</font>, then you can learn this.
desc_pro_ng_jh_204_d_0=Right click to learn Purple Rosy's Breakthrough Method. Only when <font color="#aaffaa">you have learned Level 49</font>, then you can learn this.
desc_switch_520=Age of Wushu Red Packet Function
desc_switch_2820=Skill Team Practice Function
desc_switch_2131=Jiangnan Misty Cloud Storyline Switch
