desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jy_xsd02_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Eradication - Execution</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br>Skill damage slightly increases. Skill effect range increases by 2 meters. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Execution] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be a Royal Guard Disciple, Royal Guard Disguise Disciple, Royal Guard Training Away Disciple, or a disciple who entered Blood Blade Clan from Royal Guard or a disciple who entered Blood Blade Clan from Royal Guard and Age of Wushu Records - Soul Smashed Ninefold activated. </font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jy_xsd03_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Chaotic Battlefield - Execution</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br>Skill damage slightly increases. This move can use flying skills to approach the opponent faster than before. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Execution] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be a Royal Guard Disciple, Royal Guard Disguise Disciple, Royal Guard Training Away Disciple, or a disciple who entered Blood Blade Clan from Royal Guard or a disciple who entered Blood Blade Clan from Royal Guard and Age of Wushu Records - Soul Smashed Ninefold activated. </font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jy_xsd07_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Kill Indiscriminately - Execution</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br>Skill damage slightly increases. Landing the skill on an unparried opponent will let him <font color="#f9fc00">slow down</font> for 5 seconds. The less his HP is, the better the slow down effect is. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Execution] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be a Royal Guard Disciple, Royal Guard Disguise Disciple, Royal Guard Training Away Disciple, or a disciple who entered Blood Blade Clan from Royal Guard or a disciple who entered Blood Blade Clan from Royal Guard and Age of Wushu Records - Soul Smashed Ninefold activated. </font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_wdzp_tjq02_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Splitting A Wild Horse's Mane - Incontestable</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>martial skill Description: <br>Skill damage slightly increases. When your HP is below 50% and it is within 5 seconds of your last successful parry, you can obtain <font color="#FFAE00">Grappling Force</font> if you don't have <font color="#FFAE00">Grappling Force</font> yet. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Not Fight] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be a Wudang Disciple, Wudang Disguise Disciple, Wudang Training Away Disciple, or a disciple who entered Ancient Tomb Sect from Wudang or a disciple who entered Ancient Tomb Sect from Wudang and Age of Wushu Records - Soul Smashed Ninefold activated. </font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_wdzp_tjq06_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Wyvern Leaves The Sea - Incontestable</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>martial skill Description: <br>Skill damage slightly increases. The move can be used in the air. When it is within 5 seconds of your last successful parry, you can <font color="#f9fc00">paralyze</font> the unparried opponent for 3 seconds. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Not Fight] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Player must be Wudang Disciple, Wudang Disguise Disciple, Wudang Training Away Disciple, or Ancient Tomb Sect Disciple originally from Wudang. And Age of Wushu Records - Soul Smashed Ninefold activated.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_wdzp_tjq08_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Opening the Tai Chi - Incontestable</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br>Skill damage slightly increases. The effect range of the move increases to 6 meters. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Not Fight] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Player must be Wudang Disciple, Wudang Disguise Disciple, Wudang Training Away Disciple, or Ancient Tomb Sect Disciple originally from Wudang. And Age of Wushu Records - Soul Smashed Ninefold activated.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jl_dmssj01_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Silenced by the Sword - Myriad</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br>Skill damage slightly increases. The move becomes a single target move. When the opponent has Choke debuff, his HP and energy recovery is reduced by 40%. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Shura] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Player must be Wanderer's Valley Disciple, Wanderer's Valley Disguise Disciple, Wanderer's Valley Training Away Disciple, or Five Immortals Sect Disciple originally from Wanderer's Valley. And Age of Wushu Records - Soul Smashed Ninefold activated.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jl_dmssj07_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Step Back and Return - Myriad</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br>Skill damage slightly increases. The effect range of continuous damage and stun is increased to 10 meters. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Shura] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Player must be Wanderer's Valley Disciple, Wanderer's Valley Disguise Disciple, Wanderer's Valley Training Away Disciple, or Five Immortals Sect Disciple originally from Wanderer's Valley. And Age of Wushu Records - Soul Smashed Ninefold activated.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jl_dmssj09_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Defy the Heaven - Myriad</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br>Skill damage slightly increases. If the opponent's HP is above 70% at the start of this move, then this move will knock down the opponent at the last hit. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Shura] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Player must be Wanderer's Valley Disciple, Wanderer's Valley Disguise Disciple, Wanderer's Valley Training Away Disciple, or Five Immortals Sect Disciple originally from Wanderer's Valley. And Age of Wushu Records - Soul Smashed Ninefold activated.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_slzp_lzs03_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Seize the Clouds -Zen Heart</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br>Skill damage slightly increases. The effective range of this move is increased to 10 meters. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Zen Heart] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Player must be Shaolin Disciple, Shaolin Disguise Disciple, Shaolin Training Away Disciple, or Dharma Sect Disciple originally from Shaolin. And Age of Wushu Records - Soul Smashed Ninefold activated.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_slzp_lzs05_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Cherish the Lost - Zen Heart</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br>Skill damage slightly increases. When the target has <font color="#FFAE00">Incomplete</font> debuff, his skills will be <font color="#f9fc00">disabled</font>. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Zen Heart] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Player must be Shaolin Disciple, Shaolin Disguise Disciple, Shaolin Training Away Disciple, or Dharma Sect Disciple originally from Shaolin. And Age of Wushu Records - Soul Smashed Ninefold activated.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_slzp_lzs06_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Chasing Shadow -Zen Heart</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br>Skill damage slightly increases. When your own HP is below 50%, the move can knock down the target, regardless whether the target is parrying, and applies extra damage. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Zen Heart] martial skills. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Zen Heart] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Player must be Shaolin Disciple, Shaolin Disguise Disciple, Shaolin Training Away Disciple, or Dharma Sect Disciple originally from Shaolin. And Age of Wushu Records - Soul Smashed Ninefold activated.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jz_yxjf03_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Golden Sound and Jade Vibration - Flute Sound</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br>Skill damage slightly increases. The cool down is reduced by 5 seconds. The execution of the move is faster than before. If the move successfully hits the first target, then the target will be <font color="#f9fc00">stunned</font> for 3 seconds, and the <font color="#f9fc00">flying skill disable</font> from bouncing will be in effect for 1 more second. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Flute Sound] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Player must be Scholars Disciple, Scholars Disguise Disciple, Scholars Training Away Disciple, or Mount Hua Sect Disciple originally from Scholars. And Age of Wushu Records - Soul Smashed Ninefold activated.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jz_yxjf04_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Echo Over Tower - Flute Sound</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br>Skill damage slightly increases. The paralyze effect of the parry break move will be removed. Instead, it will become knock down effect upon successful parry break. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Flute Sound] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Player must be Scholars Disciple, Scholars Disguise Disciple, Scholars Training Away Disciple, or Mount Hua Sect Disciple originally from Scholars. And Age of Wushu Records - Soul Smashed Ninefold activated.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jz_yxjf06_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Oar in Midstream - Flute Sound</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br>Skill damage slightly increases. Within the effect area, the target will be <font color="#f9fc00">slowed down</font> by 30%, and <font color="#f9fc00"> the flying skills will be disabled</font>. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Flute Sound] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Player must be Scholars Disciple, Scholars Disguise Disciple, Scholars Training Away Disciple, or Mount Hua Sect Disciple originally from Scholars. And Age of Wushu Records - Soul Smashed Ninefold activated.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jz_yxjf07_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Phoenix Song - Flute Sound</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br>Skill damage slightly increases. The move becomes a single target move. After [Oar in Midstream - Flute Sound] is used, this move will be a multiple target move, and can <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> unparried targets affected by [Oar in Midstream - Flute Sound]. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Player must be Scholars Disciple, Scholars Disguise Disciple, Scholars Training Away Disciple, or Mount Hua Sect Disciple originally from Scholars. And Age of Wushu Records - Soul Smashed Ninefold activated.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_em_ynjf01_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Counterstrike of Mulan - Fantasy Moon</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br>Skill damage slightly increases. Effective range is increased by 2 meters. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Fantasy Moon] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Player must be Emei Disciple, Emei Disguise Disciple, Emei Training Away Disciple, or Divine Water Palace Disciple originally from Emei. And Age of Wushu Records - Soul Smashed Ninefold activated.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_em_ynjf04_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Colored Eyebrows - Fantasy Moon</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br>Skill damage slightly increases. Effective range is increased to 5 meters. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Fantasy Moon] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Player must be Emei Disciple, Emei Disguise Disciple, Emei Training Away Disciple, or Divine Water Palace Disciple originally from Emei. And Age of Wushu Records - Soul Smashed Ninefold activated.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_em_ynjf07_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Light as Swallow - Fantasy Moon</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br>When you have Hidden Energy and parry successfully, you will gain 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Light as Swallow - Fantasy Moon</font> effect: <font color="#f9fc00">Internal accuracy increases by 6%</font>. It lasts for 10 seconds and can be stacked for 5 times. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Fantasy Moon] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Player must be Emei Disciple, Emei Disguise Disciple, Emei Training Away Disciple, or Divine Water Palace Disciple originally from Emei. And Age of Wushu Records - Soul Smashed Ninefold activated.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_tm_ywt03_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Hunt the Soul - Ghost Prison</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br>Skill damage slightly increases. Every time you hit the target, it reduces the cool down of [Wronged Ghost at Your Feet] and [Wicked Spirit Blocks the Way] by 3 seconds, reduces the cool down of [Soup of Oblivion] by 1 second, and <font color="#f9fc00">knocks back</font> the unparrying target. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Ghost Prison] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Player must be Tangmen Disciple, Tangmen Disguise Disciple, Tangmen Training Away Disciple, or Nianluo Dam Disciple originally from Tangmen. And Age of Wushu Records - Soul Smashed Ninefold activated.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_tm_ywt04_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Wicked Spirit Blocks the Way - Ghost Prison</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br>Secretly set the trap. Increase the trap radius by 1 meter. When the trap explodes, it will blow up at most 5 unparrying targets within trap area. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Ghost Prison] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Player must be Tangmen Disciple, Tangmen Disguise Disciple, Tangmen Training Away Disciple, or Nianluo Dam Disciple originally from Tangmen. And Age of Wushu Records - Soul Smashed Ninefold activated.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_tm_ywt05_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Soup of Oblivion - Ghost Prison</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br>Skill damage slightly increases. Damage type is changed to external damage. Skill cool down is reduced by 2 seconds. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Ghost Prison] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Player must be Tangmen Disciple, Tangmen Disguise Disciple, Tangmen Training Away Disciple, or Nianluo Dam Disciple originally from Tangmen. And Age of Wushu Records - Soul Smashed Ninefold activated.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_tm_ywt06_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Wronged Ghost at Your Feet - Ghost Prison</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br>Secretly set the trap. Increase the trap radius by 1 meter. It will disable skills and paralyze at most 5 unparrying targets within trap area for 3 seconds. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Ghost Prison] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Player must be Tangmen Disciple, Tangmen Disguise Disciple, Tangmen Training Away Disciple, or Nianluo Dam Disciple originally from Tangmen. And Age of Wushu Records - Soul Smashed Ninefold activated.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_tm_ywt07_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Brush of the Underworld Judge - Ghost Prison</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br>Skill damage slightly increases. Skill execution becomes faster. Damage type is changed to external damage. If it hits unparrying target, the target will be <font color="#f9fc00">slowed and flying skill disabled</font> for 2 seconds. In addition, if the unparrying target is debuffed with Wronged Ghost, then the target will be <font color="#f9fc00">locked</font> for 1.5 seconds. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Ghost Prison] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Player must be Tangmen Disciple, Tangmen Disguise Disciple, Tangmen Training Away Disciple, or Nianluo Dam Disciple originally from Tangmen. And Age of Wushu Records - Soul Smashed Ninefold activated.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_gbzp_dgbf02_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Swipe Dog's Back - Chase The Dog</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br>Skill damage slightly increases. If the target is in <font color="#FFAE00">Flipped</font> state, then hitting unparrying target will decrease 30% of its <font color="#f9fc00">internal and external defense</font> for 5 seconds. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Chase The Dog] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Player must be Beggar's Sect Disciple, Beggar's Sect Disguise Disciple, Beggar's Sect Training Away Disciple, or Changfeng Escort Agency Disciple originally from Beggar's Sect. And Age of Wushu Records - Soul Smashed Ninefold activated.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_gbzp_dgbf07_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Flip the Dog Upside-Down - Chase The Dog</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br>Skill damage slightly increases. If your action is interrupted, you will gain 50% <font color="#f9fc00">damage immunity</font> for 6 seconds. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Chase The Dog] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Player must be Beggar's Sect Disciple, Beggar's Sect Disguise Disciple, Beggar's Sect Training Away Disciple, or Changfeng Escort Agency Disciple originally from Beggar's Sect. And Age of Wushu Records - Soul Smashed Ninefold activated.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_gbzp_dgbf08_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">No Dogs Under Heaven - Chase The Dog</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br>Skill damage slightly increases. Hitting on unparrying target will <font color="#f9fc00">disable flying skills</font> for the target for 1 second. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Chase The Dog] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Player must be Beggar's Sect Disciple, Beggar's Sect Disguise Disciple, Beggar's Sect Training Away Disciple, or Changfeng Escort Agency Disciple originally from Beggar's Sect. And Age of Wushu Records - Soul Smashed Ninefold activated.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jh_sjjc02_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Singing Arrow - Mind and Vision</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br>Skill damage slightly increases. Increase the range to 25 meters. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Mind and Vision] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Player must be Ming Cult Disciple, Ming Cult Disguise Disciple, Ming Cult Training Away Disciple, or Shenji Camp Disciple originally from Ming Cult. And Age of Wushu Records - Soul Smashed Ninefold activated.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jh_sjjc05_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Tiger Butchering - Mind and Vision</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br>Skill damage slightly increases. Reduce the cool down by 3 seconds. The target can be close in range. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Mind and Vision] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Player must be Ming Cult Disciple, Ming Cult Disguise Disciple, Ming Cult Training Away Disciple, or Shenji Camp Disciple originally from Ming Cult. And Age of Wushu Records - Soul Smashed Ninefold activated.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jh_sjjc06_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Hang the Louse - Mind and Vision</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br>Skill damage slightly increases. Combine 3 hits into 1 single hit. The execution becomes faster. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Mind and Vision] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Player must be Ming Cult Disciple, Ming Cult Disguise Disciple, Ming Cult Training Away Disciple, or Shenji Camp Disciple originally from Ming Cult. And Age of Wushu Records - Soul Smashed Ninefold activated.</font>
