desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jh_tlq02_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Mantis Flips the Cart - Windsplitter</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br/>Slightly increases the Skill damage. Increases Range by 2 meters. When <font color="#FFAE00">[Mantis Breaks Cart - Windsplitter]</font> skill is equipped, Broken Cart state duration is increased by 2 seconds.<br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Windsplitter] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jh_tlq03_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Inquisitive Mantis - Windsplitter</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br/>Use the skill to obtain two states. When two states are active, <font color="#FFAE00">Mantis Stalks a Cicada</font> drawing it back becomes faster. Activating <font color="#FFAE00">Mantis Breaks Cart</font> will consume this state.<br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Windsplitter] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jh_tlq04_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Mantis Breaks Cart - Windsplitter</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br/> Slightly increases the Skill damage. Decreases charging time. When there are two <font color="#FFAE00">Inquisitive Mantis</font> states at the same time, skill’s Charge Speed becomes faster.<br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Windsplitter] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_xy_ktdj01_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Caged Beast's Struggle - Kuntian</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br>Slightly increases the Skill damage. Range changes to 10 meters in front. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Kuntian] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_xy_ktdj06_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Endless Separation - Kuntian</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br>Slightly increases the Skill damage. When the target has 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Trapped (parry)</font>, it gets Silenced for 2 seconds. <br>(Can’t Silence the same target within 10 seconds)<br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Kuntian] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_xy_ktdj07_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Steal The Sun - Kuntian</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br>Slightly increases the Skill damage. When the target hit by skill has 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Trapped (parry)</font>, you can pull it closer once. <br>(This effect ignores parry. Can’t pull the same target within 10 seconds). <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Kuntian] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_ts_wcjf01_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Everlasting Heartbreak - Autumn Water</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br>Skill damage slightly increases. The effect range of the move increases to 1 meter. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Autumn Water] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Player must be Tianshan Disciple, Tianshan Disguise Disciple, Tianshan Training Away Disciple.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_ts_wcjf05_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Depressed Trance - Autumn Water</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br>Skill damage slightly increases. <font color="#f9fc00">Hit Rate is greatly improved. Each hit can add 0.15 times the damage of the target's Energy, but Cooldown is increased by 2 seconds.<br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Autumn Water] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Player must be Tianshan Disciple, Tianshan Disguise Disciple, Tianshan Training Away Disciple.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_ts_wcjf07_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Faded Dots - Autumn Water</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br> <br>Skill damage slightly increases. Each hit can add 0.12 times the damage of the target's Energy.<br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Autumn Water] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Player must be Tianshan Disciple, Tianshan Disguise Disciple, Tianshan Training Away Disciple.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_ts_tsjf01_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Empty Snowfall - Boundless Ice</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br/>Skill damage slightly increases. Hitting an unparried target will inflict 25% <font color="#f9fc00">Slow down</font>.<br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Boundless Ice] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Player must be Tianshan Disciple, Tianshan Disguise Disciple, Tianshan Training Away Disciple. And Age of Wushu Records - Soul Smashed Ninefold activated.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_ts_tsjf03_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Cloud Lotus - Boundless Ice</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br/>Skill damage slightly increases. Skill Charge Speed is increased. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Boundless Ice] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Player must be Tianshan Disciple, Tianshan Disguise Disciple, Tianshan Training Away Disciple. And Age of Wushu Records - Soul Smashed Ninefold activated.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_ts_tsjf06_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the martial skill <font color="#FF0000">Broken Mount - Boundless Ice</font>. <font color="#00ff00">In order to use the martial skill, you must have learned the corresponding original skill. </font><br>Martial skill Description: <br/>Skill damage slightly increases. Increases Team Members’ within the Ice Wall range <font color="#f9fc00">Movement Speed</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Hit Rate</font> for 7 seconds. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this skill set will change once you have activated all the [Boundless Ice] martial skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate the martial skill in the Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Conditions of Use: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Player must be Tianshan Disciple, Tianshan Disguise Disciple, Tianshan Training Away Disciple. And Age of Wushu Records - Soul Smashed Ninefold activated.</font>
