desc_box_guj_bhhz_dzjl_yu_b_0=Guild War Reward Pack. Open to get: <br> If Age of Wushu Record - Plague of Luoyang has not been activated, then you get <font color="#00ff00">17 Hunyuan Pills, 1 Refined Moon Internal Skill Pill, 2 Tianyuan Soul Gathering Pills</font>. <br>If Age of Wushu Record - Plague of Luoyang has been activated, then you get <font color="#00ff00">35 Hunyuan Pills, 1 Refined Moon Internal Skill Pill, 2 Tianyuan Soul Gathering Pills</font>.
desc_box_guj_bhhz_dzjl_jin_c_0=Guild War Reward Pack. Open to get: <br> If Age of Wushu Record - Plague of Luoyang has not been activated, then you get <font color="#00ff00">12 Hunyuan Pills, 1 Jade Internal Skill Pill, 1 Chi Stabilization Pill</font>. <br>If Age of Wushu Record - Plague of Luoyang has been activated, then you get <font color="#00ff00">25 Hunyuan Pills, 1 Jade Internal Skill Pill, 1 Chi Stabilization Pill</font>.
desc_box_guj_bhhz_dzjl_yin_d_0=Guild War Reward Pack. Open to get: <br> If Age of Wushu Record - Plague of Luoyang has not been activated, then you get <font color="#00ff00">2 Hunyuan Pills, 1 Moon Internal Skill Pill, 1 Chi Accumulation Pill</font>. <br>If Age of Wushu Record - Plague of Luoyang has been activated, then you get <font color="#00ff00">5 Hunyuan Pills, 1 Moon Internal Skill Pill, 1 Chi Accumulation Pill</font>.
