desc_item_lzy_20181017hd_wxdhq_0=Martial Art Exchange Certificate: <br>Go to Lin Liang to exchange martial arts. They include: <br><font color="#FFB428">Quanzhen Sword, Record of Dancing Ghost, Kuntian Blade</font><br><font color="#FFB428">A Prodigy's Swordsmanship, Guxi Dagger, Yang Rubbing Staff</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Female Only, Golden Deer Blade, Sinister Axe of the Dragon</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Full Moon Scimitar, Western Fencing, Demon Dagger</font>.
