desc_fuli_em_blc001_0=A special medicine made for Emei skills. It can enhance the damage of Departing Sting - Kindred Death by 10%.
desc_fuli_em_blc002_0=A special medicine made for Emei skills. It can enhance the damage of Departing Sting - Parting Sorrow by 10%.
desc_fuli_em_blc003_0=A special medicine made for Emei skills. It can enhance the damage of Departing Sting - Loathsome Clouds and Rain by 10%.
