desc_fuli_em_blc005_0=A special medicine made for Emei skills. It can enhance the damage of Departing Sting - Departed Kin by 10%.
cs_004_009=Jiming Posthouse is so quiet and peaceful that many elders retire here.
desc_switchconfig_device_unstable=Not enough memory. The game is unstable. This may impact your gaming. Recommend to use simple visual setting.
desc_switchconfig_device_serious=Not enough memory. The game is very unstable. You will not be able to game normally. Recommend to use simple visual setting.
desc_taskitem_korea_001_0=Identity Tags from the Korean Guards can be given to the Servant Girl found in each of the major schools for a hefty reward. <br/>The markers for the entrances to each schools' forbidden instance are: <br/>Shaolin: (433,-56)<br/> Wudang: (1047,515)<br/> Emei: (655,-279)<br/> Beggar's Sect: (882,-11)<br/> Tangmen: (1188,-552 )<br/> Scholar's Academy: (141,617)<br/> Royal Guards: (-25,-555)<br/> Wanderer's Valley: (663,-42)<br/> Ming Cult: (148,-574)<br/>Tianshan Sect (956,577)<br/> Servant girl marker: <br/>Shaolin: (442,-61)<br/> Wudang: (1027,525)<br/> Emei: (664,-286)<br/> Beggar's Sect: (891,-11)<br/> Tangmen: (1203,-543)<br/> Scholar's Academy: (131,622)<br/> Royal Guards: (-32,-544)<br/> Wanderer's Valley: (687,-69)<br/> Ming Cult: (148 -574)<br/>Tianshan Sect (956,577)
menu_meigiu_03=Exchange refined golds, mysterious pills, and interaction animations.
desc_cropper_50004=Pink Roses, great as gift for your lover. <br>During the event, exchange at <font color="#08E905">Flower Lady</font> with Bosom Ring.
desc_box_exchange_04_1=Rewards are given to those who have made significant contributions to school script stealing or protection. These can be: Wanderer's Valley Martial Arts Skills, a certain chance to obtain Wanderer's Valley Internal Skills or annotated martial arts scripts. (Requires scroll from the Wanderer's Valley Regular Collection. Item is bound to player.)
desc_box_exchange_14_1=Rewards are given to those who have made significant contributions to school script stealing or protection. These can be: Wanderer's Valley Martial Arts Skills, a certain chance to obtain Wanderer's Valley Internal Skills or annotated martial arts scripts. (Requires scroll from the Wanderer's Valley Essential Collection.)
desc_box_exchange_24_1=Rewards are given to those who have made significant contributions to the School Raid or Script Protection. Rewards: A Wanderer's Valley Martial Arts Skills Level 1-5 and a chance to receive Wanderer's Valley Martial Arts Skills Level 6, Internal Skills or an annotated martial arts scripts. Upon completing the Age of Wushu Record Traces of the Evil Cult incident, there's a chance to receive a Wanderer's Valley Martial Arts Skills Level 7. (Requires scroll from the Wanderer's Valley Essential Collection.)
desc_box_wnhd_txb01_1=<font color="#FFB428">An exquisitely packaged gift box containing Reputation Scrolls (5000), 200 liang of silver coins, 30 repairing tools, 10 Hidden Head Exposed Tails, 5 red abalone soups, 20 hatched diagrams, 5 Slaying the Emperor, 5 fried sausages, 5 travelling tokens, 100 steamed bread, Expansion Pack Embroidered Box, one set of fashion wear for men and women (3 days), a Horse Whistle [Dayuan Horse] (14 days), 5 Zichen pills and 2 large Ruyi Pills. </font>
desc_shaolin_panshi_01=Purpose of Betrayal: <br>Players betray to leave the school, and obtain the qualification to join other schools or to join the Jianghu new factions.  Betraying is the only way to join other schools.
desc_shaolin_panshi_04=Punishments for betraying the faction:<br>The following school-related materials will be removed<br>Inner Skills<br>Martial Arts sets<br>Advanced Skill sets<br>Ultimate Skill set <br>Status and Titles<br>Some of school quests
desc_shaolin_panshi_06=Shaolin Temple: <br>Should you desire to return to the Shaolin temple, I will always welcome you back. You can speak with <a href="findnpc_new,school08,sl182" style="HLStype1">Master Zu Xun</a>.
desc_shaolin_xiashan_01=Purpose of Training Away: <br>You can leave school by training away, and then join the new Jianghu factions. However, you cannot join other schools.  Compared to school betrayal, punishment for training away is relatively less severe.
desc_shaolin_xiashan_04=Punishment for training away from school: <br>Internal Skill level of this school will be decreased. <br>Martial art skill level of this school will be decreased.<br>Ultimate Skill Set level of this school will be decreased. <br>Advanced Skill Set level of this school will be decreased.<br>Identity titles will be removed. <br>Certain school tasks will be removed.
desc_shaolin_xiashan_06=Shaolin: <br>Should you desire to return to Shaolin after having left to train, you may speak with <a href="findnpc_new,school08,sl182" style="HLStype1">Zu Xun</a>. I won't try to keep you. You can decide for yourself.
desc_shaolin_yirong_01=Purpose of Disguise: <br>You can leave school by disguise, and join the new Jianghu factions. However, you cannot join other schools. Disguise quest is relatively difficult, but you will not receive much punishment.
desc_shaolin_yirong_06=Shaolin: <br>If you wish to leave in disguise, you can go to Ruined Valley to look for the pill master of Jianghu. But I don't know exactly where he is. He is rumored to love abalone noodle soup. Just bring some when you go to find him and nothing will go wrong.
desc_emei_panshi_01=Purpose of Betrayal: <br>Players betray to leave the school, and obtain the qualification to join other schools or to join the Jianghu new factions. Betraying is the only way to join other schools.
desc_emei_panshi_04=Punishments for betraying the faction:<br>The following school-related materials will be removed<br>Inner Skills<br>Martial Arts sets<br>Advanced Skill sets<br>Ultimate Skill set <br>Status and Titles<br>Some of school quests
desc_emei_panshi_06=Emei: <br>You are welcome here at any time. Look for <a href="findnpc_new,school06,em909" style="HLStype1">Abbess Li Xiaoxiao</a> if you really want to betray the Emei. The choice is yours.
desc_emei_xiashan_01=Purpose of Training Away: <br>You can leave school by training away, and then join the new Jianghu factions. However, you cannot join other schools. Compared to school betrayal, punishment for training away is relatively less severe.
desc_emei_xiashan_04=Punishment for training away from school: <br>Internal Skill level of this school will be decreased. <br>Martial art skill level of this school will be decreased.<br>Ultimate Skill Set level of this school will be decreased. <br>Advanced Skill Set level of this school will be decreased.<br>Identity titles will be removed. <br>Certain school tasks will be removed.
