desc_item_prize_gumu_015_1=Ancient Tomb quests rewards, include <font color="#FFFF00">Reputation Token (500), Jade Bee Token x20, Icy Jade Badge x1</font>. <br><font color="#FF0000">Players who didn't reach certain damage will get few rewards</font>
