desc_box_hd_zmjh_01_1=Open the box to get Huangxian Dew, and Refined Moon Internal Skill Pill. There is also a chance to get Martial Arts Treasure Box, Internal Skill Scroll Fragment, or Copy Fragment.
desc_box_hd_zmjh_02_1=Open the box to get Green Pill, and Green Jade Internal Skill Pill.
desc_sanmeng_card_001=You can exchange for the Lore item <font color="#FFB428">"Dragon Soul Dominating Blade Sheath"</font> at Lin Liang the Event Ambassador with 2 tokens.
desc_baipei_duihuan_jin_03_0=The soldiers, who were previously average citizens, fought fiercely with each other for many days and nights. The broken weapons fell on the ground. <br>Visit <font color="#f9fc00">Luoyang (290, 570) and speak with Chinese Material Merchant (Equipment)</font> to <font color="#f9fc00">exchange for Level 3 Gold Weapon</font>.
desc_baipei_duihuan_yu_03_0=Generals and soldiers dashed into the battlefield. They eventually died a hero death. They vanished together with the bent weapons. <br>Visit <font color="#f9fc00">Luoyang (290, 570) and speak with Chinese Material Merchant (Equipment)</font> to <font color="#f9fc00">exchange for Level 3 Jade Weapon. </font>
