desc_mingjiao_panshi_01=Purpose of Betrayal: <br>Players betray to leave the school, and obtain the qualification to join other schools or to join the Jianghu new factions. Betraying is the only way to join other schools.
desc_mingjiao_panshi_04=Punishments for betraying the faction:<br>The following school-related materials will be removed<br>Inner Skills<br>Martial Arts sets<br>Advanced Skill sets<br>Ultimate Skill set <br>Status and Titles<br>Some of school quests
desc_mingjiao_xiashan_01=Purpose of Training Away: <br>You can leave school by training away, and then join the new Jianghu factions. However, you cannot join other schools. Compared to school betrayal, punishment for training away is relatively less severe.
desc_mingjiao_xiashan_04=Punishment for training away from school: <br>Internal Skill level of this school will be decreased. <br>Martial art skill level of this school will be decreased.<br>Ultimate Skill Set level of this school will be decreased. <br>Advanced Skill Set level of this school will be decreased.<br>Identity titles will be removed. <br>Certain school tasks will be removed.
desc_mingjiao_xiashan_06=Ming Cult: <br>Should you desire to return to Ming Cult after training away, you may speak with <a href="findnpc_new,school20,npc_mjwy_005" style="HLStype1">Lei Ri</a>. I won't try to keep you. You can decide for yourself.
desc_mingjiao_yirong_01=Purpose of Disguise: <br>You can leave school by disguise, and join the new Jianghu factions. However, you cannot join other schools. Disguise quest is relatively difficult, but you will not receive much punishment.
desc_mingjiao_yirong_06=Ming Cult: <br>If you wish to leave in disguise, you can go to Ruined Valley to look for the pill master of Jianghu. But I don't know exactly where he is. He is rumored to love abalone noodle soup. Just bring some when you go to find him and nothing will go wrong.
desc_box_guj_minmgjiao_huodong_013_0=<br>A package that contains exclusive martial art cultivation pills. <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 1 or 2 internal stage: 800,000 exclusive martial art Cultivation Injection; </font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 3 internal stage: 1,600,000 exclusive martial art Cultivation Injection;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 4 internal stage: 3,200,000 exclusive martial art Cultivation Injection;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 5 internal stage: 6,400,000 exclusive martial art Cultivation Injection;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 6 internal stage: 10,000,000 exclusive martial art Cultivation Injection;</font> <br>The martial art skills include: <br><font color="#FFB428">Quanzhen Sword, Record of Dancing Ghost, Kuntian Blade, A Prodigy's Swordsmanship, Guxi Dagger, Yang Rubbing Staff, Female Only, Golden Deer Blade, Sinister Axe of the Dragon, Full Moon Scimitar, Western Fencing, Demon Dagger</font>.
