desc_item_xmphd_mjywj_001_1=Tianshan Sect players can go to Ling Aomei (Tianshan Sect Elder Brother) (878, 666) in Chengdu, and complete the Wander Jianghu Companion quest to obtain the reward token. (Requirements: 1. A Tianshan Sect player and a non Tianshan Sect player form a team, of which the leader is the Tianshan Sect player, and in which there are only 2 members. 2. Players in the team must meet the inner strength requirement<font color="#FF3030">(At 3rd inner stage, inner points reach 67. At 4th inner stage, inner points reach 89. At 5th inner stage, inner points reach 109. At 6th inner stage, inner points reach 128.) Each character can only complete this quest once. </font> 3. Neither player on team has completed the quest yet, and neither has their number of quests reaching maximum limit. 4. If all the requirements are met, one can go to the Tianshan Sect Elder Brother to take the quest: Wander Jianghu Companion (Ming), and Wander Jianghu Companion (Ban).) <font color="#FF3030">Use this token to exchange a class 3 life-produced jade weapon, at Ling Aomei (Tianshan Sect Elder Brother) (878, 666) in Chengdu. </font>
desc_item_xmphd_mjywj_001=Tianshan Sect Jade Martial Art Scroll
desc_box_2017dy_qixi=After use, you will gain 1 Valentines' Magpie Bridge (which lasts 7 Days, and is a teleport tool for married couples), 2 Light Cloud Flying Star (each of which increases intimacy by 500), and 1 Valentines' Firework. After you use Valentines' Firework on another player, you two will get the following titles: Flying Phoenix (permanent).
question_2018316=In the following, which one is not a school:
desc_box_2018hd_shp_032=Activity Reward (4): <br>Jianghu VIP players can open it to get <font color="#FFFF00">10 Hundred-Year Snow Lotus Fruits, 200 Hunyuan Pills (1 Day)</font>.
