dhs_xmphd_002=Tianshan Sect Internal Level Up Event. During event, players can accept quests from me and get different advanced certificate to increase your internal skills, or you can upgrade  your Tianshan Sect martial art with Martial Art Exchange Certificate.
dhs_xmphd_003=If you have corresponding <font color="#FF3030">Tianshan Inner Level Up Token</font>, you can use it to upgrade the corresponding tier of inner here.
dhs_xmphd_004=Use Tianshan Sect Inner Level Up Tokens to upgrade Tianshan Sect Inner Skills. <font color="#FF3030">Check your own inner progress first, to avoid unnecessary waste of Level Up Tokens. </font>
dhs_xmphd_005=Use 1 <font color="#FF3030">Tianshan Sect 1st Inner Level Up Token</font> to increase Tianshan Sect 1st Inner to level 25.
dhs_xmphd_006=Use 1 <font color="#FF3030">Tianshan Sect 2nd Inner Level Up Token</font> to increase Tianshan Sect 2nd Inner to level 20.
