luandou_gift_sys_001=Happy New Year to everyone! In <font color=""#FFFF00"">60 seconds</font>, <font color=""#FFFF00"">Heavenly Treasure</font> will appear in the battlefield. Win the treasure to get various surprises!
luandou_gift_sys_002=In <font color=""#FFFF00"">60 seconds</font>, a new <font color=""#FFFF00"">Heavenly Treasure</font> will appear in the battlefield. Win the treasure to get various surprises!
luandou_gift_sys_003=Congratulations! You got Heavenly Blessing and in this battlefield you learned a set of <font color=""#FFFF00"">Jianghu Internal Skills</font>!
