talk_guanchaolianjian_001=Energy in my body is bulging, as if it is faintly in line with the waves!
talk_guanchaolianjian_002=The enlightened comprehend the sword intent
talk_guanchaolianjian_003=Please pay attention to the execution order of sword spirit!
