ui_xingmiaoge_rm01=Jianghu is in turmoil and the reclusive school is ready to make a move. Qualified Tianshan Sect players can join Starry Pavilion right away to learn its internal and martial skills. See system mail for details.
ui_xingmiaoge_title_01=Reclusive Faction Emerges (Tianshan Sect)
ui_xingmiaoge_text_01=Recently, Starry Pavilion selected soldiers from Jianghu. The head of Tianshan Mountain, who sent message via carrier pigeon, allowed his disciples to go to Starry Pavilion. If Tianshan disciples want to go to Starry Pavilion, they can go to the headmaster for detailed info. <font color="#FF0000">(Tip: Tianshan disciples willing to join Starry Pavilion must go to Tianshan to ask the Headmaster (1262 919). It is recommended that Tianshan disciples choose this way to join Starry Pavilion.) </font>
ui_xingmiaoge_rm02=Jianghu is in turmoil and the reclusive school is ready to make a move. Qualified Jianghu players (Vagrants) can join Starry Pavilion right away to learn its internal and martial skills. See system mail for details.
ui_xingmiaoge_title_02=Reclusive Faction Emerges (Starry Pavilion)
ui_xingmiaoge_text_02=Starry Pavilion is recruiting. Any vagrant player interested in joining Starry Pavilion can go to <font color="#FF0000">Yanyu Villa Wineshop second floor Ranger (484 1083)</font> for more info.
