desc_pro_ng_jh_307_d_59=One of the most infamous kung fu styles was said to be created by the Blood Blade Father. "the force from the heart, not a hair's width inaccuracy, blood bath and destruction" are the tenets, use evil thoughts to attack, can cause unstoppable bleeding, enemies can drain out if not careful. It is looked down by upright Jianghu members, but its power is considerable.
