home_10_new_01=Twinkle Firefly
desc_home_10_new_01_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Decoration<br><font color="#FFFF00">Luxury: </font>200<br><font color="#FFFF00">Requirement: </font>Home has reached level 1<br>Bugs fly, bugs fly, who are you missing? <br>Right-click to use. It will be stored to the Home Inventory automatically.
home_10_new_002=Moral Integrity Screen
home_10_new_02=Daming Palace Lantern
desc_home_10_new_02_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Lantern<br><font color="#FFFF00">Luxury: </font>200<br><font color="#FFFF00">Requirement: </font>Home has reached level 1<br>Made by skilled craftsmen in style of the Tang Dynasty Daming Palace Lantern. It is dazzling and eye-catching. <br>Right click the lamp and choose to turn on/off the lamp.<br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
home_10_new_003=Daming Palace Lantern
home_10_new_03=Moral Integrity Screen
desc_home_10_new_03_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Screen<br><font color="#FFFF00">Luxury: </font>200<br><font color="#FFFF00">Requirement: </font>Home has reached level 1<br>Tang poetry is full of brilliance in spring and autumn. A fresh and gorgeous Tang screen. <br>Right-click to use. It will be stored to the Home Inventory automatically.
home_10_new_004=River Shadow Rosewood Chair
home_10_new_04=River Shadow Rosewood Chair
desc_home_10_new_04_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Chair<br><font color="#FFFF00">Luxury: </font>200<br><font color="#FFFF00">Requirement: </font>Home has reached level 1<br>Tang nobility custom-made favorite. Beautiful and comfortable, harmonious and pleasing to the eye. <br>You will get Cultivation Points when resting on the chair. The effect differs according to the quality of the chair. The cooldown is 6 hours. Players will get the buff every 12 hours. <br>When the Home durability is less than half, the effect will be decreased.<br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
home_10_new_005=Gorgeous Chaise Lounge
home_10_new_05=Gorgeous Chaise Lounge
desc_home_10_new_05_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Bed<br><font color="#FFFF00">Luxury: </font>200<br><font color="#FFFF00">Requirement: </font>Home has reached level 1<br>Tang Dynasty Daming Palace style furniture. Elegant, chic and dignified. <br>After using it, your Max HP and Energy will increase (Effect determined by item quality). The cooldown period is 6 hours and the buff can be reused 6 hours after cooldown.<br>When home durability is lower than 50%, the furniture effect will be affected.<br>Right-click to use. It will be stored in the Home Inventory automatically.
desc_home_10_new_01_sm=Bugs fly, bugs fly, who are you missing?
