desc_xingmiaog02=If you want to cut down on fireworks and spare the world, let the clouds and moon cover the building for the time being.
desc_xingmiaog03=White gulls fly over wide rippling waters. Green and pure spring is deep and good to dye clothes.
desc_xingmiaog04=Thunder and lighting fill the room with light as the dragon walks around.
desc_xingmiaog05=Dreams float on boundless mist-covered waters.
