menu_npc_xingmiao_panshi_2_1=I want to betray my school.
title_npc_xingmiao_panshi_2_1=Betrayal will reduce levels of your Starry Pavilion internals, skill sets, and miscellaneous skills. If you have done Starry Pavilion Origin quest, then your Tianshan skills will be deleted. Do you confirm to betray?
