title_npc_xingmiao_panshi_2_2=After you graduate, your Starry Pavilion skill sets will be kept, and your Starry Pavilion miscellaneous skills will be removed. Are you sure to graduate?
menu_npc_xingmiao_panshi_2_3=I'd like to leave and return to the world at large.
title_npc_xingmiao_panshi_2_3=After you graduate, your Starry Pavilion skill sets will be kept, and your Starry Pavilion miscellaneous skills will be removed. If you have done Starry Pavilion Origin quest, then your Tianshan skills will be deleted. Do you confirm to graduate?
