desc_newschool_xingmiao02=<font color="#6E8B3D">Participation Requirements</font><br><s>All Starry Pavilion players, who have no school punishment status, are not in battle and are Jianghu VIP may take part.<br><font color="#6E8B3D">Rules</font><br><s>Event period: 10:00-11:00, 14:00-15:00 and 20:00-21:00.<br><s>Defeat <font color="#00FF00">Qian Dongbin</font>.
desc_newschool_xingmiao03=<font color="#6E8B3D">Participation Requirements</font><br><s>All Starry Pavilion disciples can participate. <br><font color="#6E8B3D">Rules</font><br><s>1. Observe the water and fish, appreciate nature, meditate on Martial Arts! <br><s>2. It is a daily activity. You can participate 1 time a day.
desc_newschool_xingmiao04=<font color="#6E8B3D">Participation Requirements</font><br><s>All Starry Pavilion disciples can participate. <br><font color="#6E8B3D">Rules</font><br><s>1. Go to the 3 Tideviewing spots in Starry Pavilion, watch the tides, reflect and cultivate! <br><s>2. It is a weekly activity. You can participate 1 time a week.
desc_newschool_xingmiao05=<font color="#6E8B3D">Participation Requirements</font><br><s>All Starry Pavilion disciples can participate. <br><font color="#6E8B3D">Rules</font><br><s>1. Form teams of three players and challenge the Elder Brother on the arena! <br><s>2. It is a weekly activity. You can participate 1 time a week.
desc_newschool_xingmiao07=<font color="#6E8B3D">Participation Requirements</font><br><s>All Starry Pavilion disciples can participate. <br><font color="#6E8B3D">Rules</font><br><s>1. Go to Starry Pavilion to patrol.<br><s>2. It is a daily activity. You can participate 1 time a day.
desc_newschool_xingmiao08=<font color="#6E8B3D">Participation Requirements</font><br><s>All Starry Pavilion disciples can participate. <br><font color="#6E8B3D">Rules</font><br><s>1. Observe the waterfalls and flowing waters of the valley to feel the way of sword! <br><s>2. It is a daily activity. You can participate 1 time a day.
desc_newschool_xingmiao09=<font color="#6E8B3D">Participation Requirements</font><br><s>All Starry Pavilion disciples can participate. <br><font color="#6E8B3D">玩法简介</font><br><s>1. Go to various places in the school to complete the assigned chores! <br><s>2. It is a daily activity. You can participate 1 time a day.
desc_newschool_xingmiao10=<font color="#6E8B3D">Participation Requirements</font><br><s>All Starry Pavilion disciples can participate. <br><font color="#6E8B3D">Rules</font><br><s>1. Go to the Star Observatory to practice swordsmanship and become familiar with martial arts! <br><s>2. It is a daily activity. You can participate 1 time a day.
desc_newschool_xingmiao11=<font color="#6E8B3D">Participation Requirements</font><br><s>All Starry Pavilion disciples can participate. <br><font color="#6E8B3D">Rules</font><br><s>1. Use Starry Pavilion martial arts in a duel! <br><s>2. It is a daily activity. You can participate 1 time a day.
