desc_item_lzy_20181221hd_wxdhq_0=Martial Art Exchange Certificate: <br>Go to Lin Liang to exchange martial arts. They include: <br><font color="#FFB428">Quanzhen Sword, Record of Dancing Ghost, Kuntian Blade</font><br><font color="#FFB428">A Prodigy's Swordsmanship, Guxi Dagger, Yang Rubbing Staff</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Female Only, Golden Deer Blade, Sinister Axe of the Dragon</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Full Moon Scimitar, Western Fencing, Demon Dagger</font>.
desc_box_guj_minmgjiao_huodong_001_1d_0=Males only: <br>A package that contains the full set of Males only. <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 1 or 2 internal stage: level 1 to 3 of Males only;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 3 internal stage: level 1 to 6 of Males only;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 4 internal stage: level 1 to 8 of Males only;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 5 internal stage: level 1 to 10 of Males only; </font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 6 internal stage: level 1 to 12 of Males only.</font>
desc_box_guj_minmgjiao_huodong_002_1d_0=Western Fencing: <br>A package that contains the full set of Western Fencing. <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 3 internal stage: level 1 to 6 of Western Fencing;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 4 internal stage: level 1 to 8 of Western Fencing;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 5 internal stage: level 1 to 10 of Western Fencing; </font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 6 internal stage: level 1 to 12 of Western Fencing.</font>
desc_box_guj_minmgjiao_huodong_003_1d_0=A Prodigy's Swordsmanship: <br>A package that contains the full set of A Prodigy's Swordsmanship. <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 3 internal stage: level 1 to 6 of A Prodigy's Swordsmanship;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 4 internal stage: level 1 to 8 of A Prodigy's Swordsmanship;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 5 internal stage: level 1 to 10 of A Prodigy's Swordsmanship; </font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 6 internal stage: level 1 to 12 of A Prodigy's Swordsmanship.</font>
desc_box_guj_minmgjiao_huodong_004_1d_0=Sinister Axe of the Dragon: <br>A package that contains the full set of Sinister Axe of the Dragon. <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 1 or 2 internal stage: level 1 to 3 of Sinister Axe of the Dragon;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 3 internal stage: level 1 to 6 of Sinister Axe of the Dragon;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 4 internal stage: level 1 to 8 of Sinister Axe of the Dragon;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 5 internal stage: level 1 to 10 of Sinister Axe of the Dragon; </font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 6 internal stage: level 1 to 12 of Sinister Axe of the Dragon.</font>
desc_box_guj_minmgjiao_huodong_005_1d_0=Guxi Dagger: <br>A package that contains the full set of Guxi Dagger. <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 3 internal stage: level 1 to 6 of Guxi Dagger;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 4 internal stage: level 1 to 8 of Guxi Dagger;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 5 internal stage: level 1 to 10 of Guxi Dagger; </font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 6 internal stage: level 1 to 12 of Guxi Dagger.</font>
desc_box_guj_minmgjiao_huodong_006_1d_0=Record of the Dancing Ghost: <br>A package that contains the full set of Record of the Dancing Ghost. <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 1 or 2 internal stage: level 1 to 3 of Record of the Dancing Ghost;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 3 internal stage: level 1 to 6 of Record of the Dancing Ghost;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 4 internal stage: level 1 to 8 of Record of the Dancing Ghost;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 5 internal stage: level 1 to 10 of Record of the Dancing Ghost; </font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 6 internal stage: level 1 to 12 of Record of the Dancing Ghost.</font>
desc_box_guj_minmgjiao_huodong_007_1d_0=Kuntian Blade: <br>A package that contains the full set of Kuntian Blade. <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 1 or 2 internal stage: level 1 to 3 of Kuntian Blade;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 3 internal stage: level 1 to 6 of Kuntian Blade;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 4 internal stage: level 1 to 8 of Kuntian Blade;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 5 internal stage: level 1 to 10 of Kuntian Blade; </font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 6 internal stage: level 1 to 12 of Kuntian Blade.</font>
desc_box_guj_minmgjiao_huodong_008_1d_0=Quanzhen Sword: <br>A package that contains the full set of Quanzhen Sword. <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 1 or 2 internal stage: level 1 to 3 of Quanzhen Sword;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 3 internal stage: level 1 to 6 of Quanzhen Sword;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 4 internal stage: level 1 to 8 of Quanzhen Sword;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 5 internal stage: level 1 to 10 of Quanzhen Sword; </font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 6 internal stage: level 1 to 12 of Quanzhen Sword.</font>
desc_box_guj_minmgjiao_huodong_009_1d_0=Golden Deer Blade: <br>A package that contains the full set of Golden Deer Blade. <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 1 or 2 internal stage: level 1 to 3 of Golden Deer Blade;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 3 internal stage: level 1 to 6 of Golden Deer Blade;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 4 internal stage: level 1 to 8 of Golden Deer Blade;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 5 internal stage: level 1 to 10 of Golden Deer Blade; </font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 6 internal stage: level 1 to 12 of Golden Deer Blade.</font>
desc_box_guj_minmgjiao_huodong_010_1d_0=Full Moon Scimitar: <br>A package that contains the full set of Full Moon Scimitar. <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 3 internal stage: level 1 to 6 of Full Moon Scimitar;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 4 internal stage: level 1 to 8 of Full Moon Scimitar;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 5 internal stage: level 1 to 10 of Full Moon Scimitar; </font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 6 internal stage: level 1 to 12 of Full Moon Scimitar.</font>
desc_box_guj_minmgjiao_huodong_011_1d_0=Yang Rubbings Staff: <br>A package that contains the full set of Yang Rubbings Staff. <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 3 internal stage: level 1 to 6 of Yang Rubbings Staff;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 4 internal stage: level 1 to 8 of Yang Rubbings Staff;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 5 internal stage: level 1 to 10 of Yang Rubbings Staff; </font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 6 internal stage: level 1 to 12 of Yang Rubbings Staff.</font>
desc_box_guj_minmgjiao_huodong_012_1d_0=Demon Dagger: <br>A package that contains the full set of Demon Dagger. <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 3 internal stage: level 1 to 6 of Demon Dagger;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 4 internal stage: level 1 to 8 of Demon Dagger;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 5 internal stage: level 1 to 10 of Demon Dagger; </font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 6 internal stage: level 1 to 12 of Demon Dagger.</font>
desc_box_guj_minmgjiao_huodong_013_1d_0=<br>A package that contains exclusive martial art cultivation pills. <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 1 or 2 internal stage: 800,000 exclusive martial art Cultivation Injection; </font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 3 internal stage: 1,600,000 exclusive martial art Cultivation Injection;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 4 internal stage: 3,200,000 exclusive martial art Cultivation Injection;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 5 internal stage: 6,400,000 exclusive martial art Cultivation Injection;</font> <br><font color="#FFB428">At tier 6 internal stage: 10,000,000 exclusive martial art Cultivation Injection;</font> <br>The martial art skills include: <br><font color="#FFB428">Quanzhen Sword, Record of Dancing Ghost, Kuntian Blade, A Prodigy's Swordsmanship, Guxi Dagger, Yang Rubbing Staff, Female Only, Golden Deer Blade, Sinister Axe of the Dragon, Full Moon Scimitar, Western Fencing, Demon Dagger</font>.
