desc_box_guj_xnzf001_1=Open the New Year Gift Box to get: each one of <font color="#FFFF00">"Everything Goes Well" Gift Pack</font>, <font color="#FFFF00">"Family Reunited" Gift Pack</font>, <font color="#FFFF00">"Fortune and Longevity" Gift Pack</font>, <font color="#FFFF00">"Treasures Fill the Home" Gift Pack</font>, and <font color="#FFFF00">"Promoting Step by Step" Gift Pack</font>.
desc_box_guj_xnzf002_1=Open "Everything Goes Well" Gift Pack to get: <font color="#FFFF00">5 Green Jade Internal Skill Pills, 5 Leaf Dew Gathered Gold, and also have a chance to get the character Blessing</font>.
desc_box_guj_xnzf003_1=Open "Family Reunited" Gift Pack to get: <font color="#FFFF00">1 Hundred-Year Snow Lotus Fruit, and also have a chance to get the character Blessing</font>.
desc_box_guj_xnzf004_1=Open "Fortune and Longevity" Gift Pack to get: <font color="#FFFF00">50 Five-Realm Demon-Slaying Items, and also have a chance to get the character Blessing</font>.
desc_box_guj_xnzf005_1=Open the "Treasures Fill the Home" Gift Pack to receive: <font color="#FFFF00">1 Precious Treasure, and a chance to receive "Luck" token</font>.
desc_box_guj_xnzf006_1=Open "Promoting Step by Step" Gift Pack to get: <font color="#FFFF00">20 Bai Xiaosheng's Weapon Manuals (superior), and also have a chance to get the character Blessing</font>.
desc_box_guj_xnzf007_1=Open to receive <font color="#FFFF00">1 Snow Hero, 1 Flame Tree Silvery Flower, 1 Warm Winter Carpet, and 2 Flowers in Bloom Stools</font>.
desc_box_guj_xnzf008_1=Open to receive <font color="#FFFF00">1 Black Jade Powder, 1 Refined Quality Binding Agent, and 50 Reset Tickets</font>.
