desc_item_xnhd_2019xnjnlcsp_002=New Year Memorial Pet Certificate
desc_item_xnhd_2019xnjnlcsp_001_1=During the event period (from 2019.1.24 to 2019.2.14), players can get 1 Golden Den shard everyday by staying online for 1 hour. <font color="#FF3030">Exchange the shards for various items and the New Year Memorial Pet at Pet Manager Yu Jing in Luoyang (1016, 715). </font>
desc_item_xnhd_2019xnjnlcsp_002_1=During the event period (from 2019.1.24 to 2019.2.14), players can go to Pet Manager Yu Jing in Luoyang (1016, 715) everyday to complete the [Catching Beast] quest and get this certificate. <font color="#FF3030">Exchange the fragments for various items and the New Year Memorial Pet at Pet Manager Yu Jing in Luoyang (1016, 715). </font>
desc_box_card_452=Right click to get 1 cape lore card <font color="#FFB428">"Kylin's Chants"</font>.
desc_box_card_452_1=Bright waves sparkle with gold, spring wind carries the kylin's chants.
desc_box_card_450=Right click to get 1 mount lore card <font color="#FFB428">"Redribbon Steed"</font>.
desc_box_card_450_1=A noble ribboned steed travels thousands of miles.
desc_box_card_449=Right-click to receive 1 Lore item <font color="#FFB428">Treading on Flowers Set</font> and 1 costume change design for your gender.
desc_box_card_449_1=Bend the bow to fight as a man, once with a thrush in a dream.
desc_tab_b_head_232_b_0=This drawing can be obtained by purchasing Lore Costume Set "Treading on Flowers Set". The craftsmanship is excellent. Use it to change the appearance of Jianghu Costume. Open <font color="#99cc00">Dressing Room</font> to change the appearance of equipments. <br><font color="#96a0c8">When the design is in the backpack, right-click to add it to the Dressing Room. It will have an unlimited number of uses. Unbound equipments will become bound upon being changed with this design.</font>
desc_tab_g_head_232_b_0=This drawing can be obtained by purchasing Lore Costume Set "Treading on Flowers Set". The craftsmanship is excellent. Use it to change the appearance of Jianghu Costume. Open <font color="#99cc00">Dressing Room</font> to change the appearance of equipments. <br><font color="#96a0c8">When the design is in the backpack, right-click to add it to the Dressing Room. It will have an unlimited number of uses. Unbound equipments will become bound upon being changed with this design.</font>
desc_pet_pig_gensui_0=<font color="#ff0000">Right-click to move the pet into the collection interface</font><br><font color="#ff0000">Attention: When the pet in the collection interface, it cannot be taken out and is bound to the player. If the pet has a time limit, it will be deleted automatically when the time is up.</font><br>Using it will summon Golden Den. With a pet summoned, players recover 5 Flying Skill Points during meditation<br><font color="#ff0000">(Tip: When the tier 2 internal skill is active, players with a pet and at level Flows with Chi, may speak with the Beast Villa Recruitment Guide to apply to join! (Location: Beggar's Sect 589 853))</font>
desc_pet_dissmiss_pig_0=Raise Golden Den
desc_pet_pig_act01_0=Hum-hum-hum!
desc_pet_pig_act02_0=It is necessary to raise Golden Enmity fat, and life will be prosperous!
desc_pet_pig_act03_0=Make way, make way you all!
