desc_box_20190527fhjy_dy_001=<font color="#00ff00">Based on the current stage of the Age of Wushu Record, open to get: </font><br>1st and 2nd internal: <font color="#00ff00">5 Mount Tianshan Snow Lotuses, 10 Purple Spirit Pills, 20 Five-Realm Demon-Slaying Items, 100 Repairing Tools, 5 Ten Aroma Reviving Pills, 1 Horse Whistle [Juedi] (7 Days), 1 "Flying Flower Sword Shadow" Title.</font><br>Tier 3 Internal Skill/Advanced School Skill servers: <font color="#00ff00">10 Mount Tianshan Snow Lotuses, 20 Purple Spirit Pills, 50 Five-Realm Demon-Slaying Items, 200 Repairing Tools, 5 Ten Aroma Reviving Pills, 1 Horse Whistle [Juedi] (7 Days), 1 "Flying Flower Sword Shadow" Title.</font><br>Tier 4 Internal Skill/Level 6 Equipment servers: <font color="#00ff00">15 Mount Tianshan Snow Lotuses, 30 Purple Spirit Pills, 100 Five-Realm Demon-Slaying Items, 300 Repairing Tools, 5 Ten Aroma Reviving Pills, 1 Horse Whistle [Juedi] (7 Days), 1 "Flying Flower Sword Shadow" Title.</font><br>Tier 5 Internal Skill/Reclusive Factions servers: <font color="#00ff00">20 Mount Tianshan Snow Lotuses, 50 Purple Spirit Pills, 150 Pure Yang Swords, 400 Repairing Tools, 5 Ten Aroma Reviving Pills, 1 Horse Whistle [Juedi] (7 Days), 1 "Flying Flower Sword Shadow" Title.</font><br>Tier 6 Internal Skill servers: <font color="#00ff00">20 Mount Tianshan Snow Lotuses, 50 Purple Spirit Pills, 200 Pure Yang Swords, 500 Repairing Tools, 5 Ten Aroma Reviving Pills, 1 Horse Whistle [Juedi] (7 Days), 1 "Flying Flower Sword Shadow" Title.</font>
