desc_tab_b_head_233_b_0=This drawing can be obtained by purchasing Lore Costume Set "Mirage Letter Ink". The craftsmanship is excellent. Use it to change the appearance of Jianghu Costume. Open <font color="#99cc00">Dressing Room</font> to change the appearance of equipments. <br><font color="#96a0c8">When the design is in the backpack, right-click to add it to the Dressing Room. It will have an unlimited number of uses. Unbound equipments will become bound upon being changed with this design.</font>
