desc_item_201907_xigua_1=Increases all attributes after eating (Brawn, Dexterity, Breath, Spirit and Stamina) by 50 for 1 hour. The effect of Watermelon cannot be stacked. <br><font color="#FF0000">Exchange at Zhu Wang (450,633) in Suzhou for surprises.</font>
