desc_faculty_event_dy_001_0=A medicine for increasing martial arts skills. <br>It can increase at most <font color="#FFFF00">8500</font> Cultivation Converting for current cultivating skill. <br><font color="#00FF00">The item is only valid for 1 day, please use it before it expires!</font>
