item_guildwar_difeng_000=Guild Scripture
desc_item_guildwar_difeng_000_0=The secret scripts obtained from participating in the Guild Tournament can be used to exchange profound internal pages. <br><font color=""#FFFF00"">Usage: Exchange rewards at the Guild Tournament Ambassador in Chengdu (633, 611). </font><br><font color=""#FFB428"">How to Obtain: Participating in the Guild Tournament.</font>
desc_box_difengdahui_001_1=The secret scripts obtained from participating in the Guild Tournament can be used to exchange this Guild Gift Boxes, which contains items to help players cultivate. <br><font color=""#FFFF00"">Usage: Based on the current Age of Wushu Record, you will guarantee to obtain some Five Aggregate Demon Slaying Items and some School / Faction / Subschool items. </font><br><font color=""#FFFF00"">3rd Internal Stage: 30 Five Aggregate Demon Slaying Items, some School / Faction / Subschool items. </font><br><font color=""#FFFF00"">4th Internal Stage: 40 Five Aggregate Demon Slaying Items, some School / Faction / Subschool items. </font><br><font color=""#FFFF00"">5th Internal Stage: 50 Five Aggregate Demon Slaying Items, some School / Faction / Subschool items. </font><br><font color=""#FFFF00"">6th Internal Stage: 60 Five Aggregate Demon Slaying Items, some School / Faction / Subschool items. </font><br><font color=""#FFFF00"">In addition, you have a chance to obtain the following items: Binding Agent, Reset Voucher, Windrider, Dragon Pattern Copy Stone, Sheepskins Scrap, Martial Merit Token, He Family Jade, Demon Gate Token, Desolate Beast Stone. </font><br><font color=""#FFB428"">How to Obtain: You can exchange this gift box with the Striving Edge Scriptures at the Guild Tournament Ambassador in Chengdu (633, 611). </font><br><font color="#FF0000">You can exchange at most 2 gift boxes per week.</font>
