desc_item_honor_school09_0=This token has two sides, with a smiley face on one side and a hideous demon evil face on the other. Legend has it that it appears once every ten years, and each occurrence causes huge waves. We do not know which craftsmen can forge so many tokens to recruit so many people and have them at their disposal. Within the changing climate, numerous odd characters in Jianghu are collecting this object or has already been recruited or is opposing this project. No one knows. Under the exchange of goods status, more benefits can be obtained.<br>They can be obtained by participating in spying, book raid, or assist in the School Wars.
desc_key_qy_jmy003_yaochu_0=This hoe is used to collect the mysterious herb (<font color="#FF4500">360, 958</font>).
desc_citanling_item1_0=The token is offered by the Reward Kindness And Punish Evil Envoy for the intelligence spy disciples. The token owners can teleport to the target place to spy. 1 token will be consumed for each teleport. <font color="#FF0000">(The item cannot be used during School War period.)</font>
desc_sd_dwlp_0=Use the Delicious Lantern Festival Exchange Token to exchange for the Lantern Festival Gift Box from the elder brother of the Martial Arts School.<br><font color="#00FFFF">Chengdu Martial Arts School Elder Brother (855,674)</font><br><font color="#00FFFF">Qiandeng Town Martial Arts School Elder Brother (892,659)</font><br><font color="#00FFFF">Yanyu Villa Martial Arts School Elder Brother (389,932)</font><br><font color="#00FFFF">Jiming Posthouse Martial Arts School Elder Brother (557,341)</font>
desc_duanwu_box_001_1=Open to receive a delicious Sweet Dumpling.
desc_gn_procon_001_0=It is said one will know the meaning of sharp after refining the Dragon Spring Sword.<br><font color="#f9fc00">Usage: Used for treasure refinement, treasure exchange, and attribute change function of gold and jade equipment.</font><br><font color="#f9fc00">How to get: Purchase with Official Taels in any store.</font>
desc_citanling_item_0=A special token granted by the leader that allows a spy to quickly travel to other schools. <font color="#FF0000">(This item cannot be used during School Battles. The leaders of reclusive schools are too busy to help you, so please find the corresponding school leader to transport you)</font>
