desc_item_exchange_ng_mark_0=A five-petal steel dart. Its shape resembles a blood-colored plum blossom. There are different symbols carved on it. It could be some kind of special code. Because it was crafted in an unusual manner, a normal decoding could easily damage it. Rumored to appear in various Forbidden Instances throughout Jianghu, the <font color="#ff0000">Mysterious Expert</font> showed up at <font color="#ff0000">Chengdu (831,589)</font> to collect this item personally and receive an ultimate internal skill as a reward. <br><font color="#ffff00">Use: </font><br><font color="#ffff00">After the Reclusive Factions are available, it can be used to exchange for </font><font color="#ffff00">Jianghu Internal Skills (Level 1-36 )</font> at the <font color="#ff0000">Mysterious Expert in Chengdu (831, 589)</font><br><font color="#ffff00">After the Reclusive Factions are available, it can be used to exchange for a</font><font color="#ffff00">Jianghu Internal Skill Scroll Fragment an Internal Skill with Calligrapher Scroll Fragment (Level 76-86)</font> at <font color="#ff0000">Fei Yu in Jiming Posthouse (946, 132)</font>
desc_duyao31002=Increase internal and external attack accuracy by 30%, increase brawn by 20, external defense decreases by 500, Duration: 20 seconds.
desc_faculty_yanwu_jhdw06_0=Enhances the efficacious medicine with martial arts skills, and is especially effective with those who currently cultivating martial arts skills.<br>After using it, it will add <font color="#FFFF00">300</font> cultivation points for those currently studying martial arts skills.<br>(You can carry up to 700 pieces of this item. Carrying more than the upper limit will lead to failure to complete your assignment.)
desc_hcitem_tj_flute_02_1_0=An ancient weapon crafting book. It tells of the production method for the Flute.
desc_hcitem_tj_flute_03_0=Murong Ye chanced upon an a weapon crafting script. After repeated study and application, he found the techniques within produced exquisite weapons. This portion records the production method for Flute.
desc_hcitem_tj_flute_04_0=Legend has it that Ou Yezi, a master sword maker in the Warring States Period, wrote a book of weapon making that covered the manufacturing techniques of much weapons. This booklet is about the making of Gold Flutes.
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_flute_02_1=You will learn much modified flute manufacturing methods if you read this notebook. <br>The manufactured weapons are fit for characters of <font color="#00FF00">Minor Achievements</font> strength.
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_flute_03=You will learn much modified flute manufacturing methods if you read this notebook. <br>The manufactured weapons are fit for characters of <font color="#00FF00">Realized Potential</font> strength. <br>Proceeding with this recipe requires a Level 1 workshop.
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_flute_04=Read this theory and you can learn many methods of making Delicate Flute. <br>The manufactured weapons are fit for characters of <font color="#00FF00">Martial Intuition</font> strength. <br>Proceeding with this recipe requires a Level 2 workshop.
desc_flute_30402=A bamboo flute, dyed in a distinctive blue shade.
desc_flute_30403=The long flute made of amethyst. Even when it is not played, it seems to emit a quiet muttering.
desc_flute_30502=A flute made of precious mica.
desc_flute_40105=This elegant flute is made with cherrywood.
desc_flute_40201=This elegant flute is made with buttonwood.
desc_flute_40205=A flute which is as clear and impeccable as the waters of Xiangjiang river.
desc_flute_40403=A flute made from red corals with beautiful natural patterns.
desc_flute_40404=Even when not played, a light breeze that passes by this flute would invoke the sound of a crying crane.
desc_flute_40405=This opulent flute is wrought in silver and studded with precious stones.
desc_flute_40603=This flute is named after one of the three peaks of Mount Hua, where it is made.
desc_flute_40604=This flute is named after one of the three peaks of Mount Hua, where it is made.
desc_flute_40605=This flute is named after one of the three peaks of Mount Hua, where it is made.
desc_flute_50203=Playing this flute under the shimmering Milky Way evokes tender melancholy.
desc_flute_50405=This precious jade is made with gold and jade.
desc_flute_60301=A dragon is engraved on this flute.
desc_flute_60302=A dragon is engraved on this flute.
desc_flute_60303=A dragon is engraved on this flute.
desc_flute_60304=A dragon is engraved on this flute.
desc_flute_60305=A golden snake wraps around this flute.
desc_flute_60401=The tone of this flute evokes deep melancholy.
desc_flute_60402=The tone of this flute evokes deep melancholy.
desc_flute_60403=The tone of this flute evokes deep melancholy.
desc_citanling_item_1_0=A special token granted by the leader that allows a spy to quickly travel to other schools. <font color="#FF0000">(This item cannot be used during School Battles. The leaders of reclusive schools are too busy to help you, so please find the corresponding school leader to transport you)</font>
desc_citanling_item1_1_0=The token is offered by the Reward Kindness And Punish Evil Envoy for the intelligence spy disciples. The token owners can teleport to the target place to spy. 1 token will be consumed for each teleport. <font color="#FF0000">(The item cannot be used during School War period.)</font>
desc_item_kfzc_jmdh_01_0=A pill-sized bit of medicine for travel convenience. <br>Speak with the <font color="#FFCC00">School War Administrator </font>to make an exchange for the <br>Yang Link Vessel Formula, Manual of the Core - Gold Gate(Chapter 1, 2, 3, 4), Manual of the Core - Yang Jiao (Chapter 1, 2), Tongyuan Pill (Level 2), Tongyuan Pill (Level 3) and the Tongyuan Pill (Level 4).
desc_item_kfzc_jmdh_02_0=A glittering and translucent pill perfectly preserved in a delicate embroidery. <br>Speak with the <font color="#FFCC00">School War Administrator </font>to make an exchange for the<br>Yang Link Vessel Formula, Manual of the Core- Yang Jiao (Chapter 3, 4) and the Manual of the Core- Yang Jiao (Chapter 1, 2, 3, 4).
desc_item_kfzc_jmdh_03_0=A glittering and translucent pill, perfectly preserved in a delicate wooden box. <br>Speak with the <font color="#FFCC00">School War Administrator </font>to make an exchange for the <br>Yang Link Vessel Formula, Manual of the Core- Yang Bai (Chapters 1,2,3,4) and the Manual of the Core - Cheng Ling (Chapter 1 and 2).
desc_item_kfzc_jmdh_04_0=A delicate pill, perfectly preserved in a exquisite Embroidered Box. <br>Speak with the <font color="#FFCC00">School War Administrator </font>to make an exchange for the <br>Yang Link Vessel Formula, Manual of the Core - Cheng Ling (Chapter 3, 4) and the Manual of the Core - Ya Men (Chapter 1, 2, 3, 4).
desc_Item_buf_5nei_sxy_bl_0=Increase your Brawn in 12 hours. <br><font color="#ff0000">The medicine can only be used after you complete Reclusive Schools' Age of Wushu Record and cannot be used with similar medicine together</font><br><font color="#FFAE00">This item can be used to other players</font>
desc_Item_buf_5nei_sxy_sf_0=Increase your Dexterity in 12 hours. <br><font color="#ff0000">The medicine can only be used after you complete Reclusive Schools' Age of Wushu Record and cannot be used with similar medicine together</font><br><font color="#FFAE00">This item can be used to other players</font>
