newworld_lingxia_biwunpc_002_talk_003=Reclusive Factions
desc_tongtianfeng_point_001_0=Right-click to open and get 3 Challenging Points.
desc_item_hd_wyqb003_1=Gift pack obtained by completing foreign information quest. Open to get 1 Central Plain Heroic Token. <font color="#FF3030">(You can exchange for exquisite gifts at Bi Ye (Central Plains Info Manager) (Ruined Valley 411,364) with this token).</font>
chaoswar_testskill_shop_010=Reclusive Faction Martial Art
ui_testskill_button_tips=Only VIP players can enter the Cultivation Hall to cultivate Skill Sets for at most 1 hour, with various setting of Internal Skills and meridians. <br>Cultivation Hall open hours: every day 1:00 - 23:00. 1:00 - 20:30 on Wednesdays and Sundays<br>Today's remaining enter chances: {@0:num}. <br>Today's remaining cultivation time: {@1:num} minutes. <br>Special notes: the key bindings of Skill Sets used in Cultivation Hall will be saved and directly used in Group Martial Arts Competition, Martial Path Convention, Snowland Escape, etc.
title_chaoswar_testskill_npc_006_2_1=Here is Cultivation Hall. You can cultivate various combinations of martial skills and Internal Skills. Special notes: the key binds of Skill Sets used in Cultivation Hall will be saved and directly used in your Martial Path Convention/Group Martial Arts Competition/Great Massacre etc.
sys_jianghudaluandou_tips_040=You have been inactive for too long. After <font color="#CC0000">{@0:时间}</font> seconds of no damage dealing, you will be kicked out of the battlefield.
ui_war_scuffle_desc_002=<font color="#FFCC00">Sign-up Date: </font><br><s><s>12:00-23:00 from Thursday to Saturday<br><s><s>12:00-20:30 on Sunday. <br><font color="#FFCC00">Participating Restriction: </font><br><s><s>None<br><font color="#FFCC00">Strength Restriction: </font><br><s><s>Flow with chi. <br><font color="#FFCC00">Number of players in battle： </font><br><s><s>24 VS 24. <br><font color="#FFCC00">Matching method：</font><br><s><s>Random matching.
desc_box_jxqy_sctm1_madh_0=Jianghu VIP players can open and get different amount of items according to the progress of Age of Wushu Records.<br>Tier 1: 2 Qi Hai Concentration Pills.<br>Tier 2: 3 Qi Hai Concentration Pills.<br>Tier 3/Advanced School Skills: 4 Qi Hai Concentration Pills.<br>Tier 4/Level 6 Equipment: 5 Qi Hai Concentration Pills.<br>Tier 5/Reclusive Factions: 6 Qi Hai Concentration Pills.<br>Tier 6: 7 Concentration Pills.
desc_box_jxqy_sctm2_madh_0=Jianghu VIP players can open and get different amount of items according to the progress of Age of Wushu Records.<br>Tier 1: 1 Hundred-Year Snow Lotus Fruit, and 2 Qi Hai Concentration Pills.<br>Tier 2: 1 Hundred-Year Snow Lotus Fruit, and 3 Qi Hai Concentration Pills.<br>Tier 3/Advanced School Skills: 1 Hundred-Year Snow Lotus Fruits, and 4 Qi Hai Concentration Pills.<br>Tier 4/Level 6 Equipment: 2 Hundred-Year Snow Lotus Fruits, and 5 Qi Hai Concentration Pills.<br>Tier 5/Reclusive Factions: 3 Hundred-Year Snow Lotus Fruits, and 6 Qi Hai Concentration Pills.<br>Tier 6: 4 Hundred-Year Snow Lotus Fruits, and 7 Concentration Pills.
desc_box_jxqy_sctm3_madh_0=Jianghu VIP players can open and get different amount of items according to the progress of Age of Wushu Records.<br>Tier 1: 1 Hundred-Year Snow Lotus Fruit, 2 Qi Hai Concentration Pills, and 3 Moon Internal Skill Pills.<br>Tier 2: 1 Hundred-Year Snow Lotus Fruit, 3 Qi Hai Concentration Pills, and 3 Moon Internal Skill Pills.<br>Tier 3/Advanced School Skills: 1 Hundred-Year Snow Lotus Fruit, 4 Qi Hai Concentration Pills, and 3 Moon Internal Skill Pills.<br>Tier 4/Level 6 Equipment: 2 Hundred-Year Snow Lotus Fruits, 5 Qi Hai Concentration Pills, and 4 Moon Internal Skill Pills.<br>Tier 5/Reclusive Factions: 3 Hundred-Year Snow Lotus Fruits, 6 Qi Hai Concentration Pills, and 5 Moon Internal Skill Pills.<br>Tier 6: 4 Hundred-Year Snow Lotus Fruits, 7 Qi Hai Concentration Pills, and 6 Moon Internal Skill Pills.
desc_box_jxqy_sctm4_madh_0=Jianghu VIP players can open and get different amount of items according to the progress of Age of Wushu Records.<br>Tier 1: 20 Five-Realm Demon-Slaying Items, and 20 Bai Xiaosheng's Weapon Manuals (superior).<br>Tier 2: 30 Five-Realm Demon-Slaying Items, and 20 Bai Xiaosheng's Weapon Manuals (superior).<br>Tier 3/Advanced School Skills: 40 Five-Realm Demon-Slaying Items, and 30 Bai Xiaosheng's Weapon Manuals (superior).<br>Tier 4/Level 6 Equipment: 50 Five-Realm Demon-Slaying Items, and 30 Bai Xiaosheng's Weapon Manuals (superior).<br>Tier 5/Reclusive Factions: 80 Five-Realm Demon-Slaying Items, and 50 Bai Xiaosheng's Weapon Manuals (superior).<br>Tier 6: 120 Five-Realm Demon-Slaying Items, and 50 Bai Xiaosheng's Weapon Manuals (superior).
desc_box_jxqy_jxqyre_madh_0=Get different amount of items according to the progress of Age of Wushu Records.<br>Tier 3/Advanced School Skills: 500 liang of silver coins, 3 Qi Hai Concentration Pills, 3 Moon Internal Skill Pills, 10 Bai Xiaosheng's Weapon Manuals (superior), 2 Jinyuan Revival Pills, 1 Revive Token, and 1 Windrider (7 days).<br>Tier 4/Level 6 Equipment: 500 liang of silver coins, 5 Qi Hai Concentration Pills, 5 Moon Internal Skill Pills, 15 Bai Xiaosheng's Weapon Manuals (superior), 2 Jinyuan Revival Pills, 1 Revive Token, and 1 Windrider (7 days).<br>Tier 5/Reclusive Factions: 500 liang of silver coins, 10 Qi Hai Concentration Pills, 10 Moon Internal Skill Pills, 20 Bai Xiaosheng's Weapon Manuals (superior), 2 Jinyuan Revival Pills, 1 Revive Token, and 1 Windrider (7 days).<br>Tier 6: 500 liang of silver coins, 15 Qi Hai Concentration Pills, 15 Moon Internal Skill Pills, 30 Bai Xiaosheng's Weapon Manuals (superior), 2 Jinyuan Revival Pills, 1 Revive Token, and 1 Windrider (7 days).
desc_box_20161219yhqt_fc_001_0=Get different amount of items according to the progress of Age of Wushu Records.<br>Tier 3/Advanced School Skills: 500 liang of silver coins, 3 Qi Hai Concentration Pills, 3 Moon Internal Skill Pills, 10 Bai Xiaosheng's Weapon Manuals (superior), 2 Jinyuan Revival Pills, 1 Revive Token, and 1 Windrider (7 days).<br>Tier 4/Level 6 Equipment: 500 liang of silver coins, 5 Qi Hai Concentration Pills, 5 Moon Internal Skill Pills, 15 Bai Xiaosheng's Weapon Manuals (superior), 2 Jinyuan Revival Pills, 1 Revive Token, and 1 Windrider (7 days).<br>Tier 5/Reclusive Factions: 500 liang of silver coins, 10 Qi Hai Concentration Pills, 10 Moon Internal Skill Pills, 20 Bai Xiaosheng's Weapon Manuals (superior), 2 Jinyuan Revival Pills, 1 Revive Token, and 1 Windrider (7 days).<br>Tier 6: 500 liang of silver coins, 15 Qi Hai Concentration Pills, 15 Moon Internal Skill Pills, 30 Bai Xiaosheng's Weapon Manuals (superior), 2 Jinyuan Revival Pills, 1 Revive Token, and 1 Windrider (7 days).
