desc_home_jy_tree_01_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Plant<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>30<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Home Size reaches level 1<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Area: </font>Courtyard<br>Red flowers growing on the green cedar.<br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_jy_tree_02_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Plant<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>30<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Home Size reaches level 1<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Area: </font>Courtyard<br>A tall and straight pine tree.<br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_jy_tree_03_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Plant<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>30<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Home Size reaches level 1<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Area: </font>Courtyard<br>The tree grows two branches which are tangling.<br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_jy_tree_04_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Plant<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>30<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Home Size reaches level 1<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Area: </font>Courtyard<br>Flame tree is combined with silvery flowers. People are going with the bright moon.<br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
