desc_item2017_4yzytsl_001_1=Tokens obtained by completing Jiugong Elder's Daily Central Plains Envoy Quest at Luoyang (295 573). After collecting a certain amount <font color="#FF3030">you can exchange for Snow Lotus Fruit, Smart Heart Bravery Pack (Open and have a chance to get Martial Arts Treasure Box, Ancient Manual Scroll Fragment Pack, or Workbench Embroidered Box), Dragon Kung Fu Sword Martial Art Pack, Cultivation Perfusion Pack, or Reclusive Schools' Reverse Meridian Pack (Level 1-180 or Level 180-216 except Dharma Sect or Divine Water Palace) at Jiugong Elder (295 573), Luoyang. </font>
desc_zhuangbei_custom_12=Click Martial Path Convention Martial Art Summary to view the martial arts you can use.
