desc_box_201706_qmzl_01_0=<br>Right click to use.<font color="#00ff00"> You will get the followings according to the Age of Wushu Records of your server: </font><br><font color="#00ff00">Players in Tier 1 and Tier 2 Internal Skill servers will receive: 5 Qi Hai Concentration Pills, 10 Purple Spirit Pills, 20 Five-Realm Demon-Slaying Items, 1 Package Box, 200 Repairing Tools, 5 Ten Aroma Pills, 1 Windrider (3 days), and the title Hiding Dragon Ghost Shadow.</font><br><font color="#00ff00">Players in Tier 3 Internal Skill/Advanced School Skill servers will receive: 10 Qi Hai Concentration Pills, 20 Purple Spirit Pills, 50 Five-Realm Demon-Slaying Items, 1 Package Box, 200 Repairing Tools, 5 Ten Aroma Pills, 1 Windrider (3 days), and the title Hiding Dragon Ghost Shadow.</font><br><font color="#00ff00">Players in Tier 4 Internal Skill/Level 6 Equipment servers will receive: 15 Qi Hai Concentration Pills, 30 Purple Spirit Pills, 100 Five-Realm Demon-Slaying Items, 1 Package Box, 300 Repairing Tools, 5 Ten Aroma Pills, 1 Windrider (3 days), and the title Hiding Dragon Ghost Shadow.</font><br><font color="#00ff00">Players in Tier 5 Internal Skill/Reclusive Factions servers will receive: 20 Qi Hai Concentration Pills, 50 Purple Spirit Pills, 150 Five-Realm Demon-Slaying Items, 1 Package Box, 400 Repairing Tools, 5 Ten Aroma Pills, 1 Windrider (3 days), and the title Hiding Dragon Ghost Shadow.</font><br><font color="#00ff00">Players in Tier 6 Internal Skill servers will receive: 20 Qi Hai Concentration Pills, 50 Purple Spirit Pills, 200 Five-Realm Demon-Slaying Items, 1 Package Box, 500 Repairing Tools, 5 Ten Aroma Pills, 1 Windrider (3 days), and the title Hiding Dragon Ghost Shadow.</font>
