desc_box_20171030_drjjb=A gift bag with many gifts. <br><font color="#00ff00">Open to receive 3 Meridian Changing Pill, 2 Tianshan Snow Lotus Fruit, Five-Realm Demon-Slaying Item gift bag. A chance to receive 1 Ancient Manual Scroll Fragment Pack, 1 Workbench Embroidered Box, and 1 Black Jade Powder.</font><br><font color="#FF0000"> According to current Age of Wushu Record progress, player must be: One With Nature in Tier 1 Internal skill stage, Flows with Chi in Tier 2 Internal skill stage, Expert of Self in Tier 3/Advanced School Skill Internal skill stage, Enlightened Virtuoso in Tier 4/class-6 gear Internal skill stage, Peerless in Tier 5/Schools Internal skill stage, Shaking Universe in Tier 6 Internal skill stage, and Jianghu VIP to use this item.</font>
task_chaoswar_testskill_shop_010=There are a bunch of scripts here. Looks like it's Skill Books of The Reclusive Factions.
desc_box_guildwar3_leader_1_1=Your guild achieved 1 basic goal in the Guild Territory war. Here is your reward. Based on Age of Wushu Record, you will have a chance to get Horse Whistle [Juedi], Gold Powder, Jade Powder, Instance Internal Fragment, Ancient Skill Fragment, and workstations.
desc_box_guildwar3_leader_2_1=Your guild achieved 1 basic goal in the Guild Territory war and 1 additional goal. Here is your reward. Based on Age of Wushu Record, you will have a chance to get Horse Whistle [Juedi], Gold Powder, Jade Powder, Instance Internal Fragment, Ancient Skill Fragment, and workstations.
desc_box_guildwar3_leader_3_1=Your guild achieved 1 basic goal in the Guild Territory war and 2 additional goals. Here is your reward. Based on Age of Wushu Record, you will have a chance to get Horse Whistle [Juedi], Gold Powder, Jade Powder, Instance Internal Fragment, Ancient Skill Fragment, and workstations.
desc_box_guildwar3_leader_4_1=Your guild achieved 1 basic goal in the Guild Territory war and 3 additional goals. Here is your reward. Based on Age of Wushu Record, you will have a chance to get Horse Whistle [Juedi], Gold Powder, Jade Powder, Instance Internal Fragment, Ancient Skill Fragment, and workstations.
desc_box_lbhd_lylb_001=December Delicate Gift Pack. Open to get <font color="#00ff00">1 Horse Whistle [Red Lightening] (7 Days), 200 Repairing Tools, 3 Martial Celebration Cards, 3 Five Crops Tokens, 5 Tongming Pills, 5 Tianyuan Soul Gathering Pill, 5 Refined Moon Internal Skill Pills, and 1 Good Quality Expansion Pack</font>.
desc_item_lahd_laz_001_1=<font color="#00ff00"> Laba Porridge gifted to players on the December Eighth Festival. Recover 20 nutrition points after eating. Increases internal and external skill accuracy by 20%.</font>
