desc_tongyong_Treasury_wuxue_0=Can exchange jianghu martial art skills at the Silent Temple Treasury Keeper in the Cloud Valley instance (516, 103) or Cheng Du (911, 564). Redeem <font color="#00ff00">Chaotic Blade, Eight Plots of Chaos, Elemental Sword Technique, Snow Palm, Crazed Demon Staff, Splitting Cloud Eight Arrows, Heartless Seven, Snow Sword, Demon Soul-Chasing Blade, and Wind of Fury</font> martial art packages of full sets.
desc_ng_book_jm_15=Right-click to learn <font color="#44ff44">Yangming Large Intestine Meridian of Hand - Acupoint Reversal Script</font>. <br><font color="#FFFF00">Meridian level must be 180 to learn and the Reclusive Schools is enabled.</font>
