fashion_suit_g027_gui=Gorgeous Face (set)
desc_fashion_suit_b024_gui=Where can I find good tidings? The world is vast, and I search for bosom friends. If a man is merciless and indifferent, it doesn't mean he is a real hero. We can become lifelong friends even if we are not brothers.
fashion_suit_b024_gui=Heartless (suit)
FASHION_SUIT_G031_02_gui=Forget the Mundane (set - jadeite)
desc_fashion_suit_g031_02_gui=With a groomed bearing and divine looks, his brilliant skills make one forget the mortal world.
desc_fashion_suit_b021_gui=No talking about the end of the world or tears, how about the broken heart and death.
fashion_suit_b021_gui=Sorrow of Love (suit)
fashion_suit_g026_gui=Fixed Eyebrows (Pack)
desc_fashion_suit_g026_gui=Knitting my brow, youth disappears and purity appears.
fashion_suit_g030_gui=Rouge (Set)
desc_fashion_suit_g030_gui=Flowers in spring can't stand the frost. There is nobody enjoying the moon with me. If I can meet my true love, I will start a new life with him.
fashion_suit_g029_gui=Phoenix (suit)
desc_fashion_suit_g029_gui=Returning to my hometown after traveling around the world searching for good fortune.
fashion_suit_b023_gui=Untamed (set)
desc_fashion_suit_b023_gui=The moon in the sky is reflected in the cup, and a myriad of emotions stir in my heart. You only get a few chances in life to get intoxicated, so why not drink until the sun comes up?
