NPC_shp_190717_04=Mo Mei (Middle sister)
NPC_shp_190717_05=Mo Wei (Little sister)
NPC_shp_190717_06=Mysterious Man
NPC_shp_190717_07=Mysterious Man
NPC_shp_190717_08=Yan Qiang
sys_shp_190717_001=The snowy road is slippery, walk carefully.
sys_shp_190717_002=This bonfire has already been lit and cannot be lit again.
sys_shp_190717_003=Yan Qiang is very satisfied with your answer. You followed her and this dreamland is over.
sys_shp_190717_004=You have completed this dreamland.
task_shp_20190716_001=When I was ten years old, my father was attacked. My mother, greedy for power, remarried a rich man three days later. He must have killed my father! I am willing to do anything to avenge my father. I deliberately seduced my stepfather and shocked my mother. However, my mother... It's all my fault for making my sisters suffer humiliation and hardship. Today, I just want to make it up to them so they don't suffer anymore.
task_shp_20190716_002=Eldest sisters are like mothers. You just want to take the responsibility to make your sisters happy.
task_shp_20190716_003=I'm sure you miss your mother a lot.
task_shp_20190716_004=After my stepfather died, I had no food or clothing, so I committed myself to my stepfather's adopted son. Big brother, he treated me with sincerity... When the eldest sister found out, she was very angry, and scolded me for being shameless and accepting a thief as my father. But... I am a weak woman just looking for a strong arm that can make my sisters grow up carefree... My eldest sister is blinded by hatred. In her eyes, I am the same as my mother.
task_shp_20190716_005=I would have given everything for my sisters.
task_shp_20190716_006=People sometimes have to think about themselves.
task_shp_20190716_007=Seeing my sisters like enemies makes me so scared... They all love me the most. But now, seeing that our three sisters are about to turn against each other, I made this decision and designed this kidnapping. Maybe they will reconcile for me. It would be nice if you could take us out of here. I'm so scared... My second sister is seriously injured and needs urgent medical attention.
task_shp_20190716_008=Live each day happily. You are the bond between sisters and their hope.
task_shp_20190716_009=Anyone who hurts sisters cannot be forgiven.
task_shp_20190716_010=Everything you see is an illusion. No one can walk out of here. They can't, and neither can you. Hahahaha…
task_shp_20190716_011=I have been wronged and have come here just to clear my name. Want to trap me in here? No way. Just make a move.
task_shp_20190716_012=What a joke. The fireworks burn out and the dust settles. You are just a puppet. You are not trapped in the "illusion".
task_shp_20190716_013=I think you already understand what happened. The three sisters hate each other because of their hatred and different positions. They are both my disciples and my relatives! Yan Wei... is my sister. I've always treated them like my own...
task_shp_20190716_014=Everyone is responsible for their own choices. Since they have chosen the path of revenge, we should let them go on.
task_shp_20190716_015=If your sister knew, she wouldn't want her daughters to fall into hatred and lose themselves. You have really given much thought to the matter!
task_shp_20190716_016=I believe that blood is thicker than water, and family love is a constant bond. Just like your love for your deceased sister, the three sisters will also open their hearts and support each other to go on.
task_shp_20190716_017=This is a campfire that can be lit to keep you warm.
task_shp_20190716_018=Ignite the Campfire
