desc_item_jtg_lzy_sfz001_0=Stone that contains jade. After removing impurities, you can obtain jade of the highest quality. <br>Clearheaven Palace Xu Libo (-114, -130) is collecting this stuff. Collect a certain amount to get Clearheaven Palace Identity Outfit.
desc_item_jtg_lzy_sfz002_0=Soft and warm. The best material for making clothes. <br>Clearheaven Palace Xu Libo (-114, -130) is collecting this stuff. Collect a certain amount to get Clearheaven Palace Identity Outfit.
desc_item_jtg_lzy_sfz003_0=Rare ore. The extracted bright silver is highly malleable. <br>Clearheaven Palace Xu Libo (-114, -130) is collecting this stuff. Collect a certain amount to get Clearheaven Palace Identity Outfit.
desc_item_jtg_lzy_sfz004_0=Rare ore. The extracted dark iron is tough. <br>Clearheaven Palace Xu Libo (-114, -130) is collecting this stuff. Collect a certain amount to get Clearheaven Palace Identity Outfit.
desc_item_jtg_lzy_sfz005_0=Has a light emerald-like luster, soft feel and high toughness. Can be made into luxurious fabrics. <br>Clearheaven Palace Xu Libo (-114, -130) is collecting this stuff. Collect a certain amount to get Clearheaven Palace Identity Outfit.
desc_item_jtg_lzy_sfz006_0=Flowers are blue. Extracted sap can be used as a fine dye. <br>Clearheaven Palace Xu Libo (-114, -130) is collecting this stuff. Collect a certain amount to get Clearheaven Palace Identity Outfit.
desc_item_jtgzc_lzy_xxjy001_0=The unique token of Clearheaven Palace. With this token, you can go to Wang Liang (15,-199) to participate in the Cultivation Test.
tips_jy_haozhai_01=The good fengshui of your home has attracted some strange guests. Time is limited. Hurry up to meet the visitor and take the quest. Submit the quest after completing before the time limit.
