desc_home_19_new_12_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Lamp<br><font color="#FFFF00">Magnificence: </font>200<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Home Size reaches level 1<br>The moon is shining in the sky, worldly lights are faint. <br>Lamp can illuminate your Home. Right click the lamp and choose to turn on/off the lamp.<br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_19_new_13_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Lamp<br><font color="#FFFF00">Magnificence: </font>200<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Home has reached level 1<br>Opens in the corner, silently pleasing everyone. <br>Lamp can illuminate your Home. Right click the lamp and choose to turn on/off the lamp.<br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_19_new_14_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Chair<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>200<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Courtyard Size reaches level 1.<br>The grass and trees are all loving, the wind and the moon are all beautiful, love and hate are romantic. <br>You will get Cultivation Points when resting on the chair. The effect differs according to the quality of the chair. The cooldown is 6 hours. Players will get the buff every 12 hours. <br>When the Home durability is less than half, the effect will be decreased. <br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_19_new_15_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Decoration<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>200<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Courtyard Size reaches level 1<br>Strict to self, nice to others. <br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
desc_home_19_new_16_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type: </font>Decoration<br><font color="#FFFF00">Prosperity: </font>200<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirement: </font>Courtyard Size reaches level 1<br>Silly brain, get me some money. <br>Right click to use and the furniture will be placed in the storage.
