desc_item_lzy_tqcy001_0=A letter of repentance written in remembrance of misdeeds. With this letter of repentance, you can go to the labor prison to receive Labor Quests.
desc_item_lzy_tqcy002_0=A letter of repentance written in remembrance of misdeeds. With this letter of repentance, you can go to the labor prison to receive Labor Quests.
desc_item_lzy_tqcy003_0=Cleaning Rag. Item used to accept "Tidy Straw Mat" quest at the labor prison. Complete it to deduct 100 Infamy.<br>(Once you are released from prison, this item gets deleted)
desc_item_lzy_tqcy004_0=A Broom. Item used to accept "Clean up clutter" quest at the labor prison. Complete it to deduct 500 Infamy.<br>(Once you are released from prison, this item gets deleted)
desc_item_lzy_tqcy005_0=An Axe. Item used to accept "Chop Firewood" quest at the labor prison. Complete it to deduct 1000 Infamy.<br>(Once you are released from prison, this item gets deleted)
desc_item_lzy_tqcy006_0=Cleaning Rag. Item used to accept "Tidy Straw Mat" quest at the labor prison. Complete it to decrease jail time by 10 minutes.<br>(Once you are released from prison, this item gets deleted)
desc_item_lzy_tqcy007_0=A Broom. Item used to accept "Clean up clutter" quest at the labor prison. Complete it to decrease jail time by 1 hour.<br>(Once you are released from prison, this item gets deleted)
desc_item_lzy_tqcy008_0=An Axe. Item used to accept "Chop Firewood" quest at the labor prison. Complete it to decrease jail time by 5 hours.<br>(Once you are released from prison, this item gets deleted)
desc_switch_1099=Demon's Challenge Limitless Plug-in Switch
desc_pet_mouse_gensui_0=<font color="#ff0000">[Right click to move the pet to collection interface]</font><br><font color="#ff0000">Note: When the pet is in the collection interface, it cannot be taken out and is bound to the player. If the pet has a time limit, it will be deleted automatically when the time is up.</font><br>Using it will summon White Majesty. With a pet summoned, players recover 5 Flying Skill Points during meditation<br><font color="#ff0000">[Note: When the tier 2 internal skill is active, players with a pet and at level Flows with Chi, may speak with the Beast Villa Recruitment Guide to apply to join! (Location: Beggar's Sect 589 853) ]</font>
