ui_xmg_shimen_kill_count=Kills
xmg_smdh_wjmz_002=Starry Pavilion School Tournament Kill Ranking
tips_time_xmg_jinlsmdh03=Starry Pavilion School Tournament Preliminary Competition Stage is on. Attack the targets around you. The top 4 will proceed to the final.
tips_time_xmg_jinlsmdh04=Starry Pavilion School Tournament Preliminary Ending Stage is on. You can check your rank at the button left to the mini map on the top right of the screen.
tips_time_xmg_jinlsmdh06=Starry Pavilion School Tournament Final Competition Stage is on. Defeat the targets around you. Once the final is over, the top 7 of kill ranking will get corresponding school positions, as well as rewards via mail. The 8th will get only the rewards in mail.
task_newmp_xmg_sm_001=<font color="#FF3030">At 21:00 on Sunday</font>, Starry Pavilion disciples can sign up here to participate in the Starry Pavilion School Tournament. Up to 48 players can register. The event is divided into Eliminations and Final Competition stages.<font color="#FF3030">1. Final Competition Stage: </font>Once the event begins, players who successfully registered will be sent to fight each other in 4 areas. They need to get a certain number of kills to get into Finals. Before the Elimination Stage is over, <font color="#FF3030">top 4 players</font> with the most kills from each area will advance to the Finals. After the Eliminations players enter Final Competition Preparation Period. Once the Final Competition begins, everyone who made it in the Eliminations will be sent to fight in the central area. After the Final Competition <font color="#FF3030">the top 7 players</font> of kill ranking will get corresponding Starry Pavilion School Positions and rewards via mail. The 8th will get only the reward.
sys_singleshop_001=Your currency is insufficient to purchase
desc_taskitem_005jx_0=This insignia, owned by the Shenfeng Sect Killer. This proves that they were engaged in some illegal activities.
desc_ctjiangli004_0=A long-lasting medicine that lasts even longer when used with Flying Skills. Increases Maximum Flying Skill value by 100. Lasts 30 minutes.
desc_book_aqsf_007=One of the important hidden weapon methods of Tangmen. Kill without leaving a trace. Yet the technique for it is unique, and those who have not mastered hidden weapons will find it difficult to get the most out of this method.
desc_book_zf_bp_04_01_0=Right-click to learn "Ten Steps Attack"
desc_book_zf_bp_04_02_0=Right-click to learn "Stop Violence By Violence"
desc_book_zf_jhts_01_001=The Three Talents array dismantles enemy attacks in an instant. It is difficult to use when deep within enemy territory.
desc_book_zf_jhts_01_002=The Three Talents array dismantles enemy attacks in an instant. It is difficult to use when deep within enemy territory.
desc_book_zf_jhts_05_002=This move breaks down the enemy's attack. It is difficult to execute while deep in enemy territory.
desc_key_ng_book_jz_005_1_0=Suzhou Zhao Daxian give you this Special Talisman; legend says it could dispel calamities and bring luck. <br>Zhao Daxian says your calamity should happen at North-West of Suzhou City, close to the Mid-Hill Pavilion in Yongcui Villa (895, 184). You should face the calamity and might be able to change it from calamity to Great Fortune. Maybe you'll get an unexpected reward.
desc_key_cjshow_26_0=Crazed Attacker dropped the package outside South Gate (586, 823) of Chengdu.
desc_key_wudang_duyao_0=This is the poison made by Ma Badao for the Royal Guards. It can kill people invisibly. Give it to the Red Flag Emissary <font color="#FF3333">Bai Libing</font> in the domain of Wudang.
desc_key_qyms_sx2_0=The letter translated by Wu Zhong stated that the meeting location is <font color="#FF4500">near the quarry (1220, 515) in Suzhou</font>. Go kill him and bring back something that can prove his identity. However, he is highly skilled and has beaten many enemies. You have to be careful. Maybe you should take some friends with you.
desc_test_cs_mhb_1=A hidden weapon skill of Tangmen. The hidden weapons in this set are as small as a finger and come and go like lightning. Fortunately, this set does not focus on attacking, but on shocking the opponent and protecting. The hidden weapons have chronic poison, although it's not fatal, it will not be easy for the enemy to come and go freely.
desc_key_qy_msjmy004_xin_0=Doctor Shen Jue wants you to persuade Pang Shijian to be cautious and not to revenge Ye Louka blindly.
desc_key_luoyang_mingce_0=It's a list among killers. There is no name on it, just some codes. Maybe only killers can understand them. Deliver it to <font color="#FF3333">Wang Dali</font> in Luoyang Martial Arts School.
desc_key_luoyang_zitiao_0=This note from Shifu Wang reads: "A book is circulation among killers. Right now it is in the possession of a <font color="#FF3333">mysterious killer</font> living in a house in the southern suburb of Luoyang, near the Peony Fields. Kill him and get the book."
desc_key_luoyang_zitiao1_0=This note from Shifu Wang reads: "The thing is progressing exactly as I have guessed. The <font color="#FF3333">Mastermind Behind the Scenes</font> should be within Luoyang Prison. You sneak in to kill him and get the letter between him and the Mysterious Killer."
(<font color=Kill <font color="#FF3333">a Wudang Disciple</font> in The Violet Chambers to get the map fragments.
