desc_pet_item_group09_12_0=Certificate of Rosy Garment Killer's assistance, use it when you become Tea Forest Distinguished Guest. You can call on Rosy Garment Killer to help via the character's Guard Interface at certain intervals.
desc_pet_item_group68_12_0=Certificate of Evil Tiger Stronghold killers' help, use it when you become the Distinguished Guest of Evil Tiger Stronghold. You can call on Evil Tiger Stronghold killers to help via the character's Guard Interface at certain intervals.
desc_karma_jiangli_005_0=An item used to cover one's face.
desc_kill_worldrule_001_0=A mask that hides one's identity and avoids an increase in Infamy for 5 murders within 1 hour. Masks with the same effect cannot be used for 3 hours. <br>(Only one type of mask will take effect. Only the effect of the last mask used will be active if different masks are used repeatedly. Palace of Shifting Flowers Mask cannot be used.)
desc_kill_worldrule_002_0=A mask that hides one's identity and avoids an increase in Infamy for 15 murders within 1 hour. Masks with the same effect cannot be used for 3 hours. <br>(Only one type of mask will take effect. Only the effect of the last mask used will be active if different masks are used repeatedly. Palace of Shifting Flowers Mask cannot be used.)
desc_kill_worldrule_003_0=A mask that hides one's identity and avoids an increase in Infamy for 25 murders within 1 hour. Masks with the same effect cannot be used for 3 hours. <br>(Only one type of mask will take effect. Only the effect of the last mask used will be active if different masks are used repeatedly. Palace of Shifting Flowers Mask cannot be used.)
desc_kill_worldrule_003_a_0=A mask that hides one's identity and avoids an increase in Infamy for 25 murders within 1 hour. Masks with the same effect cannot be used for 3 hours. <br>(Only one type of mask will take effect. Only the effect of the last mask used will be active if different masks are used repeatedly. If Palace of Shifting Flowers Mask is equipped, this cannot be used.)
desc_box_weatherwar_1_1_1=Schools Raid Reward.
desc_jianghu_jindi_jl11=Given by Gao Li for killing Ma Feng in Normal Mode. Identity "Peacock Hero" is required.
desc_book_cs_jh_dl0601=Ximen Yu, as an assassination master, is inseparable with his adept unique skill.
