desc_book_cs_jh_dl0606_1=Ximen Yu, as an assassination master, is inseparable with his adept unique skill.
desc_box_bossworld_mail02_1=<font color="#ff0000">Great Prize</font> to be granted to players who manage to kill a Top Expert.
desc_book_cs_jy_xsd06_0=Right click to learn "Stab in Back". Only <font color="#4444ff">Royal Guards Disciples</font> can learn this.
desc_tg_item_01_0=Made in Roaming the Four Seas. Items and Challenge point (1) can be exchanged at Roaming the Four Seas Store<br>You can only hold up to 20 of this item.
desc_tg_item_02_0=Made in Roaming the Four Seas. Items and Challenge point (10) can be exchanged at Roaming the Four Seas Store<br>You can only hold up to 20 of this item.
desc_tg_item_03_0=Obtained in Roaming the World. Can be used to exchange for 50 Challenge Points in the Store of new Roaming the World page.<br>Players can take 50 such items at most.
cs_005_009=Royal Guards are bloodthirsty. Few people dare come here.
cs_008_005=It's said that Wanderer's Valley members kill people like flies. I have to be careful here.
cs_008_008=Wanderer's Valley is easy to hold but hard to attack. So few people come to deal with the evil members here.
cs_024_004=The best weapon of Thunderbolt Hall can kill anyone with ease.
cs_025_004=Do keep alert in the Northern Desert. Many brutal bandits are there.
cs_026_001=The local people enjoy killing. Don't provoke them.
cs_026_003=We can see many evil soldiers and bandits in Northern Plains. People here really live a miserable life.
cj_005_002_002=Royal Guards focus on assassination and arrest. I'm practice martial arts recently.
cj_013_027_001=I entered Killers' Manor by accident. I have to work there for now.
cj_013_027_002=I was abducted to Killers' Manor and forced to work there.
cj_013_027_003=Many vicious people gather in Killers' Manor. To investigate, I became a servant there.
cj_015_012_002=I've unintentionally trespassed into the Plum Blossom Sect. To avoid being killed, I disguised myself as a laborer.
cj_022_017_003=I'm done with all the vendettas and acts of vengeance in jianghu. Let me settle down anywhere to get away from it all.
cj_025_007_002=I've stumbled into Heaven Net Cult territory. I pretended to be a common laborer so that they wouldn't kill me.
role_title_1722=Top Killer
role_title_1723=Second Best Killer
role_title_1724=Third Best Killer
desc_book_zs_hiddenwp0000701_0=One of the important hidden weapon methods of Tangmen. Kill without leaving a trace. Yet the technique for it is unique, and those who have not mastered hidden weapons will find it difficult to get the most out of this method.
desc_box_zhenpai_clone_tm_0=A device used by Tangmen disciples to hide weapons. You never know what a Tangmen disciple might pull out from one of these pouches. <br><font color="#FFFF00">Right-click to open. </font>
wudangchushi_clone007_menu_007=I am here to avenge you! First, call me master!
desc_book_CS_jy_xsd06_cs01_0=Right click to learn "Stab in Back". Only <font color="#4444ff">Royal Guards Disciples</font> can learn this.
desc_book_CS_jy_xsd06_cs03_1=Right-click to learn Level 3 Stab in Back. Level 2 Stab in Back must first be learned in order to understand this book.
desc_book_CS_jy_xsd06_cs04_1=Right-click to learn Level 4 Stab in Back. Level 3 Stab in Back must first be learned in order to understand this book.
desc_useitem_museborn_1_0=Right-click this item while standing in the river, and use it to extinguish the fires in Twilight Village. <br><font color="#FF3333">(Do not abandon the item, or you cannot finish the quest.)</font>
desc_useitem_museborn_2_0=Right-click this item to extinguish house fires in Twilight Village prologue!<br><font color="#FF3333">(Abandoning the item may cause failure to task.)</font>
desc_event_jyz_sinei_001_0=Collect the Mystic Iron Badges in the major cities where outlaw Koreans are found and hand them over to An Zaixi at the Huanxiu Mountain Villa in Suzhou for a reward<br/>Coordinates of outlaw Koreans:<br/>Yanjing: (138,-105)<br/>Suzhou: (328,765)<br/>Jinling: (1092,2256)<br/>Luoyang: (1141,642)<br/>Chengdu: (912,535)<br/>Coordinates of An Zaixi:<br/>Suzhou:(12,1108)<br/>
jiuyinzhizhenpai2=Identity Tags are proof that you have slain a Korean enemy! Give it to me, and I shall give you a rich reward!
jhzb_khbd_title_03=Killing! Ha ha! Killing and slaughtering over and over again! That is the best way to train. You will only learn quickly by killing others.
jhzb_xxdf_title_03=Killing! Ha ha! Killing and slaughtering over and over again! That is the best way to train. You will only learn quickly by killing others.
desc_superbook_khbd=Lose 1 training point every 30 minutes. Once training points run out, the treasure will disappear<br>Every day from 18:00 to 00:00</font>, go to Jinling Palace Eunuch Chambers and ask Eunuch Zheng <font color="#EE7600">(948,1534)</font>, Eunuch Dong <font color="#EE7600">(967,1515)</font>, Eunuch Bao <font color="#EE7600">(928,1522)</font> for Helianthus Codex training tips<br>When training points reach 300, ask them to teach you Helianthus Codex. When training points reach the highest level, ask them for advanced training<br><br>Right-click to learn Helianthus Codex<br>1 training point will be consumed. After training, Helianthus Codex cultivation point increases by 1.5% (an equal amount of cultivation points will be used)<br>Training requirement: <font color="#EE7600">Ask the Eunuchs for tips of training (not applicable if already engaged in other activities). Cannot practice in scenes such as Random Encounters</font><br>Training hours: <font color="#EE7600">18:00 to 00:00</font><br>Helianthus Codex level 1 to 15: <font color="#EE7600">requires at least 50 training points</font><br>Helianthus Codex level 16 to 25: <font color="#EE7600">requires at least 80 training points</font><br>Helianthus Codex level 26 to 35: <font color="#EE7600">requires at least 110 training points</font><br>Helianthus Codex level 36 to 49: <font color="#EE7600">requires at least 150 training points</font><br>From <font color="#EE7600">20:00-21:00</font>, if you practice in <font color="#EE7600">Jingling(2154,2000)</font>, <font color="#EE7600">Suzhou (1044,1044)</font>, and <font color="#EE7600">Yanjing (1696,1308)</font>, every one successfully practice will increase cultivation speed by <font color="#EE7600">2 times</font> additionally and VIP players nearby will get tons of Chi (This is not included in the daily Chi limit)<br>If killed between 18:00 to 00:00, this treasure will become inactive<br>Friday 0:00, this treasure will disappear
desc_superbook_xxdf=Lose 1 training point every 30 minutes. Once training points run out, the treasure will disappear<br>Every day from 18:00 to 00:00, go to Suzhou's Tai Lake Palace <font color="#EE7600">(600,1216)</font> and ask Palace Leader Yu Zhanglong <font color="#EE7600">(573,1374)</font> and Teng Brothers <font color="#EE7600">(600,1330)</font> for Star Vortex training tips.<br>When training points reach 300, ask them to teach you Star Vortex. When training points reach the highest level, ask them for advanced training.<br><br>Right-click to learn Star Vortex<br>1 training point will be consumed. After training, Star Vortex cultivation points increases by 1.5% (an equal amount of cultivation points will be used)<br>Training requirement: <font color="#EE7600">Ask Yu Zhanglong for tips of training (not applicable if already engaged in other activities). Cannot practice in scenes such as Random Encounters</font><br>Training hours: <font color="#EE7600">18:00 to 00:00</font><br>Star Vortex level 1 to 15: <font color="#EE7600">requires at least 50 training points</font><br>Star Vortex level 16 to 25: <font color="#EE7600">requires at least 80 training points</font><br>Star Vortex level 26 to 35: <font color="#EE7600">requires at least 110 training points</font><br>Star Vortex level 36 to 49: <font color="#EE7600">requires at least 150 training points</font><br>From <font color="#EE7600">20:00-21:00</font>, if you practice in <font color="#EE7600">Jingling(2154,2000)</font>, <font color="#EE7600">Suzhou (1044,1044)</font>, and <font color="#EE7600">Yanjing (1696,1308)</font>, every one successfully practice will increase cultivation speed by <font color="#EE7600">2 times</font> additionally and VIP players nearby will get tons of Chi (This is not included in the daily Chi limit)<br>If killed between 18:00 to 00:00, this treasure will become inactive.<br>On Friday at 00:00, this treasure will disappear.
desc_worldboss_item_01_0=Certificate for killing rare beasts. <br>Take this Certificate and go to the Constable Experts in major cities to exchange for a reward. More certificates means better rewards. <br>Suzhou<font color="#3299CC">Li Long (496,326)</font>, Chengdu <font color="#3299CC">Shan Yue (643,581)</font>, Luoyang <font color="#3299CC">Ma Qisong (1015,331)</font>, Yanjing <font color="#3299CC">Xu Ke (266,-87)</font>, Jinling <font color="#3299CC">Shen Yabing (1689,1136)</font>. <br><font color="#ff0000">The constable's task will end within 2 weeks (14 days) after last appearance of the beasts. Please make sure to get your reward on time. </font>
desc_box_xunluo_02=Reward for killing a suspicious person.
desc_gamety_item_book_zhenfa_jh_001_zs_001=The Three Talents array dismantles enemy attacks in an instant. It is difficult to use when deep within enemy territory.
desc_gamety_item_book_zhenfa_jh_001_zs_002=The Three Talents array dismantles enemy attacks in an instant. It is difficult to use when deep within enemy territory.
desc_gamety_item_book_zhenfa_jh_005_zs_002=This move breaks down the enemy's attack. It is difficult to execute while deep in enemy territory.
desc_alonebox1_1=<font color="#ff0000">[Wanted Reward]</font> Reward for defeating the Wanted Boss of today. Open to receive Bai Xiaosheng's Weapon Manual, VIP players will additionally get Hero Tokens.
