desc_bestbox27_1=<font color="#ff0000">[Achievement Award]</font> You have defeated the forces of Killers' Manor. Achievement completed! Open it up and see what treasure lies inside!
desc_bestbox59_1=<font color="#ff0000">[Achievement Award]</font> The forces of Killers' Manor are all over the world. Achievement completed! Open it up and see what treasure lies inside!
desc_bestbox79_1=<font color="#ff0000">[Achievement Awards]</font> All forces have been defeated! Achievement completed! Open it up and see what treasure lies inside!
role_title_1890=Leader of Killers' Manor
desc_box_zcswph_001_1=Slayer Gift Box - First place prize (Ranked by Death Mode level). It's a sign of strength. Open to get a lot of battlefield points tokens.
desc_book_CS_jy_xsd06_cs05_1=Right-click to learn Level 5 Stab in Back. Level 4 Stab in Back must first be learned in order to understand this book.
desc_book_CS_jy_xsd06_cs06_1=Right-click to learn Level 6 Stab in Back. Level 5 Stab in Back must first be learned in order to understand this book.
desc_book_CS_jh_dl0607_1=Ximen Yu, as an assassination master, is inseparable with his adept unique skill.
desc_book_CS_jh_dl0608_1=Ximen Yu, as an assassination master, is inseparable with his adept unique skill.
origin_1300_desc=Maniac in experimenting about making poison, especially good at making poison that has no color or smell, killing people instantly and secretively without any reason.
desc_tiguan_reset_item_03_0=In Roaming the Four Seas, when you are challenging <font color="#FFFF00">Famous faction Master, The Fire, Tales of Yanyu</font>, you can appoint the opponent you want to challenge <font color="#FFFF00">once</font>; if you are challenging factions from other level, this is invalid.
