desc_item_4nei_mxdk_0=<s>Killer San, you only have to bring these disobedient Wudang Disciples to Siguo Cliff, and I'll handle the rest. <br><s>I want them to know what kind of price they must pay for not following the rules of the game!
title_4nei_gb002=Bi Jiahuo possesses Energy Body Protection and has formidable Internal Skill. <font color="#FF3333">Ordinary people cannot defeat his powerful Chi. </font>If you want to defeat him, you must start from his followers. <font color="#FF3333">Go ahead and exchange blows with his followers, and take them close to Bi Jiahuo. </font>His Chi will start to burn his HP at that time. After <font color="#FF3333">the burning has continued for 15 seconds, it will be completely burned up. </font>Killing his followers will now eliminate his <font color="#FF3333">sources of Chi.</font>
desc_skillitem_4nei_jy_taoniao_0=You will obtain a new skill after right-clicking the hook lock. Select the Scurrying Rat (52 -119) in the fields of Eastern Yanjing, and use the skill to deal severe damage to the Scurrying Rats. After you kill 5 rats, you will find a minor completed task on the side. Click on the Cancel Button on the right side of the Skills Bar to close the Skills Bar.
desc_box_jhzb_killer_01_1=The Treasure of Jianghu Killer Reward, according to Jianghu rules you should get it.
desc_box_jhzb_killer_02_1=The Treasure of Jianghu Killer Reward, according to Jianghu rules you should get it.
desc_item_yihuagong_001_0=Earth Spirit Grass can be used to heal serious wounds inflicted by the assassins of the Linked Fortress.
desc_qinyun_duihuan_1_0=Token from killing the Green Cloud Rebel. It can be used to exchange for reward at Luoyang (1035, 405).
desc_Treasure_wgm_male_01=The King Red-Eyed Ice Toad is treasured by the Rootless Clan, which has Supplement effects on those practicing Deviant Vampire. Once upgraded to a certain level, it will trigger Deviant Vampire's special effect. <br>Gender: Male<br> Present stage: Juvenile <br>Minimum Practice Points: <font color="#ff0000">70</font><br> Supplement Effect: <font color="#ff0000">When practicing Deviant Vampire, an extra 800 Cultivation Points will be added onto Deviant Vampire every 5 minutes (There will be a certain discount for non-VIP players). </font><br>Obtaining Practice Points: Killing characters who have reached the Peak of Power or higher level will have a high chance to earn you 2 points. Killing the same character will earn you a maximum of 4 points. Killing an NPC can earn you 1 point. Practice Points cannot be obtained during an event (Such as Forbidden Instances, Battlefields, School Raids, Script Protection, etc.), and there will be different Cooldowns for Practice Points obtained from killing players and NPCs. <br>Additional Effect: <font color="#ff0000">None</font>
desc_Treasure_wgm_male_02=The King Red-Eyed Ice Toad is treasured by the Rootless Clan, which has Supplement effects on those practicing Deviant Vampire. Once upgraded to a certain level, it will trigger Deviant Vampire's special effect. <br>Gender: Male<br> Present stage: Youth <br>Minimum Practice Points: <font color="#ff0000">65</font><br> Supplement Effect: <font color="#ff0000">When practicing Deviant Vampire, an extra 1000 Cultivation Points will be added onto Deviant Vampire every 5 minutes (There will be a certain discount for non-VIP players). </font><br>Obtaining Practice Points: Killing characters who have reached the Peak of Power or higher level will have a high chance to earn you 2 points. Killing the same character will earn you a maximum of 4 points. Killing an NPC can earn you 1 point. Practice Points cannot be obtained during an event (Such as Forbidden Instances, Battlefields, School Raids, Script Protection, etc.), and there will be different Cooldowns for Practice Points obtained from killing players and NPCs. <br>Additional Effect: <font color="#ff0000">Fury King Toad: When you're in danger, using a skill again will inspire the toad's potential to highly increase your skill power, and each of your skill will add your opponent with Deadly effect. After a period of time the toad will enter the period of dormancy and cannot be triggered again.</font>
desc_Treasure_wgm_male_03=The King Red-Eyed Ice Toad is treasured by the Rootless Clan, which has Supplement effects on those practicing Deviant Vampire. Once upgraded to a certain level, it will trigger Deviant Vampire's special effect. <br>Gender: Male<br> Present stage: Youth <br>Minimum Practice Points: <font color="#ff0000">60</font><br> Supplement Effect: <font color="#ff0000">When practicing Deviant Vampire, an extra 1200 Cultivation Points will be added onto Deviant Vampire every 5 minutes (There will be a certain discount for non-VIP players). </font><br>Obtaining Practice Points: Killing characters who have reached the Peak of Power or higher level will have a high chance to earn you 2 points. Killing the same character will earn you a maximum of 4 points. Killing an NPC can earn you 1 point. Practice Points cannot be obtained during an event (Such as Forbidden Instances, Battlefields, School Raids, Script Protection, etc.), and there will be different Cooldowns for Practice Points obtained from killing players and NPCs. <br>Additional Effect: <font color="#ff0000">Fury King Toad: When you're in danger, using a skill again will inspire the toad's potential to highly increase your skill power, and each of your skill will add your opponent with Deadly effect. After a period of time the toad will enter the period of dormancy and cannot be triggered again.</font>
desc_Treasure_wgm_male_04=The King Red-Eyed Ice Toad is treasured by the Rootless Clan, which has Supplement effects on those practicing Deviant Vampire. Once upgraded to a certain level, it will trigger Deviant Vampire's special effect. <br>Gender: Male<br> Present stage: Breeding <br>Minimum Practice Points: <font color="#ff0000">55</font><br> Supplement Effect: <font color="#ff0000">When practicing Deviant Vampire, an extra 1500 Cultivation Points will be added onto Deviant Vampire every 5 minutes (There will be a certain discount for non-VIP players). </font><br>Obtaining Practice Points: Killing characters who have reached the Peak of Power or higher level will have a high chance to earn you 2 points. Killing the same character will earn you a maximum of 4 points. Killing an NPC can earn you 1 point. Practice Points cannot be obtained during an event (Such as Forbidden Instances, Battlefields, School Raids, Script Protection, etc.), and there will be different Cooldowns for Practice Points obtained from killing players and NPCs. <br>Additional Effect: <font color="#ff0000">Fury King Toad: When you're in danger, using a skill again will inspire the toad's potential to highly increase your skill power, and each of your skill will add your opponent with Deadly effect. After a period of time the toad will enter the period of dormancy and cannot be triggered again.</font>
desc_Treasure_wgm_female_01=The King Red-Eyed Ice Toad is treasured by the Rootless Clan, which has Supplement effects on those practicing Deviant Vampire. Once upgraded to a certain level, it will trigger Deviant Vampire's special effect. <br>Gender: Female<br> Present stage: Juvenile <br>Minimum Practice Points: <font color="#ff0000">70</font><br> Supplement Effect: <font color="#ff0000">When practicing Deviant Vampire, an extra 800 Cultivation Points will be added onto Deviant Vampire every 5 minutes (There will be a certain discount for non-VIP players). </font><br>Obtaining Practice Points: Killing characters who have reached the Peak of Power or higher level will have a high chance to earn you 2 points. Killing the same character will earn you a maximum of 4 points. Killing an NPC can earn you 1 point. Practice Points cannot be obtained during an event (Such as Forbidden Instances, Battlefields, School Raids, Script Protection, etc.), and there will be different Cooldowns for Practice Points obtained from killing players and NPCs. <br>Additional Effect: <font color="#ff0000">None</font>
desc_Treasure_wgm_female_02=The King Red-Eyed Ice Toad is treasured by the Rootless Clan, which has Supplement effects on those practicing Deviant Vampire. Once upgraded to a certain level, it will trigger Deviant Vampire's special effect. <br>Gender: Female<br> Present stage: Youth <br>Minimum Practice Points: <font color="#ff0000">65</font><br> Supplement Effect: <font color="#ff0000">When practicing Deviant Vampire, an extra 1000 Cultivation Points will be added onto Deviant Vampire every 5 minutes (There will be a certain discount for non-VIP players). </font><br>Obtaining Practice Points: Killing characters who have reached the Peak of Power or higher level will have a high chance to earn you 2 points. Killing the same character will earn you a maximum of 4 points. Killing an NPC can earn you 1 point. Practice Points cannot be obtained during an event (Such as Forbidden Instances, Battlefields, School Raids, Script Protection, etc.), and there will be different Cooldowns for Practice Points obtained from killing players and NPCs. <br>Additional Effect: <font color="#ff0000">Ice Toad Armor: When you're in danger, being attacked will trigger the armor of ice toad, which can highly increase your External/Internal Defense, continuously recover your HP (according to your Internal Skill Power), and make you be immune to all debuffs. After a period of time the toad will enter the period of dormancy and cannot be triggered again.</font>
desc_Treasure_wgm_female_03=The King Red-Eyed Ice Toad is treasured by the Rootless Clan, which has Supplement effects on those practicing Deviant Vampire. Once upgraded to a certain level, it will trigger Deviant Vampire's special effect. <br>Gender: Female<br> Present stage: Adult <br>Minimum Practice Points: <font color="#ff0000">60</font><br> Supplement Effect: <font color="#ff0000">When practicing Deviant Vampire, an extra 1200 Cultivation Points will be added onto Deviant Vampire every 5 minutes (There will be a certain discount for non-VIP players). </font><br>Obtaining Practice Points: Killing characters who have reached the Peak of Power or higher level will have a high chance to earn you 2 points. Killing the same character will earn you a maximum of 4 points. Killing an NPC can earn you 1 point. Practice Points cannot be obtained during an event (Such as Forbidden Instances, Battlefields, School Raids, Script Protection, etc.), and there will be different Cooldowns for Practice Points obtained from killing players and NPCs. <br>Additional Effect: <font color="#ff0000">Ice Toad Armor: When you're in danger, being attacked will trigger the armor of ice toad, which can highly increase your External/Internal Defense, continuously recover your HP (according to your Internal Skill Power), and make you be immune to all debuffs. After a period of time the toad will enter the period of dormancy and cannot be triggered again.</font>
desc_Treasure_wgm_female_04=The King Red-Eyed Ice Toad is treasured by the Rootless Clan, which has Supplement effects on those practicing Deviant Vampire. Once upgraded to a certain level, it will trigger Deviant Vampire's special effect. <br>Gender: Female<br> Present stage: Breeding <br>Minimum Practice Points: <font color="#ff0000">55</font><br> Supplement Effect: <font color="#ff0000">When practicing Deviant Vampire, an extra 1500 Cultivation Points will be added onto Deviant Vampire every 5 minutes (There will be a certain discount for non-VIP players). </font><br>Obtaining Practice Points: Killing characters who have reached the Peak of Power or higher level will have a high chance to earn you 2 points. Killing the same character will earn you a maximum of 4 points. Killing an NPC can earn you 1 point. Practice Points cannot be obtained during an event (Such as Forbidden Instances, Battlefields, School Raids, Script Protection, etc.), and there will be different Cooldowns for Practice Points obtained from killing players and NPCs. <br>Additional Effect: <font color="#ff0000">Ice Toad Armor: When you're in danger, being attacked will trigger the armor of ice toad, which can highly increase your External/Internal Defense, continuously recover your HP (according to your Internal Skill Power), and make you be immune to all debuffs. After a period of time the toad will enter the period of dormancy and cannot be triggered again.</font>
desc_Treasure_wgm_normal_01=The Normal Red-Eyed Ice Toad is treasured by the Rootless Clan, which has Supplement effects on those practicing Deviant Vampire. <br> Present stage: Juvenile <br>Minimum Practice Points: <font color="#ff0000">70</font><br> Supplement Effect: <font color="#ff0000">When practicing Deviant Vampire, an extra 800 Cultivation Points will be added onto Deviant Vampire every 5 minutes (There will be a certain discount for non-VIP players). </font><br>Obtaining Practice Points: Killing characters who have reached the Peak of Power or higher level will have a high chance to earn you 2 points. Killing the same character will earn you a maximum of 4 points. Killing an NPC can earn you 1 point. Practice Points cannot be obtained during an event (Such as Forbidden Instances, Battlefields, School Raids, Script Protection, etc.), and there will be different Cooldowns for Practice Points obtained from killing players and NPCs. <br>Additional Effect: <font color="#ff0000">None</font>
desc_Treasure_wgm_normal_02=The Normal Red-Eyed Ice Toad is treasured by the Rootless Clan, which has Supplement effects on those practicing Deviant Vampire. <br> Present stage: Youth <br>Minimum Practice Points: <font color="#ff0000">65</font><br> Supplement Effect: <font color="#ff0000">When practicing Deviant Vampire, an extra 1000 Cultivation Points will be added onto Deviant Vampire every 5 minutes (There will be a certain discount for non-VIP players). </font><br>Obtaining Practice Points: Killing characters who have reached the Peak of Power or higher level will have a high chance to earn you 2 points. Killing the same character will earn you a maximum of 4 points. Killing an NPC can earn you 1 point. Practice Points cannot be obtained during an event (Such as Forbidden Instances, Battlefields, School Raids, Script Protection, etc.), and there will be different Cooldowns for Practice Points obtained from killing players and NPCs. <br>Additional Effect: <font color="#ff0000">Red Ryes: Red-Eyed Ice Toad will absorb and consume killing will of its host and speed up the decrease of the host's infamy.</font>
desc_Treasure_wgm_normal_03=The Normal Red-Eyed Ice Toad is treasured by the Rootless Clan, which has Supplement effects on those practicing Deviant Vampire. <br> Present stage: Adult <br>Minimum Practice Points: <font color="#ff0000">60</font><br> Supplement Effect: <font color="#ff0000">When practicing Deviant Vampire, an extra 1200 Cultivation Points will be added onto Deviant Vampire every 5 minutes (There will be a certain discount for non-VIP players). </font><br>Obtaining Practice Points: Killing characters who have reached the Peak of Power or higher level will have a high chance to earn you 2 points. Killing the same character will earn you a maximum of 4 points. Killing an NPC can earn you 1 point. Practice Points cannot be obtained during an event (Such as Forbidden Instances, Battlefields, School Raids, Script Protection, etc.), and there will be different Cooldowns for Practice Points obtained from killing players and NPCs. <br>Additional Effect: <font color="#ff0000">Red Ryes: Red-Eyed Ice Toad will absorb and consume killing will of its host and speed up the decrease of the host's infamy.</font>
