title_wgm_051=1. Entry time: 7:30 -7:45 p.m.<br>2. Trial time: 7:45 -8:30 p.m.<br>3. Trial rules: You may kill at will after entry <font color="#FF0000">(You will loose some silver bits after you die, so it is recommended that you store a good amount of silver bits before entry).</font> You cannot form a team with other people within the field. <br>The field will refresh some NPC and treasure chests. You can kill NPC to obtain tokens or open the chests for a chance to receive tokens. Players who carry tokens during the trial will loose one token when they die, and may fight for pick up tokens at any time. <br>If you back out of the event during the event period, all of the token will be taken as punishment. Tokens can be used to redeem for trial reward.
desc_item_thd2_03_0=Jianghu Mask. Incognito, When equipping this item, killing will not increase infamy and Rage points increase to the maximum. <br>(You can only keep one mask effect, and it cannot exist simultaneously with a face veil. The mask cooling time is 1 hour. This item cannot be used if you are already equipped with the Palace of Shifting Flowers face veil)
desc_tqsj_tgsr_box01=Cao Zhengqing is killed by Xie Junke, you have received the participation reward!
desc_tqsj_tgsr_box02=Cao Zhengqing has been successfully killed. You have gained a great reward!
school_rule_event_25=Faction rule violation: You cannot kill (players)
szwe01_npc_szwe01301_3=When will these revenge plans ever end? First, the old devil Zhao Ziji killed Mr. Han of the Han Family at Xishan. Then a young master of the Han Family, Han Sijin, killed Zhao Ziji's wife and son. Then Zhao Ziji became furious, killed Han Sijin, and is killing anyone who has anything to do with this. Then people of the Han Family lured Zhao Ziji into the Kuang Family Estate, and with the number of people on their side, swore to kill Zhao Ziji to avenge their old and young masters!
szwe_kuangzhong_01=I heard Zhao Ziji went crazy and killed Han Sijin. Han Sijin's followers sought revenge and trapped Zhao Ziji at my house. His followers also kidnapped my family members as hostages, and I am worried to death! Who can help me to save my family, the prefect will provide a good reward!
szwe_kuangzhong_03=I want to help my kidnapped family, but I can't get close enough to help them. I must think of a way to kill the guards. I hope you can help me and I will be so grateful!
desc_helmet_jy_50501=It is said that a Royal Guard would wear this when performing an assassination task. The material is of fine quality.
desc_cloth_jy_50501=It is said that a Royal Guard would wear this when performing an assassination task. The material is of fine quality.
desc_pants_jy_50501=It is said that a Royal Guard would wear this when performing an assassination task. The material is of fine quality.
desc_shoes_jy_50501=It is said that a Royal Guard would wear this when performing an assassination task. The material is of fine quality.
desc_item_jzsj_013_0=A domineering force rushes forward. It is obtained after killing the Fierce-Eyed Tiger. It is used to produce the Warmth Pills.
desc_item_jzsj_011_0=It appears crystal clear. Obtained after killing the Beggar's Sect's king snake, it is used to produce the Tame the Beast Elixir.
nmp_menu_wx_02=Eliminate the effects that <font color="#00FF00">the number of kills </font>have on joining the faction (<font color="#FFB428">daily task</font>)
nmp_title_wx_02=You have killed too many and exude an murderous aura. However those desired to be good can still be saved. Abbot Xuanhuai of the Shaolin Temple is a good friend of mine. He is well versed in Buddhism and filled with compassion. You can go talk to him.
desc_item_force_001_0=The 88 Buddhas are the lords of penance for all beings in Buddhism. People can tell them of their repentance and changed evil desires. Ancient law stipulates that 108 ceremonies are required to read The Text of Repentance. (Used to eliminate the effects that the<font color="#ff0000"> number of kills </font>have on joining Jianghu factions, and the <font color="#ff0000">number of kills or title of kills</font> on joining reclusive factions. After holding This item , the Killer Series Title can no longer be used.)
sl_npcadv032001_03=After I start healing, the enemy will initiate an attack. As long as I can avoid being hit, I will be able to recover my HP and Energy. The more Energy I have, the more HP will be recovered. I can use my restored Energy to help you recover or defend, or slay the enemy.
sl_npcadv032001_05=Help to kill (consume the hero's energy)
sl_npcadv101_clone002_04=Help me to kill the enemy general!
sl_npcadv101_clone024_04=Help me kill the Bandit Leader!
sl_npcadv101_clone026=I have a good horse. I can enter and kill the enemy's patrol.
sl_npcadv101_clone032=I am the general's aide. I can help you kill the bandit leader's guard.
sl_npcadv100_clone001_15=Your stomach pain is sure to induce vomiting. You make a loud noise when you vomit, and the guards are bound to check up on you. Kill the guards when that time comes, take their keys, and then we can escape!
sl_npcadv100_clone012_15=It is a long story. I am from a family of doctors and I have also trained in martial arts. However, what's wrong is that my master is an enemy to my family! My father has a younger fellow apprentice who has been vicious since youth. He used live people for experiments and practices vicious martial arts. My father told grandfather after he discovered this. Grandfather discovered his practices and expelled him from faction. He held a grudge and kidnapped me when I was one year old. He wants to use the world's most vicious method to avenge my father. Therefore, he told me of the person who killed my father, who, in actuality, was my biological father.
sl_npcadv100_clone012_17=I was filled with hatred and took revenge after I complete my martial arts training. During the assassination, my biological father recognized me from my birthmark, but I had already killed him! When my father told me the truth before his last dying breath, I became furious. My mother killed herself after she saw me kill my father. She smiled at me and told me she does not hate me, and told me to live and have a good life. The only motivation for me to keep living is to kill my master! But I am still no match for my master, so I came here to look for the Lost Soul Powder for this purpose.
desc_item_mpcs_03_1=Life-saving drug carried by Jianghu assassins, but has little effect for people with profound skills!
desc_item_mpcs_03=<font color="#FFB428">Can only be used for the faction assassination event! </font>
desc_item_mpcs_02_1=The potion carried by Jianghu assassins. After using it, nearby teammates will cause an additional 30% damage!
desc_item_mpcs_02=<font color="#FFB428">Can only be used for the faction assassination event! </font>
desc_item_mpcs_01_1=An antidote carried by Jianghu assassins to prevent being poisoned to death!
desc_item_mpcs_01=<font color="#FFB428">Can only be used for the faction assassination event! </font>
desc_ruler_50403=This ruler has gained notoriety for being a weapon of serial murder.
desc_box_wssz_rw_011_1=Rewards for undertaking Beast Villa's Killing the Spy Assignment.
desc_box_jyz_equip_2_1=Although these assassins are just underlings, they accumulate a lot of wealth for their services.
desc_item_aqzw_10_1=A reward package for your completion of the assignment Killing "Taoist Mu". Open it to have the chance to win Hidden Weapon Techniques, manufacturing drawings of Hidden Weapons, Peacock Plumes, Experience Pills, Cultivation Point Pills, and Pure Chi Pills.
desc_item_aqzw_11_1=A reward package for your completion of the assignment Killing "Taoist Mu". Open it to have the chance to win Hidden Weapon Techniques, manufacturing drawings of Hidden Weapons, Peacock Plumes, Experience Pills, Cultivation Point Pills, and Pure Chi Pills.
desc_item_aqzw_12_1=A reward package for your completion of the assignment Killing "Taoist Mu". Open it to have the chance to win Hidden Weapon Techniques, manufacturing drawings of Hidden Weapons, Peacock Plumes, Experience Pills, Cultivation Point Pills, and Pure Chi Pills.
desc_item_aqzw_13_1=A reward package for your completion of the assignment Killing "Taoist Mu". Open it to have the chance to win Hidden Weapon Techniques, manufacturing drawings of Hidden Weapons, Peacock Plumes, Experience Pills, Cultivation Point Pills, and Pure Chi Pills.
desc_event_item_aqzw_04_0=Kill the killers from Phantom's Mountain Manor and collect clues from them. After you have collected 10 clues, you can go to Luoyang (1032,906) and find Xu Yuanzi to sign up for the "King of Hidden Weapons" Contest.
Shop_card_activity_page1=Activity
npc_world_menu_city04_move04=You are still in need of 10 Phantom's Mountain Manor "killer clues". If you cannot collect enough clues, I am afraid I cannot let you in!
accost_tiaoxin0_00=Every day I come up with new ways to kill.
accost_tiaoxin0_01=Every day I come up with new ways to kill.
accost_tiaoxin0_02=Every day I come up with new ways to kill.
accost_tiaoxin0_03=Every day I come up with new ways to kill.
accost_tiaoxin0_04=Every day I come up with new ways to kill.
accost_tiaoxin0_10=Every day I come up with new ways to kill.
accost_tiaoxin0_11=Every day I come up with new ways to kill.
accost_tiaoxin0_12=Every day I come up with new ways to kill.
accost_tiaoxin0_13=Every day I come up with new ways to kill.
accost_tiaoxin0_14=Every day I come up with new ways to kill.
desc_item_event_khd_weahter_01_1=You will gain this reward if you kill the killer who are hunting you. It contains mysterious item.
yd_title_khd_wfwt=There are <font face="Default" color="#00e5ee" >no laws</font> on Delightful Island. You can kill anyone, and nobody will stop you. You must be careful, hero. <font face_b="Default" color_b="#00FF00" >(No Laws Here: When you put on Leisure Robe, you can kill anyone on island without getting any Infamy and Discipline Value. There are many factions on island which will publish some daily tasks.) </font>
yd_title_khd_wfwt_b=How naive! We are commanded to supply the island, nothing more. We won't govern it, and we don't have the right to do so. This place has <font face_b="Default" color_b="#00e5ee" >no laws</font>. Killing is just a daily activity here, and there won't be any punishment for it. <font face_b="Default" color_b="#00FF00" >(No Laws Here: When you put on Leisure Robe, you can kill anyone on island without getting any Infamy and Discipline Value. There are many factions on island which will publish some daily tasks.) </font>
desc_box_zybyhg_hwq002=By opening the gift bag, disciples not from Palace of Shifting Flowers can get 50000 practice pill and 30-70 Five Aggregates and Demon-subduing Items for certain, and have a chance to get Against Worldly Evil Scroll Fragment, Hidden Prowess Scroll Fragment, Purple Rosy Clouds Skill Scroll Fragment, Five Elements Mental Skill Scroll Fragment, Sunset Skill Scroll Fragment, and tier 1 or 2 work bench.<br>Disciples from Palace of Shifting Flowers can get 250000 Palace of Shifting Flowers practice pill, and have a chance to get Against Worldly Evil Scroll Fragment, Hidden Prowess Scroll Fragment, Purple Rosy Clouds Skill Scroll Fragment, Five Elements Mental Skill Scroll Fragment, Sunset Skill Scroll Fragment, and tier 1 work bench.
desc_box_zybyhg_hwq003=By opening the gift bag, disciples not from Palace of Shifting Flowers can get 50000 practice pill and 30-70 Five Aggregates and Demon-subduing Items for certain, and have a chance to get Against Worldly Evil Scroll Fragment, Hidden Prowess Scroll Fragment, Purple Rosy Clouds Skill Scroll Fragment, Five Elements Mental Skill Scroll Fragment, Sunset Skill Scroll Fragment, and tier 1 or 2 work bench.<br>Disciples from Palace of Shifting Flowers can get 250000 Palace of Shifting Flowers practice pill, and have a chance to get Against Worldly Evil Scroll Fragment, Hidden Prowess Scroll Fragment, Purple Rosy Clouds Skill Scroll Fragment, Five Elements Mental Skill Scroll Fragment, Sunset Skill Scroll Fragment, and tier 1 work bench.
desc_box_zybyhg_hwq005_1=Such a shame we couldn't select a flower prince. Pack can open up a Yanwu Pill
desc_box_zybyhg_hwq006_1=Such a shame we couldn't select a flower prince. Pack can open up a Yanwu Pill
yd_title_khd_jysg=Cao Jiuyang pursues the ultimate of martial arts all his life. However, he is brutal and hates common people. He will kill all people who engage in life-related manufacture he meets. Take care!
