sys_jianghudaluandou_tips_029=To win a battle, points are needed. Points are gained through killing enemies, and obtaining the sword forging stoves around the blood demon statue.
tip_count_choswar_red,tip_count_choswar_red=Defeating enemy players will earn points. Successfully taking over sword forging stones will earn points.
tip_count_choswar_blue,tip_count_choswar_blue=Defeating enemy players will earn points. Successfully taking over sword forging stones will earn points.
ui_time_jianghudaluandou_fight=Before the battle period is over, the camp that reached the maximum score will win. Defeating enemy camp players will earn points. When your camp has at least 3 more players than the other camp around the sword forging stove area, maintaining the state for continuous 20 seconds will successfully obtain the flag and score points. There are 4 sword forging stoves in the battlefield. They are in the 4 corners of the blood demon statue.
ui_time_jianghudaluandou_fight,ui_time_jianghudaluandou_fight=Before battle period is over, the camp that reaches <font color="#FF0000">the maximum points</font> wins. <font color="#FF0000">Defeating enemy camp players</font> can earn points. When your camp has at least 3 more players than the other camp around the sword forging stove area, maintaining the state for continuous 20 seconds will successfully <font color="#FF0000">obtain the flag and score points</font>. <br>In the last 10 minutes of the battle, the rate to obtain points will be <font color="#FF0000">doubled</font>.
