desc_item_kxhd_qxl_001_1=Ways to obtain Diligence Tokens: 1. VIP players can complete quests at Ning Jiuhui (Jianghu Guest), at Suzhou (423, 794) and Chengdu (923, 551) to obtain the tokens. After you collect a certain amount of Diligence Tokens, <font color="#FF3030">go to Ning Jiuhui, at Suzhou (423, 794) and Chengdu (923, 551) to exchange rewards. </font>
desc_item_kxhd_qxl_001=Diligence Token
desc_box_kxhd_qxlb_001_1=Exchange Diligence Tokens for rewards from Ning Jiuhui (Jianghu Guest), at Suzhou (423, 794) and Chengdu (923, 551). <font color="#FF3030">Open to get 10 Hunyuan Pills (1 Day) and 10 Chi Gathering Pills (1 Day).</font>
desc_box_kxhd_qxlb_002_1=Exchange Diligence Tokens for rewards from Ning Jiuhui (Jianghu Guest), at Suzhou (423, 794) and Chengdu (923, 551). <font color="#FF3030">Open to get 30 Hunyuan Pills (1 Day) and 30 Chi Gathering Pills (1 Day).</font>
desc_box_kxhd_qxlb_003_1=Exchange Diligence Tokens for rewards from Ning Jiuhui (Jianghu Guest), at Suzhou (423, 794) and Chengdu (923, 551). <font color="#FF3030">Open to get 50 Hunyuan Pills (1 Day) and 50 Chi Gathering Pills (1 Day). If lucky, one can obtain one of the followings: 1 Jianghu Internal Skill Scroll Fragment Pack (Unbound) or 1 Ancient Fragment Pack (Unbound). (Ancient Fragment Pack is unbound, and contains one of the following: Tai Chi Fist (Ancient Manual) Scroll Fragment, Dog Beating Staff Technique (Ancient Manual) Scroll Fragment, or Dragon Claw (Ancient Manual) Scroll Fragment.)</font>
