desc_item_curfillvalue_dataosha_fc_001_0=It's rumored that a deity killed a beast on the Eastern Sea and used its essence along with the blood of a spirit bird to refine this pill. Using it will add <font color="#FFFF00">10,000</font> skill Cultivation Perfusion. <br>Maximum number allowed in possession:<font color="#ff0000"> 50</font>
