newschool_sjy_swdy002=Camp Killer
question_20183110=How much infamy does a character have to reach, for it to be wanted by the government:
ui_Desc_Boss_clone040_cj=Swordsman from outside the country border. When he was young, he was famous for sword martial art skills, and was known as "Sword Colder than the Northern Sky". Many years ago, Cui Ji made enemies with a group of killers, and had since then been chased for life. He was lured to the central plain and got poisoned. He ended with both of his eyes blind. After he made his revenge, he disappeared. It's said that he has been trying to uncover some secret related to a mysterious organization related to those killers.
ui_Desc_Boss_clone040_lqk_a=Li Qingkuang is mysterious. He is the leader of Xueyi Hall and is the leader of Tianwaitian Assassins. Some insiders even said Li Qingkuang kills all rebels and whoever tries to investigate about the Tianwaitian.
ui_Desc_Boss_clone040_jqw_a=Lord Qin's substitute. The real identity is the mysterious clain's six experts. To reduce the government's suspicion about Lord Qin, they take turns to act as Lord Qin and kill people in jianghu and in the government. In the mean time, the real Lord Qin secretly goes to the foreign wulin and expand his power. He is also the one who killed Lu Xin. When he knows people are suspicious about Silent Temple and Lord Qin's Residence, he plans to kill them all.
ui_csw_guild_5=Kill
ui_csw_guild_6=Killed
desc_box_ssf_zfdy_01=Open to get 25 Lingxiao Amulets.<br><font color="#FFFF00">Life and Death Runes used on the Rune Slave will be included in the Lingxiao Fairy Ranking</font>
desc_item_ssf_zfdy_01_0=With this tool, you can apply Life and Death Rune from any meridians to the Rune Slave in Lingxiao City (546, 165). This tool is only the certificate for you to be eligible to use Life and Death Rune on the Rune Slave.<br><font color="#FFFF00">Life and Death Runes used on the Rune Slave will be included in the Lingxiao Fairy Ranking</font>
task_npc_hd_dy_team=The start time is 19:00. After 19:00, you will go to the event area immediately. The minimum team requirement: 10 members. There will be 10 minutes of preparation time. The bandits will appear at 19:10. There is only 5 minutes to kill them. Please form a team ahead of time.
desc_newschool_xingmiao01=<font color="#6E8B3D">Participation requirements</font><br><s>Do not have sect punishment status, not in Novice Protection state, not on a team, not in battle, is a Starry Pavilion Jianghu VIP.<br><font color="#6E8B3D">Event Introduction</font><br><s>Registration time: 10:10-10:30, 14:10-14:30 and 20:10-20:30. Please register for the event 10 minutes before the event starts.<font color="#00FF00">Number of players: </font>24. <font color="#00FF00">Participation times: </font>One time every week (in order to get the Maze Hunt reward to count the times).<font color="#00FF00">Event content: </font>Use the School Martial Arts in the event to duel.<font color="#00FF00">Event reward: </font>Each kill gets you a reward package. The killed player will get a reward package and will be eliminated. The ones who remain until the end will get a reward package. The highest reward will be given to the last player standing, and this is where the contest ends!
desc_newschool_xingmiao06=<font color="#6E8B3D">Participation Requirements</font><br><s>All Starry Pavilion disciples can participate. <br><font color="#6E8B3D">Rules</font><br><s>1. Patrol the school and kill the hiding pirates! <br><s>2. It is a weekly activity. You can participate 1 time a week.
desc_box_kaiguan_3pin_dushifangju_1=Can be exchanged for Enhancement Materials required for Jade Poison Maker Armor (Tier 3) Life Crafting enhancing 6 times.
desc_box_kaiguan_3pin_shipin_1=Can be exchanged for Enhancement Materials required for Jade Accessories (Tier 3) Life Crafting enhancing 6 times.
desc_box_kaiguan_3pin_wuqi_1=Can be exchanged for Enhancement Materials required for Jade Weapons (Tier 3) Life Crafting enhancing 6 times.
