xtts_tyhg_sndh_001=The registration phase has ended and we will soon enter the preparation phase for the elimination round of the Tianya Haige School Conference. Please prepare yourselves, knights.
xtts_tyhg_sndh_002=The elimination round has ended and we will soon enter the preparation phase for the final round of the Tianya Haige School Conference. Please prepare yourselves, knights.
xtts_tyhg_sndh_003=Final Period is over. You are about to leave the scene.
tips_time_tyhg_jinlsmdh01=Registration for the Tianya Haige School Conference is now open. Please go to Tianya Haige (1491 1280) to register with Wang Xiaoman to participate in the conference. Time is limited, so please register promptly.
tips_time_tyhg_jinlsmdh02=During the preparation phase of the Tianya Haige School Conference, please do not leave the Tianya Haige scene as the conference is about to begin.
tips_time_tyhg_jinlsmdh03=During the elimination phase of the Tianya Haige School Conference, defeat the targets around you and kill the top 4 on the leaderboard to enter the finals.
tips_time_tyhg_jinlsmdh04=During the final phase of the Tianya Haige School Conference, you can click on the button on the left side of the mini map in the upper right corner to view your kill ranking.
tips_time_tyhg_jinlsmdh05=During the preparation phase of the final round of the Tianya Haige School Conference, please be ready as the final round is about to begin.
tips_time_tyhg_jinlsmdh06=During the final stage of the Tianya Haige School Conference, defeat your surrounding targets. After the final, the top 7 on the final kill list will receive corresponding school positions and email rewards, while the 8th place will only receive an email reward.
tips_time_tyhg_jinlsmdh07=After the conclusion of the Tianya Haige School Conference, you will be teleported out.
task_newmp_tyhg_sm_001=<font color="#FF3030">Every Sunday night at 21:00</font>, the knights of Tianya Haige can sign up for the Tianya Haige School Conference here, with a maximum of 48 participants. The event is divided into elimination rounds and finals; <font color="#FF3030">1. Elimination round:</font> After the event starts, the knights who successfully sign up will be teleported to 4 different areas to fight against each other. Before the elimination round ends, the top <font color="#FF3030">4 players</font> with the most kills in each area will advance to the finals. After the elimination round, all the knights who advanced will be teleported to the central finals area to fight. After the finals end, the top <font color="#FF3030">7 players on the kill leaderboard</font> will receive a position in the Tianya Haige sect and a reward via mail, while the 8th player will only receive a reward via mail.
menu_newmp_tyhg_sm_001_1_1=Sign up for the Tianya Haige School Conference
title_newmp_tyhg_sm_001_1_1=Requirements: Must be a knight of Tianya Haige and not have any sect laws, and must not have participated in other events in order to sign up for the Tianya Haige School Conference.
newmp_tyhg_sm_001_1_1_1=I want to sign up for the Tianya Haige School Conference
title_tyhg_smdh=Rewards for the Tianya Haige School Conference
content_tyhg_smdh=Congratulations to the knight for outstanding performance and making it onto the leaderboard in the Tianya Haige School Conference. Here is a special reward for you.
desc_switch_1138=Tianya Haige School Conference on/off switch
ui_tyhg_rm01=The world is in chaos, and the hidden sects are stirring. Kunlun players can join the Tianya Haige and practice the internal skills and martial arts of the Tianya Haige as long as they meet the corresponding conditions. For more details, please refer to the system email.
ui_tyhg_title_01=The emergence of the hidden sect (Kunlun sect)
ui_tyhg_text_01=Recently, Tianya Haige selected knights from the martial arts world, and the Kunlun sect leader allowed his disciples to go to Tianya Haige by sending messages. Kunlun disciples who wish to join Tianya Haige can go to the sect leader for information. <font color="#FF0000">(Hint: If Kunlun disciples want to join Tianya Haige, they must go to the Kunlun sect leader (-126 -545) and ask for permission. It is recommended for Kunlun disciples to choose this method to join Tianya Haige.)</font>
ui_tyhg_rm02=The martial arts world is in chaos, and hidden sects are eager to make a move. Players in the martial arts world (without a sect or power) can join Tianya Haige as long as they meet the requirements, and practice the internal skills and martial arts of Tianya Haige. More details can be found in the system email.
ui_tyhg_title_02=Hidden sects emerge (Tianya Haige)
ui_tyhg_text_02=Recently, various hidden sects have emerged. In order to deal with the evil forces colluding with Mongolia, my Tianya Haige is now recruiting a group of righteous heroes to join our sect. Those who wish to join can go to <font color="#FF0000">Wang Lao in Jinling (1552 1023)</font> for more details.
npcmp_dingzw_tyhg_zcrw_001=Qin Linling
task_npcmp_dingzw_tyhg_zcrw_001=These pirates are really annoying!
npcmp_dingzw_tyhg_zcrw_002=Disciple on guard
task_npcmp_dingzw_tyhg_zcrw_002=Lately, there have been suspicious people appearing nearby.
npcmp_dingzw_tyhg_zcrw_003=Disciple on guard
task_npcmp_dingzw_tyhg_zcrw_003=I should be fine here, there are always others watching over the sect.
npcmp_dingzw_tyhg_zcrw_004=Disciple on guard
task_npcmp_dingzw_tyhg_zcrw_004=There seems to be some commotion at the beach. I went to check it out and there are a lot of people there. Hurry and call our senior brothers to help us drive them away!
