task_jianghuzhibao_npc_000=Oh, happiness and sorrow! How can one know where they come from? I have guarded this demon dream for many years. This dream is based on the experiences of previous practitioners of the treasures of the rivers and lakes, and it is beneficial for the cultivation of the treasures of the rivers and lakes. If you want to enter this dream, you can first buy a demon pill from me. <font color=""#FFB428"">(To enter the demon illusion, you need to enter the cultivation state first. Players must first consult the instructions on the treasures of the rivers and lakes and obtain the cultivation state before they can open the demon illusion)</font><font color="#FF3030">(There are a total of 6 waves of demons and 1 demon star in the demon illusion. The first wave has 4 demons, and the number increases in subsequent waves, with 24 demons in the sixth wave. Dying in the illusion will also cause the treasures of the rivers and lakes to drop. Although you can pick them up again, the drop of the treasures of the rivers and lakes will cause the cultivation state to disappear and the accumulated cultivation points to be cleared. Heroes, please be fully prepared before challenging again)</font>
menu_jianghuzhibao_npc_000_1_1=I want to enter the demon dream to cultivate the treasures of the rivers and lakes.
title_jianghuzhibao_npc_000_1_1=The treasures of the rivers and lakes are all shrouded in demonic energy, and without enough mental fortitude, one cannot cultivate them. (To enter the demon dream, you need a demon pill, which can be exchanged at Meng Po's place)
jianghuzhibao_npc_000_1_1_1=My mind is made up! (Through one demon dream, you can get a maximum of 300 cultivation points for the treasures of the rivers and lakes)
jianghuzhibao_switch_wangcong=The gameplay for cultivating the treasures of the rivers and lakes in the demon dream is not yet available.
jhzb_xiulian_000=Demon pill
desc_jhzb_xiulian_000_0=A mysterious elixir filled with energy. It feels like a demonic aura, yet also like a bloody aura.<br><font color=""#FFFF00"">Item purpose: Enter the demonic dreamland and attempt to obtain cultivation points for the treasures of the martial world</font><br><font color=""#FFB428"">Item acquisition method: Exchange with the strange old man</font>
desc_jhzb_smhj_tips=Demonic Dreamland
desc_ltc_tips=Arena Battle
menu_hd_kl_jsrw_001_1_1=If you possess the corresponding <font color="#FF3030">Kunlun internal strength promotion certificate</font> or <font color="#FF3030">Kunlun martial arts promotion certificate</font>, you can consume the corresponding number of Kunlun promotion certificates here for promotion.
title_hd_kl_jsrw_001_1_1=Consume Kunlun promotion certificates for promotion <font color="#FF3030">(Please carefully check your own cultivation status to avoid consuming promotion certificates.)</font>
hd_kl_jsrw_001_1_1_1=Consuming 1 <font color="#FF3030">Kunlun third-level internal strength promotion certificate</font> can promote Kunlun third-level internal strength infusion to 20 layers.
hd_kl_jsrw_001_1_1_2=Consuming 1 <font color="#FF3030">Kunlun fourth-level internal strength promotion certificate</font> can promote Kunlun fourth-level internal strength infusion to 30 layers.
hd_kl_jsrw_001_1_1_3=One <font color="#FF3030">Kunlun Fifth Inner Promotion Certificate</font> can be used to upgrade the Kunlun Fifth Inner Skill to level 30.
hd_kl_jsrw_001_1_1_4=One <font color="#FF3030">Kunlun Sixth Inner Promotion Certificate</font> can be used to upgrade the Kunlun Sixth Inner Skill to level 40.
hd_kl_jsrw_001_1_1_5=One <font color="#FF3030">Kunlun Martial Arts 6th Level Promotion Certificate</font> can be exchanged for the 6th level martial arts book page of Kunlun Spiritual Leg Technique.
hd_kl_jsrw_001_1_1_6=One <font color="#FF3030">Kunlun Martial Arts 6th Level Promotion Certificate</font> can be exchanged for the 6th level martial arts book page of Kunlun Sword Washing Technique.
hd_kl_jsrw_001_1_1_7=One <font color="#FF3030">Kunlun Martial Arts 6th Level Promotion Certificate</font> can be exchanged for the 6th level martial arts book page of Kunlun Cold Spring Cleansing Heart Manual.
hd_kl_jsrw_001_1_1_8=One <font color="#FF3030">Kunlun Martial Arts 8th Level Promotion Certificate</font> can be exchanged for the 8th level martial arts book page of Kunlun Spiritual Leg Technique.
hd_kl_jsrw_001_1_1_9=One <font color="#FF3030">Kunlun Martial Arts 8th Level Promotion Certificate</font> can be exchanged for the 8th level martial arts book page of Kunlun Sword Washing Technique.
hd_kl_jsrw_001_1_1_10=One <font color="#FF3030">Kunlun Martial Arts 8th Level Promotion Certificate</font> can be exchanged for the 8th level martial arts book page of Kunlun Cold Spring Cleansing Heart Manual.
hd_kl_jsrw_001_1_1_11=One <font color="#FF3030">Kunlun Martial Arts 10th Level Promotion Certificate</font> can be exchanged for the 10th level martial arts book page of Kunlun Spiritual Leg Technique.
hd_kl_jsrw_001_1_1_12=One <font color="#FF3030">Kunlun Martial Arts 10th Level Promotion Certificate</font> can be exchanged for the 10th level martial arts book page of Kunlun Sword Washing Technique.
hd_kl_jsrw_001_1_1_13=One <font color="#FF3030">Kunlun Martial Arts 10th Level Promotion Certificate</font> can be exchanged for the 10th level martial arts book page of Kunlun Cold Spring Cleansing Heart Manual.
hd_kl_jsrw_001_1_1_14=One <font color="#FF3030">Kunlun Martial Arts 12th Level Promotion Certificate</font> can be exchanged for the 12th level martial arts book page of Kunlun Spiritual Leg Technique.
