jianghuzhibao_npc_000=Grandma Meng
jianghuzhibao_npc_001=Grandma Meng
task_jianghuzhibao_npc_001=The ambition of seeking ultimate power will never change.
jianghuzhibao_npc_002=Grandma Meng
task_jianghuzhibao_npc_002=Whether one is a true god or as insignificant as dust, in my eyes, there is no difference.
sys_zhibaoxiulian_001=Practice the most precious treasures of the rivers and lakes, it is easy to lose oneself, and strive to persevere under the impact of the demons! <font color="#FF3030">(There are a total of 6 waves of demons. The first wave has 4, and the number increases in subsequent waves, with 24 demons in the sixth wave. There is a 30-second interval between each wave of demons, so please respond promptly and face the challenge.)</font><font color="#FFB428">(You can also practice the most precious treasures of the rivers and lakes in the dream world. Although you can practice without interruption in the dream world, you will wake up after a maximum of 1 hour and 30 minutes. Please pay attention to the arrangement of your practice time, fellow warriors.)</font>
sys_zhibaoxiulian_002=No matter where the demons come from, let them come!
sys_zhibaoxiulian_003=The evil demon has transformed into a demon star, defeating the demon star - obstacle, which can greatly enhance the cultivation of the treasure of the rivers and lakes. <font color="#FF3030"> (The power of the demon star is extremely strong, so if you don't have enough confidence and preparation, it is better not to try it easily.) </font> <font color="#FFB428"> (You can also cultivate the treasure of the rivers and lakes in the dream, although you can practice without interruption in the dream, but you will wake up after a maximum of 1 hour and 30 minutes. At the same time, once you defeat the demon star, you will be forced to wake up after 1 minute. Please pay attention to the arrangement of your cultivation time, fellow martial artists.) </font>
sys_zhibaoxiulian_004=I am ready to challenge the demon star!
sys_zhibaoxiulian_005=After successfully challenging, you will receive a large amount of cultivation points for the treasure of the rivers and lakes, and will leave the demon dream in 60 seconds.
sys_zhibaoxiulian_006=The next wave of demons will appear in 30 seconds, please prepare as soon as possible.
