ui_guild_store_ui_info=<s><s>The guild's treasure vault is where the guild stores the treasures collected from the martial world, and there is a detailed record of all the treasures that enter and leave the vault. <font color=""#FFFF00"">Click on the items in the treasure vault to distribute them</font>. <br><s>1. Only the guild leader can distribute the treasures in the guild's treasure vault. <br><s>2. All treasures in the guild's treasure vault have a limited storage time, and any treasures that have not been distributed by the end of the storage time will be destroyed. <br><s>3. The storage space in the guild's treasure vault is limited, so the guild leader should distribute the treasures as soon as possible. If the storage space is full, any new treasures will be destroyed and disappear. <br><s>4. Guild members must have at least 200 guild activity points in order to be eligible to receive distributed treasures. <br><s>5. The treasures in the treasure vault are valuable, and there is a detailed record of all items that enter and leave (only the most recent 300 records are saved). All guild members can view this record. <br><s>6. As the guild level increases, the storage space for treasures in the vault will expand.
