desc_item_revise_7name_0=According to government regulations, changing one's name requires filling out a name change document at the local yamen and obtaining a visa. <br>If the basic conditions for changing one's name are met, one can bring this document to the Ministry of Households in Jinling and formally apply at the office of the Minister of Households (1140,1586). <br><br><font color="#FFFF00">Requirements for changing one's name</font>: <br>Unlocked level 2 password; <br>Strength at the level of <font color="#FFFF00">初窥门径</font>; <br>No wanted warrants issued, and not a bounty hunter or wanted criminal; <br>Not the leader of a gang (gang leaders cannot change their names); <br>Not holding a position in a sect (those in important positions in a sect cannot change their names); <br>Not participating in any active gameplay; <br>Not participating in bidding or managing shops; <br>No important letters left unclaimed; <br>Other; <br><font color="#FFFF00">Time still counts in emails</font>
