taolu_body55_name=Silent Lament
taolu_body55_desc=When using the "Bright Day" technique, the internal energy consumption is reduced by 7%. <br> When using the "Sprinkling Spirit" technique, the internal energy consumption is reduced by 7%. <br> When using the "Fish Playing in the Cold Spring" technique, the internal energy consumption is reduced by 7%. <br> When using the "Green Plains" technique, the internal energy consumption is reduced by 7%. <br> When using the "Inviting Moon and Expressing Sorrow" technique, the internal energy consumption is reduced by 7%. <br> When using the "Chaotic Red Drifting on the Wall" technique, the internal energy consumption is reduced by 7%. <br> When using the "Climbing the Tower in the Bamboo Forest" technique, the internal energy consumption is reduced by 7%. <br> When using the "Thick Ink and Bright Colors" technique, the internal energy consumption is reduced by 7%. <br>
taolu_body56_name=Silent Lament
taolu_body56_desc=When using the "Bright Day" technique, reduce the internal force consumption by 15%. <br> When using the "Sprinkling Spirit" technique, reduce the internal force consumption by 15%. <br> When using the "Fish Playing in the Cold Spring" technique, reduce the internal force consumption by 15%. <br> When using the "Green Plains" technique, reduce the internal force consumption by 15%. <br> When using the "Inviting Moon and Expressing Sorrow" technique, reduce the internal force consumption by 15%. <br> When using the "Chaotic Red Drifting on the Wall" technique, reduce the internal force consumption by 15%. <br> When using the "Climbing the Tower in the Bamboo Forest" technique, reduce the internal force consumption by 15%. <br> When using the "Thick Ink and Bright Colors" technique, reduce the internal force consumption by 15%. <br>
taolu_body57_name=Silent Lament
taolu_body57_desc=When using the skill "<font color="#FFA500">Bright Day</font>", the internal force consumption is reduced by <font color="#FFA500">25%</font>. After using the skill or completing the use of "Bright Day · Bright Color", the user will gain a 15% speed boost for 4 seconds.<br>When using the skill "<font color="#FFA500">Sprinkling Spirit</font>", the internal force consumption is reduced by <font color="#FFA500">25%</font>.<br>When using the skill "<font color="#FFA500">Fish Playing in the Cold Spring</font>", the internal force consumption is reduced by <font color="#FFA500">25%</font>.<br>When using the skill "<font color="#FFA500">Green Plains</font>", the internal force consumption is reduced by <font color="#FFA500">25%</font>.<br>When using the skill "<font color="#FFA500">Inviting the Moon to Speak of Sorrow</font>", the internal force consumption is reduced by <font color="#FFA500">25%</font>.<br>When using the skill "<font color="#FFA500">Disorderly Red Drifting on the Wall</font>", the internal force consumption is reduced by <font color="#FFA500">25%</font>.<br>When using the skill "<font color="#FFA500">Climbing the Tower in the Bamboo Forest</font>", the internal force consumption is reduced by <font color="#FFA500">25%</font>.<br>When using the skill "<font color="#FFA500">Thick Ink Bright Color</font>", the internal force consumption is reduced by <font color="#FFA500">25%</font>, and 5 points of anger are consumed.<br>
