desc_item_ssf_shoushaoyin_z_0=Congealed by energy, the Ice Spirit can have the target suffer great pain. <br><font color="#ffd700">Item Origin: Twelve Swallows in the Snow [Lingxiao City (526,171)]Exchange</font><br><font color="#ffd700">Item Uses: After using, the user will get Unmarked Runes and the used will get Marked Runes (both can be exchanged at the Peak interface) </font><br><font color="#ffd700">How to use: </font><br>This item can only be used on players affected by Life and Death Runes for less than 5 times at the day <font color="#00ff00">outside battle, during events, with a stall, or if seriously inured, </font>by <font color="#00ff00">players</font>. <br>When Age of Wushu Record <font color="#00ff00">Pirate Raid</font> is activated, it requires that the user's item-related meridian should be practiced to <font color="#00ff00">72 cultivation cycles</font> and the target's power should reach <font color="#00ff00">Mentally Balanced</font>. <br>When Age of Wushu Record <font color="#00ff00">Soul Smashed Ninefold</font> is activated, it requires that the user's item-related meridian should be practiced to <font color="#00ff00">108 cultivation cycles</font> and the target's power should reach <font color="#00ff00">Enlightened Virtuoso</font>. <br>When Age of Wushu Record <font color="#00ff00">Plague of Luoyang</font> is activated, it requires that the user's item-related meridian should be practiced to <font color="#00ff00">144 cultivation cycles</font> and the target's power should reach <font color="#00ff00">Peerless</font>. <br>When Age of Wushu Record <font color="#00ff00">Traces of the Evil Cult</font> is activated, it requires that the user's item-related meridian should be practiced to <font color="#00ff00">180 cultivation cycles</font> and the target's power should reach <font color="#00ff00">Awe of the Universe</font>. <br><font color="#ffd700">Lord of Lingxiao City boards calculate Unmarked Runes at 00:30am on the first of each month.</font>
desc_qizhen_0116=This item has a strengthening effect on the <font color="#00aa00">Hand Shaoyin Heart Meridian</font>. When taking the rare treasure, it must be accompanied by a medicinal guide. The effect is better when purchasing the medicinal guide with whole silver.
desc_qizhen_0116_0=Grows in the high and cold regions, among the snowy mountains and grasslands. It resembles plants and insects, and after taking it, it can nourish the kidneys and lungs, stop bleeding and dissolve phlegm.
