srcx_01=The surface of the rivers and lakes appears calm, but it is unknown when there has been hidden turmoil. Not long ago, a secret religious organization appeared in the Qin Palace. What is the connection between the Qin King and the secret religion? Several jade chess pieces have triggered a series of bloody incidents in the martial arts world... The master of the Yunyan Pavilion, a great creator, suddenly issued an invitation, inviting you to a meeting.
desc_srcx_condition=The completion of Age of Wushu Record Wokou Incident <br> The player's strength has reached an incredible level <br> The switch for the "Twelve Zodiac Signs of the Great Ming Crisis" series of tasks has been opened.
desc_srcx_npc=Find <a href="findnpc_new,city04,NPC_2020jq_001" style="HLStype1">a disciple of the Yunyan Pavilion</a> to take you to the Yunyan Pavilion.
sys_dingzw202004_001=We want to challenge the seniors!
sys_dingzw202004_002=You want to challenge me? Haha, you alone are not enough, find more people to come with you! (At least three people are required to form a team to challenge)
sys_dingzw202004_003=We are ready, please teach us, senior.
sys_dingzw202004_004=Leave this place.
sys_dingzw202004_005=Leave this place.
sys_dingzw202004_006=Yes, I want to leave.
task_NPC_2020jq_dingzw001=One wrong move can lead to defeat, but one clever move can lead to victory.
task_NPC_2020jq_dingzw002=It is better to sacrifice one piece than to lose the initiative.
task_NPC_2020jq_dingzw003=I have roamed the rivers and lakes for half of my life, and now I am living in seclusion here, feeling extremely free.
task_NPC_2020jq_dingzw004=Do not rush to kill, victory comes from stability.
task_NPC_2020jq_dingzw005=One careless move can lead to losing the entire game.
task_NPC_2020jq_dingzw006=One chariot can defeat ten soldiers.
task_NPC_2020jq_dingzw007=Chess is like a formation, and each move is like a soldier.
task_NPC_2020jq_dingzw008=General of the army does not leave the city, the little soldier does not return home
task_NPC_2020jq_dingzw009=The Next Step
task_npc_shenyb_name=When playing chess against a skilled opponent, the general will encounter a talented player
