desc_box_card_552=Right-click to open and receive one clothing item, <font color="#FFB428">"Hua Chao Moon Night Robe"</font>, and one unlimited use dressing pattern for the corresponding gender.
desc_box_card_552_1=A solitary traveler, a lonely shadow of a wild goose.
desc_tab_b_head_241_b_0=This drawing can be obtained by purchasing the "Hua Chao Moon Night Clothes", which is of slightly better craftsmanship. You can change the style of your outfit by referring to this drawing. Open the <font color="#99cc00">Cosmetic Pavilion</font> interface to change the style of your outfit. <br><font color="#96a0c8">When the drawing is stored in the backpack, right-click to store it in the Dressing Pavilion, the drawing can be used unlimitedly, and will not disappear. Non-binding equipment becomes binding after using the drawing to change the image</font>.
desc_tab_g_head_241_b_0=This drawing can be obtained by purchasing the "Hua Chao Moon Night Clothes", which is of slightly better craftsmanship. You can change the style of your outfit by referring to this drawing. Open the <font color="#99cc00">Cosmetic Pavilion</font> interface to change the style of your outfit. <br><font color="#96a0c8">When the drawing is stored in the backpack, right-click to store it in the Dressing Pavilion, the drawing can be used unlimitedly, and will not disappear. Non-binding equipment becomes binding after using the drawing to change the image</font>.
