desc_item_ylqj_lzy_qizi001=Chess pieces scattered around the world.
desc_item_ylqj_lzy_qizi001_1=After collecting them, go to the Hidden Scale Envoy (-997,-237) to hand them in. The first 4 players to hand them in can advance in the "Speed is Key" stage (disappears after character death).
desc_item_ylqj_lzy_jlqp002=Chess pieces used to appreciate Saint Plum Secret (ancient manual).
desc_item_ylqj_lzy_jlqp002_1=Take the chess pieces to the Chess Player in Suzhou (551,299) to enter the training scene. Consume the chess pieces and a deposit of official silver to appreciate Saint Plum Secret (ancient manual).
