ui_mobilecheck_001=Please enter the current phone number in use.
ui_mobilecheck_002=Mobile phone verification for speaking
ui_mobilecheck_003=Mobile phone verification for speaking
ui_mobilecheck_004=1. Upon binding your phone number for the first time, you can receive generous rewards (each character can only receive the reward once). <br>2. During a mute, mail ban, or book confiscation, changing your bound phone number is prohibited. <br>3. Enter and verify a new phone number to change your original bound number. <br>4. The interval for sending verification codes is 1 hour, and the codes are valid for 5 minutes. <br>5. If a verified phone number is on the mute list, all characters verified with this number will be muted. New characters cannot be verified with this number. <br>6. Each phone number can be verified up to 10 times within 24 hours.
sys_mobile_title001=Phone Verification Rewards
sys_mobile_content001=Congratulations, hero, on successfully verifying your phone number! As a thank you for your support of the game, we are giving you the following rewards!
desc_baibaoxiang_key_ride_wheelchair_0101_0=Right-click to use <br>After use, you can learn the <font color="#00ff00">Mysterious Immortal Wheel</font> technique and permanently obtain this fun mount in the "Treasure Box". <br><font color="#00ff00">Treasure Box</font> can be exchanged for at the <font color="#00ff00">Chengdu 720,693 Treasure Box Merchant</font>.
