desc_ride_wheelchair_0101_0=<font color="#66CD00">【Right-click to use】</font><br>The Gongshu family of the Pre-Qin period has been extremely skilled in the art of hidden weapons and mechanisms for hundreds of years. At that time, Zhuge Kongming invented the four-wheeled carriage and sat in the army, commanding the troops. The ninth generation descendant of the Gongshu family, based on the ingenious ideas of Mr. Kongming, created the Xuanji Xianlun, which is filled with endless hidden mechanisms and weapons. After generations of improvements, it has become incredibly skilled and unstoppable by gods and ghosts.<br><font color"#FFC125">Cannot be dropped</font>
desc_item_title_4245=After use, you can obtain the title "Exemplary Style"<br>Right-click to use
desc_item_title_4246=After use, you can obtain the title "Invincible in Battle"<br>Right-click to use
