desc_Fsweetemploy_1_a=With strong bones and clear leaves, facing the wind with a smile that shocks the world.
desc_Fsweetemploy_2_a=In the South Sea, there are mermaids who can make clothes from their skin. According to legend, mermaids have skilled hands and can weave clothes from the skin of their own kind, which can protect them from knives and guns and resist water and fire. This clothing is extremely tough, like a treasure made from mermaid skin, and is therefore named "Demon Mermaid".
desc_Fsweetemploy_2_b=Bailuan said that the wings of the White Luan can transform into feathers as bright as the sun. According to legend, the Luan bird has five colors, and its wings can produce white feathers that can be used to make a dusting brush for immortals. This clothing has a soft and gentle luster, resembling the feathers of a Luan bird, and is therefore named "Wandering Luan".
