desc_box_guildcity_shp_cj_001=<font color="#00ff00">Upon opening, you will receive one of the following: the Unfounded Divine Skill, the Heaven-Defying Evil Skill, the Remnant Sun Skill, the Secret Seal of the Heart Chamber, the Purple Auspicious Heart Sutra, the Five Elements Mind Method, the Poisonous Clam Scripture Remnant, the Ice Heart Technique Remnant, the Mixed Yuan Skill Remnant, or the Blood Sea Saber Qi Remnant.</font>
desc_box_guildcity_shp_cy_001=<font color="#00ff00">Upon opening, you will receive 50,000 cultivation points, 5 top-grade soldier records, and a chance to obtain the "Umbrella · Emerald Bamboo" from the Wind and Scenery Chronicles and the "Secret Strategy · Cloud Traveling to the Nine Heavens".</font>
desc_box_guildcity_shp_def_leader=<font color="#00ff00">Upon opening, receive a whistle [Jedi] (8 days) * 10, Border Town Tiger Fight Remnant Scroll Gift Pack * 10</font>
desc_box_guildcity_shp_atc_lose=<font color="#00ff00">Upon opening, you will receive 10,000 cultivation points and have a chance to obtain the following items: Horse Whistle [Ultimate] (8 days), Border Town Tiger Fight Scroll Gift Pack, Martial Arts Gift Box 1-3, Xuan Yu Powder (bound), Washing Voucher (bound) *3, Treasure Refining Voucher (bound) *3, Doll Tempering Voucher (bound) *3, 15-day Weapon Scenery Chronicle, Permanent Weapon Scenery Chronicle</font>
desc_box_guildcity_shp_atc_win=<font color="#00ff00">Upon opening, you will receive 10,000 cultivation points and have a chance to obtain the following items: Horse Whistle [Ultimate] (8 days), Border Town Tiger Fight Scroll Gift Pack, Martial Arts Gift Box 1-3, Xuan Yu Powder (bound), Washing Voucher (bound) *3, Treasure Refining Voucher (bound) *3, Doll Tempering Voucher (bound) *3, 15-day Weapon Scenery Chronicle, Permanent Weapon Scenery Chronicle</font>
desc_box_guildcity_shp_fight_win=<font color="#00ff00">Upon opening, you will receive Horse Whistle [Ultimate] (8 days) *6, Border Town Tiger Fight Scroll Gift Pack *6</font>
