desc_box_card_557=Right-click to open and get 1 card of the accessory-themed Fengwu Zhi <font color="#FFB428">"Pine Spirit's Clear Sound"</font>.
desc_box_card_557_1=Watching squirrels drink while sitting in meditation, drunken sleep does not disturb the birds bathing in the mountains.
desc_box_card_559=Right-click to open and get 1 bound card of the accessory-themed Fengwu Zhi <font color="#FFB428">"Pine Spirit's Clear Sound"</font>.
desc_box_card_559_1=Watching squirrels drink while sitting in meditation, drunken sleep does not disturb the birds bathing in the mountains.
desc_box_card_556=Right-click to open and get 1 card of the clothing-themed Fengwu Zhi <font color="#FFB428">"Wooden Elegance and Pure Wind"</font> and 1 unlimited-use dressing pattern for the corresponding gender.
desc_box_card_556_1=Do you still follow the iron cavalry, or are you chasing after the cycle of mountain winds?
desc_tab_b_head_242_b_0=Purchasing the "Mu Ya Pure Wind" in "Feng Wu Zhi" will give you this blueprint, which has exquisite craftsmanship. Referring to this blueprint can change the style of your equipment in the martial world. Opening the <font color="#99cc00">Dressing Room</font> interface allows you to transform your equipment and change its style. <br><font color="#96a0c8">When the transformation blueprint is stored in your backpack, right-click to add it to the Dressing Room. This blueprint can be used an unlimited number of times and will not disappear. After using it to change the appearance of a bound equipment, it will become bound as well.</font>
desc_tab_g_head_242_b_0=Purchasing the "Mu Ya Pure Wind" in "Feng Wu Zhi" will give you this blueprint, which has exquisite craftsmanship. Referring to this blueprint can change the style of your equipment in the martial world. Opening the <font color="#99cc00">Dressing Room</font> interface allows you to transform your equipment and change its style. <br><font color="#96a0c8">When the transformation blueprint is stored in your backpack, right-click to add it to the Dressing Room. This blueprint can be used an unlimited number of times and will not disappear. After using it to change the appearance of a bound equipment, it will become bound as well.</font>
desc_box_card_558=Right-click to open and obtain 1 bound card of the clothing category in "Feng Wu Zhi" <font color="#FFB428">"Mu Ya Pure Wind"</font> and 1 unlimited use transformation blueprint for the corresponding gender.
desc_box_card_558_1=Do you still follow the iron cavalry, or are you chasing after the cycle of mountain winds?
desc_box_card_560=Right-click to open and obtain 1 card of the weapon category in "Feng Wu Zhi" <font color="#FFB428">"Scale Wing Sword Sheath"</font>.
desc_box_card_560_1=This sword was crafted by a hidden master in the East Sea, and its unsheathing reveals a cold light that kills without a trace.
desc_box_card_561=Right-click to open and obtain 1 bound card of the weapon category in "Feng Wu Zhi" <font color="#FFB428">"Scale Wing Sword Sheath"</font>.
desc_box_card_561_1=This sword was crafted by a hidden master in the East Sea, and its unsheathing reveals a cold light that kills without a trace.
