desc_box_lzy_duanwu_002=Right-click to use<br><font color="#00ff00">Open to receive mixed yuan muscle-building elixir (1 day) *30, qi-gathering elixir *20, horse whistle [extreme] (7 days)</font>
desc_tab_b_head_243_b_0=Purchasing the "Firefly Nesting on the Moon" can obtain this blueprint, with exquisite craftsmanship. Referring to this blueprint can change the style of the equipment in the martial arts world. Opening the <font color="#99cc00">Dressing Room</font> interface allows for equipment modification, changing its style.<br><font color="#96a0c8">When the costume blueprint is stored in the backpack, right-clicking can collect it into the Dressing Room. This blueprint can be used an unlimited number of times and will not disappear. Non-bound equipment will become bound after using this blueprint to change its appearance.</font>
desc_tab_g_head_243_b_0=Purchasing the "Firefly Nesting on the Moon" can obtain this blueprint, with exquisite craftsmanship. Referring to this blueprint can change the style of the equipment in the martial arts world. Opening the <font color="#99cc00">Dressing Room</font> interface allows for equipment modification, changing its style.<br><font color="#96a0c8">When the costume blueprint is stored in the backpack, right-clicking can collect it into the Dressing Room. This blueprint can be used an unlimited number of times and will not disappear. Non-bound equipment will become bound after using this blueprint to change its appearance.</font>
