desc_signup_schoolpose_11_0=Kunlun Sect School Meeting Registration Certificate, holding this certificate allows you to register for the first stage of the school meeting competition every Sunday at 21:30.
desc_box_paiz_kl_01=This package contains 100 Kunlun sect honor certificates, which can be traded with others.
desc_box_paiz_kl_01_1=
desc_klp_fhmp_box_1=After one day examine period is over, you can click the token to check whether you passed the examination.
desc_klp_fhmp_box_1_1=<font color="#FF0000">The examination token for disciples who returned from training away. Can be opened after one day examine period.</font>
desc_taskitem_yl185_0=Certificate allowing entry into the Kunlun sect.
desc_taskitem_guj_kl=Holding this certificate allows one to find the leader of the Kunlun sect and join by passing their test.
desc_taskitem_guj_kl_0=Letter of introduction to join the Kunlun sect. Holding this letter allows one to join the Kunlun sect.
desc_kunlun_panshi_01=The purpose of betraying the master: <br>Players generally rebel to get out of the faction and obtain qualification for entering into the other six major factions or join the new forces of Jianghu. Betraying the master is the only way to join the other six major factions.
desc_kunlun_panshi_02=Related to the martial world: <br> By betraying your master, you can join new forces in the martial world, such as <a href="findnpc_new,city05,xjz_021" style="HLStype1">Xu Family Village</a>, Jinzhen Shen Family, <a href="findnpc_new,school02,wssz_132" style="HLStype1">Beast Villa</a>, etc. As for those hidden forces in the martial world, I have no information about them. You have to explore them yourself in the martial world. <br> Of course, you can also join other major sects: <a href="findnpc_new,school06,em909" style="HLStype1">Emei</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school08,sl182" style="HLStype1">Shaolin</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school07,wd179" style="HLStype1">Wudang</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school05,tm089" style="HLStype1">Tangmen</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school02,gb390" style="HLStype1">Beggar's Sect</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school04,jlg093" style="HLStype1">Paradise Valley</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school03,JZTNPC150" style="HLStype1">Gentleman's Hall</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school01,jyw048" style="HLStype1">Embroidered Uniform Guard</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school20,npc_mjwy_005" style="HLStype1">Mingjiao</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school22,npc_tsguj_005" style="HLStype1">Tianshan Sect</a>
desc_kunlun_panshi_03=Requirements for Betraying School: <br>Tier 2 Internal Skill is available. <br>Not an Acting Headmaster in the school. <br>Not a Deacon in the school. <br>Not an Elder in the school. <br>Not in an ongoing training-away task. <br>Not in an ongoing disguise task. <br>Has been more than 30 days since you left a school last time.
desc_kunlun_panshi_04=Punishments for betraying the faction:<br>The school will delete your<br>Inner Skills;<br>Martial Arts sets;<br>And Status and titles.<br><br>And just to drive the message home, you will be banned from participating in a Disciple Rebellion or similar event.
desc_kunlun_panshi_05=Compensation for betraying a master: <br>When a player got away from a school through master betrayal and joined other schools, the player will obtain the martial arts strength equivalent to that deleted for the betrayal as compensation in order to accelerate the player's practice of the new school martial arts studies.
desc_kunlun_panshi_06=Kunlun Sect: <br> If you want to return to Kunlun Sect in the future, you are always welcome. Remember that you can find <a href="findnpc_new,school24,npc_klguj_005" style="HLStype1">Xuanyuan Qing</a>. We won't force you to stay here, it's up to you whether you want to betray your master or not.
desc_kunlun_xiashan_01=Purpose of Training Away: <br>You can leave school by training away, and then join the new Jianghu factions. However, you cannot join other schools. Compared to school betrayal, punishment for training away is relatively less severe.
desc_kunlun_xiashan_02=Jianghu related: <br>Through training away from factions, you can join the new factions of Jianghu, such as the <a href="findnpc_new,city05,xjz_021" style="HLStype1">Xu Family Manor</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,city05,WorldNpc100048" style="HLStype1">Golden Needle Sect</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school02,wssz_132" style="HLStype1">Beast Villa, </a>etc. I have no news regarding to the hidden factions. You need to find out about them in Jianghu yourself.
desc_kunlun_xiashan_03=Leaving faction for further training requirements: <br>Tier 2 internal Skill is active.<br>Not an Acting Grandmaster, Deacon or Elder in the school.<br>Not betraying school, or under disguise<br>It has been more than 30 days since the last time betrayed a faction.<br>Level reaches Peak of Power.
desc_kunlun_xiashan_04=Punishment for leaving the sect and traveling down the mountain: <br> Temporary downgrade of internal skills <br> Temporary downgrade of martial arts routines <br> Temporary downgrade of sect-specific routines <br> Deletion of sect identity title <br> Deletion of some sect tasks
desc_kunlun_xiashan_05=Compensation for training away from school: <br>Players will have all of their martial arts strengths returned to the previous level before they left the previous faction. Of course, you can obtain extra precious items during your training quest. You may make a small fortune.
desc_kunlun_xiashan_06=Kunlun Sect: <br> If you successfully travel outside the mountain and want to return to our Kunlun Sect, remember that you can find <a href="findnpc_new,school24,npc_klguj_005" style="HLStype1">Xuanyuan Qing</a>. I won't force you to stay, it's up to you whether you want to travel outside the mountain or not.
desc_kunlun_yirong_01=Purpose of Disguise: <br>You can leave school by disguise, and join the new Jianghu factions. However, you cannot join other schools. Disguise quest is relatively difficult, but you will not receive much punishment.
desc_kunlun_yirong_02=Jianghu related: <br>By going away from factions in disguise, you can join the new factions of Jianghu, such as the<a href="findnpc_new,city05,xjz_021" style="HLStype1"> Xu Family Manor</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,city05,WorldNpc100048" style="HLStype1">Golden Needle Sect</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school02,wssz_132" style="HLStype1">Beast Villa</a>, etc. I have no news regarding to the hidden factions. You need to find out about them in Jianghu yourself.
desc_kunlun_yirong_03=Conditions for leaving the mountain in disguise: <br> Server must be open for internal use <br> Cannot be the leader of the school <br> Cannot be a school official <br> Cannot be an elder of the school <br> Not currently on a mission to betray the school <br> Not currently on a mission to leave the mountain in disguise <br> Must have been away from the school for more than thirty days <br> Must have reached the peak of strength <br> Must be a Jianghu VIP.
desc_kunlun_yirong_04=Punishment of disguise:<br>Delete identity title of the school.<br>Delete some tasks of the school.<br>Cannot betray, go downhill, or disguise again within 30 days.
desc_kunlun_yirong_05=Disguise compensation: <br>The martial arts strengths for players who leave under disguise will not be affected. They can also enjoy easy face change services.  They can also quickly return back to their schools
desc_kunlun_yirong_06=Kunlun Sect: <br> If you want to disguise yourself and go down the mountain, you can go to the Ruined Valley to find the martial arts master Chunyu Cang. However, this person's whereabouts are mysterious and I don't know exactly where he is. But it is said that this person loves to eat red soup abalone noodles. If you bring this thing to find him, you will definitely not be wrong.
desc_itembox_ajbw_kl_1_16=A treasure specially crafted for disciples of the Kunlun Sect, with a quality of at least <font color="#ae8e6b">bronze</font>. <br> Right-click to identify the treasure.
