desc_box_zhenpai_clone_kl_0=Made from fabric produced by Kunlun Mountain. (Obtained through the <font color="#FFFF00">normal</font> level reward of the sect trial) <br> <font color="#FFFF00">Right-click to open.</font>
desc_box_zhenpai_clone_kl02_0=Made from fabric produced by Kunlun Mountain. (Obtained through the sect's trial [difficult] test level reward) <br> <font color="#FFFF00">Right-click to open.</font>
desc_itembox_drop_clone025_1=A heavy treasure chest. There might be treasure hidden inside.
desc_itembox_drop_clone025=<font color="#3299CC">Right-click to open.</font>
desc_xueweitool_0101_0=A volume in a martial arts book written with reference to the medical classic "Ling Shu", which can be read by martial artists to gain enlightenment in an instant, and can also help to open up the <font color="#FFCC00">Jiquan</font> point, the first point of the <font color="#FFCC00">Hand Shaoyin Heart Meridian</font>. <br> Requires <font color="#FFFF00">500000</font> cultivation to use.
desc_xueweitool_0102_0=A volume in a martial arts book written with reference to the medical book "Ling Shu". Those who study martial arts can gain enlightenment in an instant, and use their entire body's cultivation to open up the second acupoint, "Qing Ling", of the <font color="#FFCC00">Hand Shaoyin Heart Meridian</font>. <br> Requires a cultivation cost of: <font color="#FFFF00">1000000</font>
desc_xueweitool_0103_0=A volume in a martial arts book written with reference to the medical book "Ling Shu". Those who study martial arts can gain enlightenment in an instant, and use their entire body's cultivation to open up the third acupoint, "Shao Hai", of the <font color="#FFCC00">Hand Shaoyin Heart Meridian</font>. <br> Requires a cultivation cost of: <font color="#FFFF00">1500000</font>
desc_xueweitool_0104_0=This is a volume in a martial arts book written with reference to the medical book "Ling Shu". Those who study martial arts can gain enlightenment in an instant, and use their entire body's cultivation to open up the <font color="#FFCC00">Ling Dao</font>, the fourth acupoint on the <font color="#FFCC00">Hand Shaoyin Heart Meridian</font>. <br> Requires <font color="#FFFF00">2000000</font> cultivation to use.
desc_xueweitool_0105_0=This is a volume in a martial arts book written with reference to the medical book "Ling Shu". Those who study martial arts can gain enlightenment in an instant, and use their entire body's cultivation to open up the <font color="#FFCC00">Tong Li</font>, the fifth acupoint on the <font color="#FFCC00">Hand Shaoyin Heart Meridian</font>. <br> Requires <font color="#FFFF00">2500000</font> cultivation to use.
desc_xueweitool_0106_0=This is a volume in a martial arts book written with reference to the medical book "Ling Shu". Those who study martial arts can gain enlightenment in an instant, and can ultimately directly open the sixth acupoint "Shenmen" of the <font color="#FFCC00">Hand Shaoyin Heart Meridian</font>. <br> Requires <font color="#FFFF00">3000000</font> cultivation to use.
desc_bookitem_exchange_kl_0=The reward vouchers obtained from participating in the book-snatching and book-protection activities can be exchanged with the disciples of our sect for Kunlun sect martial arts techniques.
desc_bookitem_exchange_kl01_0=The reward vouchers obtained from participating in the book-snatching and book-protection activities can be exchanged with the disciples of our sect for Kunlun sect martial arts techniques.
desc_box_exchange_kl_1=Right click to open and you can obtain the school martial art skill rewards
desc_box_exchange_kl_2=Right click to open and you can obtain the school martial art skill rewards
desc_box_exchange_kl_3=Right click to open and you can obtain the apprentice school martial art skill rewards
desc_box_exchange_kl_1_1=Rewards are given to individuals who have made significant contributions to the sect's book-snatching and book-protection activities; after opening, they can obtain Kunlun sect martial arts techniques, and have a certain chance of obtaining Kunlun sect internal skills, martial arts annotations, and other props. <br> <font color="#FF0000">(Requires exchange with ordinary Kunlun sect book, binding after exchange)</font>
desc_box_exchange_kl_2_1=Rewards will be given to individuals who make significant contributions to the protection and acquisition of books for the sect; opening it will grant access to Kunlun sect martial arts techniques, and there is a chance to receive props such as Kunlun sect internal skills and martial arts annotation books. <br> <font color="#FF0000"> (Requires exchange with important Kunlun sect books) </font>
desc_box_exchange_kl_3_1=Rewards will be given to individuals who make significant contributions to the protection and acquisition of books for the sect; opening it will grant access to Kunlun sect martial arts techniques, and there is a chance to receive props such as Kunlun sect internal skills and martial arts annotation books. <br> <font color="#FF0000"> (Requires exchange with important Kunlun sect books) </font>
desc_switch_1116=Kunlun sect master switch
desc_box_zlb17173_jqjs_001_1=Exquisite gift package, opening it will grant <font color="#FFFF00"> 50 Five Elements Demon-Suppressing Pills, 20 Mind-Stabilizing Pills, 30 Ten Fragrance Revival Pills, 10 Qi Sea Concentration Pills, 10 Exquisite Moon Inner Cultivation Pills, 500 Repair Tools, 1 7-Day Horse Whistle (Ultimate), 2 Great Wish Pills, 150 Silver Pieces </font> <br> <font color="#ff0000"> Requires mastery to use </font>
desc_box_zlb17173_jqjs_001=Gift pack that contains many tools.
jyz_count_kl_1_1=Hand over the silk painting.
jyz_count_kl_1_2=Destroy the Strongpoint.
jyz_count_kl_1_3=Crack the secrets.
tips_jyz_count_kl_1_1_0=Places where disciples of the Kunlun sect may encounter members of the demonic cult: (-254 -436), (5 -431). All sect disciples must quickly go to these locations to defeat the demonic cult disciples. The sect that completes the task first will receive more rewards.
tips_jyz_count_kl_1_1_1=Places where disciples of the Kunlun sect may encounter members of the demonic cult: (-254 -436), (5 -431). All sect disciples must quickly go to these locations to defeat the demonic cult disciples. The sect that completes the task first will receive more rewards.
tips_jyz_count_kl_1_2_0=Kunlun demonic cult stronghold: (-69 242). The sect that first eliminates the stronghold will receive more rewards.
tips_jyz_count_kl_1_2_1=Kunlun demonic cult stronghold: (-69 242). The sect that first eliminates the stronghold will receive more rewards.
tips_jyz_count_kl_1_3_0=After receiving the secret code from the elder in the sect's storage room, look for the spy at one of the following locations: (38 260), (-152 244), (-291 155), (-389 197), (-77 128), (-46 74), (11 39), (-101 293), (-203 108), (-38 281).
tips_jyz_count_kl_1_3_1=After receiving the secret code from the elder in the sect's storage room, look for the spy at one of the following locations: (38 260), (-152 244), (-291 155), (-389 197), (-77 128), (-46 74), (11 39), (-101 293), (-203 108), (-38 281).
desc_taskitem_event_011_0=This is a beautiful piece of silk map...fragment...the writing on the fragment is obscure, and it is not known which dynasty it belongs to. Recently, this item was stolen by a mysterious person, and the elders of the sect have requested that all disciples do their best to retrieve it, as it must be related to some major secret (handing it over to the elder in the storage room (-174 -465) will result in a reward).
desc_event_kunlun001_0=This signal was specially made for each Sect to search for hidden traitors. When it is used close to a spy, the spy will reveal his original identity.
task_world_korea_c11=My master, you are both quick witted and skilled in the arts of war. Wait and I will come back very soon.
jyz_event_6_juanxiankl=I have a sect honor certificate (Kunlun).
sineijuanxian15=Hand over the sect honor certificate (Kunlun).
event_end_kl01=<font color="#bc1717" >The Kunlun sect has retrieved a complete scroll of the silk map, and even with the magic skills of the demonic sect, they cannot obtain the complete Jiangshan brocade.</font>
event_end_kl02=<font color="#bc1717" >The Kunlun sect's top masters have destroyed the demon cult's stronghold and killed several of their top masters, boosting morale.</font>
event_end_kl03=<font color="#bc1717" >The Kunlun sect's disciples have completely eliminated all the demon cult spies hidden within the faction, boosting morale.</font>
event_end_kl04=<font color="#bc1717" >The Kunlun sect's disciples were the first to eliminate the threat of the demon cult. With the cult's resurgence, the martial arts world is in turmoil and the leaders of various factions have decided to teach a second set of internal martial arts to prepare for the cult's counterattack.</font>
100020jyz_kl_error1=The faction honor certificate (Kunlun) is less than 15, unable to be turned in.
100020jyz_kl_world={@0:Value} has donated 15 faction honor certificates (Kunlun).
100020jyz_kl=Turn in successful, deducting 15 faction honor certificates (Kunlun).
menu_xl_shp_sz_001_1_1=I want to practice the 12th level of the Descending Dragon and the 12th level of the Holy Plum Blossom.
title_xl_shp_sz_001_1_1=The Dragon Descending Palm Technique and Saint Plum Secret (ancient manual) require a certain amount of official silver to be consumed in order to reach the 12th level, and <font color="#FF0000">will recover to the 10th level after a certain amount of time</font>.
null_title_xl_shp_sz_001_1_1=Confirm cultivation
xl_shp_sz_001_1=Understanding of the Dragon Descending Palm and Saint Mei
menu_xl_shp_sz_001_2_1=I want to cultivate the 12th level of the Dragon Descending Palm, <font color="#FF0000">which will be restored to the 10th level before the next Mount Tai martial arts competition</font>.
title_xl_shp_sz_001_2_1=It costs 60 taels of official silver to cultivate the Dragon Descending Palm to the 12th level! <font color="#FF0000">The Dragon Descending Palm will be restored to the 10th level before the next Mount Tai martial arts competition</font>.
null_title_xl_shp_sz_001_2_1=Confirm cultivation
xl_shp_sz_001_2_1_1=Understanding of the Dragon Descending Palm
menu_xl_shp_sz_001_2_2=I want to cultivate the 12th level of Saint Plum Secret (ancient manual), <font color="#FF0000">which will be restored to the 10th level after 28 days</font>.
title_xl_shp_sz_001_2_2=It takes 295 taels of official silver to cultivate Saint Plum Secret (ancient manual) up to the 12th level! <font color="#FF0000">After 28 days, Saint Plum Secret (ancient manual) will be restored to the 10th level.</font>
null_title_xl_shp_sz_001_2_2=Confirm cultivation
xl_shp_sz_001_2_2_1=Understanding Saint Plum Secret (ancient manual)
desc_offdaily_44801=Emerging from the sky, dominating Kunlun, witnessing all the beauty of the world.
desc_offdaily_44802=As the protector of the ancestor of the ten thousand mountains and the source of the true dragon, it is the sacred mission of every Kunlun disciple.
desc_offdaily_44803=Kunlun Sect is one of the nine major sects in the Central Plains and is a traditional prestigious sect. Kunlun Sect originated from the time of King Wu of Zhou and has been established for two thousand years, taking its name from the mountain.
desc_offdaily_44804=Throughout history, Kunlun Sect has produced many outstanding individuals with profound martial arts. Its disciples are devoted to cultivation, staying away from the conflicts of the world, silently guarding this sacred ancestral mountain and the hidden secrets unknown to the world.
sys_advanced_hp_condition_failed=To understand Saint Plum Secret (ancient manual), one must have Age of Wushu Record Journal 6 and have mastered all 10 levels of Saint Plum Secret (ancient manual) themselves.
sys_ad_hp_cw_money_failed=Your funds are insufficient to comprehend Saint Plum Secret (ancient manual).
sys_ad_hp_cw_money_used=Successful cultivation
