origin_10201_desc=Just entered the Kunlun sect, a naive young man in the rivers and lakes.
origin_10202_desc=A first-level disciple who abides by the rules of the Kunlun sect.
origin_10203_desc=Under the sky, the heron sleeps on the idle shore, the clouds are clear and the crows return to their resting place among the falling plum blossoms.
origin_10204_desc=The haze is washed away and the lonely sun rises, the dry virtue of Qingming awakens everything.
origin_10205_desc=Although there is no red fence to protect, one is not affected by the dust of the world.
origin_10206_desc=It takes ten years to sharpen a sword, but the frosty blade has never been tested.
origin_10207_desc=The dust of war and the stains of wine on my clothes, every place I travel to captures my heart.
origin_10208_desc=I have no home to return to, but I find peace in traveling, my hometown does not have such beautiful lakes and mountains.
origin_10209_desc=I have written many poems and received many rewards, leaving behind clouds and borrowing the moon.
origin_10210_desc=The rushing rapids and waterfalls make a loud noise, the rocks and cliffs create a thunderous sound.
origin_10211_desc=Life is like a vast expanse, where the owl scares away the decaying mice and guesses at the young herons.
origin_10212_desc=I sit on the tower by the sea every night, waiting for the morning bell to ring.
origin_10213_desc=Sitting on the clouds and rocks, I embrace the immortals and drive away worries, my drunken state allows me to freely write poetry.
origin_10214_desc=The jade steps still report the dawn, but the golden palace does not know of spring.
origin_10215_desc=The senior disciple of the Kunlun sect travels the world, upholding the justice of the Kunlun sect.
origin_10216_desc=As a newcomer to the Kunlun sect, I am still naive and inexperienced in the world of martial arts.
origin_10217_desc=A first-level disciple who abides by the rules of the Kunlun sect.
origin_10218_desc=Remember the flowers blooming on the snow-covered branches, and the bees and butterflies carrying the flowers.
origin_10219_desc=As the day draws to a close, the snow dances in the air, half plum blossoms and half willow catkins floating.
origin_10220_desc=The fragrance quietly fills the room, where the beauty and talent are hidden.
origin_10221_desc=Butterflies scatter and birds sing, the sun sets and the wind calms, and the beauty is even more enchanting.
origin_10222_desc=The perfect radiance never fades, hanging in the blue sky is my heart.
origin_10223_desc=Several times I invited the geese to come, but they were late, and when they returned, I was not there.
origin_10224_desc=No birds fly above the mountains and no one walks on the paths.
origin_10225_desc=One flower blooms with a thousand red petals, without relying on the spring breeze.
origin_10226_desc=The feathered robe always carries the colors of the clouds and mist, not disturbing the peach and plum blossoms in the human world.
origin_10227_desc=The Kunlun Sect forgets the world and hides as immortals, overseeing the rewards and punishments of their disciples.
origin_10228_desc=The Kunlun Sect has no ripples and hides as immortals, overseeing the discipline of their disciples.
origin_10229_desc=The Kunlun Sect admires the Xiao and hides as immortals, overseeing the life and death of their disciples.
origin_10230_desc=The senior sister of the Kunlun Sect travels the world, upholding justice for the sect.
origin_10231_desc=One of the three chief disciples of the Kunlun Sect, overseeing the cultivation of the disciples within the sect.
origin_10232_desc=One of the three chief disciples of the Kunlun Sect, overseeing the cultivation of the disciples within the sect.
origin_10233_desc=One of the three chief disciples of the Kunlun Sect, overseeing the cultivation of the disciples within the sect.
origin_10234_desc=One of the three elders of the Kunlun Sect, in charge of the sect's martial arts scriptures.
origin_10235_desc=One of the three elders of the Kunlun Sect, in charge of the sect's martial arts scriptures.
origin_10236_desc=One of the three elders of the Kunlun Sect, in charge of the sect's martial arts scriptures.
origin_10237_desc=The Kunlun Sect's Holy Lord, responsible for overseeing the world.
origin_2960_desc=The Kunlun Immortal Child, in charge of the Kunlun Sect.
origin_2961_desc=The Yaochi Goddess, in charge of the Kunlun Sect.
sys_cant_accuse_snatchbook_001=You are prohibited from participating in the remaining {@0:value} seconds of the book-snatching and book-protection activities.
sys_cant_accuse_snatchbook_002=Your account linked to the same phone number is prohibited from participating in the book-snatching and book-protection activities.
desc_switch_1122=Phone number prohibited from participating in activity switch.
desc_box_xmphd_kljsb_001=After opening, you can obtain <font color="#FFFF00">Qingtanjue pages 21-30, sect martial arts 6th level certificate *1, three internal promotion certificates *1</font>
desc_box_xmphd_kljsb_002=After opening, you can obtain <font color="#FFFF00">Qiaojue pages 31-40, sect martial arts 8th level certificate *1, four internal promotion certificates *1</font>
desc_box_xmphd_kljsb_003=After opening, you can obtain <font color="#FFFF00">Fengqijue pages 31-40, sect martial arts 10th level certificate *1, five internal promotion certificates *1</font>
desc_box_xmphd_kljsb_004=Upon opening, you can obtain <font color="#FFFF00">pages 41-48 of the Kunlun manual, a certificate for the 12th level of martial arts, and a certificate for advancing to the sixth level of internal strength</font>
