desc_item_xmphd_kl_jspz_001_0=The certificate for advancing to the first level of internal strength in Kunlun can be used to receive a promotion from Bu Wentian (Kunlun senior brother) (52,-299) near the Kunlun martial arts hall, increasing your internal strength level.
desc_item_xmphd_kl_jspz_002_0=The certificate for advancing to the second level of internal strength in Kunlun can be used to receive a promotion from Bu Wentian (Kunlun senior brother) (52,-299) near the Kunlun martial arts hall, increasing your internal strength level.
desc_item_xmphd_kl_jspz_003_0=The certificate for advancing to the third level of internal strength in Kunlun can be used to receive a promotion from Bu Wentian (Kunlun senior brother) (52,-299) near the Kunlun martial arts hall, increasing your internal strength level.
desc_item_xmphd_kl_jspz_004_0=Kunlun's four internal promotion certificates can be used to receive a promotion at the nearby Kunlun Martial Arts Hall from Brother Kunlun (52,-299), increasing internal strength level.
desc_item_xmphd_kl_jspz_005_0=Kunlun's five internal promotion certificates can be used to receive a promotion at the nearby Kunlun Martial Arts Hall from Brother Kunlun (52,-299), increasing internal strength level.
desc_item_xmphd_kl_jspz_006_0=Kunlun's six internal promotion certificates can be used to receive a promotion at the nearby Kunlun Martial Arts Hall from Brother Kunlun (52,-299), increasing internal strength level.
desc_item_xmphd_kl_wxzs_001_0=The 6th level certificate of martial arts sect can be obtained by asking Bu Wentian (Kunlun senior brother) near the Kunlun Martial Arts Hall (52,-299). You can choose one of the three sets of Kunlun martial arts and unlock the corresponding level of martial arts techniques (not martial arts infusion).
desc_item_xmphd_kl_wxzs_002_0=The 8th level certificate of martial arts sect can be obtained by asking Bu Wentian (Kunlun senior brother) near the Kunlun Martial Arts Hall (52,-299). You can choose one of the three sets of Kunlun martial arts and unlock the corresponding level of martial arts techniques (not martial arts infusion).
desc_item_xmphd_kl_wxzs_003_0=The 10th level certificate of martial arts sect can be obtained by asking Bu Wentian (Kunlun senior brother) near the Kunlun Martial Arts Hall (52,-299). You can choose one of the three sets of Kunlun martial arts and unlock the corresponding level of martial arts techniques (not martial arts infusion).
desc_item_xmphd_kl_wxzs_004_0=The 12th level certificate of martial arts sect can be obtained by asking Bu Wentian (Kunlun senior brother) near the Kunlun Martial Arts Hall (52,-299). You can choose one of the three sets of Kunlun martial arts and unlock the corresponding level of martial arts techniques (not martial arts infusion).
desc_item_qmzh_yl_001_0=It can be used to perform Qimen substitution (fan, heavy sword, pen, fist blade, qin, bow) at the blacksmith.
