desc_baibaoxiang_key_ride_sika_0301_0=Right-click to use<br>After use, you can learn the <font color="#00ff00">Midsummer Night's Dream · White Deer Riding</font> riding skill, and permanently obtain this fun mount in the "Treasure Chest".<br><font color="#00ff00">Can be obtained from Cao Heixin (Treasure Merchant) (available from August to September)</font><br><font color="#00ff00">Treasure Chest</font> can be exchanged for at <font color="#00ff00">Chengdu 720,693 Treasure Chest Merchant</font>.
desc_baibaoxiang_key_ride_sika_0302_0=Right-click to use<br>After use, you can learn the <font color="#00ff00">Half-Summer Day · Lotus Breeze Deer</font> riding skill, and permanently obtain this fun mount in the "Treasure Chest".<br><font color="#00ff00">Can be obtained from Cao Heixin (Treasure Merchant) (available from August to September)</font><br><font color="#00ff00">Treasure Chest</font> can be exchanged for at <font color="#00ff00">Chengdu 720,693 Treasure Chest Merchant</font>.
desc_baibaoxiang_key_ride_sika_0303_0=Right-click to use<br>After use, you can learn the <font color="#00ff00">Summer Dream Long · Fresh Deer</font> riding skill, and permanently obtain this fun mount in the "Treasure Chest".<br><font color="#00ff00">Can be obtained from Cao Heixin (Treasure Merchant) (available long-term)</font><br><font color="#00ff00">Treasure Chest</font> can be exchanged for at <font color="#00ff00">Chengdu 720,693 Treasure Chest Merchant</font>.
desc_ride_sika_0301_0=<font color="#66CD00">[Right click to use]</font><br>In the midst of the Bohai Sea, Penglai Island appears like a cloud. In the hidden mountains of the island, there seems to be a white figure moving through them. The gentle sound of the waves calms the intense heat of summer. According to legend, in ancient times, the spirit deer of the Penglai paradise would appear on summer nights, jumping through the forests and by the streams, consuming nightmares and eating away people's misfortunes. Therefore, the white deer on the island is revered as a deer fairy, living in harmony with humans. <br>By the murmuring stream, a pure white deer can be seen gently drinking.<br><font color"#FFC125">Do not drop</font>
desc_ride_sika_0302_0=<font color="#66CD00">[Right click to use]</font><br>In the midst of the Bohai Sea, Penglai Island appears like a cloud. In the hidden mountains of the island, there seems to be a white figure moving through them. The gentle sound of the waves calms the intense heat of summer. According to legend, in ancient times, the spirit deer of the Penglai paradise would appear on summer nights, jumping through the forests and by the streams, consuming nightmares and eating away people's misfortunes. Therefore, the white deer on the island is revered as a deer fairy, living in harmony with humans. <br>In the early summer, when the lotus flowers bloom, this pond belongs to the drowsy and innocent white deer.<br><font color"#FFC125">Do not drop</font>
desc_ride_sika_0303_0=<font color="#66CD00">[Right click to use]</font><br>In the midst of the Bohai Sea, Penglai Island appears like a cloud. In the hidden mountains of the island, there seems to be a white figure moving through them. The gentle sound of the waves calms the intense heat of summer. According to legend, in ancient times, the spirit deer of the Penglai paradise would appear on summer nights, jumping through the forests and by the streams, consuming nightmares and eating away people's misfortunes. Therefore, the white deer on the island is revered as a deer fairy, living in harmony with humans. <br>In the hazy distant mountains, faintly, the deer call, never forgotten.<br><font color"#FFC125">Do not drop</font>
desc_switch_1124=Kunlun Sect scene teleportation gate switch
desc_item_ride_sika_0301_tickt_1=You can exchange related treasures at <font color="#FFAE00">Suzhou (305,739) Cao Heixin</font><br>Obtainment method: <font color="#00ff00">Forbidden Zone · Speed ​​Treasure</font> gameplay
desc_item_ride_sika_0301_tickt=
desc_box_xmphd_klwxb_hqx001=Opening it will grant the complete set of "Kunlun Sect Martial Arts" Cold Spring Cleansing Heart Manual (6th level)
