desc_equip_tihuan_501_replace_3level_0=<font color="#FF0000">This can be used as a substitute for "Golden Powder" to refine three-star gold equipment.</font><br>You can use it at blacksmiths, tailors, and craftsmen in major cities.<br><font color="#00FF00">Using this material for equipment refinement will bind the refined equipment.</font><br>Can be used with <font color="#00FF00">High-Quality Fusion Powder or High-Quality Fusion Powder·Three-Star</font><br>Obtained from:<br>1. <font color="#FF4500">Exchange at the blacksmith, tailor, and craftsman shops in major newbie villages and main cities</font><br>2. <font color="#FF4500">Rewards from guild base battles</font>
