desc_zither_battlefield_40201=Crafted from ore mined by a famed blacksmith.
desc_zither_battlefield_40401=Forged by Master Cui Yingjie and imbedded with Black Jade.
desc_zither_battlefield_40501=This has been carefully crafted by the weapon master, the material is extremely resilient.
desc_zither_battlefield_40502=This has been carefully crafted by the weapon master, the material is extremely resilient.
