desc_pen_drop_10101=Scratched, but whole.
desc_pen_drop_10201=Taoism is beyond measure.
desc_pen_drop_10301=A good general is both tough and tender.
desc_pen_drop_10401=Walk the even path.
desc_pen_drop_20101=The elements punish those who fight the heavens.
desc_pen_drop_20201=Mankind's wisdom is not omnipotent.
desc_pen_drop_20301=The afterlife dispenses justice.
desc_pen_drop_20401=The natural balance must be maintained.
desc_pen_drop_30201=The seasons, sun and moon are heaven's envoys. The stars announce heaven's times, and comets proclaim heaven's anathema.
desc_pen_drop_30301=Come and go with ease.
desc_pen_drop_30401=The eternal cycle continues.
desc_pen_drop_40201=Kunming has a pillar that reaches the sky.
desc_pen_drop_40301=The Universe Encompasses All
desc_pen_drop_40401=Heaven goes around. It is yang and hard, and is worshipped by all.
