desc_zither_leader_kl_001=<font color="#FFB428" face="font_name_tittle">Kunlun Sect's Sect-defending Weapons</font><br>During the Yuan Dynasty, Kunlun Sect produced two exceptionally talented Daoist masters, Tianlingzi and Dilingzi. Both were skilled in playing the qin, and Tianlingzi's Longxiu Qin has been passed down to this day.
kunlun01=Gentle Breeze Outfit
kunlun02=Phoenix and Phoenix Outfit
kunlun03=Autumn Water Dress
kunlun04=Longevity Dress
kunlun05=Fine Dust Dress
kunlun06=Chasing Dreams Dress
kunlun07=Snowy Moon Dress
kunlun08=Jade Platform Dress
kunlun09=Water Mirror Dress
kunlun10=Emperor's Robe
s_kunlun_1_b=White Robe
s_kunlun_1_g=Luoshui Dress
desc_kunlun01=Leaves with gentle breeze and flowers with dew. Leaves cover and flowers adorn the mandarin ducks.
desc_kunlun02=Where is the old mirror phoenix, the withered phoenix does not perch. Money is abundant with peacocks, and brocade falls with mountain chickens.
desc_kunlun03=A solitary wild duck joins the speeding sunset clouds. The autumn waters and the sky share the same hue.
desc_kunlun04=The way to immortality, how could it exist in this world.
desc_kunlun05=Not knowing how many people return under the moon, the falling moon shakes with emotions on the trees by the river.
desc_kunlun06=In the mortal world, danger lurks at every step, only in sleep do we realize that it is not reality.
desc_kunlun07=Love is always attributed to the Eastern Lord, but even the Eastern Lord has moments of heartlessness.
desc_kunlun08=Originally a fairy in the moon palace, now smiling and beckoning the cranes and phoenixes to stay in the human world. The peaches ripen once every three thousand years, and the remaining time is spent enjoying the leisurely days and months.
desc_kunlun09=The Phoenix Pool opens the moon mirror, reflecting the clear and bright sky. The shadows scatter on the ripples, and the light contains fragments of suspended jade.
desc_kunlun10=From extreme madness to divine foolishness, what does fate have to do with fairness?
desc_s_kunlun_1_b=The eternal coldness of the White Spirit is too bright, and it should be divided into two stars.
desc_s_kunlun_1_g=How can we thaw the coldness of the human world, the frost on our temples never disappears.
b_origin_kunl_1_1=The clothes of the mortal world,
b_origin_kunl_2_1=The robes of vanity.
desc_b_origin_kunl_1_1=In this mortal world, there are no days without worries. I steal a moment of leisure in the morning pavilion. The bridge casts a green shadow on the boundary waters, and the burnt marks break the green mountains.
desc_b_origin_kunl_2_1=To cultivate immortality, one must not be tainted by any worldly desires. One must be humble and sincere, and follow the true path to become an immortal. When one's achievements are complete, they will ascend to the heavens and become a feathered immortal in the golden palace of the morning sun.
