desc_ride_huodong_20_86_0=<font color="#ff0003">Right click to use the item</font><br>After use, you'll enter Pre-windrider state. After continuous run or jumping, you'll enter Windrider state. <br>"It is a magic Jianghu medicine. After use, you feel flexible and energetic."<br>In Windrider state, player's movement speed will increase and all flying skills will be improved; however, 1% Max Internal Force will be consumed every 10 seconds. When all Energy points are consumed, Windrider state ends. In addition, Windrider state will also end when player enters a battle.
