desc_pet_mouse2_gensui_0=<font color="#ff0000">【Right-click to move the spirit into the collection interface】</font><br><font color="#ff0000">Note: Once added to the collection interface, it cannot be removed and is bound to the player character. If it is a limited-time spirit, it will be automatically deleted after the expiration date.</font><br>After use, the <font color="#FFB428">"Golden Mouse"</font> will follow the player. During the summoning period, the player will recover 5 points of light work value per second while meditating.<br><font color="#ff0000">【Note: Players who have the spirit can directly go to the Hundred Beast Villa and talk to the guide to apply for joining the faction after reaching a certain level of strength and unlocking Age of Wushu Record II. (Coordinates: Beggar's Sect 589 853)】</font>
