desc_tab_b_head_244_b_0=The document "Roaming in the World of Immortals" can be obtained by purchasing it, and the craftsmanship is slightly exquisite. Referring to this document can change the style of the equipment in the martial arts world. Open the <font color="#99cc00">Dressing Room</font> interface to modify the equipment and change its style. <br><font color="#96a0c8">When the dressing document is stored in the backpack, right-click to collect it into the Dressing Room. The document can be used unlimited times and will not disappear. After using it to change the appearance of a non-bound equipment, it will become bound.</font>
desc_tab_g_head_244_b_0=The document "Roaming in the World of Immortals" can be obtained by purchasing it, and the craftsmanship is slightly exquisite. Referring to this document can change the style of the equipment in the martial arts world. Open the <font color="#99cc00">Dressing Room</font> interface to modify the equipment and change its style. <br><font color="#96a0c8">When the dressing document is stored in the backpack, right-click to collect it into the Dressing Room. The document can be used unlimited times and will not disappear. After using it to change the appearance of a non-bound equipment, it will become bound.</font>
desc_box_card_572=Right-click to open and obtain 1 card of the clothing document <font color="#FFB428">"Roaming in the World of Immortals"</font> and 1 unlimited use dressing document for the corresponding gender.
desc_box_card_572_1=Thirty-six jade heavens, six Brahma gather to become immortals.
