desc_item_lzy_20200930hd_gtma001_0=The Chinese character "Guo" is tied into a Chinese knot.<br><font color="#3299CC">Usage: Players who hold a certain number of Chinese knots can exchange for Snow Lotus Pill, Qi Hai Concentration Pill, Exquisite Moon Concentration Pill, Bai Xiao Sheng's Military Record (Superior), and Guo Tai Min An Gift Pack at the activity ambassador Shang Wu (Suzhou (389,768)).</font>
desc_item_lzy_20200930hd_gtma002_0=Chinese knot with the character "Tai". <br> <font color="#3299CC">Purpose: Players with a certain number of Chinese knots can exchange for Xuelian Dan, Qi Hai Ning Shen Dan, Jingzhi Yue Ning Nei Xiu Dan, Baixiaosheng Binglu (Superior), and Guotai Min'an gift pack at the activity ambassador Shangwu (Suzhou (389,768)).</font>
desc_item_lzy_20200930hd_gtma003_0=Chinese knot with the character "Min". <br> <font color="#3299CC">Purpose: Players with a certain number of Chinese knots can exchange for Xuelian Dan, Qi Hai Ning Shen Dan, Jingzhi Yue Ning Nei Xiu Dan, Baixiaosheng Binglu (Superior), and Guotai Min'an gift pack at the activity ambassador Shangwu (Suzhou (389,768)).</font>
desc_item_lzy_20200930hd_gtma004_0=An character Chinese knot. <br> <font color="#3299CC">Purpose: Players with a certain number of Chinese knots can exchange for Snow Lotus Pill, Qi Hai Ning Shen Pill, Exquisite Moon Inner Cultivation Pill, Hundred Scholars' Military Record (Superior), and Guo Tai Min An Gift Pack at Ambassador Shang Wu (Suzhou (389,768)).</font>
desc_item_title_4216_1d=Use to obtain the title [Moment Sharing] (Title is valid for 30 days). <br>Right click to use.
desc_kill_worldrule_003_1d_0=A mask that hides one's identity and avoids an increase in Infamy for 25 murders within 1 hour. Masks with the same effect cannot be used for 3 hours. <br>(Only one type of mask will take effect. Only the effect of the last mask used will be active if different masks are used repeatedly. If Palace of Shifting Flowers Mask is equipped, this cannot be used.)
