desc_box_gujds_001_1=After opening the gift package, you can obtain: <font color="#FFFF00">Experience Dan, Cold Crow Grass, Broken Silver, Bright Spirit Dan, Small Spirit Dan</font> randomly, Merit Points * 5, and have the chance to obtain <font color="#FFFF00">Golden Cicada Shedding (Page 1), Golden Cicada Shedding (Page 2)</font>.
