desc_item_seekemperorcity_001_0=A dish of spring snow in the heart, exquisitely made, with carefully selected ingredients, and an excellent taste.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_002_0=The top-quality nine-headed abalone, a tribute from coastal regions to high-ranking officials.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_003_0=Using mandarin fish as the main ingredient, it is known for its shape and the meticulous knife skills used in its preparation. It is crispy on the outside and tender on the inside, with a delicious sweet and sour flavor.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_004_0=This jade pot is crystal clear, as if it were a gentleman, spotless and elegant.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_005_0=A traditional Sichuan dish, said to have been created by Chen Mapo, the tofu is cooked to perfection with a perfect balance of color, aroma, and taste.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_006_0=The tender and smooth lamb, cooked by the imperial kitchen, has a delicious taste that is irresistible.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_007_0=A specialty dish with delicate knife skills, carefully selected seasonings, and a rich and non-greasy flavor from the lamb.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_008_0=Fresh eel strips, poured with hot oil, sizzling and tender, truly delicious.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_009_0=The color is cherry red, bright and pleasing, and the texture is soft and delicious.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_010_0=The Nanjing salted duck, well-known for a long time, is best made during the blooming season of osmanthus.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_011_0=The jade ruler is engraved with dragon patterns, and when touched, it feels warm and smooth, and can reflect light.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_012_0=Carved from precious black jade, a descending tiger is vivid and lifelike, making people marvel.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_013_0=Carving and recarving, a piece of jade is worth ten thousand pieces of gold.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_014_0=Hetian ink jade, as black as ink, with delicate patterns and elegant luster.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_015_0=It is said that this jade can ward off evil spirits and avoid miasma. Wearing it for a long time can protect against all kinds of poisons.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_016_0=Carved from precious ink jade, a tiger preparing to ambush its prey is lifelike and irresistible.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_017_0=The whole body is warm and smooth, with two dragons coiling around, making it very valuable.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_018_0=The rare ancient scrolls hidden in the palace contain the Eight Trigrams formation passed down from ancient times.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_019_0=The dragon is a auspicious animal, symbolizing reunion, and when combined, it creates a clever design.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_020_0=The pattern is centered around the dragon, with a beautifully carved jade dragon, exuding elegance and nobility.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_021_0=When placed under the moonlight, the wine in the cup will shine brightly.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_022_0=The bronze wine vessel is simple and dignified, with excellent quality.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_023_0=The water-colored glass cup is extremely difficult to make, and is also a top-grade item in the palace.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_024_0=The water is full and the ice is full of green hand strings, shining with colorful light.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_025_0=The golden wedding rings, designed and crafted by the master craftsman, symbolize unbreakable love.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_026_0=A jade ruyi, with a unique emerald green color, made from the precious white bear hunted in the Changbai Mountains, is extremely warm.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_027_0=Made from precious white bears killed by hunters in the Changbai Mountains, the body is snow-white and extremely warm.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_028_0=Now, it is tied into a knot of unity, and will be given to the traveler, whether they know its significance or not.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_029_0=The armor, faintly shining with silver light, may have experienced many years and shows some signs of wear.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_030_0=Ancient coins from the time of Emperor Wu of Han, symbolizing the unification of the world.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_031_0=The glory and fame of the past 30 years was nothing, the road ahead is long.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_032_0=A broken iron sword from the Western Zhou Dynasty, bearing witness to history.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_033_0=The ancient bronze bow resembles a curved crescent moon, simple and elegant, yet solemn.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_034_0=The sword is made of mysterious iron, with a faint golden light shining on the hilt, giving off an aura of great authority.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_035_0=One of the four famous ancient Chinese stringed instruments, made of paulownia wood and named "Jiaowei" because of the burnt marks on its end.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_036_0=Symbolizing abundant wealth and smooth career, bringing the owner supreme good luck.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_037_0=A weapon for killing, drinking blood, and taking lives, as easily as plucking grass.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_038_0=The wolf's teeth, brought as tribute from foreign lands, are worn on the chest and possess the power to ward off evil spirits.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_039_0=Right hand holds the female sword, left hand holds the male sword, holding both swords, able to cut through gold.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_040_0=Those who know me say my heart is worried, those who do not know me, what do they think I seek? The vast sky, who is this person?
desc_item_seekemperorcity_041_0=Not writing love poems, not writing lyrics, a scented handkerchief sent with longing.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_042_0=Flames rise fiercely, purple gas soars. A type of rare stone that burns like red fire.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_043_0=A unique mineral found only on Penglai Island, extremely rare and precious.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_044_0=One drop of chicken blood avoids evil energy, obtaining this treasure is most auspicious.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_045_0=Embroidered shoes made with gold thread, a glance reveals they belong to a noblewoman in the palace.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_046_0=Sweet and fragrant, lingering on the lips, loved by all the women in the palace.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_047_0=A scented sachet carried by women in the palace, filled with seasonal flowers and precious spices.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_048_0=Red water chestnuts shimmer, a private item of a daughter's household, made with the finest silk.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_049_0=This veil is so light and thin, like the thin mist rising in the morning.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_050_0=The trauma pills made by the imperial court's royal physician have miraculous effects on bruises, sprains, and fractures.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_051_0=It can invigorate the qi and strengthen the heart, but should not be used excessively.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_052_0=Long-term use can improve beauty and nourish the skin without any side effects. It is a special beauty product made by the imperial medical bureau.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_053_0=Long-term use can improve physical strength and delay aging without any side effects. It is a special health product made by the imperial medical bureau.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_054_0=Combining traditional Chinese medicine for strengthening the body with alcohol is a common health method in the royal family.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_055_0=It is made from dozens of precious medicinal ingredients such as deer antler, and can invigorate the qi, strengthen the foundation, nourish the blood, and calm the mind.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_056_0=After taking this pill, one will instantly become as strong as a bull and as fierce as a tiger.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_057_0=It is a special medicine for treating bruises, sprains, and fractures, and can relax the tendons, activate the collaterals, reduce swelling, and dispel stasis.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_058_0=Wild ginseng, which has been aged for a hundred years, can greatly replenish the vitality, nourish the blood, and calm the mind.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_059_0=Once exposed to this poison, one will immediately bleed from the seven orifices and die.
desc_item_seekemperorcity_060_0=A highly toxic substance, if ingested or exposed to the eyes, will cause blindness and a blocked throat.
