desc_baibaoxiang_key_ride_sika_0401_0=Right-click to use<br>After use, you can learn the <font color="#00ff00">Autumn Thoughts Day · Leisurely Clear Deer</font> riding skill, and permanently obtain this fun mount in the "Treasure Chest".<br><font color="#00ff00">Can be exchanged from Cao Heixin (Treasure Merchant) (long-term acquisition)</font><br><font color="#00ff00">Treasure Chest</font> can be exchanged from <font color="#00ff00">Chengdu 720,693 Treasure Chest Merchant</font>.
desc_baibaoxiang_key_ride_sika_0402_0=Right-click to use<br>After use, you can learn the <font color="#00ff00">Shengchun Chao · Qiu Hui Linlu</font> riding skill, and permanently obtain this fun mount in the "Treasure Chest".<br><font color="#00ff00">Can be obtained from Cao Heixin (Treasure Merchant) (available from November to December)</font><br><font color="#00ff00">Treasure Chest</font> can be obtained by exchanging at <font color="#00ff00">Chengdu 720,693 Treasure Chest Merchant</font>.
desc_baibaoxiang_key_ride_sika_0403_0=Right-click to use<br>After use, you can learn the <font color="#00ff00">Red Leaf Heaven · Wind and Moon Love Deer</font> riding skill, and permanently obtain this fun mount in the "Treasure Chest".<br><font color="#00ff00">Can be obtained from Cao Heixin (Treasure Merchant) (available from November to December)</font><br><font color="#00ff00">Treasure Chest</font> can be obtained by exchanging at <font color="#00ff00">Chengdu 720,693 Treasure Chest Merchant</font>.
desc_ride_sika_0401_0=<font color="#66CD00">[Right-click to use]</font><br>The scattered clouds, the blowing wind, the autumn leaves, the gentle breeze. Accompanied by the blooming fragrance of wild chrysanthemums, the newly awakened fawn sets off at the break of dawn. The journey of life has no turning back, even if it is difficult and bumpy, we must move forward against the wind!<br>The autumn wind is pressing, taking advantage of the leisure to contemplate the wins and losses, just like the leisurely stroll of the fawn in the forest.<br><font color"#FFC125">Do not drop</font>
desc_ride_sika_0402_0=<font color="#66CD00">[Right-click to use]</font><br>The scattered clouds, the blowing wind, the autumn leaves, the gentle breeze. Accompanied by the blooming fragrance of large fields of wild chrysanthemums, the newly awakened fawn sets off at the break of dawn. The journey of life has no turning back, even if it is difficult and bumpy, we must move forward against the wind!<br>The chrysanthemums are in full bloom and the wine is strong, I say that autumn is better than spring. In the deep forest, I see deer, and in the sea of flowers, I see you.<br><font color"#FFC125">Do not drop</font>
desc_ride_sika_0403_0=<font color="#66CD00">[Right-click to use]</font><br>Scattered clouds, a gentle breeze blowing, autumn leaves falling, a light breeze blowing. Accompanied by the fragrance of blooming wild chrysanthemums, the newly awakened fawn sets off at dawn. The journey of life has no turning back, even if it is difficult and bumpy, we must move forward against the wind!<br>The mountains are far, the sky is high, and the smoke is cold. The maple leaves of lovesickness slowly fall, following a fawn jumping into the heart.<br><font color"#FFC125">Do not drop</font>
