desc_box_stormswdm_ngcj001_1=Right-click to open.
desc_box_stormswdm_ngcj001=Upon opening the exquisite gift package, you can obtain 5 Snow Lotus Pills and have a chance to receive one of the following fragments: "Sunset Technique Scroll", "Five Elements Heart Method Scroll", "Purple Auspicious Heart Sutra Scroll", "Unfettered Divine Technique Scroll", or "Heaven-Defying Evil Technique Scroll".
desc_item_stormswdma_new_1=Open and see what is inside!
desc_item_stormswdma_new=This is the Treasure left behind by a treasure hunter who has been engulfed by the desert (Open it to receive a tattered Treasure Map)
desc_item_stormswdmb_new_1=Open and see what is inside!
desc_item_stormswdmb_new=This is the Treasure left behind by a treasure hunter who has been engulfed by the desert (Open it to receive an exquisite Treasure Map)
desc_item_stormswdmc_new_1=Open and see what is inside!
desc_item_stormswdmc_new=Here is a reward from the Village Head for your Righteous Hearts
desc_item_stormswdmd_new_1=Open and see what is inside!
desc_item_stormswdmd_new=I went through quite the bother to win the reward of a tattered Treasure Map finally. It can be opened in the Tornado Scene only)
desc_item_stormswdme_new_1=Open and see what is inside!
desc_item_stormswdme_new=I went through quite the bother to win the reward of an exquisite Treasure Map finally. It is said the treasure is packed in a Treasure Box made by Wu Rui, a legendary Master Craftsman, and the treasure chest is locked by an ingenious mechanism. You have to examine it under sunlight in a <font color="#FFB428">sandstorm</font> to figure out the method to solve the mechanism. It can be opened in the Tornado Scene only)
desc_switch_2867=Purchase switch for the He Shi Bi gift package
desc_box_lzy_20201029hd_hsb001=Upon opening the exquisite gift package, you can obtain <font color="#FFFF00">342 He Shi Bi fragments</font>.
desc_box_lzy_20201029hd_hsb001_1=Right click to use
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_zither_01_1=
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_zither_01=Reading this collection can teach various methods for making ordinary qin instruments. <br> The weapons produced are suitable for characters with <font color="#00FF00">basic proficiency</font>. <br> The recipe can be obtained through wild boxes, forbidden areas, and challenging other players.
desc_hcitem_tj_zither_02_1_0=A ancient book on weapon refining discovered at the foot of Mount Taihua, the highest peak of the Western Mountains. It is divided into eight parts and is named Taihua. The Taihua Lingqin Collection covers the craftsmanship of making qin instruments.
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_zither_02_1=
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_zither_02=Reading this collection can learn various ordinary piano enhancement production methods. <br> The weapons produced are suitable for characters who are <font color="#00FF00">skilled</font>. <br> Recipes can be obtained through wild boxes, forbidden areas, and kicking halls. <br> This recipe requires a first-order forge.
desc_hcitem_tj_zither_03_0=Jia Bing Ji Murong Ye accidentally obtained an unnamed book on refining weapons, and after repeated research and application, all the weapons inside were of high quality. Jia Bing Yu Qin Ji records its qin-making methods.
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_zither_03_1=
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_zither_03=Reading this article can learn various exquisite qin-making methods. <br> The weapons produced are suitable for characters who are <font color="#00FF00">expert</font>. <br> Recipes can be obtained during the enmity mission. <br> This recipe requires a second-order forge.
desc_hcitem_tj_zither_04_0=According to legend, during the Warring States period, the master craftsman Ou Ye Zi wrote a book on weapon forging, which included various weapon manufacturing techniques. The book is divided into eight sections, one of which is the Jingjin Drum Qin section.
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_zither_04_1=
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_zither_04=Reading this book will teach you how to make a qin (a traditional Chinese stringed instrument). <br> The qin produced is suitable for characters with <font color="#00FF00">masterful</font> skills.
desc_hcitem_tj_zither_04_01_0=The Yanling's Qin Record is one of the eight volumes in the Whirlwind Eight Forges, passed down from the Godly Weapons Pavilion of the Zangjian Mountain Villa in the martial arts holy land. <br> This book is obscure and difficult to understand, and can only be understood by a <font color="#00FF00">master weaponsmith</font>.
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_zither_05_1=
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_zither_05=Reading this score will teach you various methods for making rare and divine qins. <br> The weapons produced are suitable for characters with <font color="#00FF00">grandmaster</font> skills. <br> Crafting with this recipe requires a third-tier forge.
desc_hcitem_tj_zither_10_0=All divine weapons are made from this book, but its origin is unknown. Its crafting techniques are complex and meticulous, and require not only high-quality materials, but also favorable timing and location. The Divine Weapon Howling Qin Book describes the highest secrets of qin casting.
sytk_01=In the world of jianghu, the flashing of swords and shadows has stirred up a new round of bloodshed. In recent days, many jianghu sects have been cleared and suppressed by the imperial court with thunderous force, causing everyone to fear for their safety. Meanwhile, in the military stronghold of Yanjing City, the huge "rat demons" have been appearing frequently, causing the people to panic and spread rumors that the "rat demons" have emerged and will not only eat people, but also bring great disasters to the country... Suspicion abounds, but it seems that the hidden hand behind the scenes is still plotting an even bigger scheme...
desc_sytk_condition=[The Twelve Zodiac Signs of the Ming Dynasty] series of missions completed<br>[Rat Bites the Sky] series of missions activated
desc_sytk_npc=Go to visit <a href="findnpc_new,city02,WorldNpc01194" style="HLStype1">Lin Tiannan</a>
