desc_box_lzy_qdjjhd_qdfl_1=Right-click to use
desc_box_lzy_qdjjhd_qdfl=A package filled with abundant props, opening it will receive <font color="#00ff00">Daily Reward Pack*1, Sign-in Reward Pack*1</font><br>Daily Reward Pack: Opening it will receive <font color="#00ff00">Demon Expelling Order*1, Gift Egg Treasure Box*2 (servers that have not opened the Three Inner Age of Wushu Record will receive Tianshan Snow Lotus Fruit*1).</font><br>Sign-in Reward Pack: Opening it will receive <font color="#00ff00">Primordial Yi Jing Pill*3, Tianshan Snow Lotus Fruit*2, one of the Five Elements Demon Subduing Gift Packs, with a chance to receive ancient manual Fragments Pack*1, Crafting Table Treasure Box*1, and Xuan Yu Powder*1.</font>
enchantitem_ds_05=The Chapter of Bone-Eroding Poison (Poisonous Hand Yan Wang)
enchantitem_ys_05=The Condensing Spirit Jade Dew Formula (Compassionate Holy Hand)
enchantitem_tj_05=The Record of Blazing Gold Fire Stone (Intention Refining Master)
enchantitem_jq_05=The Heavenly Treasure Engraving Knife Chronicle (Skillful Master Craftsman)
enchantitem_cs_05=The Tough Iron Fine Sand Manual (King of Cooking)
enchantitem_cf_05=The Collection of Hundred Skillful Embroidery Needles (Heavenly Skillful Hands)
desc_enchantitem_ds_05_0=Made by <font color="#FFFF00" >poison master</font> according to the Hundred Family Scrolls, can be used for armor consecration<br>Suitable for armor that requires the identity of <font color="#FFFF00" >poison identification students, poison-making apprentices, eight-armed poison masters, and poison hand Yan Wang</font> to be consecrated<br>Right-click to use<br><font color="#FF0000">Using the consecration item will still cost 10 liang of official silver</font>
desc_enchantitem_ys_05_0=Made by <font color="#FFFF00" >medicine master</font> according to the Hundred Family Scrolls, can be used for jewelry consecration<br>Suitable for jewelry that requires the identity of <font color="#FFFF00" >medicine identification students, medicine dispensing apprentices, wandering doctors, and compassionate healers</font> to be consecrated<br>Right-click to use<br><font color="#FF0000">Using the consecration item will still cost 10 liang of official silver</font>
desc_enchantitem_tj_05_0=Made by <font color="#FFFF00" >blacksmiths</font> according to the ancient scrolls, can be used for weapon enchantment<br>Suitable for weapons that require the identity of <font color="#FFFF00" >blacksmith's apprentice, ironworking apprentice, master caster, or master craftsman</font> to be enchanted<br>Right-click to use<br><font color="#FF0000">Using the enchantment item will still cost 10 silver coins</font>
desc_enchantitem_jq_05_0=Made by <font color="#FFFF00" >craftsmen</font> according to the ancient scrolls, can be used for jewelry enchantment<br>Suitable for jewelry that require the identity of <font color="#FFFF00" >village craftsman, inlaying novice, meticulous carver, or skilled craftsman</font> to be enchanted<br>Right-click to use<br><font color="#FF0000">Using the enchantment item will still cost 10 silver coins</font>
desc_enchantitem_cs_05_0=Made by <font color="#FFFF00" >a chef</font> according to the Hundred Family Scrolls, can be used for weapon enchantment<br>Suitable for weapons that require the identity of <font color="#FFFF00" >a kitchen assistant, a busy cook, an apprentice chef, or a cooking master</font> to be enchanted<br>Right-click to use<br><font color="#FF0000">Using the enchantment item will still cost 10 silver coins</font>
desc_enchantitem_cf_05_0=Made by <font color="#FFFF00" >a tailor</font> according to the Hundred Family Scrolls, can be used for armor enchantment<br>Suitable for armor that requires the identity of <font color="#FFFF00" >a textile worker, a cutting apprentice, a measuring expert, or a skilled craftsman</font> to be enchanted<br>Right-click to use<br><font color="#FF0000">Using the enchantment item will still cost 10 silver coins</font>
sys_homemine_008=There are no rewards available to claim
sys_homemine_009=Already claimed [{@0:name}]
desc_fan_Tiger=The trees are dark in the south and north, and the fierce tiger roams the village in broad daylight. In the evening, it dominates the food, and the deer in the mountains are silent.
desc_fan_Dragon=The dragon strides with a majestic aura, and the heavens whisper to each other. Chaos begins to take shape, and the primordial world begins to open.
desc_fan_Horse=The desert is as white as snow, and the moon over Mount Yan is like a hook. When will the golden hair adorn the head, and we can quickly walk through the clear autumn.
fan_Tiger_token=The Starry Sky Fan · Tiger of the Hour <font color="#00ff00">Tips for Use</font>
fan_Dragon_token=The Starry Sky Celestial Fan: Dragon of the Morning <font color="#00ff00">Usage Tips</font>
fan_Horse_token=The Starry Sky Celestial Fan: Horse of the Noon <font color="#00ff00">Usage Tips</font>
desc_fan_Tiger_token_0=Right-click to use<br>After use, you can learn the <font color="#00ff00">Starry Sky Celestial Fan: Tiger of the Tiger</font> usage tips, and permanently obtain this interesting weapon in the "Treasure Box".<br><font color="#00ff00">Treasure Box</font> can be exchanged for at the <font color="#00ff00">Chengdu 720,693 Treasure Box Merchant</font>.
desc_fan_Dragon_token_0=Right-click to use<br>After use, you can learn the skills of <font color="#00ff00">Xingxiu Tianchen Shan · Chenlong</font> and permanently obtain this interesting weapon in the "Treasure Box".<br><font color="#00ff00">Treasure Box</font> can be exchanged at the <font color="#00ff00">Chengdu 720,693 Treasure Box Merchant</font>.
desc_fan_Horse_token_0=Right-click to use<br>After use, you can learn the skills of <font color="#00ff00">Xingxiu Tianchen Shan · Wuma</font> and permanently obtain this interesting weapon in the "Treasure Box".<br><font color="#00ff00">Treasure Box</font> can be exchanged at the <font color="#00ff00">Chengdu 720,693 Treasure Box Merchant</font>.
desc_switch_20201026=Assist the leader to enter the hidden world
desc_item_title_4293=After use, you can obtain the title "Mingmen Huiwu"<br>Right-click to use
desc_item_20201029_wlt_001_0=Can be used on players, throwing it at them will give them the "Huiwu" effect, increasing the conversion speed of experience by 25% for 30 minutes<br><font color=""#FF0000"">Usage requirements: Need to be a Jianghu VIP</font>
desc_box_mmhw_001_1=After opening, you can obtain <font color="#FFFF00">"Mingmen Huiwu" title *1, Hunyuan Yijin Dan (one day) *70</font>
desc_box_mmhw_001=Right-click to use.
desc_item_mmhw_hwl_0=To obtain a certain number of martial arts orders, you can go to the Suzhou NPC Martial Arts Ambassador (390,768) to exchange for corresponding rewards.
desc_box_card_582=Right-click to open and obtain 1 card of the accessory category "Qi'an Yaoling".
desc_box_card_582_1=Before the fierce warrior Qi'an Yaoling, others will fall behind in terms of charm.
