desc_box_card_583_1=Before the fierce warrior Qi'an Yaoling, others will fall behind in terms of charm.
desc_tab_b_head_245_b_0=Use it to change the appearance of jianghu outfit. Open <font color="#99cc00">Dressing Room</font> to change the appearance of equipments. <br><font color="#96a0c8">When the design is in the backpack, right-click to add it to the Dressing Room. It will have an unlimited number of uses. Unbound equipments will become bound upon being changed with this design.</font>
desc_tab_g_head_245_b_0=Use it to change the appearance of jianghu outfit. Open <font color="#99cc00">Dressing Room</font> to change the appearance of equipments. <br><font color="#96a0c8">When the design is in the backpack, right-click to add it to the Dressing Room. It will have an unlimited number of uses. Unbound equipments will become bound upon being changed with this design.</font>
