npc_tianyahaige_panshi_2_1_1=Betray the School
npc_tianyahaige_panshi_2_2_1=Returning to Kunlun as a graduate (If you have not reached the 10th rank of Tianya Haige, you need to consume the Tianya Haige graduate certificate)
npc_tianyahaige_panshi_2_3_1=Returning to the Jianghu as a graduate (If you have not reached the 10th rank of Tianya Haige, you need to consume the Tianya Haige graduate certificate)
menu_npc_tianyahaige_panshi_1_1=I want to leave Tianya Haige
title_npc_tianyahaige_panshi_1_1=Leaving Tianya Haige requires accepting punishment
menu_npc_tianyahaige_panshi_2_1=I want to betray my school.
title_npc_tianyahaige_panshi_2_1=Leaving the sect will lower your internal strength and the highest level of your techniques, and delete miscellaneous studies. If you have completed the sect's origin tasks, your Kunlun martial arts will also be deleted. Are you sure you want to leave the sect?
menu_npc_tianyahaige_panshi_2_2=I want to leave the sect and return to Kunlun.
title_npc_tianyahaige_panshi_2_2=After leaving the sect, you will keep the martial arts you have learned in the sect, but miscellaneous studies will be deleted. Are you sure you want to leave the sect?
menu_npc_tianyahaige_panshi_2_3=I'd like to leave and return to the world at large.
title_npc_tianyahaige_panshi_2_3=After leaving the sect, you will keep the martial arts from the sect, but miscellaneous studies will be deleted. If you have completed the sect's origin tasks, your Kunlun martial arts will also be deleted. Are you sure you want to leave the sect?
npc_tianyahaige_panshi_2_2_2=Return to Kunlun after leaving the sect <font color="#FF0000">(You are missing the sect's certificate of leaving. Those below the 10th rank will need to consume the certificate to leave the sect.)</font>
npc_tianyahaige_panshi_2_3_2=出师回江湖<font color="#FF0000">（You are missing the certificate of graduation from Tianya Haige. Graduation for those below level 10 requires the certificate of graduation from Tianya Haige.）</font>
