desc_xueweitool_4301_0=This is a volume in a martial arts book written with reference to the medical book "Ling Shu". Those who study martial arts can gain enlightenment in an instant and improve their overall cultivation by reading it. Ultimately, they can directly open the first acupoint, "Shaochong", of the <font color="#FFCC00">reverse circulation of the Hand Shaoyin Heart Meridian</font>. <br> Requires <font color="#FFFF00">1000000</font> cultivation to use. <br> <font color="#FFFF00">To use this book, one must have cultivated their meridians to the 180th level.</font>
desc_xueweitool_4302_0=This is a volume in a martial arts book written with reference to the medical book "Ling Shu". Those who study martial arts can gain enlightenment in an instant and improve their overall cultivation by reading it. Ultimately, they can directly open the second acupoint, "Shaofu", in the reverse direction of the "Hand Shaoyin Heart Meridian". <br> To use, it requires a cultivation cost of <font color="#FFFF00">1500000</font>. <br> <font color="#FFFF00">To use this book, one must have cultivated their meridians to the 180th level.</font>
desc_xueweitool_4303_0=This is a volume in a martial arts book written with reference to the medical classic "Ling Shu". Those who study martial arts can gain enlightenment in an instant and cultivate their entire body's abilities, ultimately directly opening the third acupoint, "Shen Men", of the reverse flow of the "Hand Shaoyin Heart Meridian". <br> Requires cultivation of <font color="#FFFF00">2000000</font> to use. <br> <font color="#FFFF00">Must have cultivated the meridians up to 180 levels to use this book.</font>
desc_xueweitool_4304_0=This is a volume in a martial arts book written with reference to the medical book "Ling Shu". Those who study martial arts can gain enlightenment in an instant, and can also improve their overall physical abilities and directly open the fourth acupoint "Tongli" of the <font color="#FFCC00">reverse circulation of the hand Shaoyin heart meridian</font>. <br> Requires <font color="#FFFF00">3000000</font> cultivation to use. <br> <font color="#FFFF00">To use this book, one must have cultivated the meridians to the 180th level.</font>
desc_xueweitool_4305_0=This is a volume in a martial arts book written with reference to the medical book "Ling Shu". Those who study martial arts can gain enlightenment in an instant, and can also improve their overall physical abilities and directly open the fifth acupoint "Ling Dao" of the <font color="#FFCC00">reverse circulation of the hand Shaoyin heart meridian</font>. <br> Requires <font color="#FFFF00">4000000</font> cultivation to use. <br> <font color="#FFFF00">To use this book, one must have cultivated the meridians to the 180th level.</font>
desc_xueweitool_4306_0=This is a volume in a martial arts book written with reference to the medical book "Ling Shu". Those who study martial arts can gain enlightenment in an instant and open up their meridians, ultimately directly connecting to the sixth acupoint "Shaohai" of the <font color="#FFCC00">reverse circulation of the Hand Shaoyin Heart Meridian</font>. <br>Consumes cultivation: <font color="#FFFF00">5000000</font><br><font color="#FFFF00">Studying this book requires cultivation of the meridians to reach level 180.</font>
desc_ng_book_jm_17=Studying this book can open up the <font color="#44ff44">reverse circulation of the Hand Shaoyin Heart Meridian</font>. <br><font color="#FFFF00">Studying this book requires cultivation of the meridians to reach level 180 and the current progress of Age of Wushu Record server is to open the Reclusive School.</font>
desc_ng_book_jm_17_1=One of the three meridians of the Hand San Yin, it combines with the Foot Shaoyin Kidney Meridian to form the wisdom meridian. Opening up this meridian can awaken wisdom and increase the internal energy of martial artists.
desc_item_newapex_arrest_0=Reverse Scale Pill, when used, opens up the Reverse Scale Challenge. If the hero can survive for 3 minutes, the team will gain 300 points.
desc_item_newapex_score_0=Emerald Feather Ring, when picked up, immediately adds 200 points to the team.
