desc_tab_b_head_246_b_0=By purchasing the "Zaiyue Yunjian" in the "Fengwuzhi" store, you can obtain this blueprint, which is crafted with great precision. By referring to this blueprint, you can change the style of your equipment in the martial arts world. Opening the <font color="#99cc00">Dressing Room</font> interface allows you to transform your equipment and change its style.<br><font color="#96a0c8">When the transformation blueprint is stored in your backpack, you can right-click to add it to the Dressing Room. This blueprint can be used an unlimited number of times and will not disappear. Non-bound equipment will become bound after using this blueprint to change its appearance.</font>
desc_tab_g_head_246_b_0=By purchasing the "Zaiyue Yunjian" in the "Fengwuzhi" store, you can obtain this blueprint, which is crafted with great precision. By referring to this blueprint, you can change the style of your equipment in the martial arts world. Opening the <font color="#99cc00">Dressing Room</font> interface allows you to transform your equipment and change its style.<br><font color="#96a0c8">When the transformation blueprint is stored in your backpack, you can right-click to add it to the Dressing Room. This blueprint can be used an unlimited number of times and will not disappear. Non-bound equipment will become bound after using this blueprint to change its appearance.</font>
desc_item_wgm_dy_join_0=The Wugenmen Special Token can only be recognized by using the special internal martial arts of Wugenmen. Only those who possess this item can gain recognition from Shen Xuefei (839,1532) in Jinling. <font color="#44ff44">Players who hold the "Wugenmen Recommendation Token" and "Faceless Token" before the opening of Age of Wushu Record event can gain recognition from Wugenmen and join the sect!</font>
