desc_home_20_new_01_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type:</font> Folding Screen<br><font color="#FFFF00">Elegance:</font> 200<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirements:</font> Home must be at least level 1<br>The forest is filled with new trees and flowers, and the flowers are smiling without any concern for spring.<br>Right-click to use, will automatically store in the home warehouse;
desc_home_20_new_02_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type:</font> Decoration<br><font color="#FFFF00">Elegance:</font> 200<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirements:</font> Home must be at least level 1<br>There is a strange path in the Heron Hill, and the Qilin Island is rich with immortal families.<br>Right-click to use, will automatically store in the home warehouse;
desc_home_20_new_03_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Furniture Type:</font> Lighting<br><font color="#FFFF00">Elegance:</font> 200<br><font color="#FFFF00">Placement Requirements:</font> Home must be at least level 1<br>The water fairy has rosy cheeks, and a little bit of love blooms in two places.<br>Lighting can illuminate the area. Right-click on the lighting and select "Turn On" or "Turn Off" to activate or deactivate the lighting effect.<br>Right-click to use, and it will automatically be stored in the home warehouse.
desc_home_20_new_01_sm=The forest is filled with new grass and trees, and the flowers smile without regard for the season.
desc_home_20_new_02_sm=There is a strange path on the crane peak, and the unicorn island is home to the wealthy immortals.
