desc_item_shp_exchange_20201130_3a_0=Can be exchanged for Level 3 Xuan Yu Powder (Return to Heart Plan) at the Shangwu Exchange in Suzhou (389 768). Equipment made or upgraded using Return to Heart Plan materials will be automatically bound.
