desc_jm_hcitem_tj_bow_01_1=
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_bow_01=Reading this collection can learn various methods of making ordinary bows. <br> The weapons produced are suitable for characters with <font color="#00FF00">beginner level</font>. <br> Recipes can be obtained through wild boxes, forbidden areas, and challenging others.
desc_hcitem_tj_bow_02_1_0=A book on ancient military tactics discovered at the waist of Mount Taihua, the highest peak of Xishan, was named Taihua and divided into eight parts. The Taihua Bow Collection covers the craftsmanship of making bows. Reading this collection can teach various methods for enhancing the production of ordinary bows. The weapons produced are suitable for characters who are skilled and experienced. The recipe can be obtained through wild boxes, forbidden areas, and kicking halls. The first-order forge is required to make this recipe. Jiabingji Murong Ye accidentally obtained an unnamed military book, and after repeated research and application, all the weapons inside were of high quality. Jiabing Jiaogongji records its bow-making method.
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_bow_02_1=
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_bow_02=Reading this collection can teach you various common methods for enhancing bows. <br> The weapons produced are suitable for characters who are <font color="#00FF00">skilled and experienced</font>. <br> The recipe can be obtained through wilderness chests, forbidden areas, and challenging other players. <br> To make this recipe, a first-tier crafting table is required.
desc_hcitem_tj_bow_03_0=Jia Bing Ji Murong Ye accidentally obtained an unnamed book on refining weapons, and after repeated research and application, all the weapons inside were of high quality. Jia Bing Jiao Gong Ji records his bow-making methods.
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_bow_03_1=
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_bow_03=This document teaches various methods for crafting exquisite bows.<br>The resulting weapons are suitable for characters with <font color="#00FF00">masterful</font> strength to use.<br>The recipe can be obtained when completing the enmity mission.<br>To carry out this recipe, a second-tier forge is required.
desc_hcitem_tj_bow_04_0=According to legend, during the Warring States period, the master blacksmith Ou Yezi wrote a book on weapon forging, which included various techniques for crafting weapons. The book is divided into eight sections, one of which is the chapter on crafting fine gold bows.
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_bow_04_1=
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_bow_04=Reading this record teaches the art of bow crafting.<br>The resulting bows are suitable for characters with <font color="#00FF00">masterful</font> strength to use.
desc_hcitem_tj_bow_04_01_0=The "Yanling Fine Bow Record" is one of the eight volumes in the "Eight Forges of the Whirlwind" series, passed down from the weapon pavilion of the Wulin Holy Land, Zangjian Mountain Villa.<br>This item is obscure and difficult to understand, and can only be deciphered by a blacksmith with the title of <font color="#00FF00">master of weapons</font>.
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_bow_05_1=
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_bow_05=This manual contains various methods for crafting rare and divine bows. <br> The weapons produced are suitable for characters with the strength of a <font color="#00FF00">Grandmaster</font>. <br> Crafting this recipe requires a third-tier crafting table.
desc_hcitem_tj_bow_10_0=All divine weapons are made from this book, but its origin is unknown. The crafting process is complex and meticulous, requiring not only high-quality materials but also favorable timing and location. The Divine Weapon Control Bow Manual describes the highest level of bow forging techniques.
hcitem_tj_bow_02_1=The Taihua Curved Bow Collection
hcitem_tj_bow_03=The Excellent Bow Angle Record
hcitem_tj_bow_04=The Fine Gold Bow Volume
hcitem_tj_bow_04_01=The Swallow Feather Good Bow Record
hcitem_tj_bow_10=The Divine Weapon Control Bow Manual
jm_hcitem_tj_bow_01=The Taihua Curved Bow Collection
jm_hcitem_tj_bow_02=The Excellent Bow Angle Record
jm_hcitem_tj_bow_03=The Fine Gold Bow Volume
jm_hcitem_tj_bow_04=The Swallow Feather Good Bow Record
jm_hcitem_tj_bow_05=The Divine Weapon Control Bow Manual
desc_baibaoxiang_key_ride_sika_0501_0=Right-click to use<br>After use, you can learn the <font color="#00ff00">Snowy Sky · Cloud White Deer</font> riding skill, and permanently obtain this fun mount in the "Treasure Chest".<br><font color="#00ff00">Can be obtained from Cao Heixin (Treasure Merchant) (long-term acquisition)</font><br><font color="#00ff00">Treasure Chest</font> can be obtained by exchanging at <font color="#00ff00">Chengdu 720,693 Treasure Chest Merchant</font>.
desc_baibaoxiang_key_ride_sika_0502_0=Right-click to use<br>After use, you can learn the <font color="#00ff00">Thousand Snow · First Clear Snow Deer</font> riding skill, and permanently obtain this fun mount in the "Treasure Chest".<br><font color="#00ff00">Can be obtained from Cao Heixin (Treasure Merchant) (available from January to February)</font><br><font color="#00ff00">Treasure Chest</font> can be exchanged for at <font color="#00ff00">Chengdu 720,693 Treasure Chest Merchant</font>.
desc_baibaoxiang_key_ride_sika_0503_0=Right-click to use<br>After use, you can learn the <font color="#00ff00">Floating Clouds · Splendid Deer</font> riding skill, and permanently obtain this fun mount in the "Treasure Chest".<br><font color="#00ff00">Can be obtained from Cao Heixin (Treasure Merchant) (available from January to February)</font><br><font color="#00ff00">Treasure Chest</font> can be exchanged for at <font color="#00ff00">Chengdu 720,693 Treasure Chest Merchant</font>.
desc_ride_sika_0501_0=<font color="#66CD00">[Right-click to use]</font><br>The snow in Kunlun continued all night, with ice crystals flying, and the sky, clouds, mountains, and water were all covered in white. Outside the window, there was a sound of "click, click", which was so pleasant to hear. Following the sound, I walked out of the courtyard and into a tranquil and elegant world of ice and snow. Several proud snow plum blossoms smiled in the wind and snow, and the three white deer under the tree seemed to be attracted by the fragrance of the plum blossoms and were reluctant to leave.<br>The wind and snow were everywhere, the land was frozen, and the white deer roamed the snow-covered plain. This feeling was profound, carrying the white clouds back home.<br><font color"#FFC125">Do not drop</font>
desc_ride_sika_0502_0=<font color="#66CD00">[Right-click to use]</font><br>The snow in Kunlun continued all night, with ice crystals flying, and the sky, clouds, mountains, and water were all covered in white. Outside the window, there was a sound of "click, click", which was so pleasant to the ear. Following the sound, I walked out of the courtyard and into a tranquil and elegant world of ice and snow. Several proud snow plum blossoms smiled in the wind and snow, and the three white deer under the tree seemed to be attracted by the fragrance of the plum blossoms and were reluctant to leave.<br>After the snow, the sun came out, but even the sunlight felt cold. The plum blossoms in the courtyard were frozen by the snow, and there were still traces of the deer that had come through the mountains on the ground.<br><font color"#FFC125">Do not drop</font>
desc_ride_sika_0503_0=<font color="#66CD00">[Right-click to use]</font><br>The snow in Kunlun continued all night, with ice flowers flying, and the sky, clouds, mountains, and water were all white. Outside the window came the sound of "crackling, crackling", which was so pleasant to hear. Following the sound, I walked out of the courtyard and saw a peaceful and elegant snowy world outside. Several proud snow plum blossoms smiled in the wind and snow, and the three white deer under the tree seemed to be attracted by the fragrance of the plum blossoms and refused to leave.<br>Looking at Kunlun from afar, you can see the majestic and magnificent snow-capped mountains, and the piled up white snow looks like it is floating in the clouds. According to legend, seeing a white deer in Kunlun is a sign of good luck.<br><font color"#FFC125">Do not drop</font>
desc_xsyd_6_0=You can join a school. Talk to the coachman to ask him about the ten major schools.
desc_item_skillprove_0=Proof of defeat. This item can be taken to the School War Envoy to exchange for a School Donation. <br><font color="#ff0000">(Exchange is not available once you leave the Ten Schools.)</font>
desc_taskitem_yl172_0=The disciples of the ten major faction can collect this item if they want to go for training. This item can act as a certificate for proving their own strengths.
desc_item_h_xiashan_01_0=The certificate required by the disciples of the ten schools who have left for training.
desc_item_h_xiashan_02_0=The experience reward item for the disciples of the ten schools who left for training. It is an extremely rare immortality pill that can be easily used to exchange for other required items later (currently cannot be exchanged).
desc_dw_zz_001=<font color="#ff0000">Please be noted that only one effect exists after using Sweet Dumpling</font>
desc_dw_zz_002=<font color="#ff0000">Please be noted that only one effect exists after using Sweet Dumpling</font>
desc_dw_zz_003=<font color="#ff0000">Please be noted that only one effect exists after using Sweet Dumpling</font>
desc_dw_zz_004=<font color="#ff0000">Please be noted that only one effect exists after using Sweet Dumpling</font>
desc_dw_zz_005=<font color="#ff0000">Please be noted that only one effect exists after using Sweet Dumpling</font>
desc_box_schoolwar_prize_01a_0=Heroes on the winning team with a School War ranking from 1 - 20 will receive an award which includes: 400 level 5 cultivation points, 16 Chi Accumulation Pills and 10 School Honor Certificates. <br><font color="#FF0000">(Players who haven't joined one of the Ten Major Schools will not receive a School Honor Certificate but will receive a corresponding item of Vagrant or the new schools)</font>
desc_box_schoolwar_prize_02a_0=Heroes on the winning team with a School War ranking from 21 - 100 will receive an award which includes: 300 level 5 cultivation points, 12 Chi Accumulation Pills and 10 School Honor Certificates. <br><font color="#FF0000">(Players who haven't joined one of the Ten Major Schools will not receive a School Honor Certificate but will receive a corresponding item of Vagrant or the new schools)</font>
desc_box_schoolwar_prize_03a_0=Heroes on the winning team with a School War ranking from 101 - 200 will receive an award which includes: 250 level 5 cultivation points, 8 Chi Accumulation Pills and 10 School Honor Certificates. <br><font color="#FF0000">(Players who haven't joined one of the Ten Major Schools will not receive a School Honor Certificate but will receive a corresponding item of Vagrant or the new schools)</font>
desc_box_schoolwar_prize_04a_0=Heroes on the winning team with a School War ranking after 200 and possess points will receive an award which includes: 200 level 5 cultivation points, 4 Chi Accumulation Pills and 10 School Honor Certificates. <br><font color="#FF0000">(Players who haven't joined one of the Ten Major Schools will not receive a School Honor Certificate but will receive a corresponding item of Vagrant or the new schools)</font>
desc_box_schoolwar_prize_01b_0=Heroes on the losing team with a School War ranking from 1 - 20 will receive an award which includes: 200 level 5 cultivation points, 8 Chi Accumulation Pills and 10 School Honor Certificates. <br><font color="#FF0000">(Players who haven't joined one of the Ten Major Schools will not receive a School Honor Certificate but will receive a corresponding item of Vagrant or the new schools)</font>
desc_box_schoolwar_prize_02b_0=Heroes on the losing team with a School War ranking from 21 - 100 will receive an award which includes: 150 level 5 cultivation points, 6 Chi Accumulation Pills and 10 School Honor Certificates. <br><font color="#FF0000">(Players who haven't joined one of the Ten Major Schools will not receive a School Honor Certificate but will receive a corresponding item of Vagrant or the new schools)</font>
desc_box_schoolwar_prize_03b_0=Heroes on the losing team with a School War ranking from 101 - 200 will receive an award which includes: 125 level 5 cultivation points, 4 Chi Accumulation Pills and 10 School Honor Certificates. <br><font color="#FF0000">(Players who haven't joined one of the Ten Major Schools will not receive a School Honor Certificate but will receive a corresponding item of Vagrant or the new schools)</font>
desc_box_schoolwar_prize_04b_0=Heroes on the losing team with a School War ranking after 200 and possess points will receive an award which includes: 100 level 5 cultivation points, 2 Chi Accumulation Pills and 10 School Honor Certificates. <br><font color="#FF0000">(Players who haven't joined one of the Ten Major Schools will not receive a School Honor Certificate but will receive a corresponding item of Vagrant or the new schools)</font>
desc_box_schoolwar_prize_01c_0=Support players on the winning team with a School War ranking from 1 - 20 will receive an award which includes: 200 level 5 cultivation points, 8 Chi Accumulation Pills and 5 School Honor Certificates. <br><font color="#FF0000">(Players who haven't joined one of the Ten Major Schools will not receive a School Honor Certificate but will receive a corresponding item of Vagrant or the new schools)</font>
desc_box_schoolwar_prize_02c_0=Support players on the winning team with a School War ranking from 21 - 100 will receive an award which includes: 150 level 5 cultivation points, 6 Chi Accumulation Pills and 5 School Honor Certificates. <br><font color="#FF0000">(Players who haven't joined one of the Ten Major Schools will not receive a School Honor Certificate but will receive a corresponding item of Vagrant or the new schools)</font>
desc_box_schoolwar_prize_03c_0=Support players on the winning team with a School War ranking from 101 - 200 will receive an award which includes: 125 level 5 cultivation points, 4 Chi Accumulation Pills and 5 School Honor Certificates. <br><font color="#FF0000">(Players who haven't joined one of the Ten Major Schools will not receive a School Honor Certificate but will receive a corresponding item of Vagrant or the new schools)</font>
desc_box_schoolwar_prize_04c_0=Support players on the winning team with a School War ranking after 200 and possess points will receive an award which includes: 100 level 5 cultivation points, 2 Chi Accumulation Pills and 5 School Honor Certificates. <br><font color="#FF0000">(Players who haven't joined one of the Ten Major Schools will not receive a School Honor Certificate but will receive a corresponding item of Vagrant or the new schools)</font>
desc_box_schoolwar_prize_01d_0=Support players on the losing team with a School War ranking from 1 - 20 will receive an award which includes: 100 level 5 cultivation points, 4 Chi Accumulation Pills and 5 School Honor Certificates. <br><font color="#FF0000">(Players who haven't joined one of the Ten Major Schools will not receive a School Honor Certificate but will receive a corresponding item of Vagrant or the new schools)</font>
desc_box_schoolwar_prize_02d_0=Support players on the losing team with a School War ranking from 21 - 100 will receive an award which includes: 75 level 5 cultivation points, 3 Chi Accumulation Pills and 5 School Honor Certificates. <br><font color="#FF0000">(Players who haven't joined one of the Ten Major Schools will not receive a School Honor Certificate but will receive a corresponding item of Vagrant or the new schools)</font>
desc_box_schoolwar_prize_03d_0=Support players on the losing team with a School War ranking from 101 - 200 will receive an award which includes: 62.5 level 5 cultivation points, 2 Chi Accumulation Pills and 5 School Honor Certificates. <br><font color="#FF0000">(Players who haven't joined one of the Ten Major Schools will not receive a School Honor Certificate but will receive a corresponding item of Vagrant or the new schools)</font>
desc_box_schoolwar_prize_04d_0=Support players on the losing team with a School War ranking after 200 and possess points will receive an award which includes: 50 level 5 cultivation points, 1 Chi Accumulation Pills and 5 School Honor Certificates. <br><font color="#FF0000">(Players who haven't joined one of the Ten Major Schools will not receive a School Honor Certificate but will receive a corresponding item of Vagrant or the new schools)</font>
desc_box_schoolwar_prize_zh_0=Heroes who obtained the School Commander identity during the School War will receive an award which includes: 600 level 5 cultivation points, 24 Chi Accumulation Pills and 30 School Honor Certificates. <br><font color="#FF0000">(Void for players who haven't joined a school, please use it before you leaving a school)</font>
desc_item_setwuxing_001_0=<font color="#FFFF00">Suppress the mixing of the Chi with different attributes</font><br>The Softness, Hardness, Yin, Yang and Tai Chi of certain skill sets can be changed at the Adventuring Grand Master. These skill sets include: <br><font color="#eb6100">Yanyang Blade</font><font color="#eb6100">Ensnare the Soul</font><br><font color="#eb6100">Dragon Subduing Palm</font><font color="#eb6100">Deceiving Staff</font><br><font color="#eb6100">Iron leader Skill</font><font color="#eb6100">Tempest Staff</font><br><font color="#eb6100">Phantom Twin Daggers</font><font color="#eb6100">Dragon Claw (Ancient Manual)</font><br><font color="#eb6100">Tai Chi Fist (Ancient Manual)</font>      <font color="#eb6100">Dog Beating Staff Technique (Ancient Manual)</font><br><font color="#eb6100">Mozi's Sword</font><font color="#eb6100">Yuanyang Twin Blades</font><br><font color="#eb6100">Nine Palaces Sword</font><font color="#eb6100">Hu Family Blade</font><br><font color="#eb6100">Divine Wind</font><font color="#eb6100">Eight Trigrams Staff</font><br><font color="#eb6100">Heavenly Dance</font><font color="#eb6100">Sura Blade</font><br><font color="#eb6100">Whirl-Wind Leaves Sweeping Kick</font><font color="#eb6100">Yunxiao Flying Sword</font><br><font color="#eb6100">Cross Soul-chasing Staff</font><font color="#eb6100">Buddha Heart Palm</font><br><font color="#eb6100">Seven Techniques of the Flower Goddess (Flower Prince)</font><font color="#eb6100">Ghost Shadow Sword</font><br><font color="#eb6100">Spirit Step Sword</font><font color="#eb6100">Seven-Star Sword</font><br><font color="#eb6100">Joined Fingers</font> <font color="#eb6100">Eight Skills of the Broken Lotus</font><br><font color="#eb6100">Eternal Warrior Staff</font> <font color="#eb6100">Blood Sea Demon Blade</font><br><font color="#eb6100">King of the Damned</font> <font color="#eb6100">Curled Branch Sword</font><br><font color="#eb6100">Pride of Winter</font> <font color="#eb6100">Holy Fire Token</font><br><font color="#eb6100">Reversed Yin Yang Blade</font> <font color="#eb6100">Eighteen Dragon Subduing Palm</font><br><font color="#eb6100">Wave Motion Staff</font>
desc_item_cwqy_featrer_0=Beautiful feathers, soft, smooth, and very lovable to touch.<br>Suzhou <font color="#3299CC">maid {@IDName:WorldNpc01172}</font> needs it, and if you have 20 of them, you may get some unexpected surprises.<font color="#00FF00">If this item cannot be stacked in the package, you can go to the Shangwu Ambassador in Suzhou (390,768) to exchange it for the same item.</font>
cj_002_015_002=I was defeated by the Kunlun Sect disciple. So I have to work for them as a servant as I promised.
desc_treasure_skill_reset_0=The Token to rework your treasure and skills at the Scalper Liu Yingpeng without Silver. Jianghu VIP and Elite VIP players can get it freely at the Scalper Liu Yingpeng every day. <br>(You can carry up to 300 pieces of this item. Carrying more than the upper limit will lead to failure of getting it.)
desc_item_cwqy_taozi_0=A delicious peach. <br>The Suzhou <font color="#3299CC">Peachblossom Island Lord's daughter {@IDName:WorldNpc01223}</font> loves peaches. Give her 20 peaches for a special reward.
desc_item_clone_exchange_sl02_0=The reward certificate obtained by Shaolin disciple when passing the [Hard] challenge of Wooden Monk Lane. <br>Shaolin disciple trades for advanced school skill <font color="#FF3030">Dragon Claw </font>levels 5 and 6 and <font color="#FF3030">Long Style Boxing, Bhodidharma's Staff, and Weituo Staff Skill </font>levels 8 and 9 important items, which can be redeemed at Shaolin's <font color="#FF3030">Force Transmitting Elder (721, 375). </font> (Jianghu VIPs have priority for exchange.)
desc_item_clone_exchange_wd02_0=The reward certificate obtained by Wudang disciple when passing the [Hard] challenge of Violet Chambers. <br>Wudang disciple trades for advanced school skill <font color="#FF3030">Tai Chi Fist </font>levels 5 and 6 and <font color="#FF3030">Tai Chi Sword, Breeze Sword, and Yin Yang Sword </font>levels 8 and 9 important items, which can be redeemed at Wudang's <font color="#FF3030">Force Transmitting Elder (369, 334). </font> (Jianghu VIPs have priority for exchange.)
desc_item_clone_exchange_em02_0=The reward certificate obtained by the Emei disciple when passing the [Hard] challenge of Sacrifice Cliff. <br>Emei disciple trades for the advanced school skill <font color="#FF3030">Jade Maiden Sword </font>, levels 5 and 6, and <font color="#FF3030">Golden Diamond Soft Palm, Rosy Cloud Stab, and Farewell Stab </font>, levels 8 and 9, important items which can be redeemed at the Emei <font color="#FF3030">Force Transmitting Elder (277, 111). </font> (Jianghu VIPs have priority for exchange.)
desc_item_clone_exchange_jz02_0=The reward certificate obtained by Scholars disciple when passing the [Hard] challenge of Villa of the Departed. <br>Scholars disciple trades for advanced school skill <font color="#FF3030">Jade Flute Sword </font>,levels 5 and 6, and <font color="#FF3030">Leisure Kick, Boundless Sword, and Flying Flowers and Falling Leaves Sword </font>,levels 8 and 9, important items which can be redeemed at Scholars <font color="#FF3030">Force Transmitting Elder (542, 453). </font> (Jianghu VIPs have priority for exchange.)
desc_item_clone_exchange_gb02_0=The reward certificate obtained by the Beggar's Sect disciple when passing the [Hard] challenge of Apricot Forest. <br>Beggar's Sect disciple trades for the advanced school skill <font color="#FF3030">Dog Staff Technique </font>, levels 5 and 6, and <font color="#FF3030">Lotus Palm, Spirit Snake Staff, and Crying Staff </font>, levels 8 and 9, important items which can be redeemed at Beggar's Sect's <font color="#FF3030">Force Transmitting Elder (619, 224). </font> (Jianghu VIPs have priority for exchange.)
desc_item_clone_exchange_tm02_0=The reward certificate obtained by Tangmen disciple when passing the [Hard] challenge of Poison Palace. <br>Tangmen disciple trades for advanced school skill <font color="#FF3030">Hell King Patch </font>levels 5 and 6 and <font color="#FF3030">Vertigo Dart, Golden Snake Sting, and Shadow Chasing Sting </font>levels 8 and 9 important items, which can be redeemed at Tangmen's <font color="#FF3030">Force Transmitting Elder (1067,-133). </font> (Jianghu VIPs have priority for exchange.)
desc_item_clone_exchange_jy02_0=The reward certificate obtained by Royal Guard disciple when passing the [Hard] challenge of Purgatory. <br>Royal Guard disciple trades for advanced school skill <font color="#FF3030">The Executioner's Blade </font>, levels 5 and 6, and <font color="#FF3030">Soul Losing Blade, Soul Chasing Claw, and Eagle Claw Fist </font>, levels 8 and 9, important items which can be redeemed at Royal Guard <font color="#FF3030">Force Transmitting Elder (354,-126). </font> (Jianghu VIPs have priority for exchange.)
desc_item_clone_exchange_jl02_0=The reward certificate obtained by Wanderer's Valley disciple when passing the [Hard] challenge of Cavern of Lost Souls. <br>Wanderer's Valley disciple trades for advanced school skill <font color="#FF3030">The Thirteen Swords of Fatality </font>, levels 5 and 6, and <font color="#FF3030">Bone Corroding Palm, Perish Stab, and Wind Chasing Blade </font>, levels 8 and 9, important items which can be redeemed at Wanderer's Valley <font color="#FF3030">Force Transmitting Elder (134,42). </font> (Jianghu VIPs have priority for exchange.)
desc_box_zhenpai_clone_sl02_0=The bag carried by monks when they go out for alms is often very large. (Obtained through the sect trial [difficult] test level reward)<br><font color="#FFFF00">Right-click to open.</font>
desc_box_zhenpai_clone_wd02_0=A Taoist's essential item for traveling, can be considered versatile. (Obtained as a reward for completing the [Difficult] level of the sect's trial) <br><font color="#FFFF00">Right-click to open.</font>
desc_box_zhenpai_clone_em02_0=A woman's personal embroidered bag, popular for a time. (Obtained as a reward for completing the [Difficult] level of the sect's trial) <br><font color="#FFFF00">Right-click to open.</font>
desc_box_zhenpai_clone_jz02_0=A favorite item of migrating scholars and poets, a symbol of intelligence and entertainment. (Obtained as a reward for completing the [Difficult] level of the sect's trial) <br><font color="#FFFF00">Right-click to open.</font>
desc_box_zhenpai_clone_gb02_0=A patched and mended large cloth bag, capable of holding many things. (Obtained as a reward for completing the [Difficult] level of the sect's trial) <br><font color="#FFFF00">Right-click to open.</font>
desc_box_zhenpai_clone_tm02_0=A device used by Tangmen disciples to hide weapons. You never know what a Tangmen disciple might pull out from one of these pouches. (The reward obtained by passing the [Hard] challenge of the Poison Palace) <br><font color="#FFFF00">Right-click to open.</font>
desc_box_zhenpai_clone_jy02_0=Used to store secret orders and confidential materials issued by the court, sealed with wax and triple protection. (Obtained as a reward for completing the <Difficulty> level of the Sect Trial) <br><font color="#FFFF00">Right-click to open.</font>
desc_box_zhenpai_clone_jl02_0=Exquisitely crafted, with excellent quality, can remain uncorrupted even in dark and damp environments. (Obtained as a reward for completing the <Difficulty> level of the Sect Trial) <br><font color="#FFFF00">Right-click to open.</font>
desc_box_zhenpai_clone_mj02_0=Time reverses. Heaven and earth come together. Ming Cult disciples often take this item with them. (The reward is obtained by passing the challenge of the Thousand Green Ravine [Hard Mode]) . <br><font color="#FFFF00">Right click to open it.</font>
desc_box_zhenpai_clone_ts02_0=Embroidered by thousand year mysterious icy silk. Can be obtained through Oki Islands [Hard]. <br><font color="#FFFF00">Right click to use.</font>
desc_Item_4nei_duihuan_0=It's covered with mysterious symbols, but there's no way to know what it actually contains. The Ten Schools are searching for this object, and want to decipher the clues from the mysterious organization. <br><font color="#FF3333">(This object could have been acquired when the Schools sent their troops to the Forbidden Instance. It is also said that people came up with this thing while in high-level Forbidden Instance.) </font><br><font color="#FF3333">(You can give it to the School's Tier Four Internal Skill Trader in exchange for the Tier Four Internal Skill Page.)</font>
desc_item_4nei_richang_0=After the Blade Sharpening Hall affair had ended for the time being, the Eight Schools continued to receive news that Remnants from the Blade Sharpening Hall were showing up everywhere. Open the Secret Order and see where the Blade Sharpening Hall Remnants are hiding, and quickly go there and wipe them out.
desc_zhenqi_match_002_0=Right-click to receive <font color="#FFFF00">50,000</font> Chi. Doesn't decrease player's Chi limit.
desc_item_wgm_rm001_0=Everything has its fate, and nature plays tricks. How to choose depends entirely on your fate. <br> Once you reach the level of <font color="#ff0000">dominating the world</font>, you can use this item to go to Jinling (839,1532) and ask Shen Xuefei for information on joining the Wugenmen. <br> <font color="#44ff44">If you use this item, you must first undergo castration. If you don't have any treasures, you can seek help from Shi Cheng'en in Jinling (677,241).</font> <br> <font color="#ff0000">[Before opening the fourth inner Age of Wushu Record, you need to have the "faceless token" and use this referral token to join the Wugenmen. After opening the soul, you don't need the "faceless token".]</font>
desc_item_wbhd_qz_1=Unearth the reward package through Chao Heng's treasures. Open the package and you will randomly receive an artifact from the ten major schools or 2 Self Recollection Skill artifacts.
desc_taskitem_wmp_pz_0=This letter is written by the distressed monk to the ten major factions. Take this letter to find the escort of the ten major factions. You may join a faction under the guidance of the escort. <br>Shaolin (743,549) Wudang (481,631) <br>Emei (480,256) Beggar's Sect (607,463) <br>Tangmen (889,-97) Scholars (232,431) <br> Royal Guard (345,97) Wanderer's Valley (386,118) <br>Ming Cult (-12,-177) Tianshan Sect (1240,1433)
desc_shaolin_panshi_02=Jianghu related: Through betraying your master, you can be added into the new powers of Jianghu, such as the <br>Xu Family Manor<a href="findnpc_new,city05,xjz_021" style="HLStype1">, </a>Golden Needle Sect<a href="findnpc_new,city05,WorldNpc100048" style="HLStype1">, </a>Beast Villa<a href="findnpc_new,school02,wssz_132" style="HLStype1">, </a>etc. I have no news regarding to the hidden Jianghu powers. You will have to search through Jianghu yourself. <br>Of course, you can also join other schools: <a href="findnpc_new,school07,wd179" style="HLStype1">Wudang</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school04,jlg093" style="HLStype1">Wanderer's Valley</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school01,jyw048" style="HLStype1">Royal Guard</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school02,gb390" style="HLStype1">Beggar's Sect</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school03,JZTNPC150" style="HLStype1">Scholar's Academy Hall</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school05,tm089" style="HLStype1">Tangmen</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school20,npc_mjwy_005" style="HLStype1">Ming Cult</a>, and <a href="findnpc_new,school22,npc_tsguj_005" style="HLStype1">Tianshan Sect</a>
desc_shaolin_yirong_03=Leave faction under disguise requirements: <br>Tier 2 internal Skill is active.<br>Not an Acting Grandmaster, Deacon or Elder in the school.<br>Not betraying school, or leaving faction for further training<br>It has been more than 30 days since the last time betrayed a school.<br>Level reaches Peak of Power.<br>Must be Jianghu VIP.<br>Only thirty players can disguise themselves each day.
desc_emei_panshi_02=Jianghu related: Through betraying your master, you can be added into the new powers of Jianghu, such as the <br>Xu Family Manor<a href="findnpc_new,city05,xjz_021" style="HLStype1">, </a>Golden Needle Sect<a href="findnpc_new,city05,WorldNpc100048" style="HLStype1">, </a>Beast Villa<a href="findnpc_new,school02,wssz_132" style="HLStype1">, </a>etc. I have no news regarding to the hidden Jianghu powers. You will have to search through Jianghu yourself. <br>Of course, you can also join other schools: <a href="findnpc_new,school07,wd179" style="HLStype1">Wudang</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school04,jlg093" style="HLStype1">Wanderer's Valley</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school01,jyw048" style="HLStype1">Royal Guard</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school02,gb390" style="HLStype1">Beggar's Sect</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school03,JZTNPC150" style="HLStype1">Scholar's Academy Hall</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school05,tm089" style="HLStype1">Tangmen</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school20,npc_mjwy_005" style="HLStype1">Ming Cult</a>, and <a href="findnpc_new,school22,npc_tsguj_005" style="HLStype1">Tianshan Sect</a>
