desc_jinyiwei_yirong_03=Leave faction under disguise requirements: <br>Tier 2 internal Skill is active.<br>Not an Acting Grandmaster, Deacon or Elder in the school.<br>Not betraying school, or leaving faction for further training<br>It has been more than 30 days since the last time betrayed a school.<br>Level reaches Peak of Power.<br>Must be Jianghu VIP.<br>Only thirty players can disguise themselves each day.
desc_taskitem_panshi_01_0=Congratulations for having successfully completed the faction betrayal test. This is your faction betrayal certificate. With this, you can look for a <font color="#FFAE00">faction betrayal guide</font> in your faction. Please <font color="#FFAE00">remove all of the treasures</font> obtained previously before leaving the faction; otherwise, you will <font color="#FF3030">fail</font> leaving the faction. <br>Royal Guards faction betrayal guide (Royal Guards 342 -79), Beggar's Sect faction betrayal guide (Beggar's Sect 538 341), Scholars faction betrayal guide (Scholars  471 466), Wanderer's Valley faction betrayal guide (Wanderer's Valley  148 -24), Tangmen faction betrayal guide (Tangmen 1057 -133), Emei faction betrayal guide (Emei 502 195), Wudang faction betrayal guide (Wudang 473 353), Shaolin faction betrayal guide (Shaolin 790 384), Ming Cult faction betrayal guide (Ming Cult -25 213), Tianshan Sect faction betrayal guide (Tianshan Sect 1298 998)
desc_taskitem_xiashan_01_0=Congratulations for having successfully completed the Training Away test. This is your training away certificate. With this, you can look for a <font color="#FFAE00">training away guide</font> in your faction. Please <font color="#FFAE00">remove all of the treasures</font> obtained previously before training away; otherwise, you will <font color="#FF3030">fail</font> training away. <br>Royal Guards training away guide (Royal Guards 341 -77), Beggar's Sect training away guide (Beggar's Sect 538 337), Scholars training away guide (Scholars  474 466), Wanderer's Valley training away guide (Wanderer's Valley  150 -22), Tangmen training away guide (Tangmen 1056 -135), Emei training away guide (Emei 504 188), Wudang training away guide (Wudang 470 352), Shaolin training away guide (Shaolin 789 383), Ming Cult training away guide (Ming Cult -25 210), Tianshan Sect training away guide (Tianshan Sect 1301 998)
desc_item_9yin_newforce_0=There was a letter in the beautifully wrapped embroidered box. The writing was graceful and appears to have been written by a woman. The content of the letter is: <br><s><s>I have received your invitation to live at the secluded island of the Eastern sea a day ago. It appears that unrest at Jianghu is about to take place. The future will be fraught with unpredictable fortunes. It is hard for me to be unaffected under these trends. The eight major factions have slowly deteriorated and become undependable. There is also no upcoming faction that we can depend upon in the mountains or the cities of Jianghu. I have personally written this recommendation, which will guarantee you to join the various powers unimpeded. <s><s><s><s><s>---Qin Hezheng <br><font color="#ff0000">entry certificates are the necessary tools to add to the new powers. You must also satisfy the conditions set by the various powers in order to join. Some of the tools has a time limit after you received them. </font><br><font color="#ff0000">Right-click to receive the entry certificate to enter one of the six new powers. </font>
desc_Item_HomePoint_common_0=Right-click to use this token. After use, your "teleport point" will be bound based on your current identity. The "teleport point"<br> of school-less heroes will be bound to the herbal hall of Ruined Valley. <br>The ten schools heroes' "teleport point" will be bound to the herbal hall of their school. The faction heroes'<br> "teleport point" will be bound to the herbal hall of their faction.
desc_item_jhdw_ww002_0=This is a high grade Jianghu Identity Token that can be acquired when you have won certain Affinity with some NPCs. It represents their high approval of you. These NPCs are generally disciples of some super factions and important persons of the ten schools and the Four Families. The token is a necessity if you want to attain certain Jianghu Position.
desc_item_jhdw_ww003_0=This is a special Identity Token that can be acquired at random when you have won certain Affinity with some NPCs. It represents their high approval of your Heroic. These NPCs are generally disciples of some super factions and important persons of the ten schools and the Four Families. The token is a necessity if you want to attain certain Jianghu Position.
desc_item_jhdw_ww004_0=This is a special Identity Token that can be acquired at random when you have won certain Affinity with some NPCs. It represents their high approval of your Pride and Disrespect. These NPCs are generally disciples of some super factions and important persons of the ten schools and the Four Families. The token is a necessity if you want to attain certain Jianghu Position.
desc_item_jhdw_ww005_0=This is a special Identity Token that can be acquired at random when you have won certain Affinity with some NPCs. It represents their high approval of your Astounding Martial Arts. These NPCs are generally disciples of some super factions and important persons of the ten schools and the Four Families. The token is a necessity if you want to attain certain Jianghu Position.
desc_Item_BattleS25_jineng001_0=The Warrior Spirit Pavilion Token grants you Red Super Armor for 4 seconds. (This item has a 2-minute Cooldown and cannot be used while moving) <br><font color="#FF3333">This token can only be used after 5 pieces of Fighter's Spirit or Wyvern set are equipped</font>
desc_box_revenge_tp01_1=An ordinary box containing a Tier 1 Internal Skill Achievement Method of the major Schools.
desc_box_revenge_tp02_1=An ordinary box containing a Tier 2 Internal Skill Achievement Method of the major Schools.
desc_box_revenge_tp03_1=An ordinary box containing a Tier 3 Internal Skill Achievement Method of the major Schools.
desc_box_revenge_school_1=A dust-laden Martial Arts Treasure Box containing 1 page of the ten Schools Martial Arts book.
desc_Item_5nei_duihuan_0=It's said that only real kung fu masters are able to use it<br><font color="#FF3333">(Use it to exchange for fifth internal page or advanced skill page). Shaolin Exchange NPC (720 378), Wudang Exchange NPC (392 339), Emei Exchange NPC (298 124), Beggar's Sect Exchange NPC (547 252), Royal Guards Exchange NPC (394 -48), Wanderer's Valley Exchange NPC (140 51), Scholars Exchange NPC (616 457), Tangmen Exchange NPC (1053 -170), Shaolin First Disciple (800 368), Wudang First Disciple (454 342), Emei First Disciple (475 152), Beggar's Sect First Disciple (563 351), Royal Guards First Disciple (338 -92), Wanderer's Valley First Disciple (145 21), Scholars First Disciple (518 471), Tangmen First Disciple (1038 -161),Ming Cult Force Transmitting Elder (-23 238), Tianshan Sect Force Transmitting Elder (1272 975)</font></font>
desc_cropper_70001_1=Available at the Farmer's (Life Skills)
desc_hd_wunei_zp_0=Ten Schools Advanced School Skill Gift Pack, gifted to Jianghu Re-emerging Heroes.
title_newworld_xiyu_a3_005_2_6=Wonderful. I owe you much. Consider yourself a part of the Desert Ghost Town now!
title_newworld_xiyu_a3_002_2_3=I hate greedy people more than anything. Many vile people have been trying to sneak into the Desert Ghost Town. I hope my father is ok. Do you quarrel with your parents?
title_newworld_xiyu_a1_002_2_9=Other than us, the Wudang and Scholars also have entered the Western Region. Other schools and factions are on their way as well. Even the Demon Blade Elder has arrived. I hope this will give me an opportunity to kill Xiang Jiuchen.
title_newworld_xiyu_a2_027_2_3=Well, what a question! It is used to locate a great treasure but do you really think you are up to the task? As you are now, death is certain. I have a proposition. This is a Heaven Net Cult Saintess Token which can be an invaluable item in the Western Region. I'll exchange it for the map. How say you?
title_newworld_xiyu_a2_030_2_2=The <a href="item,item_newworld_xiyu_a1_task_003" style="HLStypebuzz">Desert Ghost Town Map</a>? It is of value...to me. I will trade you this Heaven Net Cult Saintess Token for it. The token will bring you respect. Deal?
title_newworld_xiyu_yd_001_4_1=Nearly all the factions in the Western Regions get involved.  They are Loulan descendants, Western Xia descendants, Heaven Net Cult, Desert Ghost Town, Qiuci and Shi Guanyin. The ten schools of the central plains also get involved. Look, that is the duel between those two regions, the Western Regions and the central plains.
menu_newworld_xiyu_yd_001_5_1=Why are they fighting here?
title_newworld_xiyu_yd_01_005=(Shake his head) Forces in Western Regions are all about Desert Ghost Town, Heaven Net Cult, Stone Forest Cave, Lianfang and Western Xia Supreme Hall.  Now even you came from the Central Plain for this. It must be real.
menue_newworld_xiyu_yd_01_005=What? All the school masters know this already?
desc_Item_xdm_enterkey01_2=Only disciples of the ten schools who have reached Spiritually Balanced can use it.
desc_events_390=Know your school: You have done this {@0:完成}/{@1:总数} times. <br>While on the Hero Islands, show <a href="findnpc_new,scene17,newworldnpc_xkd_40" style="HLStype1">Bai Xiaoming the Wise</a> what you know about the major schools and factions back on the mainland. Reward is unlocked 3 times on the previous day.
desc_events_879=School assassins: You have completed this {@0:完成}/{@1:总数} times. <br>Defeat the disciples of the ten major schools on the Hero Islands. Reward is unlocked 3 times on the previous day.
desc_sworn_lengpf001_0=Summon your sworn friends in emergency.  <br><font color="#FFFF00">Only effective in the four beginner towns, five major cities, ten schools and the Northern Desert. </font><br>Right-click to use.
xlsbz_info_2=<font color="#FFFF00">Eighteen Dragon Subduing Palm Stack 1-10:</font><br>1.Click Comprehension Button to receive <font color="#FFFF00">Comprehension Points</font><br>2. <font color="#FFFF00">10</font> comprehension points will grants a stack of Eighteen Dragon Subduing Palm or enhance maximum limit of the skill. <br>3. Each use will consume <font color="#FFFF00">40</font> Silver Taels and <font color="#FFFF00"></font>Eighteen Dragon Subduing Palm fragment (Obtained after getting Five Ultimates in Mount Hua Competition. 1 for each comprehension of Stack 1-4. And 2 for each comprehension of Stack 5-10.)<br>4. During comprehension, you have a <font color="#FFFF00">5%</font> chance of getting double comprehension points.<br><font color="#FFFF00">Stack Eleven to Twelve:</font><br>1.Must consume<font color="#FFFF00">1</font> comprehension point for comprehension upgrade. Eighteen Dragon Subduing Palm has to reach Level 10.<br>2. Each comprehension costs 1 <font color="#FFFF00">Five-Spices Beggar's Chicken</font>(Obtained after getting 1st Place of Five Ultimates in Mount Hua Competition)<br>3. Comprehension <font color="#FFFF00">doesn't cost Silver Taels</font>. Double effect will not be triggered during comprehension.<br>4.Level 11 and 12 of Dragon Subduing Palm will <font color="#FFFF00"> drop to Level 10</font> on the next session of the Mount Hua Competition.
null_title_xlsbz_learn_8688=<font color="#FFFF00">Five-Spices Beggar's Chicken</font> is always a treat we love to share...we can never have too much of those! If you also happen to find some <font color="#FFFF00">scroll fragments</font> of the Eighteen Dragon Subduing Palm, I can give you a tip or two. <br>Please note: <br><s>1. You need to be recognized as an "Ultimate Five" player Mount Hua Competition to comprehend levels 1 to 10. <br><s>2. You need to be ranked first as an "Ultimate Five" player in the Mount Hua Competition to comprehend levels 11 and 12. <br><s>3. Skill comprehension is unlocked during the 24 hours following the conclusion of Mount Hua Competition each day. <br><s>4. The upper limit of your comprehension is also determined by the tier of your internal skill. <br><s>5. Please check that you have learned no more than 480 skills, or you will not be able to proceed with the comprehension.
title_xlsbz_learn_8688=I love Spicy Beggar's Chicken. It is really delicious. Or if you have Eighteen Dragon Subduing Palm Incomplete Page, I can also teach you something. <br>Note: <br><s>1.  Only the Five Swordsmen of Mount Hua Competition can comprehend the Eighteen Dragon Subduing Palm. <br><s>2. Only the top one of the Five Swordsmen of Mount Hua can comprehend Eighteen Dragon Subduing Palm level 11-12. <br><s>3. Comprehension starts at the midnight of the day Mount Hua Competition ends. <br><s>4. Max comprehension level is determined by the internal skill level. <br><s>5. You have learned no more than 480 skills, or you cannot comprehend.
title_xlsbz_learn_8689=I love Spicy Beggar's Chicken. It is really delicious. Or if you have Eighteen Dragon Subduing Palm Incomplete Page, I can also teach you something. <br>Note: <br><s>1.  Only the Five Swordsmen of Mount Hua Competition can comprehend the Eighteen Dragon Subduing Palm. <br><s>2. Only the top one of the Five Swordsmen of Mount Hua can comprehend Eighteen Dragon Subduing Palm level 11-12. <br><s>3. Comprehension starts at the midnight of the day Mount Hua Competition ends. <br><s>4. Max comprehension level is determined by the internal skill level. <br><s>5. You have learned no more than 480 skills, or you cannot comprehend.
newworld_lingxia_biwunpc_001_talk_001=Elder Wang Yue has set the Eight Diagrams Tianmen Array in Lingxiao City, for those worthy of accepting his challenge. When in the array, you have to face various notable figures in Jianghu - including the leaders of the major schools and reclusive factions! Fight them to increase combat experience and find your weakness for further improvement.
newworld_lingxia_biwunpc_002_talk_002=Ten major schools
desc_box_swhd_lzy001_0=Players in faction schools or reclusive schools will get corresponding Reputation. Players in the ten schools or not in a school will get Jianghu Reputation. <br><font color="#FF0000">Jianghu VIP is required to open the pack.</font>
desc_box_prize_miemen_drwf005_1=Contains <font color="#FFFF00">5000 Cultivation Points, 2000 Cultivation Perfusion, 2000 Chi, 1 Bai Xiaosheng's Weapon Manual, and 25 School Honor Certificates of the ten schools.</font>.
desc_box_lzy_sdsj_mppz_0=Only the disciples of the ten schools can open to get 25 School Honor Certificates of the corresponding school.
desc_Box_news_race_madh_1=Fine gift, Jianghu VIP and Spiritually Balanced are required to open it.
title_chaoswar_testskill_npc_006_2_5=Only VIP players can enter Cultivation Hall and can stay there for at most 1 hour. Everyday, one can cultivate in Cultivation Hall for at most 3 hours. There is a limit on how many times one can enter too. If one wants to leave Cultivation Hall, please directly click "exit" button above the count-down timer.
desc_faculty_yanwu_lzyysmp001_0=A medicine for increasing martial arts skills. <br>It can increase at most <font color="#FFFF00">10000</font> Cultivation Converting for current cultivating skill. <br>(Can only be used if you practice the following internal skills) <br><font color="#FFB428">Jade Maiden’s Heart (< level 20)</font><br><font color="#FFB432">Blood Blade Heart (< level 20)</font><br><font color="#FFB432">Cloud-surpassing Mental Skill (< level 20)</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Heavenly Demon Secret Script (< level 20)</font><br><font color="#FFB432">Tidal Wave (< level 20)</font><br><font color="#FFB432">Palm-Leaf Sutra (< level 20)</font><br><font color="#FFB432">Five Immortals in a Rain of Flowers (< level 20)</font><br><font color="#FFB432">Purple Soul (< level 20)</font><br><font color="#FFB432">Ghost Valley Divine Scrolls (< level 20)</font><br><font color="#FFB432">Shadow Flow Secret (< level 20)</font>
desc_faculty_yanwu_lzyysmp002_0=A medicine for increasing martial arts skills. <br>It can increase at most <font color="#FFFF00">10000</font> Cultivation Converting for current cultivating skill. <br>(Can only be used if you practice the following internal skills) <br><font color="#FFB428">Jade Maiden’s Heart (< level 40)</font><br><font color="#FFB432">Blood Blade Heart (< level 40)</font><br><font color="#FFB432">Cloud-surpassing Mental Skill (< level 40)</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Heavenly Demon Secret Script (< level 40)</font><br><font color="#FFB432">Tidal Wave (< level 40)</font><br><font color="#FFB432">Palm-Leaf Sutra (< level 40)</font><br><font color="#FFB432">Five Immortals in a Rain of Flowers (< level 40)</font><br><font color="#FFB432">Purple Soul (< level 40)</font><br><font color="#FFB432">Ghost Valley Divine Scrolls (< level 40)</font><br><font color="#FFB432">Shadow Flow Secret (< level 40)</font>
desc_faculty_yanwu_lzyysmp003_0=A medicine for increasing martial arts skills. <br>It can increase at most <font color="#FFFF00">10000</font> Cultivation Converting for current cultivating skill. <br>(Can only be used if you practice the following internal skills) <br><font color="#FFB428">Jade Maiden’s Heart (< level 51)</font><br><font color="#FFB432">Blood Blade Heart (< level 51)</font><br><font color="#FFB432">Cloud-surpassing Mental Skill (< level 51)</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Heavenly Demon Secret Script (< level 51)</font><br><font color="#FFB432">Tidal Wave (< level 51)</font><br><font color="#FFB432">Palm-Leaf Sutra (< level 51)</font><br><font color="#FFB432">Five Immortals in a Rain of Flowers (< level 51)</font><br><font color="#FFB432">Purple Soul (< level 51)</font><br><font color="#FFB432">Ghost Valley Divine Scrolls (< level 51)</font><br><font color="#FFB432">Shadow Flow Secret (< level 51)</font>
desc_faculty_yanwu_lzyysmp004_0=A medicine for increasing martial arts skills. <br>It can increase at most <font color="#FFFF00">10000</font> Cultivation Converting for current cultivating skill. <br>(Can only be used if you practice the following internal skills) <br><font color="#FFB428">Jade Maiden’s Heart (< level 58)</font><br><font color="#FFB432">Blood Blade Heart (< level 58)</font><br><font color="#FFB432">Cloud-surpassing Mental Skill (< level 58)</font><br><font color="#FFB428">Heavenly Demon Secret Script (< level 58)</font><br><font color="#FFB432">Tidal Wave (< level 58)</font><br><font color="#FFB432">Palm-Leaf Sutra (< level 58)</font><br><font color="#FFB432">Five Immortals in a Rain of Flowers (< level 58)</font><br><font color="#FFB432">Purple Soul (< level 58)</font><br><font color="#FFB432">Ghost Valley Divine Scrolls (< level 58)</font><br><font color="#FFB432">Shadow Flow Secret (< level 58)</font>
desc_box_lzy_sdhd_mpbt_mp_1=Reward presented by Lin Tiannan. Open to get a certain amount of corresponding Internal Skill/Martial Art Exchange Items according to your current school and Age of Wushu Records  (You must be a disciple of the ten schools or don not belong to any school to open).
desc_box_lzy_hyd_rc001_1=Reward of Daily Active Value reaching 25 points. Open to receive <font color="#FFFF00">50000 Cultivation Points, and 3 Hunyuan Tendon-Relaxing Pills</font>
desc_box_lzy_hyd_zc_ew_yssw001_0=An exquisite package. Players in faction schools or reclusive schools will get corresponding Reputation. Players in the ten schools or not in a school will get Jianghu Reputation.
desc_item_2017fyzqpz_001_1=Certificate obtained by completing Trouble Rising Again series quests. <font color="#FF3030">You can exchange for rewards such as school Meridian Gift Pack (Level 1-180), Reversal Meridian Gift Pack (level 1-180), Item Support Pack, 10000000 Cultivation Perfusion Pack and so on at Suzhou (472, 314) Fan Hongju. </font>
desc_box_xfzx_zx4_madh=Open to get 1 Reset Ticket, and 1 Omnipotent Voucher.
desc_box_2017_dwhd_4nei_001_1=Gift pack obtained by completing Dragon Boat Festival event. <font color="#FF3030">Ten Major School Players can get 30 corresponding Advanced School Skill High Level Exchange Items and 10 Sheepskin Fragments from it, Non-school Players can get 30 Sheepskin Fragments from it, Reclusive School and Faction Players can get 100 corresponding school exchange items from it. </font>
desc_box_2017_dwhd_5nei_001_1=Gift pack obtained by completing Dragon Boat Festival event. <font color="#FF3030">Ten Major School Players and Non-school Players can get 10 He Family Jade Fragments from it, Reclusive School and Faction Players can get 200 corresponding school reputation from it. </font>
desc_box_2017_dwhd_6nei_001_1=Gift pack obtained by completing Dragon Boat Festival event. <font color="#FF3030">Ten Major School Players and Non-school Players can get 10 Demon Gate Tokens from it, Reclusive School and Faction Players can get 500 corresponding school reputation from it. </font>
desc_box_2017_dwhd_dwjsbx_004_1=Gift pack obtained by completing Dragon Boat Festival event. <font color="#FF3030">Jianghu VIP is required to open it. Open to get 1 Refined Moon Internal Skill Pill, and one from 5 Hunyuan Tendon-Relaxing Pills, 1 Tianshan Snow Lotus Fruit, or Tier Four Internal Skill Reward Pack (In the Tier Four Internal Skill Reward Pack, Ten Major School Players can get 30 corresponding Advanced School Skill High Level Exchange Items and 10 Sheepskin Fragments from it, Non-school Players can get 30 Sheepskin Fragments from it, Reclusive School and Faction Players can get 100 corresponding school exchange items from it). There is also a chance to get 1 Workbench Embroidered Box (The box is bound but you can get unbound Workbench from it).</font>
desc_box_2017_dwhd_dwjsbx_005_1=Gift pack obtained by completing Dragon Boat Festival event. <font color="#FF3030">Jianghu VIP is required to open it. Open to get 1 Refined Moon Internal Skill Pill, and one from 5 Hunyuan Tendon-Relaxing Pills, 1 Tianshan Snow Lotus Fruit, or Tier Five Internal Skill Reward Pack (In the Tier Five Internal Skill Reward Pack, Ten Major School Players and Non-school Players can get 10 He Family Jade Fragments from it, Reclusive School and Faction Players can get 200 corresponding school reputation from it). There is also a chance to get 1 Workbench Embroidered Box (The box is bound but you can get unbound Workbench from it).</font>
desc_box_2017_dwhd_dwjsbx_006_1=Gift pack obtained by completing Dragon Boat Festival event. <font color="#FF3030">Jianghu VIP is required to open it. Open to get 1 Refined Moon Internal Skill Pill, and one from 5 Hunyuan Tendon-Relaxing Pills, 1 Tianshan Snow Lotus Fruit, or Tier Six Internal Skill Reward Pack (In the Tier Six Internal Skill Reward Pack, Ten Major School Players and Non-school Players can get 10 Demon Gate Tokens from it, Reclusive School and Faction Players can get 500 corresponding school reputation from it). There is also a chance to get 1 Workbench Embroidered Box (The box is bound but you can get unbound Workbench from it).</font>
desc_jm_hcitem_ds_fumo_01=A Poison Master will craft different qualities of Bone Eroding Poison Oil Chapter according to the identity to be <font color="#FFB428">Poisoning Novice</font>, <font color="#FFB428">Apprentice Poison Maker</font>, <font color="#FFB428">Expert Poison Maker</font>, or <font color="#FFB428">Diabolical Poisoner</font>.
desc_jm_hcitem_ys_fumo_01=A Herbalist will craft different qualities of Concentrating Jade Dew Chapter according to the identity to be<font color="#FFB428"> Novice Herbalist</font>,<font color="#FFB428"> Apprentice Herbalist</font>,<font color="#FFB428"> Expert Herbalist</font>, or<font color="#FFB428"> Divine Healer</font>.
desc_jm_hcitem_tj_fumo_01=A Blacksmith will craft different qualities of Fiery Gold and Flint Chapter according to the identity to be<font color="#FFB428"> Novice Blacksmith</font>,<font color="#FFB428"> Apprentice Blacksmith</font>,<font color="#FFB428"> Expert Blacksmith</font>, or<font color="#FFB428"> God of Craftsmen</font>.
desc_jm_hcitem_jq_fumo_01=A Craftsman will craft different qualities of Heavenly Carving Chapter according to the identity to be<font color="#FFB428"> Novice Craftsman</font>,<font color="#FFB428"> Apprentice Craftsman</font>,<font color="#FFB428"> Expert Craftsman</font>, or<font color="#FFB428"> Hand of Hephaestus</font>.
desc_jm_hcitem_cs_fumo_01=A Chef will craft different qualities of Refined Grinder Stone Chapter according to the identity to be<font color="#FFB428"> Novice Cook</font>,<font color="#FFB428"> Apprentice Cook</font>,<font color="#FFB428"> Cooking Expert</font>, or<font color="#FFB428"> Consummate Gourmet</font>.
desc_jm_hcitem_cf_fumo_01=A Tailor will craft different qualities of Hundred Embroidery Needle Chapter according to the identity to be<font color="#FFB428"> Novice Tailor</font>,<font color="#FFB428"> Apprentice Tailor</font>,<font color="#FFB428"> Expert Tailor</font>, or<font color="#FFB428"> God of Tailors</font>.
desc_enchantitem_ds_04_0=Crafted by a <font color="#FFFF00" >Poison Maker</font> according to Hundred School Booklet. Can be used for enhancing Armor.<br>Suitable for armors needed to be enhanced by the identity <font color="#FFFF00" >Poisoning Novice, Apprentice Poison Maker, Expert Poison Maker, or Diabolical Poisoner</font>.<br>Right click to use.<br><font color="#FF0000">Enhance with enhancing item will still cost 10 liang of silver tales.</font>
desc_enchantitem_ys_04_0=Crafted by a <font color="#FFFF00" >Herbalist</font> according to Hundred School Booklet. Can be used for enhancing Jewelry.<br>Suitable for jewelries needed to be enhanced by the identity <font color="#FFFF00" >Novice Herbalist, Apprentice Herbalist, Expert Herbalist, or Divine Healer</font>.<br>Right click to use.<br><font color="#FF0000">Enhance with enhancing item will still cost 10 liang of silver tales.</font>
desc_enchantitem_tj_04_0=Crafted by a <font color="#FFFF00" >Blacksmith</font> according to Hundred School Booklet. Can be used for enhancing Weapon.<br>Suitable for weapons needed to be enhanced by the identity <font color="#FFFF00" >Novice Blacksmith, Apprentice Blacksmith, Expert Blacksmith, or God of Craftsmen</font>.<br>Right click to use.<br><font color="#FF0000">Enhance with enhancing item will still cost 10 liang of silver tales.</font>
desc_enchantitem_jq_04_0=Crafted by a <font color="#FFFF00" >Craftsman</font> according to Hundred School Booklet. Can be used for enhancing Jewelry.<br>Suitable for jewelries needed to be enhanced by the identity <font color="#FFFF00" >Novice Craftsman, Apprentice Craftsman, Expert Craftsman, or Hand of Hephaestus</font>.<br>Right click to use.<br><font color="#FF0000">Enhance with enhancing item will still cost 10 liang of silver tales.</font>
desc_enchantitem_cs_04_0=Crafted by a <font color="#FFFF00" >Chef</font> according to Hundred School Booklet. Can be used for enhancing Weapon.<br>Suitable for weapons needed to be enhanced by the identity <font color="#FFFF00" >Novice Cook, Apprentice Cook,= Cooking Expert, or Consummate Gourmet</font>.<br>Right click to use.<br><font color="#FF0000">Enhance with enhancing item will still cost 10 liang of silver tales.</font>
desc_enchantitem_cf_04_0=Crafted by a <font color="#FFFF00" >Tailor</font> according to Hundred School Booklet. Can be used for enhancing Armor.<br>Suitable for armors needed to be enhanced by the identity <font color="#FFFF00" >Novice Tailor, Apprentice Tailor, Expert Tailor, or God of Tailors</font>.<br>Right click to use.<br><font color="#FF0000">Enhance with enhancing item will still cost 10 liang of silver tales.</font>
desc_box_2017_worldboss_gpcj_001_1=Abundant rewards for defeating a Peerless Expert. Contains a random ancient script fragment from <font color="#FFFF00">Tai Chi Fist, Dragon Claw, or Dog Beating Staff Technique</font>
desc_item_clone_exchange_mj02_0=The reward certificates obtained by the Ming Cult disciples when passing the Thousand Green Ravin [Hard Mode]. <br>Ming Cult disciples trade them for the advanced school skill <font color="#FF3030">Divine Arrow Nine Skills </font>, levels 5 and 6, and <font color="#FF3030">Enlightened Shadowblade, Light and Shadow Dagger, and Fallen Goose Bow</font>, levels 8 and 9. These important items can be redeemed at <font color="#FF3030">Force Transmitting Elder (Ming Cult: -23,238). </font> (Jianghu VIPs have priority for exchange.)
desc_mingjiao_panshi_02=Jianghu related: Through betraying your master, you can be added into the new powers of Jianghu, such as the <br>Xu Family Manor<a href="findnpc_new,city05,xjz_021" style="HLStype1">, </a>Golden Needle Sect<a href="findnpc_new,city05,WorldNpc100048" style="HLStype1">, </a>Beast Villa<a href="findnpc_new,school02,wssz_132" style="HLStype1">, </a>etc. I have no news regarding to the hidden Jianghu powers. You will have to search through Jianghu yourself.<br>Of course, you can also join other schools: <a href="findnpc_new,school06,em909" style="HLStype1">Emei</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school08,sl182" style="HLStype1">Shaolin</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school07,wd179" style="HLStype1">Wudang</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school05,tm089" style="HLStype1">Tangmen</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school02,gb390" style="HLStype1">Beggar's Sect</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school04,jlg093" style="HLStype1">Wanderer's Valley</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school03,JZTNPC150" style="HLStype1">Scholars</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school01,jyw048" style="HLStype1">Royal Guards</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school22,npc_tsguj_005" style="HLStype1">Tianshan Sect</a>
desc_mingjiao_yirong_03=Requirements to Leave a School on Disguise: <br>Tier 2 Internal Skill is available. <br>Not an Acting Headmaster in the school. <br>Not a Deacon in the school. <br>Not an Elder in the school. <br>Not in an ongoing betrayal task. <br>Not in an ongoing training away task. <br>More than 30 days have passed since the last time that you left a school. <br>Level has reached Peak of Power. <br> Must be a Jianghu VIP.
desc_duyao_mj_001_1=Apply it to arrows. There are 100 chances of 5% probability to poison the target. Each time, the target will drop HP by 1% every 3 seconds for 15 seconds. <br>Go to Ming Cult <font color=""#00FF00"">(259, 307)</font> and find <font color=""#00FF00"">School Item Exchange NPC</font> to exchange.
desc_duyao_mj_002_1=Apply it to arrows. There are 100 chances of 5% probability to poison the target. Each time, the target will drop Energy by 1% every 3 seconds for 15 seconds. <br>Go to Ming Cult <font color=""#00FF00"">(259, 307)</font> and find <font color=""#00FF00"">School Item Exchange NPC</font> to exchange.
desc_duyao_mj_003_1=Apply it to arrows. There are 100 chances of 5% probability to poison the target. Each time, the target will get explode effect, damaging all targets within 3 meters range once for 3% HP. <br>Go to Ming Cult <font color=""#00FF00"">(259, 307)</font> and find <font color=""#00FF00"">School Item Exchange NPC</font> to exchange.
desc_duyao_mj_004_1=Apply it to arrows. There are 100 chances of 5% probability to poison the target. Each time, the target will drop in internal and external defense by 5% for 8 seconds. <br>Go to Ming Cult <font color=""#00FF00"">(259, 307)</font> and find <font color=""#00FF00"">School Item Exchange NPC</font> to exchange.
desc_duyao_mj_005_1=Apply it to arrows. There are 100 chances of 10% probability to poison the target. Each time, the target will drop in Evasion rate by 7% for 8 seconds. <br>Go to Ming Cult <font color=""#00FF00"">(259, 307)</font> and find <font color=""#00FF00"">School Item Exchange NPC</font> to exchange.
desc_item_rose_2017_title03_0=The most romantic firework for the Chinese Valentines' Day. Use it with your loved one, and you two will get the titles "Flying Phoenix".
desc_box_lzy_hd_kxxxr_007=Right click to open and obtain<font color="#FFFF00">5 Omnipotent Vouchers, 1 Activity Point Token (50 points), and 1 Diligence Token</font>.
desc_box_lzy_hd_kxxxr_014=Right click to open and obtain<font color="#FFFF00">5 Omnipotent Vouchers, 1 Activity Point Token (50 points), and 1 Diligence Token</font>.
