desc_item_20170928zqj_lzy_002_0=Mid-autumn Festival blessings. Collect the four characters, Luck, Longevity, Safety, Health. After collecting enough, you can exchange for items like Five-Realm Demon-Slaying Item, Hero Token, Bai Xiaosheng's Weapon Manual, Hunyuan Ticket, Hunyuan Tendon-Relaxing Pill, Omnipotent Voucher, High Level Flying Skill Book, or Ancient Manual Scroll Fragment Pack at <font color="#00ff00">Suzhou Hanshan Temple (1068,416) Festival Lantern</font>.
