desc_item_20170928zqj_lzy_004_0=Mid-autumn Festival blessings. Collect the four characters, Luck, Longevity, Safety, Health. After collecting enough, you can exchange for items like Five-Realm Demon-Slaying Item, Hero Token, Bai Xiaosheng's Weapon Manual, Hunyuan Ticket, Hunyuan Tendon-Relaxing Pill, Omnipotent Voucher, High Level Flying Skill Book, or Ancient Manual Scroll Fragment Pack at <font color="#00ff00">Suzhou Hanshan Temple (1068,416) Festival Lantern</font>.
desc_box_gqhd_sjhqlb_001=Right-click to use. <br><font color="#00ff00">After use will receive 50 Steamed Bread, 1 Horse Whistle (Red Thunder) 7 Days, 5 Omnipotent Voucher, 1 Costume Gift Box (7 days), 10 Hunyuan Ticket, 2 Package Embroidered Box (7 days), 500 Liang Bound Silver, 3 Show The Tail But Hide The Head, 3 Martial Arts Celebration Gift Card, 5 Tongming Pill, and 1 Double Festival Celebration Token.</font>
desc_origin_tiguan_3_1_7d=The sky is a tent and earth is a carpet. I sleep with the sun, the moon, and the stars.
desc_box_drop_fun_qdlb_004_zy=An exquisite gift bag. Open it to receive <font color="#00ff00">1 Omnipotent Vouchers</font>
desc_box_hd_2017_12_30_3_1=Open the New Year Gold Egg to randomly receive: 1 Refined Binding Agent, 1 Black Jade Powder, or 20 Omnipotent Voucher.
desc_box_guj_hd_kxxxr_004_1=Sign-in Reward (4). <br> Jianghu VIP players can open it to get <font color="#FFFF00">5 Omnipotent Vouchers, 10 Five Aggregate Demon Slaying Items, and 1 Activity Token</font>. <br>Young Master VIP players can in addition get <font color="#FFFF00">1 Activity Token</font>.
desc_box_zgqhhg_001=Right click to use. <br><font color="#00ff00">Open to get 5 Bai Xiaosheng's Weapon Manuals (Superior), 50 Five Aggregate Demon Slaying Items, 50 steamed buns, 10 Omnipotent Vouchers, 1 Refined Quality Binding Agent, 1 Good Quality Binding Agent, 1 Scholar Outfit (30 Days), and Goose Hunting Token (Returning Goose Pill instead if Age of Wushu Beautiful Land is completed).</font>
desc_box_lzy_sdhd_mpbt_mp004_1=Reward presented by Lin Tiannan. Open to get a certain amount of corresponding internal skill and martial art exchange items according to your current school and Age of Wushu Records. (You must be a disciple of the ten schools or do not belong to any school to open.)
desc_box_lbhd_lylb_002=Laba Delicate Gift Pack. Open to get <font color="#00ff00">20 Laba Porridge (Event), 10 Omnipotent Vouchers, 1 Refined Quality Binding Agent</font>.
desc_box_zhihui_001_1=Monk Huizhi is grateful for your gift. <br><font color="#00ff00">Open to get 1 Five Crops Token. Lucky players will additionally get one of 1 Hundred Year Snow Lotus Fruit, 1 Omnipotent Voucher, 5 Five Aggregate Demon Slaying Items.</font>
desc_box_2018xinchunlb=New Year Delicate Gift Pack. Open to get <font color="#00ff00">50 Steamed Buns, 5 Tea Eggs, 5 Abalone Noodle Soups, 20 Bai Xiaosheng Weapon Manuals (Superior), 50 Five Aggregate Demon Slaying Items, 5 Refined Moon Internal Pills, 20 Omnipotent Vouchers, 5 Hundred Year Snow Lotus Fruits, 1 Good Quality Expansion Pack</font>.
desc_item_spring_festival_suzhou_0=Exchange this item at <font color="#FF4500">page 2 in the store of Zhou Yixian in Suzhou (320,732)</font> for 2 <font color="#00ff00">Omnipotent Vouchers</font>.
desc_box_2018hd_kxhg_001_1=Delicate gift pack, especially prepared for returning players. Open to get <font color="#FFFF00">5 Bai Xiaosheng's Weapon Manuals (Superior), 50 Five Aggregate Demon Slaying Items, 50 Steamed Buns, 10 Omnipotent Vouchers, 1 Refined Quality Binding Agent, 1 Good Quality Binding Agent, 1 lore card Phoenix Dance and Snow Shadow Robe (30 Days), and 1 Returning Goose Pill</font>.
desc_qizhen_duihuanquan_0=Use this voucher at <font color="#FF4500">Suzhou Zhou Yixian (320, 732)</font> shop to exchange for artifacts of the normal ten meridians.
desc_qizhen_duihuanquan=Use this voucher at <font color="#FF4500">Suzhou Zhou Yixian (320, 732)</font> shop to exchange for artifacts of the normal ten meridians.
desc_sns_condtion_clone040_1=Max Level
desc_box_2018hd_yyjl_004=Sign-in Reward (4): <br>Jianghu VIP players can open it to get <font color="#FFFF00">5 Omnipotent Vouchers, 10 Five Aggregate Demon Slaying Items</font>.
title_huodong_dy_01=The event time is everyday from 10:00 to 22:00. Being a VIP and 10 Five Aggregate Demon Slaying Items are required. One can participate only once everyday. And only the first time's damage will be recorded.
desc_box_2018hd_shp_007=Sign-in Reward (7): <br>Jianghu VIP players can open it to get <font color="#FFFF00">5 Omnipotent Vouchers, Activity Points Voucher (50)</font>.
