box_ding_0606qx004=Ten Schools Advance Martial Skills Package
desc_box_ding_0606qx004_1=After opening, Emei disciples get <font color="#FFFF00">200 Female Warrior Maps (peerless)</font>, Beggar disciples get <font color="#FFFF00">200 Glazed Jade Bracelets (peerless)</font>, Wanderers Valley disciples get <font color="#FFFF00">200 Rare Scripts (peerless)</font>, Royal Guard disciples get <font color="#FFFF00">200 Secret Letters (peerless)</font>, Scholar disciples get <font color="#FFFF00">200 Books of Leisure (peerless)</font>, Shaolin disciples get <font color="#FFFF00">200 Iron Arhats (peerless)</font>, Tangmen disciples get <font color="#FFFF00">200 Tang Gold Plaques (peerless)</font>, Wudang disciples get <font color="#FFFF00">200 Taichi Seals (peerless)</font>, Ming Sect disciples get <font color="#FFFF00">200 Ming Emperor Tokens (peerless)</font>, Tianshan Sect disciples get <font color="#FFFF00">200 Tianshan Arrow Tokens (peerless)</font>.
desc_box_ding_0606qx004=Right click to open. (Must be a disciple of the ten schools to open.)
desc_tianshan_panshi_02=Jianghu related: By betraying your faction, you can join the new factions of Jianghu, such as the <br><a href="findnpc_new,city05,xjz_021" style="HLStype1">Xu Family Manor </a>, Golden Needle Sect, <a href="findnpc_new,school02,wssz_132" style="HLStype1">Beast Villa</a>etc. I have no news regarding to the hidden factions. You will have to search through Jianghu yourself. <br>Of course, you can also join the other six major factions: <a href="findnpc_new,school06,em909" style="HLStype1">Emei</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school08,sl182" style="HLStype1">Shaolin</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school07,wd179" style="HLStype1">Wudang</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school05,tm089" style="HLStype1">Tangmen</a>,<a href="findnpc_new,school02,gb390" style="HLStype1">Beggar's Sect</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school04,jlg093" style="HLStype1">Wanderer's Valley</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school03,JZTNPC150" style="HLStype1">Scholars</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school01,jyw048" style="HLStype1">Royal Guard</a>, <a href="findnpc_new,school20,npc_mjwy_005" style="HLStype1">Ming Cult</a>
desc_tianshan_yirong_03=Leave faction under disguise requirements: <br>Tier 2 internal Skill is active.<br>Not an Acting Grandmaster, Deacon or Elder in the school.<br>Not betraying school, or leaving faction for further training<br>It has been more than 30 days since the last time betrayed a school.<br>Level reaches Peak of Power.<br>Must be Jianghu VIP.<br>Only thirty players can disguise themselves each day.
desc_box_guild_2018hd_013_1=Guild Ambassador prepared abundant rewards. <br>It contains <font color="#FFFF00">10 Green Pills, 10 Big Ruyi Pills, 3 School Honor Certificate Gift Boxes, 20 3-hour Guild Chasing Tokens</font>.
desc_box_guild_2018hd_014_1=Guild Ambassador prepared abundant rewards. <br>It contains <font color="#FFFF00">10 Green Pills, 10 Big Ruyi Pills, 3 School Honor Certificate Gift Boxes, 40 3-hour Guild Chasing Tokens</font>.
desc_box_20180903_xxxzlb_guj_001=Right click to use. <br><font color="#00ff00"> Obtain 50 Steamed Buns, 1 Horse Whistle [Juedi] (8 Days), 1 Scholar Costume - Blue Flower (30 Days), 60 Hero Tokens, 10 Bai Xiaosheng's Weapon Manuals (Superior), 5 Omnipotent Vouchers, 1 Good Quality Expansion Pack.</font>
desc_xueweitool_4201_0=One of the martial arts classics written based on the medical tantra "Lingshu." When read by a martial arts practitioner, the reader can instantly gain insight and unclog the meridian channels of the body, and eventually open up <font color="#FFCC00">Zhiyin</font>, the <font color="#FFCC00">first</font> acupoint of the <font color="#FFCC00">Yangming Large Intestine Meridian of Hand - Riposte</font>. <br>Cultivation points required for usage: <font color="#FFFF00">1,000,000</font>. <br><font color="#FFFF00">Can only use the book after the corresponding normal meridian has been cultivated to level 180.</font>
desc_xueweitool_4202_0=One of the martial arts classics written based on the medical tantra "Lingshu." When read by a martial arts practitioner, the reader can instantly gain insight and unclog the meridian channels of the body, and eventually open up <font color="#FFCC00">Kunlun</font>, the <font color="#FFCC00">second</font> acupoint of the <font color="#FFCC00">Yangming Large Intestine Meridian of Hand - Riposte</font>. <br>Cultivation points required for usage: <font color="#FFFF00">1,500,000</font>. <br><font color="#FFFF00">Can only use the book after the corresponding normal meridian has been cultivated to level 180.</font>
desc_xueweitool_4203_0=One of the martial arts classics written based on the medical tantra "Lingshu." When read by a martial arts practitioner, the reader can instantly gain insight and unclog the meridian channels of the body, and eventually open up <font color="#FFCC00">Weizhong</font>, the <font color="#FFCC00">third</font> acupoint of the <font color="#FFCC00">Yangming Large Intestine Meridian of Hand - Riposte</font>. <br>Cultivation points required for usage: <font color="#FFFF00">2,000,000</font>. <br><font color="#FFFF00">Can only use the book after the corresponding normal meridian has been cultivated to level 180.</font>
desc_xueweitool_4204_0=One of the martial arts classics written based on the medical tantra "Lingshu." When read by a martial arts practitioner, the reader can instantly gain insight and unclog the meridian channels of the body, and eventually open up <font color="#FFCC00">Huiyang</font>, the <font color="#FFCC00">fourth</font> acupoint of the <font color="#FFCC00">Yangming Large Intestine Meridian of Hand - Riposte</font>. <br>Cultivation points required for usage: <font color="#FFFF00">3,000,000</font>. <br><font color="#FFFF00">Can only use the book after the corresponding normal meridian has been cultivated to level 180.</font>
desc_xueweitool_4205_0=One of the martial arts classics written based on the medical tantra "Lingshu." When read by a martial arts practitioner, the reader can instantly gain insight and unclog the meridian channels of the body, and eventually open up <font color="#FFCC00">Shenyu</font>, the <font color="#FFCC00">fifth</font> acupoint of the <font color="#FFCC00">Yangming Large Intestine Meridian of Hand - Riposte</font> <br>Cultivation points required for usage: <font color="#FFFF00">4,000,000</font>. <br><font color="#FFFF00">Can only use the book after the corresponding normal meridian has been cultivated to level 180.</font>
desc_xueweitool_4206_0=One of the martial arts classics written based on the medical tantra "Lingshu." When read by a martial arts practitioner, the reader can instantly gain insight and unclog the meridian channels of the body, and eventually open up <font color="#FFCC00">Fengmen</font>, the <font color="#FFCC00">sixth</font> acupoint of the <font color="#FFCC00">Yangming Large Intestine Meridian of Hand - Riposte</font> <br>Cultivation points required for usage: <font color="#FFFF00">5,000,000</font>. <br><font color="#FFFF00">Can only use the book after the corresponding normal meridian has been cultivated to level 180.</font>
