desc_box_menpai_win_001_1=Age of Wushu Record Tier 1 Internal Skill: 10 School Honor Certificates, 2 Hunyuan Tendon-Relaxing Pills (1 Day)<br>Age of Wushu Record Tier 2 Internal Skill: 10 School Honor Certificates, 2 Hunyuan Tendon-Relaxing Pills (1 Day), 80 Challenge Points.<br>Age of Wushu Record Tier 3 Internal Skill: 10 School Honor Certificates, 3 Hunyuan Tendon-Relaxing Pills (1 Day), 100 School Contribution, 80 Challenge Points.<br>Age of Wushu Record Tier 4 Internal Skill: 10 School Honor Certificates, 4 Hunyuan Tendon-Relaxing Pills (1 Day), 100 School Contribution, 14 Sheepskins Scraps, 80 Challenge Points.<br>Age of Wushu Record Tier 5 Internal Skill: 10 School Honor Certificates, 5 Hunyuan Tendon-Relaxing Pills (1 Day), 200 School Contribution, 25 Martial Merit Tokens, 80 Challenge Points.<br>Age of Wushu Record Tier 6 Internal Skill: 10 School Honor Certificates, 6 Hunyuan Tendon-Relaxing Pills (1 Day), 200 School Contribution, 20 Demon Gate Tokens, 80 Challenge Points.
desc_box_menpai_fail_001_1=Age of Wushu Record Tier 1 Internal Skill: 5 School Honor Certificates, 1 Hunyuan Tendon-Relaxing Pills (1 Day)<br>Age of Wushu Record Tier 2 Internal Skill: 5 School Honor Certificates, 1 Hunyuan Tendon-Relaxing Pills (1 Day), 40 Challenge Points.<br>Age of Wushu Record Tier 3 Internal Skill: 5 School Honor Certificates, 2 Hunyuan Tendon-Relaxing Pills (1 Day), 50 School Contribution, 40 Challenge Points.<br>Age of Wushu Record Tier 4 Internal Skill: 5 School Honor Certificates, 2 Hunyuan Tendon-Relaxing Pills (1 Day), 50 School Contribution, 7 Sheepskins Scraps, 40 Challenge Points.<br>Age of Wushu Record Tier 5 Internal Skill: 5 School Honor Certificates, 3 Hunyuan Tendon-Relaxing Pills (1 Day), 100 School Contribution, 12 Martial Merit Tokens, 40 Challenge Points.<br>Age of Wushu Record Tier 6 Internal Skill: 5 School Honor Certificates, 4 Hunyuan Tendon-Relaxing Pills (1 Day), 100 School Contribution, 10 Demon Gate Tokens, 40 Challenge Points.
